import type { LibraryEntry } from '../types.ts';

export const FIVE_E_TOOLS_SPELLS: LibraryEntry[] = JSON.parse("[{\"id\":\"5et_spell_air_bubble_aag\",\"name\":\"Air Bubble\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AAG\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You create a spectral globe around the head of a willing creature you can see within range. The globe is filled with fresh air that lasts until the sp\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou create a spectral globe around the head of a willing creature you can see within range. The globe is filled with fresh air that lasts until the spell ends. If the creature has more than one head, the globe of air appears around only one of its heads (which is all the creature needs to avoid suffocation, assuming that all its heads share the same respiratory system).\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you can create two additional globes of fresh air for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AAG\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_spelljamming_helm_aag\",\"name\":\"Create Spelljamming Helm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AAG\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • Touch — Holding the rod used in the casting of the spell, you touch a Large or smaller chair that is unoccupied. The rod disappears, and the chair is transfor\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a crystal rod worth at least 5,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nHolding the rod used in the casting of the spell, you touch a Large or smaller chair that is unoccupied. The rod disappears, and the chair is transformed into a [[spelljamming helm|AAG]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a crystal rod worth at least 5,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AAG\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_distort_value_ai\",\"name\":\"Distort Value\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AI\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Illusion • 1 minute • Touch — Do you need to squeeze a few more gold pieces out of a merchant as you try to sell that weird octopus statue you liberated from the chaos temple? Do y\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nDo you need to squeeze a few more gold pieces out of a merchant as you try to sell that weird octopus statue you liberated from the chaos temple? Do you need to downplay the worth of some magical assets when the tax collector stops by? Distort value has you covered.\\n\\nYou cast this spell on an object no more than 1 foot on a side, doubling the object's perceived value by adding illusory flourishes or polish to it, or reducing its perceived value by half with the help of illusory scratches, dents, and other unsightly features. Anyone examining the object can ascertain its true value with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the maximum size of the object increases by 1 foot for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AI\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fast_friends_ai\",\"name\":\"Fast Friends\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AI\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — When you need to make sure something gets done, you can't rely on vague promises, sworn oaths, or binding contracts of employment. When you cast this \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nWhen you need to make sure something gets done, you can't rely on vague promises, sworn oaths, or binding contracts of employment. When you cast this spell, choose one humanoid within range that can see and hear you, and that can understand you. The creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become [[charmed]] by you for the duration. While the creature is [[charmed]] in this way, it undertakes to perform any services or activities you ask of it in a friendly manner, to the best of its ability.\\n\\nYou can set the creature new tasks when a previous task is completed, or if you decide to end its current task. If the service or activity might cause harm to the creature, or if it conflicts with the creature's normal activities and desires, the creature can make another Wisdom saving throw to try to end the effect. This save is made with advantage if you or your companions are fighting the creature. If the activity would result in certain death for the creature, the spell ends.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the creature knows it was [[charmed]] by you.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AI\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gift_of_gab_ai\",\"name\":\"Gift of Gab\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AI\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Reaction, which you take when you speak to another creature • Self — When I met Jim Darkmagic, I wondered how he got anything done in that outfit. I have since learned that most of his talents involve standing and talki\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when you speak to another creature\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, R (2 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\n*When I met Jim Darkmagic, I wondered how he got anything done in that outfit. I have since learned that most of his talents involve standing and talking. His outfit is perfect for that.*— MôrgænJim Darkmagic is said to have invented this spell, originally calling it *I said what?!* Have you ever been talking to the local monarch and accidentally mentioned how their son looks like your favorite hog from when you were growing up on the family farm? We've all been there! But rather than being beheaded for an honest slip of the tongue, you can pretend it never happened—by ensuring that no one knows it happened.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you skillfully reshape the memories of listeners in your immediate area, so that each creature of your choice within 5 feet of you forgets everything you said within the last 6 seconds. Those creatures then remember that you actually said the words you speak as the verbal component of the spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when you speak to another creature\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, R (2 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AI\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Reaction\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_incite_greed_ai\",\"name\":\"Incite Greed\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AI\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — When you cast this spell, you present the gem used as the material component and choose any number of creatures within range that can see you. Each ta\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gem worth at least 50 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nWhen you cast this spell, you present the gem used as the material component and choose any number of creatures within range that can see you. Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be [[charmed]] by you until the spell ends, or until you or your companions do anything harmful to it. While [[charmed]] in this way, a creature can do nothing but use its movement to approach you in a safe manner. While an affected creature is within 5 feet of you, it cannot move, but simply stares greedily at the gem you present.\\n\\nAt the end of each of its turns, an affected target can make a Wisdom saving throw. If it succeeds, this effect ends for that target.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gem worth at least 50 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AI\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_jim_s_glowing_coin_ai\",\"name\":\"Jim's Glowing Coin\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AI\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — Of the many tactics employed by master magician and renowned adventurer Jim Darkmagic, the old glowing coin trick is a time-honored classic. When you \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a coin), R (2 gp)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nOf the many tactics employed by master magician and renowned adventurer Jim Darkmagic, the old glowing coin trick is a time-honored classic. When you cast the spell, you hurl the coin that is the spell's material component to any spot within range. The coin lights up as if under the effect of a [[light]] spell. Each creature of your choice that you can see within 30 feet of the coin must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be distracted for the duration. While distracted, a creature has disadvantage on Wisdom ([[Perception]]) checks and initiative rolls.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a coin), R (2 gp)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AI\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_jim_s_magic_missile_ai\",\"name\":\"Jim's Magic Missile\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AI\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — Jim's magic missile is an ancient and powerful spell, as well as being the name of my band in Wizard Academy.— Jim DarkmagicAny apprentice wizard can \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, R (1 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\n*Jim's magic missile is an ancient and powerful spell, as well as being the name of my band in Wizard Academy.*— Jim DarkmagicAny apprentice wizard can cast a boring old magic missile. Sure, it always strikes its target. Yawn. Do away with the drudgery of your grandfather's magic with this improved version of the spell, as used by Jim Darkmagic!\\n\\nYou create three twisting, whistling, hypoallergenic, gluten-free darts of magical force. Each dart targets a creature of your choice that you can see within range. Make a ranged spell attack for each missile. On a hit, a missile deals 2d4 force damage to its target.\\n\\nIf the attack roll scores a critical hit, the target of that missile takes 5d4 force damage instead of you rolling damage twice for a critical hit. If the attack roll for any missile is a 1, all missiles miss their targets and blow up in your face, dealing 1 force damage per missile to you.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the spell creates one more dart, and the royalty component increases by 1 gp, for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, R (1 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AI\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_motivational_speech_ai\",\"name\":\"Motivational Speech\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AI\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Enchantment • 1 minute • 60 feet — I once heard a motivational speech by Jim and it was the worst ninety seconds of my life. What does Omin see in him, anyway?— Walnut DankgrassYou addr\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\n*I once heard a motivational speech by Jim and it was the worst ninety seconds of my life. What does Omin see in him, anyway?*— Walnut DankgrassYou address allies, staff, or innocent bystanders to exhort and inspire them to greatness, whether they have anything to get excited about or not. Choose up to five creatures within range that can hear you. For the duration, each affected creature gains 5 temporary hit points and has advantage on Wisdom saving throws. If an affected creature is hit by an attack, it has advantage on the next attack roll it makes. Once an affected creature loses the temporary hit points granted by this spell, the spell ends for that creature.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the temporary hit points increase by 5 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AI\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_linked_glyphs_aitfr_avt\",\"name\":\"Linked Glyphs\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AitFR-AVT\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • 1 hour • Touch — When you cast this spell, you inscribe a detection glyph that later activates a magical effect at the site of a separate, linked glyph. You inscribe t\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (incense and powdered diamond worth at least 300 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled or triggered\\nWhen you cast this spell, you inscribe a detection glyph that later activates a magical effect at the site of a separate, linked glyph. You inscribe the detection glyph either on a surface (such as a table or a section of floor or wall) or within an object that can be closed (such as a book, a scroll, or a treasure chest) to conceal the glyph. The glyph can cover an area no larger than 10 feet in diameter. If the surface or object is moved more than 10 feet from where you cast this spell, the detection glyph is broken, and the spell ends without being triggered.\\n\\nBoth glyphs are nearly invisible, and finding either requires a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC.\\n\\nYou decide what triggers the detection glyph when you cast this spell. For glyphs inscribed on a surface, the most typical triggers include touching or standing on the glyph, removing another object covering the glyph, approaching within a certain distance of the glyph, or manipulating the object on which the glyph is inscribed. For glyphs inscribed within an object, the most common triggers include opening that object, approaching within a certain distance of the object, or seeing or reading the glyph. Once a glyph is triggered, this spell ends.\\n\\nYou can further refine the trigger so the spell activates only under certain circumstances or according to physical characteristics (such as height or weight), creature kind (for example, the ward could be set to affect aberrations or drow), or alignment. You can also set conditions for creatures that don't trigger the glyph, such as those who say a certain password.\\n\\nWhen you inscribe the detection glyph, choose an alarm glyph or spell glyph to link to it.\\n\\n***Alarm Glyph.*** You create and magically link two glyphs: a detection glyph and an effect glyph. Each of these two glyphs must stay within 100 miles of the other or the spell effect ends. When the detection glyph is triggered, the effect glyph reacts like an alarm spell, creating a mental ping in your mind if you are within 1 mile of the effect glyph. This ping awakens you if you are sleeping.\\n\\n***Spell Glyph.*** You create and magically link two glyphs: a detection glyph and an effect glyph. These two glyphs must be within 100 feet of each other. You can store a prepared spell of 4th level or lower in the effect glyph by casting it as part of creating the glyphs. The spell must target a single creature or an area. The spell being stored has no immediate effect when cast in this way. When the detection glyph is triggered, the spell stored in the effect glyph is cast. If the spell has a target, it targets the creature that triggered the glyph. If the spell affects an area, the area is centered on the effect glyph. If the spell summons hostile creatures or creates harmful objects or traps, they appear as close as possible to the effect glyph. If the spell requires [[concentration]], it lasts until the end of its full duration.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher to create a spell glyph, you can store any spell of up to the same level as the slot you use.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (incense and powdered diamond worth at least 300 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled or triggered\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AitFR-AVT\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aura_of_evasion_au\",\"name\":\"Aura of Evasion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Abjuration • Action • Self — An aura of alacrity radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and your all\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nAn aura of alacrity radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and your allies have [[Advantage|XPHB]] on Dexterity saving throws. When an affected creature is subjected to an effect that allows it to make a Dexterity saving throw to take only half damage, it takes no damage if it succeeds on the save and only half damage if it fails. A creature with the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition doesn't gain any benefit from being in the aura.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_battle_familiar_au\",\"name\":\"Battle Familiar\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 10 feet — You conjure a familiar imbued with magical might. The familiar appears in an unoccupied space within range; resembles an animal of your choice but is \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth 25+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou conjure a familiar imbued with magical might. The familiar appears in an unoccupied space within range; resembles an animal of your choice but is a Celestial, Fey, or Fiend (your choice); and uses the [[Battle Familiar|AU]] stat block. When you cast this spell, choose the Brute, Flyer, or Stalker form. The choice determines certain details in the stat block.\\n\\n***Combat.*** The familiar is an ally to you and your allies. It rolls its own [[Initiative|XPHB]] and acts on its own turn.\\n\\n***Disappearance of the Familiar.*** The battle familiar disappears when the spell ends, if it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], or if you die. When it disappears, it leaves behind in its space anything it was wearing or carrying. If you cast this spell again, you decide whether you summon the familiar that disappeared or a different one.\\n\\n***One Familiar at a Time.*** You can't have more than one familiar at a time. If you cast this spell while you already have a familiar from this spell, that familiar is replaced by the new one.\\n\\nIf you have a familiar from the [[Find Familiar|XPHB]] spell when you cast this spell, you empower your existing familiar rather than conjuring a new one. For the duration, your familiar can attack in addition to taking other actions as normal, and your familiar's game statistics are replaced by the Battle Familiar stat block, but it retains its creature type, alignment, [[Hit Points|XPHB]], [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]], and any features granted by the [[Find Familiar|XPHB]] spell. Your familiar gains a number of [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to the [[Hit Points|XPHB]] of the battle familiar. Battle Familiar ends early if the familiar has no more [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] left, and these [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] vanish if any remain when Battle Familiar ends. Your familiar reverts to its previous form when Battle Familiar ends.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Warlike Familiar|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth 25+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_catnap_au\",\"name\":\"Catnap\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You make a calming gesture, and up to three willing creatures of your choice that you can see within range have the Unconscious condition for the spel\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a pinch of sand)\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou make a calming gesture, and up to three willing creatures of your choice that you can see within range have the [[Unconscious|XPHB]] condition for the spell's duration. The spell ends on a target if it takes damage or another creature takes an action to shake it awake. If a target has the [[Unconscious|XPHB]] condition from this spell for the full duration, that target gains the benefits of finishing a [[Short Rest|XPHB]], and it can't be affected by this spell again until it finishes a [[Long Rest|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional willing creature for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a pinch of sand)\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_detonate_au\",\"name\":\"Detonate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Evocation • Action • 500 feet — You create a magical, explosive seed inside a creature you can see within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 10d10 Fire damag\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 500 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of tinder)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create a magical, explosive seed inside a creature you can see within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 10d10 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nAn explosion then originates from the target. Each creature in a 60-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from the target (not including the target) makes a Dexterity saving throw, with [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] if this spell reduced the target to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]]. A creature takes 10d10 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nA nonmagical object that isn't being worn or carried also takes the damage if it's in the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]], and the object starts [[burning|XPHB]] if it's flammable.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"500 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of tinder)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d10\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_disruptive_tune_au\",\"name\":\"Disruptive Tune\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • 120 feet — A distracting melody momentarily fills a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range. Each crea\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA distracting melody momentarily fills a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a target loses [[Concentration|XPHB]], and it has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on Constitution saving throws to maintain [[Concentration|XPHB]] for the spell's duration.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_distorted_distance_au\",\"name\":\"Distorted Distance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You create an illusory spatial dilation that fills a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range. For each\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create an illusory spatial dilation that fills a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range. For each creature you can see in the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]], you can choose one of the following effects for it:\\n\\n- **Dizzying Elongation.** The creature makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 2d10 Psychic damage, and the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] is [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] for it until the end of its turn.\\n- **Shortened Space.** The creature's [[Speed|XPHB]] increases by 20 feet until the end of its next turn.\\n  Until the spell ends, whenever a creature enters the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] or ends its turn there, you can choose for it to receive one of these effects. A creature can be affected by this spell only once per turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dueling_ground_au\",\"name\":\"Dueling Ground\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • 10 minutes or Ritual • Touch — You create a magical dueling ground bounded by a glowing, rune-scribed circle in a 15-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a silk flag worth 100+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou create a magical dueling ground bounded by a glowing, rune-scribed circle in a 15-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point on the ground you touch.\\n\\nAs part of creating the dueling ground, you designate two willing creatures within the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] as the targets. The spell ends early if a creature other than one of the targets enters the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]].\\n\\nIf a target drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] while in the dueling ground, the target is [[Stable|XPHB]] and teleports to the nearest unoccupied space outside the dueling ground. If a target is subjected to an effect that would kill it instantly without dealing damage while in the dueling ground, the target doesn't die and instead has 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] and the [[Unconscious|XPHB]] condition, is [[Stable|XPHB]], and teleports to the nearest unoccupied space outside the dueling ground.\\n\\nWhen only one target remains in the dueling ground, runes matching those on the ground around the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] briefly flash around the remaining target's head like a crown.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional willing creature for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a silk flag worth 100+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_enervation_au\",\"name\":\"Enervation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — A tendril of inky darkness reaches out from you to drain life from a creature you can see within range. The target makes a Dexterity saving throw. On \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA tendril of inky darkness reaches out from you to drain life from a creature you can see within range.\\n\\nThe target makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 6d8 Necrotic damage. On each of your subsequent turns, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to deal 2d8 Necrotic damage to the target automatically. The spell ends if the target is ever outside the spell's range or it has [[Cover|XPHB|Total Cover]] from you.\\n\\nOn a successful save, the target takes half the initial damage only, and the spell ends.\\n\\nWhenever this spell deals damage to a target, you regain [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to half the amount of Necrotic damage dealt.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The initial damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_entrancing_mirrors_au\",\"name\":\"Entrancing Mirrors\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Illusion • Action • 90 feet — You create dozens of illusory mirrors to confuse up to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range. Each target makes an Intelligence\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a mirror shard)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create dozens of illusory mirrors to confuse up to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range.\\n\\nEach target makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 7d6 Psychic damage and has the [[Stunned|XPHB]] condition. While the target is [[Stunned|XPHB]], its [[Speed|XPHB]] is halved. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage only.\\n\\nA [[Stunned|XPHB]] target repeats the Intelligence saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a mirror shard)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"7d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_festering_blast_au\",\"name\":\"Festering Blast\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Necromancy • Action • Self — A 60-foot-long, 10-foot-wide [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] of miasma blasts from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the [[Line [Are\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nA 60-foot-long, 10-foot-wide [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] of miasma blasts from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 4d10 Necrotic damage and has the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition for the duration.\\n\\nA creature [[Poisoned|XPHB]] by this spell takes 2d10 Poison damage at the start of each of its turns. At the end of each of its turns, a [[Poisoned|XPHB]] target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The initial damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fractured_awareness_au\",\"name\":\"Fractured Awareness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Divination • Action • 120 feet — You cause a creature to receive conflicting visions of multiple possible futures. Choose a creature you can see within range. The target makes an Inte\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou cause a creature to receive conflicting visions of multiple possible futures. Choose a creature you can see within range. The target makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 12d10 Psychic damage and has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on [[D20 Test|XPHB|D20 Tests]] for the duration. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage only, and the spell ends.\\n\\nAt the end of each of its turns, an affected target repeats the save, ending the spell on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Divination\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_grave_ground_au\",\"name\":\"Grave Ground\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Action • 120 feet — Skeletal hands burst from an area on the ground within range. The area consists of up to four 10-foot squares, which you arrange as you like. Each squ\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a handful of grave dirt)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nSkeletal hands burst from an area on the ground within range. The area consists of up to four 10-foot squares, which you arrange as you like. Each square must be contiguous with at least one other square. That area is [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] for your enemies.\\n\\nAny enemy in that area when the skeletal hands appear makes a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 6d6 Necrotic damage, and until the end of its next turn, the creature subtracts 1d6 from all its damage rolls. An enemy also makes this save if it enters the area or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a handful of grave dirt)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hindsight_au\",\"name\":\"Hindsight\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Divination • 10 minutes • 500 feet — You peer backward through the fabric of time. You see visions of events that occurred within range throughout the past 10 years, racing by at approxim\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 500 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny hourglass worth 500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou peer backward through the fabric of time. You see visions of events that occurred within range throughout the past 10 years, racing by at approximately 1 day per second. Throughout the spell's duration, you can freely slow down, pause, rewind, or fast-forward through these visions.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"500 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny hourglass worth 500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Divination\",\"Level 9\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_illusory_dragon_au\",\"name\":\"Illusory Dragon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — By gathering threads of shadow material from the Shadowfell, you create a Huge shadowy dragon in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. Th\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nBy gathering threads of shadow material from the Shadowfell, you create a Huge shadowy dragon in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The illusion lasts for the spell's duration and occupies its space as if it were a creature. The illusion is tangible because of the shadow material used to create it but has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to all damage and conditions.\\n\\nWhen the illusion appears, any enemy that can see it makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the creature drops whatever it's holding and has the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition for the duration. If a creature [[Frightened|XPHB]] in this way ends its turn in a space where it doesn't have line of sight to the illusion, the creature repeats the saving throw, ending the condition on itself on a success.\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you can move the illusion up to 60 feet. At any point during its movement, you can cause the shadowy dragon to exhale a blast of energy in a 60-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]]. Each creature in the [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] makes an Intelligence saving throw, taking 6d6 Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Necrotic, or Poison damage (your choice when you create the dragon) on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nA creature that takes a [[Study|XPHB]] action to examine the dragon can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image and has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on saving throws to end the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition it caused and to resist its exhalation.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d6\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_inflict_doubt_au\",\"name\":\"Inflict Doubt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Enchantment • Action • 120 feet — You inflict self-doubt on a creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have Disadvantage on D20 Tests for \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou inflict self-doubt on a creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on [[D20 Test|XPHB|D20 Tests]] for the duration. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_invulnerability_au\",\"name\":\"Invulnerability\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Abjuration • Action • Self — You have Immunity to all damage until the spell ends.\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of adamantine worth 500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou have [[Immunity|XPHB]] to all damage until the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of adamantine worth 500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_iron_body_au\",\"name\":\"Iron Body\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Transmutation • Action • Touch — One willing creature you touch transforms into living metal. Until the spell ends, the target's Exhaustion level can't increase; the target has Resist\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (diamond dust worth 250+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nOne willing creature you touch transforms into living metal. Until the spell ends, the target's [[Exhaustion|XPHB]] level can't increase; the target has [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Bludgeoning, Fire, Piercing, and Slashing damage; and it has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to Poison damage and the [[Paralyzed|XPHB]], [[Petrified|XPHB]], and [[Poisoned|XPHB]] conditions. If the target is [[Paralyzed|XPHB]], [[Petrified|XPHB]], or [[Poisoned|XPHB]] when you cast the spell, those conditions immediately end for the target.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (diamond dust worth 250+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_lightning_ring_au\",\"name\":\"Lightning Ring\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — A ring of crackling electricity fills a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you. Whenever the [[Emanation [Area of \",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fur and a glass ring)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA ring of crackling electricity fills a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you. Whenever the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] enters a creature's space and whenever a creature enters the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] or ends its turn there, you can force that creature to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 3d6 Lightning damage plus 3d6 Thunder damage, and it has the [[Deafened|XPHB]] condition for 1 minute. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage only.\\n\\nAs a [[Magic|XPHB]] action while the spell is active, you can emit a 60-foot-long, 5-foot-wide [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] out from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 6d6 Lightning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fur and a glass ring)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 8\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_moment_of_prescience_au\",\"name\":\"Moment of Prescience\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Divination • Reaction, which you take when you fail a D20 Test or when a creature hits you with an attack roll • Self — You have a powerful sixth sense that guides you at just the right time. Turn the roll of your failed D20 Test into a 20, or turn the roll of the trigg\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when you fail a D20 Test or when a creature hits you with an attack roll\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou have a powerful sixth sense that guides you at just the right time. Turn the roll of your failed [[D20 Test|XPHB]] into a 20, or turn the roll of the triggering attack roll into a 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when you fail a D20 Test or when a creature hits you with an attack roll\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Divination\",\"Level 8\",\"Reaction\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mordenkainen_s_lucubration_au\",\"name\":\"Mordenkainen's Lucubration\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • Action • Self — You recover up to two expended spell slots of level 2 or lower.\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou recover up to two expended spell slots of level 2 or lower.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The maximum level of spell slots you can recover increases to level 3 (if cast with a level 6-7 spell slot) or level 4 (if cast with a level 8+ spell slot).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_negative_energy_flood_au\",\"name\":\"Negative Energy Flood\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You send ribbons of negative energy at one creature you can see within range. If the target isn't Undead, it makes a Constitution saving throw, taking\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a broken bone and a square of black silk)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou send ribbons of negative energy at one creature you can see within range. If the target isn't Undead, it makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 3d10 + 25 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A Humanoid killed by this spell rises at the start of your next turn as a [[Zombie|XMM]] that follows your verbal orders for 24 hours, after which it acts according to its nature.\\n\\nIf the target is Undead, it gains 3d10 [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a broken bone and a square of black silk)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10 + 25\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_power_word_pain_au\",\"name\":\"Power Word Pain\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You speak a word of power that causes waves of intense pain to assail one creature you can see within range. If the target has 100 Hit Points or fewer\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou speak a word of power that causes waves of intense pain to assail one creature you can see within range. If the target has 100 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or fewer, it takes 6d8 Force damage and has the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. Otherwise, it takes 6d8 Force damage only.\\n\\nWhile the target is [[Charmed|XPHB]], its [[Speed|XPHB]] can be no more than 10 feet, and it has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on [[D20 Test|XPHB|D20 Tests]] except Constitution saving throws. In addition, when the target tries to cast a spell, it must first succeed on a Constitution saving throw, or the spell dissipates with no effect, and the action, [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], or [[Reaction|XPHB]] used to cast it is wasted. If that spell was cast with a spell slot, the slot isn't expended.\\n\\nAt the end of each of its turns, the [[Charmed|XPHB]] target makes a Constitution saving throw, ending the spell on itself on a successful save.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_reweave_fate_au\",\"name\":\"Reweave Fate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Divination • Reaction, which you take when a creature you can see within 60 feet of you fails a D20 Test • 60 feet — You untangle a single thread of fate to encourage a different result. The creature that failed the D20 Test can reroll it with Advantage, and the crea\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when a creature you can see within 60 feet of you fails a D20 Test\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou untangle a single thread of fate to encourage a different result. The creature that failed the [[D20 Test|XPHB]] can reroll it with [[Advantage|XPHB]], and the creature must use the new roll. If the [[D20 Test|XPHB]] is successful, the creature gains 6d10 [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] from its strengthened fate.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when a creature you can see within 60 feet of you fails a D20 Test\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Divination\",\"Level 7\",\"Reaction\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spirit_lantern_au\",\"name\":\"Spirit Lantern\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Action • Self — You conjure a floating, ghostly black lantern that hovers above you and sheds Dim Light in a 60-foot radius. When an enemy dies within this Dim Light,\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a black lantern)\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou conjure a floating, ghostly black lantern that hovers above you and sheds [[Dim Light|XPHB]] in a 60-foot radius. When an enemy dies within this [[Dim Light|XPHB]], a fragment of the creature's soul flies into the lantern. The lantern can hold a number of soul fragments equal to your spellcasting ability modifier, and those fragments dissipate when the spell ends.\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you can expend a soul fragment to create one of the following effects.\\n\\n***Drain Life.*** The soul fragment darts at a creature of your choice that you can see within 60 feet of yourself. The target makes a Constitution saving throw, taking Necrotic damage equal to 4d8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***Repair Undead.*** The soul fragment flies into an Undead creature of your choice that you can see within 60 feet of yourself. That creature regains [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to 4d8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\n***Ward Ally.*** The soul fragment darts around a creature of your choice that you can see within 60 feet of yourself. Other creatures have [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against the chosen creature until the start of your next turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a black lantern)\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"healing\":\"4d8\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_dinosaur_au\",\"name\":\"Summon Dinosaur\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth the spirit of a primeval dinosaur. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Dinosaur Spirit stat \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (polished scale worth 600+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth the spirit of a primeval dinosaur. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Dinosaur Spirit|AU]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose Ankylosaur, Triceratops, or Tyrannosaur. The creature resembles a dinosaur of the chosen type, which determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, the creature takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (polished scale worth 600+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_plant_au\",\"name\":\"Summon Plant\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth the spirit of an animated plant. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Plant Spirit stat block\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (herbs worth 500+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth the spirit of an animated plant. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Plant Spirit|AU]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose Fungus, Tree, or Vine. The creature resembles a plant of the chosen type, which determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (herbs worth 500+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_transfix_au\",\"name\":\"Transfix\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Enchantment • Action • Self — For the duration, your appearance becomes otherworldly and alluring. One creature of your choice that you can see within 60 feet of you must succeed o\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the duration, your appearance becomes otherworldly and alluring. One creature of your choice that you can see within 60 feet of you must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration.\\n\\nWhile [[Charmed|XPHB]], the target has the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition, and if the target is more than 5 feet away from you, it moves on its turn toward you by the most direct route, trying to get within 5 feet of you. If the [[Charmed|XPHB]] creature ends its turn within 5 feet of you, it takes 4d8 Psychic damage.\\n\\nThe target doesn't avoid [[Opportunity Attack|XPHB|Opportunity Attacks]] when moving toward you, but before moving into damaging terrain (such as lava or a pit), the target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action on subsequent turns to target another creature, but you can't target a creature again if it has succeeded on a save against this casting of the spell.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 7.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_uncertain_footing_au\",\"name\":\"Uncertain Footing\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You create illusory obstacles such as rocks or spikes in an attempt to confuse up to three creatures you can see within range, affecting their ability\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a distorted lens)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create illusory obstacles such as rocks or spikes in an attempt to confuse up to three creatures you can see within range, affecting their ability to move. Each target makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, a target's [[Speed|XPHB]] is halved, and it can't take the [[Dash|XPHB]] action. A hampered target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a distorted lens)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_vision_of_elapsing_eons_au\",\"name\":\"Vision of Elapsing Eons\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You trick a creature you can see within range into believing it is watching itself and its surroundings crumble away, as if eons were passing in momen\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou trick a creature you can see within range into believing it is watching itself and its surroundings crumble away, as if eons were passing in moments. The target must succeed on an Intelligence saving throw or take 10d12 Psychic damage and have the [[Paralyzed|XPHB]] condition for the duration.\\n\\nWhile [[Paralyzed|XPHB]], the target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns. On a failed save, it gains 1 [[Exhaustion|XPHB]] level. On a successful save, the spell ends. The spell ends early if someone within 5 feet of the target takes an action to shake it free from the illusion.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d12\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wail_of_the_banshee_au\",\"name\":\"Wail of the Banshee\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You emit a terrible scream that can kill those who hear it. Choose up to ten creatures within range. Each target with 50 Hit Points or fewer dies. Tar\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou emit a terrible scream that can kill those who hear it. Choose up to ten creatures within range. Each target with 50 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or fewer dies. Targets with more than 50 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 12d10 Psychic damage and has the [[Deafened|XPHB]] condition for 1 hour. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage only. A target is unaffected by the spell if it can't hear you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_waves_of_exhaustion_au\",\"name\":\"Waves of Exhaustion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Bonus action • Self — You evoke a nimbus of flickering gray light around your body. For the duration, you can take a Magic action to emit a wave of gray light in a 60-foot \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of dried meat)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou evoke a nimbus of flickering gray light around your body. For the duration, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to emit a wave of gray light in a 60-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]]. Creatures in that area must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or gain 1 [[Exhaustion|XPHB]] level. This spell can't increase a creature's [[Exhaustion|XPHB]] level above 4.\\n\\n[[Exhaustion|XPHB]] levels gained from this spell are removed when the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of dried meat)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wither_and_bloom_au\",\"name\":\"Wither and Bloom\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You invoke both death and life in a 10-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range. Each creature of your cho\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a withered vine twisted into a loop)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou invoke both death and life in a 10-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range. Each creature of your choice in that area makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 3d6 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. Nonmagical plants in that area that aren't creatures, such as trees and shrubs, wither.\\n\\nIn addition, one creature of your choice in that area can roll one of its unexpended [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]] and regain a number of [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to the roll plus your spellcasting ability modifier. That die is then expended.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2. The number of [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]] that can be rolled and expended increases by one for each spell slot level above 2. You add your spellcasting modifier to the number of [[Hit Points|XPHB]] regained by this spell only once, regardless of the number of [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]] rolled and expended.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a withered vine twisted into a loop)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_zone_of_amicability_au\",\"name\":\"Zone of Amicability\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"AU\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • Self — A magical zone of amicability radiates from you in a 60-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. When you make an ability \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nA magical zone of amicability radiates from you in a 60-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. When you make an ability check to influence a creature in that area, you can treat a d20 roll of 9 or lower as a 10.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"AU\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_antagonize_bmt\",\"name\":\"Antagonize\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"BMT\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You whisper magical words that antagonize one creature of your choice within range. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a playing card depicting a rogue)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou whisper magical words that antagonize one creature of your choice within range. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 4d4 psychic damage and must immediately use its reaction to make a melee attack against another creature of your choice that you can see. If the target can't make this attack (for example, because there is no one within its reach or because its reaction is unavailable), the target instead has disadvantage on the next attack roll it makes before the start of your next turn. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage only.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d4 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a playing card depicting a rogue)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d4\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"BMT\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spirit_of_death_bmt\",\"name\":\"Spirit of Death\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"BMT\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You call forth a spirit that embodies death. The spirit manifests in an unoccupied space you can see within range and uses the reaper spirit stat bloc\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gilded playing card worth at least 400 gp and depicting an avatar of death)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a spirit that embodies death. The spirit manifests in an unoccupied space you can see within range and uses the [[reaper spirit|BMT]] stat block. The spirit disappears when it is reduced to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe spirit is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the spirit shares your initiative count and takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue the spirit any commands, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the reaper spirit stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gilded playing card worth at least 400 gp and depicting an avatar of death)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"BMT\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spray_of_cards_bmt\",\"name\":\"Spray of Cards\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"BMT\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • Self — You spray a 15-foot cone of spectral cards. Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d10 for\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a deck of cards)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou spray a 15-foot cone of spectral cards. Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d10 force damage and has the [[blinded]] condition until the end of its next turn. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage only.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a deck of cards)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"BMT\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_homunculus_servant_efa\",\"name\":\"Homunculus Servant\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EFA\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • 1 hour or Ritual • 10 feet — You summon a special homunculus in an unoccupied space within range. This creature uses the Homunculus Servant stat block. If you already have a homun\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gem worth 100+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou summon a special homunculus in an unoccupied space within range. This creature uses the [[Homunculus Servant|EFA]] stat block. If you already have a homunculus from this spell, the homunculus is replaced by the new one. You determine the homunculus's appearance, such as a mechanical-looking bird, winged vial, or miniature animate cauldron.\\n\\n***Combat.*** The homunculus is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, it shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour or Ritual\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gem worth 100+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EFA\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dark_star_egw\",\"name\":\"Dark Star\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — This spell creates a sphere centered on a point you choose within range. The sphere can have a radius of up to 40 feet. The area within this sphere is\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a shard of onyx and a drop of the caster's blood, both of which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThis spell creates a sphere centered on a point you choose within range. The sphere can have a radius of up to 40 feet. The area within this sphere is filled with magical darkness and crushing gravitational force.\\n\\nFor the duration, the spell's area is difficult terrain. A creature with [[darkvision]] can't see through the magical darkness, and nonmagical light can't illuminate it. No sound can be created within or pass through the area. Any creature or object entirely inside the sphere is immune to thunder damage, and creatures are [[deafened]] while entirely inside it. Casting a spell that includes a verbal component is impossible there.\\n\\nAny creature that enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there must make a Constitution saving throw. The creature takes 8d10 force damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature reduced to 0 hit points by this damage is disintegrated. A disintegrated creature and everything it is wearing and carrying, except magic items, are reduced to a pile of fine gray dust.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a shard of onyx and a drop of the caster's blood, both of which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fortune_s_favor_egw\",\"name\":\"Fortune's Favor\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • 1 minute • 60 feet — You impart latent luck to yourself or one willing creature you can see within range. When the chosen creature makes an attack roll, an ability check, \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a white pearl worth at least 100 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou impart latent luck to yourself or one willing creature you can see within range. When the chosen creature makes an attack roll, an ability check, or a saving throw before the spell ends, it can dismiss this spell on itself to roll an additional d20 and choose which of the d20s to use. Alternatively, when an attack roll is made against the chosen creature, it can dismiss this spell on itself to roll a d20 and choose which of the d20s to use, the one it rolled or the one the attacker rolled.\\n\\nIf the original d20 roll has advantage or disadvantage, the creature rolls the additional d20 after advantage or disadvantage has been applied to the original roll.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a white pearl worth at least 100 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gift_of_alacrity_egw\",\"name\":\"Gift of Alacrity\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • 1 minute • Touch — You touch a willing creature. For the duration, the target can add 1d8 to its initiative rolls.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch a willing creature. For the duration, the target can add 1d8 to its initiative rolls.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gravity_fissure_egw\",\"name\":\"Gravity Fissure\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • Self — You manifest a ravine of gravitational energy in a line originating from you that is 100 feet long and 5 feet wide. Each creature in that line must ma\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a fistful of iron filings)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou manifest a ravine of gravitational energy in a line originating from you that is 100 feet long and 5 feet wide. Each creature in that line must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 8d8 force damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nEach creature within 10 feet of the line but not in it must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 8d8 force damage and be pulled toward the line until the creature is in its area.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a fistful of iron filings)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gravity_sinkhole_egw\",\"name\":\"Gravity Sinkhole\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A 20-foot-radius sphere of crushing force forms at a point you can see within range and tugs at the creatures there. Each creature in the sphere must \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a black marble)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA 20-foot-radius sphere of crushing force forms at a point you can see within range and tugs at the creatures there. Each creature in the sphere must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 5d10 force damage and is pulled in a straight line toward the center of the sphere, ending in an unoccupied space as close to the center as possible (even if that space is in the air). On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage and isn't pulled.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a black marble)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_immovable_object_egw\",\"name\":\"Immovable Object\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch an object that weighs no more than 10 pounds and cause it to become magically fixed in place. You and the creatures you designate when you c\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (gold dust worth at least 25 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch an object that weighs no more than 10 pounds and cause it to become magically fixed in place. You and the creatures you designate when you cast this spell can move the object normally. You can also set a password that, when spoken within 5 feet of the object, suppresses this spell for 1 minute.\\n\\nIf the object is fixed in the air, it can hold up to 4,000 pounds of weight. More weight causes the object to fall. Otherwise, a creature can use an action to make a Strength check against your spell save DC. On a success, the creature can move the object up to 10 feet.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** If you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th or 5th level, the DC to move the object increases by 5, it can carry up to 8,000 pounds of weight, and the duration increases to 24 hours. If you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the DC to move the object increases by 10, it can carry up to 20,000 pounds of weight, and the effect is permanent until dispelled.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (gold dust worth at least 25 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magnify_gravity_egw\",\"name\":\"Magnify Gravity\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — The gravity in a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you can see within range increases for a moment. Each creature in the sphere on the turn wh\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nThe gravity in a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you can see within range increases for a moment. Each creature in the sphere on the turn when you cast the spell must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d8 force damage, and its speed is halved until the end of its next turn. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage and suffers no reduction to its speed.\\n\\nUntil the start of your next turn, any object that isn't being worn or carried in the sphere requires a successful Strength check against your spell save DC to pick up or move.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_pulse_wave_egw\",\"name\":\"Pulse Wave\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Self — You create intense pressure, unleash it in a 30-foot cone, and decide whether the pressure pulls or pushes creatures and objects. Each creature in tha\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create intense pressure, unleash it in a 30-foot cone, and decide whether the pressure pulls or pushes creatures and objects. Each creature in that cone must make a Constitution saving throw. A creature takes 6d6 force damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. And every creature that fails the save is either pulled 15 feet toward you or pushed 15 feet away from you, depending on the choice you made for the spell.\\n\\nIn addition, unsecured objects that are completely within the cone are likewise pulled or pushed 15 feet.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 and the distance pulled or pushed increases by 5 feet for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ravenous_void_egw\",\"name\":\"Ravenous Void\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Evocation • Action • 1000 feet — You create a 20-foot-radius sphere of destructive gravitational force centered on a point you can see within range. For the spell's duration, the sphe\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 1000 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small, nine-pointed star made of iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a 20-foot-radius sphere of destructive gravitational force centered on a point you can see within range. For the spell's duration, the sphere and any space within 100 feet of it are difficult terrain, and nonmagical objects fully inside the sphere are destroyed if they aren't being worn or carried.\\n\\nWhen the sphere appears and at the start of each of your turns until the spell ends, unsecured objects within 100 feet of the sphere are pulled toward the sphere's center, ending in an unoccupied space as close to the center as possible.\\n\\nA creature that starts its turn within 100 feet of the sphere must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pulled straight toward the sphere's center, ending in an unoccupied space as close to the center as possible. A creature that enters the sphere for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there takes 5d10 force damage and is [[restrained]] until it is no longer in the sphere. If the sphere is in the air, the [[restrained]] creature hovers inside the sphere. A creature can use its action to make a Strength check against your spell save DC, ending this [[restrained]] condition on itself or another creature in the sphere that it can reach. A creature reduced to 0 hit points by this spell is annihilated, along with any nonmagical items it is wearing or carrying.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"1000 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small, nine-pointed star made of iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_reality_break_egw\",\"name\":\"Reality Break\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You shatter the barriers between realities and timelines, thrusting a creature into turmoil and madness. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving th\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a crystal prism)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou shatter the barriers between realities and timelines, thrusting a creature into turmoil and madness. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw, or it can't take reactions until the spell ends. The affected target must also roll a d10 at the start of each of its turns; the number rolled determines what happens to the target, as shown on the Reality Break Effects table.\\n\\nAt the end of each of its turns, the affected target can repeat the Wisdom saving throw, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\n##### Reality Break Effects\\n|  d10 | Effect                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |\\n|:----:|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\\n|  1-2 | **Vision of the Far Realm.** The target takes 6d12 psychic damage, and it is [[stunned]] until the end of the turn.                                                                                                                |\\n|  3-5 | **Rending Rift.** The target must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 8d12 force damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.                                                                            |\\n|  6-8 | **Wormhole.** The target is teleported, along with everything it is wearing and carrying, up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see. The target also takes 10d12 force damage and is knocked [[prone]]. |\\n| 9-10 | **Chill of the Dark Void.** The target takes 10d12 cold damage, and it is [[blinded]] until the end of the turn.                                                                                                                   |\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a crystal prism)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d12\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sapping_sting_egw\",\"name\":\"Sapping Sting\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Necromancy Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You sap the vitality of one creature you can see in range. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 1d4 necrotic damage and fall\",\"content\":\"*Necromancy Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou sap the vitality of one creature you can see in range. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 1d4 necrotic damage and fall [[prone]].\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d4 when you reach 5th level (2d4), 11th level (3d4), and 17th level (4d4).\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Necromancy\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_temporal_shunt_egw\",\"name\":\"Temporal Shunt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Reaction, taken when a creature you can see makes an attack roll or starts to cast a spell • 120 feet — You target the triggering creature, which must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or vanish, being thrown to another point in time and causing the attac\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, taken when a creature you can see makes an attack roll or starts to cast a spell\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou target the triggering creature, which must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or vanish, being thrown to another point in time and causing the attack to miss or the spell to be wasted. At the start of its next turn, the target reappears where it was or in the closest unoccupied space. The target doesn't remember you casting the spell or being affected by it.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 5th. All targets must be within 30 feet of each other.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, taken when a creature you can see makes an attack roll or starts to cast a spell\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Reaction\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tether_essence_egw\",\"name\":\"Tether Essence\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — Two creatures you can see within range must make a Constitution saving throw, with disadvantage if they are within 30 feet of each other. Either creat\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a spool of platinum cord worth at least 250 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nTwo creatures you can see within range must make a Constitution saving throw, with disadvantage if they are within 30 feet of each other. Either creature can willingly fail the save. If either save succeeds, the spell has no effect. If both saves fail, the creatures are magically linked for the duration, regardless of the distance between them. When damage is dealt to one of them, the same damage is dealt to the other one. If hit points are restored to one of them, the same number of hit points are restored to the other one. If either of the tethered creatures is reduced to 0 hit points, the spell ends on both. If the spell ends on one creature, it ends on both.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a spool of platinum cord worth at least 250 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_time_ravage_egw\",\"name\":\"Time Ravage\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Necromancy • Action • 90 feet — You target a creature you can see within range, putting its physical form through the devastation of rapid aging. The target must make a Constitution \",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an hourglass filled with diamond dust worth at least 5,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou target a creature you can see within range, putting its physical form through the devastation of rapid aging. The target must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 10d12 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. If the save fails, the target also ages to the point where it has only 30 days left before it dies of old age. In this aged state, the target has disadvantage on attack rolls, ability checks, and saving throws, and its walking speed is halved. Only the [[wish]] spell or the [[greater restoration]] cast with a 9th-level spell slot can end these effects and restore the target to its previous age.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an hourglass filled with diamond dust worth at least 5,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d12\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wristpocket_egw\",\"name\":\"Wristpocket\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"EGW\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action or Ritual • Self — You flick your wrist, causing one object in your hand to vanish. The object, which only you can be holding and can weigh no more than 5 pounds, is tra\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou flick your wrist, causing one object in your hand to vanish. The object, which only you can be holding and can weigh no more than 5 pounds, is transported to an extradimensional space, where it remains for the duration.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can use your action to summon the object to your free hand, and you can use your action to return the object to the extradimensional space. An object still in the pocket plane when the spell ends appears in your space, at your feet.\\n\\n**Subclasses:** [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"EGW\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ashardalon_s_stride_ftd\",\"name\":\"Ashardalon's Stride\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FTD\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — The billowing flames of a dragon blast from your feet, granting you explosive speed. For the duration, your speed increases by 20 feet and moving does\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe billowing flames of a dragon blast from your feet, granting you explosive speed. For the duration, your speed increases by 20 feet and moving doesn't provoke opportunity attacks.\\n\\nWhen you move within 5 feet of a creature or an object that isn't being worn or carried, it takes 1d6 fire damage from your trail of heat. A creature or object can take this damage only once during a turn.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, increase your speed by 5 feet for each spell slot level above 3rd. The spell deals an additional 1d6 fire damage for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FTD\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Artificer\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_draconic_transformation_ftd\",\"name\":\"Draconic Transformation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FTD\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — With a roar, you draw on the magic of dragons to transform yourself, taking on draconic features. You gain the following benefits until the spell ends\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a statuette of a dragon, worth at least 500 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nWith a roar, you draw on the magic of dragons to transform yourself, taking on draconic features. You gain the following benefits until the spell ends:\\n\\n- **Blindsight.** You have [[blindsight]] with a range of 30 feet. Within that range, you can effectively see anything that isn't behind total cover, even if you're [[blinded]] or in darkness. Moreover, you can see an [[invisible]] creature, unless the creature successfully hides from you.\\n- **Breath Weapon.** When you cast this spell, and as a bonus action on subsequent turns for the duration, you can exhale shimmering energy in a 60-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 6d8 force damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n- **Wings.** Incorporeal wings sprout from your back, giving you a flying speed of 60 feet.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a statuette of a dragon, worth at least 500 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"6d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FTD\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fizban_s_platinum_shield_ftd\",\"name\":\"Fizban's Platinum Shield\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FTD\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • Bonus action • 60 feet — You create a field of silvery light that surrounds a creature of your choice within range (you can choose yourself). The field sheds dim light out to \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a platinum-plated dragon scale, worth at least 500 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a field of silvery light that surrounds a creature of your choice within range (you can choose yourself). The field sheds dim light out to 5 feet. While surrounded by the field, a creature gains the following benefits:\\n\\n- **Cover.** The creature has half cover.\\n- **Damage Resistance.** The creature has resistance to acid, cold, fire, lightning, and poison damage.\\n- **Evasion.** If the creature is subjected to an effect that allows it to make a Dexterity saving throw to take only half damage, the creature instead takes no damage if it succeeds on the saving throw, and only half damage if it fails.\\n\\nAs a bonus action on subsequent turns, you can move the field to another creature within 60 feet of the field.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a platinum-plated dragon scale, worth at least 500 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FTD\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_nathair_s_mischief_ftd\",\"name\":\"Nathair's Mischief\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FTD\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • 60 feet — You fill a 20-foot cube you can see within range with fey and draconic magic. Roll on the Mischievous Surge table to determine the magical effect prod\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a piece of crust from an apple pie)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou fill a 20-foot cube you can see within range with fey and draconic magic. Roll on the Mischievous Surge table to determine the magical effect produced, and roll again at the start of each of your turns until the spell ends. You can move the cube up to 10 feet before you roll.\\n\\n##### Mischievous Surge\\n|  d4 | Effect                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |\\n|:---:|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\\n|  1  | The smell of apple pie fills the air, and each creature in the cube must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become [[charmed]] by you until the start of your next turn.                                              |\\n|  2  | Bouquets of flowers appear all around, and each creature in the cube must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be [[blinded]] until the start of your next turn as the flowers spray water in their faces.           |\\n|  3  | Each creature in the cube must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or begin giggling until the start of your next turn. A giggling creature is [[incapacitated]] and uses all its movement to move in a random direction. |\\n|  4  | Drops of molasses hover in the cube, making it difficult terrain until the start of your next turn.                                                                                                                    |\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a piece of crust from an apple pie)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FTD\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_raulothim_s_psychic_lance_ftd\",\"name\":\"Raulothim's Psychic Lance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FTD\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • 120 feet — You unleash a shimmering lance of psychic power from your forehead at a creature that you can see within range. Alternatively, you can utter a creatur\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash a shimmering lance of psychic power from your forehead at a creature that you can see within range. Alternatively, you can utter a creature's name. If the named target is within range, it becomes the spell's target even if you can't see it. If the named target isn't within range, the lance dissipates without effect.\\n\\nThe target must make an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 7d6 psychic damage and is [[incapacitated]] until the start of your next turn. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage and isn't [[incapacitated]].\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"7d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FTD\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_rime_s_binding_ice_ftd\",\"name\":\"Rime's Binding Ice\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FTD\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • Self — A burst of cold energy emanates from you in a 30-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a crea\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S, M (a vial of meltwater)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA burst of cold energy emanates from you in a 30-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 3d8 cold damage and is hindered by ice formations for 1 minute, or until it or another creature within reach of it uses an action to break away the ice. A creature hindered by ice has its speed reduced to 0. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage and isn't hindered by ice.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, increase the cold damage by 1d8 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S, M (a vial of meltwater)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FTD\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_draconic_spirit_ftd\",\"name\":\"Summon Draconic Spirit\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FTD\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You call forth a draconic spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Draconic Spirit stat\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an object with the image of a dragon engraved on it, worth at least 500 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a [[draconic spirit|FTD]]. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Draconic Spirit stat block. When you cast this spell, choose a family of dragon: chromatic, gem, or metallic. The creature resembles a dragon of the chosen family, which determines certain traits in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an object with the image of a dragon engraved on it, worth at least 500 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FTD\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_alustriel_s_mooncloak_frhof\",\"name\":\"Alustriel's Mooncloak\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • Self — For the duration, moonlight fills a 20-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you with Dim Light. While in that area, you\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a moonstone worth 50+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the duration, moonlight fills a 20-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you with [[Dim Light|XPHB]]. While in that area, you and your allies have [[Cover|XPHB|Half Cover]] and [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Cold, Lightning, and Radiant damage.\\n\\nWhile the spell lasts, you can use one of the following options, ending the spell immediately:\\n\\n- **Liberation.** When you fail a saving throw to avoid or end the [[Frightened|XPHB]], [[Grappled|XPHB]], or [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition, you can take a [[Reaction|XPHB]] to succeed on the save instead.\\n- **Respite.** As a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, you or an ally within the area regains [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to 4d10 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a moonstone worth 50+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"4d10\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_backlash_frhof\",\"name\":\"Backlash\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Reaction, which you take in response to taking damage • 60 feet — You ward yourself against destructive energy, reducing the damage taken by 4d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier. If the triggering damage was f\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take in response to taking damage\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou ward yourself against destructive energy, reducing the damage taken by 4d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\nIf the triggering damage was from a creature within range, you can force the creature to make a Constitution saving throw. The creature takes 4d6 Force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage reduction and Force damage from this spell both increase by 1d6 for every spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take in response to taking damage\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Reaction\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blade_of_disaster_frhof\",\"name\":\"Blade of Disaster\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Conjuration • Bonus action • 60 feet — You create a 3-foot-long blade-shaped planar rift that lasts for the duration. The rift appears within range in a space of your choice, and you can im\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a 3-foot-long blade-shaped planar rift that lasts for the duration. The rift appears within range in a space of your choice, and you can immediately make up to two melee spell attacks, each one against a creature or object within 5 feet of the rift. On a hit, the target takes 10d6 Force damage. This attack scores a [[Critical Hit|XPHB]] if the number on the d20 is 18 or higher.\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on your later turns, you can move the rift up to 60 feet and repeat the two attacks against a creature or an object within 5 feet of it. You can direct the attacks at the same target or at different ones.\\n\\nThe blade can harmlessly pass through any barrier, including ones created by spells like [[Wall of Force|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cacophonic_shield_frhof\",\"name\":\"Cacophonic Shield\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Self — Thunderous reverberations fill a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you for the duration. Whenever the [[Emanation\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nThunderous reverberations fill a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you for the duration. Whenever the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] enters a creature's space and whenever a creature enters the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] or ends its turn there, the creature makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 3d6 Thunder damage and has the [[Deafened|XPHB]] condition until the start of your next turn. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage only. A creature makes this save only once per turn. When you cast this spell, you can designate creatures to be unaffected by it.\\n\\nIn addition, you have [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Thunder damage, and ranged attack rolls against you are made with [[Disadvantage|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_constructs_frhof\",\"name\":\"Conjure Constructs\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You conjure a group of intangible, orderly spirits that appear as a Medium group of modrons or other Constructs in an unoccupied space you can see wit\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a brass cog)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou conjure a group of intangible, orderly spirits that appear as a Medium group of modrons or other Constructs in an unoccupied space you can see within range. The spirits last for the duration. When you cast this spell and as a [[Magic|XPHB]] action on subsequent turns, you can command the spirits to target one creature or object you can see within 5 feet of the spirits and create one of the following effects:\\n\\n- **Clockwork Force.** The target makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 Force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n- **Orderly Ward.** The target gains [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to 1d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\nWhen you move on your turn, you can also move the spirits up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage and [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] both increase by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a brass cog)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_death_armor_frhof\",\"name\":\"Death Armor\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Necromancy • Action • Touch — For the duration, an inky aura surrounds one creature you touch. The target has Advantage on Death Saving Throws, and once per turn, when a creature w\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an onyx worth 50+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nFor the duration, an inky aura surrounds one creature you touch. The target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on [[Death Saving Throw|XPHB|Death Saving Throws]], and once per turn, when a creature within 5 feet of the target hits it with a melee attack roll, the attacker takes 2d4 Necrotic damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an onyx worth 50+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_deryan_s_helpful_homunculi_frhof\",\"name\":\"Deryan's Helpful Homunculi\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action or Ritual • Self — You summon a group of helpful spirits, which lasts for the duration. The spirits appear as homunculi or as another Construct of your choice but are in\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (powdered gemstones worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes, and one set of Artisan's Tools with which you have proficiency)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou summon a group of helpful spirits, which lasts for the duration. The spirits appear as homunculi or as another Construct of your choice but are intangible and invulnerable, and they are considered to have proficiency in the [[Arcana|XPHB]] skill and with the set of [[Artisan's Tools|XPHB]] used in the spell's casting.\\n\\nIf you are crafting an item, the spirits function as a single assistant for your crafting, halving the crafting time.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (powdered gemstones worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes, and one set of Artisan's Tools with which you have proficiency)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dirge_frhof\",\"name\":\"Dirge\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Enchantment • Action • Self — Deathly power fills a 60-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you for the duration. When you cast this spell, you can d\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nDeathly power fills a 60-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you for the duration.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can designate creatures to be unaffected by it. Any other creature can't regain [[Hit Points|XPHB]] while in the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. Whenever the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] enters a creature's space and whenever a creature enters the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] or ends its turn there, the creature makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 3d10 Necrotic damage and has the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage and its [[Speed|XPHB]] is halved. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n\\n***Casting as a Circle Spell.*** Casting this as a Circle spell requires a minimum of two secondary casters. If the spell is cast as a Circle spell, its duration becomes [[Concentration|XPHB]], up to 10 minutes.\\n\\nA creature that fails its save against the spell's effect also gains 1 [[Exhaustion|XPHB]] level. While the creature has [[Exhaustion|XPHB]] levels, finishing a [[Long Rest|XPHB]] neither restores lost [[Hit Points|XPHB]] nor reduces the creature's [[Exhaustion|XPHB]] level.\\n\\nWhen the spell is cast, each secondary caster must expend a level 4+ spell slot; otherwise, the spell fails.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_doomtide_frhof\",\"name\":\"Doomtide\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — You create a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of inky fog within range. The fog is magical Darkness and lasts for the duration o\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (soot and a dried eel)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of inky fog within range. The fog is magical [[Darkness|XPHB]] and lasts for the duration or until a strong wind (such as the one created by the [[Gust of Wind|XPHB]] spell) disperses it, ending the spell.\\n\\nEach creature in the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] when it appears makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 5d6 Psychic damage and subtracts 1d6 from its saving throws until the end of its next turn. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage only. A creature also makes this save when the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] moves into its space, when it enters the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]], or when it ends its turn inside the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n\\nThe [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] moves 10 feet away from you at the start of each of your turns.\\n\\n***Casting as a Circle Spell.*** Casting this as a Circle spell requires a minimum of five secondary casters. In addition to the spell's usual components, you must provide a special component (a string of three black pearls from Pandemonium), which the spell consumes. The spell's range increases to 1 mile, and its duration increases to until dispelled (no [[Concentration|XPHB]] required). The spell ends early if any caster who participated in this casting contributes to another casting of [[Doomtide|FRHOF]] as a Circle spell.\\n\\nWhen the spell is cast, each secondary caster must expend a level 3+ spell slot; otherwise, the spell fails.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (soot and a dried eel)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_elminster_s_effulgent_spheres_frhof\",\"name\":\"Elminster's Effulgent Spheres\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • Self — Six chromatic spheres orbit you for the duration. While the spheres are present, you can expend spheres to create the following effects: - Absorb Ener\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an opal worth 1,000 GP+)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nSix chromatic spheres orbit you for the duration.\\n\\nWhile the spheres are present, you can expend spheres to create the following effects:\\n\\n- **Absorb Energy.** When you take Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder damage, you can take a [[Reaction|XPHB]] to expend one sphere and give yourself [[Resistance|XPHB]] to the triggering damage type until the start of your next turn.\\n- **Energy Blast.** As a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you send one sphere hurtling toward a target within 120 feet of yourself. Make a ranged spell attack. On a hit, the target takes 3d6 Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder damage (your choice). Regardless of whether you hit, the sphere is expended.\\n\\nThe spell ends early if you have no more spheres remaining.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The number of spheres increases by 1 for every spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an opal worth 1,000 GP+)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_elminster_s_elusion_frhof\",\"name\":\"Elminster's Elusion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Bonus action • Self — Arcane wards protect you against magic for the duration. You have Advantage on saving throws against spells and magical effects. Additionally, if you \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nArcane wards protect you against magic for the duration. You have [[Advantage|XPHB]] on saving throws against spells and magical effects. Additionally, if you succeed on a saving throw against a spell or magical effect and would normally take half as much damage, you instead take no damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_holy_star_of_mystra_frhof\",\"name\":\"Holy Star of Mystra\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — You create a glowing mote of energy that hovers above you for the duration. The mote sheds Bright Light in a 5-foot radius and Dim Light for an additi\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a glowing mote of energy that hovers above you for the duration. The mote sheds [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 5-foot radius and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 5 feet.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell and as a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on later turns, you can unleash a shining bolt from the mote, targeting one creature within 120 feet of yourself. Make a ranged spell attack. On a hit, the target takes Force or Radiant damage (your choice) equal to 4d10 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\nIn addition, while the mote is present, you have [[Cover|XPHB|Three-Quarters Cover]], and if you succeed on a saving throw against a spell of level 7 or lower that targeted only you and didn't create an area of effect, you can take a [[Reaction|XPHB]] to deflect that spell back at the spell's caster; the caster makes a saving throw against that spell using that caster's own spell save DC.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 8\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_laeral_s_silver_lance_frhof\",\"name\":\"Laeral's Silver Lance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Self — Silver energy bursts out from you in a 120-foot-long, 5-foot-wide [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]]. Each creature of your choice in the [[Line [Are\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a silver pin worth 250+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nSilver energy bursts out from you in a 120-foot-long, 5-foot-wide [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]]. Each creature of your choice in the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] makes a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 3d10 Force damage and has the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage only.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for every spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a silver pin worth 250+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_simbul_s_synostodweomer_frhof\",\"name\":\"Simbul's Synostodweomer\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You imbue one creature you touch with magical healing energy for the duration. Whenever the target casts a spell using a spell slot, the target can im\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou imbue one creature you touch with magical healing energy for the duration. Whenever the target casts a spell using a spell slot, the target can immediately roll a number of unexpended [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]] equal to the spell slot's level and regain [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to the roll's total plus your spellcasting ability modifier; those dice are then expended.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_songal_s_elemental_suffusion_frhof\",\"name\":\"Songal's Elemental Suffusion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • Self — You imbue yourself with the elemental power of genies. You gain the following benefits until the spell ends: - Elemental Immunity. When you cast this \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pearl worth 100+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou imbue yourself with the elemental power of genies. You gain the following benefits until the spell ends:\\n\\n- **Elemental Immunity.** When you cast this spell, choose one of the following damage types: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder. You have [[Resistance|XPHB]] to the chosen damage type.\\n- **Elemental Pulse.** When you cast this spell and at the start of each of your subsequent turns, you release a burst of elemental energy in a 15-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from yourself. Each creature of your choice in that area makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d6 Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder damage (your choice) and has the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage only.\\n- **Flight.** You gain a [[Fly Speed|XPHB]] of 30 feet and can hover.\\n\\n***Casting as a Circle Spell.*** If the spell is cast as a Circle spell, its casting time increases to 1 minute, and its duration increases to [[Concentration|XPHB]], up to 10 minutes. For each secondary caster who participates in the casting, you can choose one additional creature, to a maximum of nine additional creatures. The chosen creatures also gain the benefits of the spell for its duration.\\n\\nWhen the spell is cast, each secondary caster must expend a level 2+ spell slot; otherwise, the spell fails.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pearl worth 100+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spellfire_flare_frhof\",\"name\":\"Spellfire Flare\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — You unleash a blast of brilliant fire. Make a ranged spell attack against a target within range; a target gains no benefit from Half Cover or Three-Qu\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash a blast of brilliant fire. Make a ranged spell attack against a target within range; a target gains no benefit from [[Cover|XPHB|Half Cover]] or [[Cover|XPHB|Three-Quarters Cover]] for this attack roll. On a hit, the target takes 2d10 Radiant damage.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You create an additional blast for each spell slot level above 1. You can direct the blasts at the same target or at different ones. Make a separate attack roll for each blast.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spellfire_storm_frhof\",\"name\":\"Spellfire Storm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — You conjure a pillar of spellfire in a 20-foot-radius, 20-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range. The \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou conjure a pillar of spellfire in a 20-foot-radius, 20-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range. The area of the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] is [[Bright Light|XPHB]], and each creature in it when it appears makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 4d10 Radiant damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature also makes this save when it enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n\\nIn addition, whenever a creature in the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] casts a spell, that creature makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the spell dissipates with no effect, and the action, [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], or [[Reaction|XPHB]] used to cast it is wasted. If that spell was cast with a spell slot, the slot isn't expended.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can designate creatures to be unaffected by it.\\n\\n***Casting as a Circle Spell.*** In addition to the spell's usual components, you must provide a special component (a blue star sapphire worth 25,000+ GP), which the spell consumes. The spell's range increases to 1 mile, and it no longer requires [[Concentration|XPHB]]. When the spell is cast, each secondary caster must expend a level 3+ spell slot; otherwise, the spell fails.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for every spell slot level above 4.\\n\\nThe number of secondary casters determines the spell's area of effect and duration, as shown in the table below. The spell ends early if any caster who participated in this casting contributes to another casting of Spellfire Storm as a Circle spell.\\n\\n| Secondary Casters | Area of Effect                                                             | Duration |\\n|:-----------------:|----------------------------------------------------------------------------|----------|\\n|        1-3        | 40-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]]   | 1 Hour   |\\n|        4-6        | 60-foot-radius, 60-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]]   | 8 Hours  |\\n|         7+        | 100-foot-radius, 100-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] | 24 Hours |\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d10\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sylun_s_viper_frhof\",\"name\":\"Syluné's Viper\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Bonus action • Self — A shimmering, spectral snake encircles your body for the duration. You gain 15 Temporary Hit Points; the spell ends early if you have no Temporary Hit\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a snake fang)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nA shimmering, spectral snake encircles your body for the duration. You gain 15 [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]]; the spell ends early if you have no [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] left.\\n\\nWhile the spell is active, you gain the following benefits:\\n\\n- **Climbing.** You gain a [[Climb Speed|XPHB]] equal to your [[Speed|XPHB]].\\n- **Venomous Bite.** As a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, you can make a ranged spell attack using the snake against one creature within 50 feet. On a hit, the target takes 1d6 Force damage and has the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition until the start of your next turn. While [[Poisoned|XPHB]], the target has the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** For each spell slot level above 3, the number of [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] you gain from this spell increases by 5, and the damage of Venomous Bite increases by 1d6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a snake fang)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wardaway_frhof\",\"name\":\"Wardaway\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"FRHoF\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Action • 60 feet — You hurl a disorienting magical force toward one creature within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw; Constructs and Undead automatica\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature clay hand)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hurl a disorienting magical force toward one creature within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw; Constructs and Undead automatically succeed on this save.\\n\\nOn a failed save, the target takes 2d4 Force damage, its [[Speed|XPHB]] is halved until the start of your next turn, and on its next turn, it can take only an action or a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] (but not both). On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage only.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 2d4 for every spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature clay hand)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"FRHoF\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_encode_thoughts_ggr\",\"name\":\"Encode Thoughts\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"GGR\",\"summary\":\"Enchantment Cantrip • Action • Self — Putting a finger to your head, you pull a memory, an idea, or a message from your mind and transform it into a tangible string of glowing energy calle\",\"content\":\"*Enchantment Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nPutting a finger to your head, you pull a memory, an idea, or a message from your mind and transform it into a tangible string of glowing energy called a thought strand, which persists for the duration or until you cast this spell again. The thought strand appears in an unoccupied space within 5 feet of you as a Tiny, weightless, semisolid object that can be held and carried like a ribbon. It is otherwise stationary.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell while [[concentration||concentrating]] on a spell or an ability that allows you to read or manipulate the thoughts of others (such as [[detect thoughts]] or [[modify memory]]), you can transform the thoughts or memories you read, rather than your own, into a thought strand.\\n\\nCasting this spell while holding a thought strand allows you to instantly receive whatever memory, idea, or message the thought strand contains. (Casting [[detect thoughts]] on the strand has the same effect.)\\n\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"GGR\",\"Enchantment\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_magen_idrotf\",\"name\":\"Create Magen\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"IDRotF\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • 1 hour • Touch — While casting the spell, you place a vial of quicksilver in the chest of a life-sized human doll stuffed with ash or dust. You then stitch up the doll\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a vial of quicksilver worth 500 gp and a life-sized human doll, both of which the spell consumes, and an intricate crystal rod worth at least 1,500 gp that is not consumed)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nWhile casting the spell, you place a vial of quicksilver in the chest of a life-sized human doll stuffed with ash or dust. You then stitch up the doll and drip your blood on it. At the end of the casting, you tap the doll with a crystal rod, transforming it into a magen clothed in whatever the doll was wearing. The type of magen is chosen by you during the casting of the spell. See *appendix C* for different kinds of magen and their statistics.\\n\\nWhen the magen appears, your hit point maximum decreases by an amount equal to the magen's challenge rating (minimum reduction of 1). Only a [[wish]] spell can undo this reduction to your hit point maximum.\\n\\nAny magen you create with this spell obeys your commands without question.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a vial of quicksilver worth 500 gp and a life-sized human doll, both of which the spell consumes, and an intricate crystal rod worth at least 1,500 gp that is not consumed)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"IDRotF\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_frost_fingers_idrotf\",\"name\":\"Frost Fingers\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"IDRotF\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • Self — Freezing cold blasts from your fingertips in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 2d8 cold damage \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nFreezing cold blasts from your fingertips in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 2d8 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe cold freezes nonmagical liquids in the area that aren't being worn or carried.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"IDRotF\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flock_of_familiars_llk\",\"name\":\"Flock of Familiars\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"LLK\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • 1 minute • Touch — You temporarily summon three familiars—spirits that take animal forms of your choice. Each familiar uses the same rules and options for a familiar con\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou temporarily summon three familiars—spirits that take animal forms of your choice. Each familiar uses the same rules and options for a familiar conjured by the [[find familiar]] spell. All the familiars conjured by this spell must be the same type of creature (celestials, fey, or fiends; your choice). If you already have a familiar conjured by the [[find familiar]] spell or similar means, then one fewer familiars are conjured by this spell.\\n\\nFamiliars summoned by this spell can telepathically communicate with you and share their visual or auditory senses while they are within 1 mile of you.\\n\\nWhen you cast a spell with a range of touch, one of the familiars conjured by this spell can deliver the spell, as normal. However, you can cast a touch spell through only one familiar per turn.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you conjure an additional familiar for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"LLK\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_galder_s_speedy_courier_llk\",\"name\":\"Galder's Speedy Courier\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"LLK\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 10 feet — You summon a Small air elemental to a spot within range. The air elemental is formless, nearly transparent, immune to all damage, and cannot interact \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (25 gold pieces, or mineral goods of equivalent value, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou summon a Small air elemental to a spot within range. The air elemental is formless, nearly transparent, immune to all damage, and cannot interact with other creatures or objects. It carries an open, empty chest whose interior dimensions are 3 feet on each side. While the spell lasts, you can deposit as many items inside the chest as will fit. You can then name a living creature you have met and seen at least once before, or any creature for which you possess a body part, lock of hair, clipping from a nail, or similar portion of the creature's body.\\n\\nAs soon as the lid of the chest is closed, the elemental and the chest disappear, then reappear adjacent to the target creature. If the target creature is on another plane, or if it is proofed against magical detection or location, the contents of the chest reappear on the ground at your feet.\\n\\nThe target creature is made aware of the chest's contents before it chooses whether or not to open it, and knows how much of the spell's duration remains in which it can retrieve them. No other creature can open the chest and retrieve its contents. When the spell expires or when all the contents of the chest have been removed, the elemental and the chest disappear. The elemental also disappears if the target creature orders it to return the items to you. When the elemental disappears, any items not taken from the chest reappear on the ground at your feet.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using an 8th-level spell slot, you can send the chest to a creature on a different plane of existence from you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (25 gold pieces, or mineral goods of equivalent value, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"LLK\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_galder_s_tower_llk\",\"name\":\"Galder's Tower\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"LLK\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • 10 minutes • 30 feet — You conjure a two-story tower made of stone, wood, or similar suitably sturdy materials. The tower can be round or square in shape. Each level of the \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a fragment of stone, wood, or other building material)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou conjure a two-story tower made of stone, wood, or similar suitably sturdy materials. The tower can be round or square in shape. Each level of the tower is 10 feet tall and has an area of up to 100 square feet. Access between levels consists of a simple ladder and hatch. Each level takes one of the following forms, chosen by you when you cast the spell:\\n\\n- A bedroom with a bed, chairs, chest, and magical fireplace\\n- A study with desks, books, bookshelves, parchments, ink, and ink pens\\n- A dining space with a table, chairs, magical fireplace, containers, and cooking utensils\\n- A lounge with couches, armchairs, side tables and footstools\\n- A washroom with toilets, washtubs, a magical brazier, and sauna benches\\n- An observatory with a telescope and maps of the night sky\\n- An unfurnished, empty room\\n\\nThe interior of the tower is warm and dry, regardless of conditions outside. Any equipment or furnishings conjured with the tower dissipate into smoke if removed from it. At the end of the spell's duration, all creatures and objects within the tower that were not created by the spell appear safely outside on the ground, and all traces of the tower and its furnishings disappear.\\n\\nYou can cast this spell again while it is active to maintain the tower's existence for another 24 hours. You can create a permanent tower by casting this spell in the same location and with the same configuration every day for one year.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the tower can have one additional story for each slot level beyond 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a fragment of stone, wood, or other building material)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"LLK\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_acid_splash_phb\",\"name\":\"Acid Splash\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Conjuration Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You hurl a bubble of acid. Choose one creature you can see within range, or choose two creatures you can see within range that are within 5 feet of ea\",\"content\":\"*Conjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hurl a bubble of acid. Choose one creature you can see within range, or choose two creatures you can see within range that are within 5 feet of each other. A target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d6 acid damage.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d6 when you reach 5th level (2d6), 11th level (3d6), and 17th level (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Genasi (Water)|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aid_phb\",\"name\":\"Aid\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • 30 feet — Your spell bolsters your allies with toughness and resolve. Choose up to three creatures within range. Each target's hit point maximum and current hit\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny strip of white cloth)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYour spell bolsters your allies with toughness and resolve. Choose up to three creatures within range. Each target's hit point maximum and current hit points increase by 5 for the duration.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, a target's hit points increase by an additional 5 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny strip of white cloth)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\",\"Bard\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_alarm_phb\",\"name\":\"Alarm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • 1 minute or Ritual • 30 feet — You set an alarm against unwanted intrusion. Choose a door, a window, or an area within range that is no larger than a 20-foot cube. Until the spell e\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny bell and a piece of fine silver wire)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou set an alarm against unwanted intrusion. Choose a door, a window, or an area within range that is no larger than a 20-foot cube. Until the spell ends, an alarm alerts you whenever a Tiny or larger creature touches or enters the warded area. When you cast the spell, you can designate creatures that won't set off the alarm. You also choose whether the alarm is mental or audible.\\n\\nA mental alarm alerts you with a ping in your mind if you are within 1 mile of the warded area. This ping awakens you if you are sleeping.\\n\\nAn audible alarm produces the sound of a hand bell for 10 seconds within 60 feet.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny bell and a piece of fine silver wire)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_alter_self_phb\",\"name\":\"Alter Self\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Self — You assume a different form. When you cast the spell, choose one of the following options, the effects of which last for the duration of the spell. Wh\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou assume a different form. When you cast the spell, choose one of the following options, the effects of which last for the duration of the spell. While the spell lasts, you can end one option as an action to gain the benefits of a different one.\\n\\n***Aquatic Adaptation.*** You adapt your body to an aquatic environment, sprouting gills and growing webbing between your fingers. You can breathe underwater and gain a swimming speed equal to your walking speed.\\n\\n***Change Appearance.*** You transform your appearance. You decide what you look like, including your height, weight, facial features, sound of your voice, hair length, coloration, and distinguishing characteristics, if any. You can make yourself appear as a member of another race, though none of your statistics change. You also can't appear as a creature of a different size than you, and your basic shape stays the same; if you're bipedal, you can't use this spell to become quadrupedal, for instance. At any time for the duration of the spell, you can use your action to change your appearance in this way again.\\n\\n***Natural Weapons.*** You grow claws, fangs, spines, horns, or a different natural weapon of your choice. Your unarmed strikes deal 1d6 bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage, as appropriate to the natural weapon you chose, and you are proficient with your unarmed strikes. Finally, the natural weapon is magic and you have a +1 bonus to the attack and damage rolls you make using it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Moon|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Master of Myriad Forms|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animal_friendship_phb\",\"name\":\"Animal Friendship\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — This spell lets you convince a beast that you mean it no harm. Choose a beast that you can see within range. It must see and hear you. If the beast's \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a morsel of food)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nThis spell lets you convince a beast that you mean it no harm. Choose a beast that you can see within range. It must see and hear you. If the beast's Intelligence is 4 or higher, the spell fails. Otherwise, the beast must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be [[charmed]] by you for the spell's duration. If you or one of your companions harms the target, the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can affect one additional beast for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]], [[Yuan-Ti|MPMM]], [[Yuan-ti Pureblood|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a morsel of food)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animal_messenger_phb\",\"name\":\"Animal Messenger\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — By means of this spell, you use an animal to deliver a message. Choose a Tiny beast you can see within range, such as a squirrel, a blue jay, or a bat\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a morsel of food)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nBy means of this spell, you use an animal to deliver a message. Choose a Tiny beast you can see within range, such as a squirrel, a blue jay, or a bat. You specify a location, which you must have visited, and a recipient who matches a general description, such as \\\"a man or woman dressed in the uniform of the town guard\\\" or \\\"a red-haired dwarf wearing a pointed hat.\\\" You also speak a message of up to twenty-five words. The target beast travels for the duration of the spell toward the specified location, covering about 50 miles per 24 hours for a flying messenger, or 25 miles for other animals.\\n\\nWhen the messenger arrives, it delivers your message to the creature that you described, replicating the sound of your voice. The messenger speaks only to a creature matching the description you gave. If the messenger doesn't reach its destination before the spell ends, the message is lost, and the beast makes its way back to where you cast this spell.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** If you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the duration of the spell increases by 48 hours for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a morsel of food)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animal_shapes_phb\",\"name\":\"Animal Shapes\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — Your magic turns others into beasts. Choose any number of willing creatures that you can see within range. You transform each target into the form of \",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 24 hours\\nYour magic turns others into beasts. Choose any number of willing creatures that you can see within range. You transform each target into the form of a Large or smaller beast with a challenge rating of 4 or lower. On subsequent turns, you can use your action to transform affected creatures into new forms.\\n\\nThe transformation lasts for the duration for each target, or until the target drops to 0 hit points or dies. You can choose a different form for each target. A target's game statistics are replaced by the statistics of the chosen beast, though the target retains its alignment and Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores. The target assumes the hit points of its new form, and when it reverts to its normal form, it returns to the number of hit points it had before it transformed. If it reverts as a result of dropping to 0 hit points, any excess damage carries over to its normal form. As long as the excess damage doesn't reduce the creature's normal form to 0 hit points, it isn't knocked [[unconscious]]. The creature is limited in the actions it can perform by the nature of its new form, and it can't speak or cast spells.\\n\\nThe target's gear melds into the new form. The target can't activate, wield, or otherwise benefit from any of its equipment.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animate_dead_phb\",\"name\":\"Animate Dead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • 1 minute • 10 feet — This spell creates an undead servant. Choose a pile of bones or a corpse of a Medium or Small humanoid within range. Your spell imbues the target with\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of blood, a piece of flesh, and a pinch of bone dust)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThis spell creates an undead servant. Choose a pile of bones or a corpse of a Medium or Small humanoid within range. Your spell imbues the target with a foul mimicry of life, raising it as an undead creature. The target becomes a [[skeleton]] if you chose bones or a [[zombie]] if you chose a corpse (the DM has the creature's game statistics).\\n\\nOn each of your turns, you can use a bonus action to mentally command any creature you made with this spell if the creature is within 60 feet of you (if you control multiple creatures, you can command any or all of them at the same time, issuing the same command to each one). You decide what action the creature will take and where it will move during its next turn, or you can issue a general command, such as to guard a particular chamber or corridor. If you issue no commands, the creature only defends itself against hostile creatures. Once given an order, the creature continues to follow it until its task is complete.\\n\\nThe creature is under your control for 24 hours, after which it stops obeying any command you've given it. To maintain control of the creature for another 24 hours, you must cast this spell on the creature again before the current 24-hour period ends. This use of the spell reasserts your control over up to four creatures you have animated with this spell, rather than animating a new one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, you animate or reassert control over two additional undead creatures for each slot level above 3rd. Each of the creatures must come from a different corpse or pile of bones.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Undying Servitude|TCE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of blood, a piece of flesh, and a pinch of bone dust)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animate_objects_phb\",\"name\":\"Animate Objects\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — Objects come to life at your command. Choose up to ten nonmagical objects within range that are not being worn or carried. Medium targets count as two\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nObjects come to life at your command. Choose up to ten nonmagical objects within range that are not being worn or carried. Medium targets count as two objects, Large targets count as four objects, Huge targets count as eight objects. You can't animate any object larger than Huge. Each target animates and becomes a creature under your control until the spell ends or until reduced to 0 hit points.\\n\\nAs a bonus action, you can mentally command any creature you made with this spell if the creature is within 500 feet of you (if you control multiple creatures, you can command any or all of them at the same time, issuing the same command to each one). You decide what action the creature will take and where it will move during its next turn, or you can issue a general command, such as to guard a particular chamber or corridor. If you issue no commands, the creature only defends itself against hostile creatures. Once given an order, the creature continues to follow it until its task is complete.\\n\\n##### Animated Object Statistics\\n| Size                                    |  HP |  AC | Attack                     | Str | Dex |\\n|-----------------------------------------|:---:|:---:|----------------------------|:---:|:---:|\\n| [[animated object (tiny)|PHB|Tiny]]     |  20 |  18 | +8 to hit, 1d4 + 4 damage  |  4  |  18 |\\n| [[animated object (small)|PHB|Small]]   |  25 |  16 | +6 to hit, 1d8 + 2 damage  |  6  |  14 |\\n| [[animated object (medium)|PHB|Medium]] |  40 |  13 | +5 to hit, 2d6 + 1 damage  |  10 |  12 |\\n| [[animated object (large)|PHB|Large]]   |  50 |  10 | +6 to hit, 2d10 + 2 damage |  14 |  10 |\\n| [[animated object (huge)|PHB|Huge]]     |  80 |  10 | +8 to hit, 2d12 + 4 damage |  18 |  6  |\\n\\nAn animated object is a construct with AC, hit points, attacks, Strength, and Dexterity determined by its size. Its Constitution is 10 and its Intelligence and Wisdom are 3, and its Charisma is 1. Its speed is 30 feet; if the object lacks legs or other appendages it can use for locomotion, it instead has a flying speed of 30 feet and can hover. If the object is securely attached to a surface or a larger object, such as a chain bolted to a wall, its speed is 0. It has blindsight with a radius of 30 feet and is blind beyond that distance. When the animated object drops to 0 hit points, it reverts to its original object form, and any remaining damage carries over to its original object form.\\n\\nIf you command an object to attack, it can make a single melee attack against a creature within 5 feet of it. It makes a slam attack with an attack bonus and bludgeoning damage determined by its size. The DM might rule that a specific object inflicts slashing or piercing damage based on its form.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** If you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, you can animate two additional objects for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4 + 4\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_antilife_shell_phb\",\"name\":\"Antilife Shell\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • Self — A shimmering barrier extends out from you in a 10-foot radius and moves with you, remaining centered on you and hedging out creatures other than undea\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nA shimmering barrier extends out from you in a 10-foot radius and moves with you, remaining centered on you and hedging out creatures other than undead and constructs. The barrier lasts for the duration.\\n\\nThe barrier prevents an affected creature from passing or reaching through. An affected creature can cast spells or make attacks with ranged or reach weapons through the barrier.\\n\\nIf you move so that an affected creature is forced to pass through the barrier, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_antimagic_field_phb\",\"name\":\"Antimagic Field\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Abjuration • Action • Self — A 10-foot-radius invisible sphere of antimagic surrounds you. This area is divorced from the magical energy that suffuses the multiverse. Within the s\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of powdered iron or iron filings)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nA 10-foot-radius invisible sphere of antimagic surrounds you. This area is divorced from the magical energy that suffuses the multiverse. Within the sphere, spells can't be cast, summoned creatures disappear, and even magic items become mundane. Until the spell ends, the sphere moves with you, centered on you.\\n\\nSpells and other magical effects, except those created by an artifact or a deity, are suppressed in the sphere and can't protrude into it. A slot expended to cast a suppressed spell is consumed. While an effect is suppressed, it doesn't function, but the time it spends suppressed counts against its duration.\\n\\n***Targeted Effects.*** Spells and other magical effects, such as [[magic missile]] and [[charm person]], that target a creature or an object in the sphere have no effect on that target.\\n\\n***Areas of Magic.*** The area of another spell or magical effect, such as [[fireball]], can't extend into the sphere. If the sphere overlaps an area of magic, the part of the area that is covered by the sphere is suppressed. For example, the flames created by a wall of fire are suppressed within the sphere, creating a gap in the wall if the overlap is large enough.\\n\\n***Spells.*** Any active spell or other magical effect on a creature or an object in the sphere is suppressed while the creature or object is in it.\\n\\n***Magic Items.*** The properties and powers of magic items are suppressed in the sphere. For example, a +1 longsword in the sphere functions as a nonmagical longsword.\\n\\nA magic weapon's properties and powers are suppressed if it is used against a target in the sphere or wielded by an attacker in the sphere. If a magic weapon or a piece of magic ammunition fully leaves the sphere (for example, if you fire a magic arrow or throw a magic spear at a target outside the sphere), the magic of the item ceases to be suppressed as soon as it exits.\\n\\n***Magical Travel.*** Teleportation and planar travel fail to work in the sphere, whether the sphere is the destination or the departure point for such magical travel. A portal to another location, world, or plane of existence, as well as an opening to an extradimensional space such as that created by the rope trick spell, temporarily closes while in the sphere.\\n\\n***Creatures and Objects.*** A creature or object summoned or created by magic temporarily winks out of existence in the sphere. Such a creature instantly reappears once the space the creature occupied is no longer within the sphere.\\n\\n***Dispel Magic.*** Spells and magical effects such as [[dispel magic]] have no effect on the sphere. Likewise, the spheres created by different [[antimagic field]] spells don't nullify each other.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of powdered iron or iron filings)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_antipathy_sympathy_phb\",\"name\":\"Antipathy/Sympathy\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Enchantment • 1 hour • 60 feet — This spell attracts or repels creatures of your choice. You target something within range, either a Huge or smaller object or creature or an area that\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (either a lump of alum soaked in vinegar for the antipathy effect or a drop of honey for the sympathy effect)\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nThis spell attracts or repels creatures of your choice. You target something within range, either a Huge or smaller object or creature or an area that is no larger than a 200-foot cube. Then specify a kind of intelligent creature, such as red dragons, goblins, or vampires. You invest the target with an aura that either attracts or repels the specified creatures for the duration. Choose antipathy or sympathy as the aura's effect.\\n\\n***Antipathy.*** The enchantment causes creatures of the kind you designated to feel an intense urge to leave the area and avoid the target. When such a creature can see the target or comes within 60 feet of it, the creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become [[frightened]]. The creature remains [[frightened]] while it can see the target or is within 60 feet of it. While [[frightened]] by the target, the creature must use its movement to move to the nearest safe spot from which it can't see the target. If the creature moves more than 60 feet from the target and can't see it, the creature is no longer [[frightened]], but the creature becomes [[frightened]] again if it regains sight of the target or moves within 60 feet of it.\\n\\n***Sympathy.*** The enchantment causes the specified creatures to feel an intense urge to approach the target while within 60 feet of it or able to see it. When such a creature can see the target or comes within 60 feet of it, the creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or use its movement on each of its turns to enter the area or move within reach of the target. When the creature has done so, it can't willingly move away from the target.\\n\\nIf the target damages or otherwise harms an affected creature, the affected creature can make a Wisdom saving throw to end the effect, as described below.\\n\\n***Ending the Effect.*** If an affected creature ends its turn while not within 60 feet of the target or able to see it, the creature makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the creature is no longer affected by the target and recognizes the feeling of repugnance or attraction as magical. In addition, a creature affected by the spell is allowed another Wisdom saving throw every 24 hours while the spell persists.\\n\\nA creature that successfully saves against this effect is immune to it for 1 minute, after which time it can be affected again.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (either a lump of alum soaked in vinegar for the antipathy effect or a drop of honey for the sympathy effect)\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"200-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 8\",\"Special\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Bard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_arcane_eye_phb\",\"name\":\"Arcane Eye\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Divination • Action • 30 feet — You create an invisible, magical eye within range that hovers in the air for the duration. You mentally receive visual information from the eye, which\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of bat fur)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou create an invisible, magical eye within range that hovers in the air for the duration.\\n\\nYou mentally receive visual information from the eye, which has normal vision and [[darkvision]] out to 30 feet. The eye can look in every direction.\\n\\nAs an action, you can move the eye up to 30 feet in any direction. There is no limit to how far away from you the eye can move, but it can't enter another plane of existence. A solid barrier blocks the eye's movement, but the eye can pass through an opening as small as 1 inch in diameter.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]], [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Visions of Distant Realms|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of bat fur)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_arcane_gate_phb\",\"name\":\"Arcane Gate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 500 feet — You create linked teleportation portals that remain open for the duration. Choose two points on the ground that you can see, one point within 10 feet \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 500 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create linked teleportation portals that remain open for the duration. Choose two points on the ground that you can see, one point within 10 feet of you and one point within 500 feet of you. A circular portal, 10 feet in diameter, opens over each point. If the portal would open in the space occupied by a creature, the spell fails, and the casting is lost.\\n\\nThe portals are two-dimensional glowing rings filled with mist, hovering inches from the ground and perpendicular to it at the points you choose. A ring is visible only from one side (your choice), which is the side that functions as a portal.\\n\\nAny creature or object entering the portal exits from the other portal as if the two were adjacent to each other; passing through a portal from the nonportal side has no effect. The mist that fills each portal is opaque and blocks vision through it. On your turn, you can rotate the rings as a bonus action so that the active side faces in a different direction.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"500 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_arcane_lock_phb\",\"name\":\"Arcane Lock\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a closed door, window, gate, chest, or other entryway, and it becomes locked for the duration. You and the creatures you designate when you \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (gold dust worth at least 25 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou touch a closed door, window, gate, chest, or other entryway, and it becomes locked for the duration. You and the creatures you designate when you cast this spell can open the object normally. You can also set a password that, when spoken within 5 feet of the object, suppresses this spell for 1 minute. Otherwise, it is impassable until it is broken or the spell is dispelled or suppressed. Casting [[knock]] on the object suppresses [[arcane lock]] for 10 minutes.\\n\\nWhile affected by this spell, the object is more difficult to break or force open; the DC to break it or pick any locks on it increases by 10.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]], [[Tiefling (Mammon)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (gold dust worth at least 25 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_armor_of_agathys_phb\",\"name\":\"Armor of Agathys\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Action • Self — A protective magical force surrounds you, manifesting as a spectral frost that covers you and your gear. You gain 5 temporary hit points for the durat\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a cup of water)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nA protective magical force surrounds you, manifesting as a spectral frost that covers you and your gear. You gain 5 temporary hit points for the duration. If a creature hits you with a melee attack while you have these hit points, the creature takes 5 cold damage.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, both the temporary hit points and the cold damage increase by 5 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]], [[Tiefling (Levistus)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a cup of water)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_arms_of_hadar_phb\",\"name\":\"Arms of Hadar\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • Self — You invoke the power of Hadar, the Dark Hunger. Tendrils of dark energy erupt from you and batter all creatures within 10 feet of you. Each creature i\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou invoke the power of Hadar, the Dark Hunger. Tendrils of dark energy erupt from you and batter all creatures within 10 feet of you. Each creature in that area must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 2d6 necrotic damage and can't take reactions until its next turn. On a successful save, the creature takes half damage, but suffers no other effect.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_astral_projection_phb\",\"name\":\"Astral Projection\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Necromancy • 1 hour • 10 feet — You and up to eight willing creatures within range project your astral bodies into the Astral Plane (the spell fails and the casting is wasted if you \",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (for each creature you affect with this spell, you must provide one jacinth worth at least 1,000 gp and one ornately carved bar of silver worth at least 100 gp, all of which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Special\\nYou and up to eight willing creatures within range project your astral bodies into the Astral Plane (the spell fails and the casting is wasted if you are already on that plane). The material body you leave behind is [[unconscious]] and in a state of suspended animation, it doesn't need food or air and doesn't age.\\n\\nYour astral body resembles your mortal form in almost every way, replicating your game statistics and possessions. The principal difference is the addition of a silvery cord that extends from between your shoulder blades and trails behind you, fading to invisibility after 1 foot. This cord is your tether to your material body. As long as the tether remains intact, you can find your way home. If the cord is cut-something that can happen only when an effect specifically states that it does-your soul and body are separated, killing you instantly.\\n\\nYour astral form can freely travel through the Astral Plane and can pass through portals there leading to any other plane. If you enter a new plane or return to the plane you were on when casting this spell, your body and possessions are transported along the silver cord, allowing you to re-enter your body as you enter the new plane. Your astral form is a separate incarnation. Any damage or other effects that apply to it have no effect on your physical body, nor do they persist when you return to it.\\n\\nThe spell ends for you and your companions when you use your action to dismiss it. When the spell ends, the affected creature returns to its physical body, and it awakens.\\n\\nThe spell might also end early for you or one of your companions. A successful [[dispel magic]] spell used against an astral or physical body ends the spell for that creature. If a creature's original body or its astral form drops to 0 hit points, the spell ends for that creature. If the spell ends and the silver cord is intact, the cord pulls the creature's astral form back to its body, ending its state of suspended animation.\\n\\nIf you are returned to your body prematurely, your companions remain in their astral forms and must find their own way back to their bodies, usually by dropping to 0 hit points.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Monk|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (for each creature you affect with this spell, you must provide one jacinth worth at least 1,000 gp and one ornately carved bar of silver worth at least 100 gp, all of which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Special\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 9\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Monk\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_augury_phb\",\"name\":\"Augury\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — By casting gem-inlaid sticks, rolling dragon bones, laying out ornate cards, or employing some other divining tool, you receive an omen from an otherw\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (specially marked sticks, bones, or similar tokens worth at least 25 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nBy casting gem-inlaid sticks, rolling dragon bones, laying out ornate cards, or employing some other divining tool, you receive an omen from an otherworldly entity about the results of a specific course of action that you plan to take within the next 30 minutes. The DM chooses from the following possible omens:\\n\\n- Weal, for good results\\n- Woe, for bad results\\n- Weal and woe, for both good and bad results\\n- Nothing, for results that aren't especially good or bad\\n\\nThe spell doesn't take into account any possible circumstances that might change the outcome, such as the casting of additional spells or the loss or gain of a companion.\\n\\nIf you cast the spell two or more times before completing your next long rest, there is a cumulative 25 percent chance for each casting after the first that you get a random reading. The DM makes this roll in secret.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Ancestral Guardian|XGE]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (specially marked sticks, bones, or similar tokens worth at least 25 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aura_of_life_phb\",\"name\":\"Aura of Life\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • Self — Life-preserving energy radiates from you in an aura with a 30-foot radius. Until the spell ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. Each nonhos\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nLife-preserving energy radiates from you in an aura with a 30-foot radius. Until the spell ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. Each nonhostile creature in the aura (including you) has resistance to necrotic damage, and its hit point maximum can't be reduced. In addition, a nonhostile, living creature regains 1 hit point when it starts its turn in the aura with 0 hit points.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]], [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"1\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Cleric\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aura_of_purity_phb\",\"name\":\"Aura of Purity\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • Self — Purifying energy radiates from you in an aura with a 30-foot radius. Until the spell ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. Each nonhostile c\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nPurifying energy radiates from you in an aura with a 30-foot radius. Until the spell ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. Each nonhostile creature in the aura (including you) can't become diseased, has resistance to poison damage, and has advantage on saving throws against effects that cause any of the following conditions: [[blinded]], [[charmed]], [[deafened]], [[frightened]], [[paralyzed]], [[poisoned]], and [[stunned]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]], [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aura_of_vitality_phb\",\"name\":\"Aura of Vitality\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Self — Healing energy radiates from you in an aura with a 30-foot radius. Until the spell ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. You can use a bonus\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nHealing energy radiates from you in an aura with a 30-foot radius. Until the spell ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. You can use a bonus action to cause one creature in the aura (including you) to regain 2d6 hit points.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"2d6\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_awaken_phb\",\"name\":\"Awaken\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • 8 hours • Touch — After spending the casting time tracing magical pathways within a precious gemstone, you touch a Huge or smaller beast or plant. The target must have \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 8 hours\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an agate worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nAfter spending the casting time tracing magical pathways within a precious gemstone, you touch a Huge or smaller beast or plant. The target must have either no Intelligence score or an Intelligence of 3 or less. The target gains an Intelligence of 10. The target also gains the ability to speak one language you know. If the target is a plant, it gains the ability to move its limbs, roots, vines, creepers, and so forth, and it gains senses similar to a human's. Your DM chooses statistics appropriate for the awakened plant, such as the statistics for the [[awakened shrub]] or the [[awakened tree]].\\n\\nThe awakened beast or plant is [[charmed]] by you for 30 days or until you or your companions do anything harmful to it. When the [[charmed]] condition ends, the awakened creature chooses whether to remain friendly to you, based on how you treated it while it was [[charmed]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"8 hours\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an agate worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_bane_phb\",\"name\":\"Bane\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — Up to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range must make Charisma saving throws. Whenever a target that fails this saving throw ma\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of blood)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nUp to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range must make Charisma saving throws. Whenever a target that fails this saving throw makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the target must roll a d4 and subtract the number rolled from the attack roll or saving throw.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Thief of Five Fates|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of blood)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_banishing_smite_phb\",\"name\":\"Banishing Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Bonus action • Self — The next time you hit a creature with a weapon attack before this spell ends, your weapon crackles with force, and the attack deals an extra 5d10 forc\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe next time you hit a creature with a weapon attack before this spell ends, your weapon crackles with force, and the attack deals an extra 5d10 force damage to the target. Additionally, if this attack reduces the target to 50 hit points or fewer, you banish it. If the target is native to a different plane of existence than the one you're on, the target disappears, returning to its home plane. If the target is native to the plane you're on, the creature vanishes into a harmless demiplane. While there, the target is [[incapacitated]]. It remains there until the spell ends, at which point the target reappears in the space it left or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"5d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_banishment_phb\",\"name\":\"Banishment\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to send one creature that you can see within range to another plane of existence. The target must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an item distasteful to the target)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to send one creature that you can see within range to another plane of existence. The target must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be banished.\\n\\nIf the target is native to the plane of existence you're on, you banish the target to a harmless demiplane. While there, the target is [[incapacitated]]. The target remains there until the spell ends, at which point the target reappears in the space it left or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied.\\n\\nIf the target is native to a different plane of existence than the one you're on, the target is banished with a faint popping noise, returning to its home plane. If the spell ends before 1 minute has passed, the target reappears in the space it left or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied. Otherwise, the target doesn't return.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an item distasteful to the target)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_barkskin_phb\",\"name\":\"Barkskin\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature. Until the spell ends, the target's skin has a rough, bark-like appearance, and the target's AC can't be less than 16, re\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a handful of oak bark)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou touch a willing creature. Until the spell ends, the target's skin has a rough, bark-like appearance, and the target's AC can't be less than 16, regardless of what kind of armor it is wearing.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a handful of oak bark)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_beacon_of_hope_phb\",\"name\":\"Beacon of Hope\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • 30 feet — This spell bestows hope and vitality. Choose any number of creatures within range. For the duration, each target has advantage on Wisdom saving throws\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThis spell bestows hope and vitality. Choose any number of creatures within range. For the duration, each target has advantage on Wisdom saving throws and death saving throws, and regains the maximum number of hit points possible from any healing.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_beast_sense_phb\",\"name\":\"Beast Sense\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action or Ritual • Touch — You touch a willing beast. For the duration of the spell, you can use your action to see through the beast's eyes and hear what it hears, and continue\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou touch a willing beast. For the duration of the spell, you can use your action to see through the beast's eyes and hear what it hears, and continue to do so until you use your action to return to your normal senses. While perceiving through the beast's senses, you gain the benefits of any special senses possessed by that creature, though you are [[blinded]] and [[deafened]] to your own surroundings.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Totem Warrior|PHB]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_bestow_curse_phb\",\"name\":\"Bestow Curse\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • Touch — You touch a creature, and that creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become cursed for the duration of the spell. When you cast this spell\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou touch a creature, and that creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become cursed for the duration of the spell. When you cast this spell, choose the nature of the curse from the following options:\\n\\n- Choose one ability score. While cursed, the target has disadvantage on ability checks and saving throws made with that ability score.\\n- While cursed, the target has disadvantage on attack rolls against you.\\n- While cursed, the target must make a Wisdom saving throw at the start of each of its turns. If it fails, it wastes its action that turn doing nothing.\\n- While the target is cursed, your attacks and spells deal an extra 1d8 necrotic damage to the target.\\n\\nA [[remove curse]] spell ends this effect. At the DM's option, you may choose an alternative curse effect, but it should be no more powerful than those described above. The DM has final say on such a curse's effect.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** If you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the duration is [[concentration]], up to 10 minutes. If you use a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the duration is 8 hours. If you use a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the duration is 24 hours. If you use a 9th level spell slot, the spell lasts until it is dispelled. Using a spell slot of 5th level or higher grants a duration that doesn't require [[concentration]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Sign of Ill Omen|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_bigby_s_hand_phb\",\"name\":\"Bigby's Hand\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You create a Large hand of shimmering, translucent force in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The hand lasts for the spell's duration\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an eggshell and a snakeskin glove)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a Large hand of shimmering, translucent force in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The hand lasts for the spell's duration, and it moves at your command, mimicking the movements of your own hand.\\n\\nThe hand is an object that has AC 20 and hit points equal to your hit point maximum. If it drops to 0 hit points, the spell ends. It has a Strength of 26 (+8) and a Dexterity of 10 (+0). The hand doesn't fill its space.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell and as a bonus action on your subsequent turns, you can move the hand up to 60 feet and then cause one of the following effects with it.\\n\\n***Clenched Fist.*** The hand strikes one creature or object within 5 feet of it. Make a melee spell attack for the hand using your game statistics. On a hit, the target takes 4d8 force damage.\\n\\n***Forceful Hand.*** The hand attempts to push a creature within 5 feet of it in a direction you choose. Make a check with the hand's Strength contested by the Strength ([[Athletics]]) check of the target. If the target is Medium or smaller, you have advantage on the check. If you succeed, the hand pushes the target up to 5 feet plus a number of feet equal to five times your spellcasting ability modifier. The hand moves with the target to remain within 5 feet of it.\\n\\n***Grasping Hand.*** The hand attempts to grapple a Huge or smaller creature within 5 feet of it. You use the hand's Strength score to resolve the grapple. If the target is Medium or smaller, you have advantage on the check. While the hand is grappling the target, you can use a bonus action to have the hand crush it. When you do so, the target takes bludgeoning damage equal to 2d6 + your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\n***Interposing Hand.*** The hand interposes itself between you and a creature you choose until you give the hand a different command. The hand moves to stay between you and the target, providing you with half cover against the target. The target can't move through the hand's space if its Strength score is less than or equal to the hand's Strength score. If its Strength score is higher than the hand's Strength score, the target can move toward you through the hand's space, but that space is difficult terrain for the target.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the damage from the clenched fist option increases by 2d8 and the damage from the grasping hand increases by 2d6 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an eggshell and a snakeskin glove)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blade_barrier_phb\",\"name\":\"Blade Barrier\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — You create a vertical wall of whirling, razor-sharp blades made of magical energy. The wall appears within range and lasts for the duration. You can m\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a vertical wall of whirling, razor-sharp blades made of magical energy. The wall appears within range and lasts for the duration. You can make a straight wall up to 100 feet long, 20 feet high, and 5 feet thick, or a ringed wall up to 60 feet in diameter, 20 feet high, and 5 feet thick. The wall provides three-quarters cover to creatures behind it, and its space is difficult terrain.\\n\\nWhen a creature enters the wall's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, the creature must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 6d10 slashing damage. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d10\",\"damageType\":\"Slashing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Slashing Damage\",\"Slashing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blade_ward_phb\",\"name\":\"Blade Ward\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Abjuration Cantrip • Action • Self — You extend your hand and trace a sigil of warding in the air. Until the end of your next turn, you have resistance against bludgeoning, piercing, and \",\"content\":\"*Abjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou extend your hand and trace a sigil of warding in the air. Until the end of your next turn, you have resistance against bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage dealt by weapon attacks.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Genasi (Earth)|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_bless_phb\",\"name\":\"Bless\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You bless up to three creatures of your choice within range. Whenever a target makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the targe\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sprinkling of holy water)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou bless up to three creatures of your choice within range. Whenever a target makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to the attack roll or saving throw.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sprinkling of holy water)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blight_phb\",\"name\":\"Blight\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Necromancy • Action • 30 feet — Necromantic energy washes over a creature of your choice that you can see within range, draining moisture and vitality from it. The target must make a\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nNecromantic energy washes over a creature of your choice that you can see within range, draining moisture and vitality from it. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. The target takes 8d8 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n\\nIf you target a plant creature or a magical plant, it makes the saving throw with disadvantage, and the spell deals maximum damage to it.\\n\\nIf you target a nonmagical plant that isn't a creature, such as a tree or shrub, it doesn't make a saving throw, it simply withers and dies.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]], [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blinding_smite_phb\",\"name\":\"Blinding Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — The next time you hit a creature with a melee weapon attack during this spell's duration, your weapon flares with bright light, and the attack deals a\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe next time you hit a creature with a melee weapon attack during this spell's duration, your weapon flares with bright light, and the attack deals an extra 3d8 radiant damage to the target. Additionally, the target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or be [[blinded]] until the spell ends.\\n\\nA creature [[blinded]] by this spell makes another Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a successful save, it is no longer [[blinded]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blindness_deafness_phb\",\"name\":\"Blindness/Deafness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Necromancy • Action • 30 feet — You can blind or deafen a foe. Choose one creature that you can see within range to make a Constitution saving throw. If it fails, the target is eithe\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou can blind or deafen a foe. Choose one creature that you can see within range to make a Constitution saving throw. If it fails, the target is either [[blinded]] or [[deafened]] (your choice) for the duration. At the end of each of its turns, the target can make a Constitution saving throw. On a success, the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Deep)|DMG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Svirfneblin Magic|MTF]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blink_phb\",\"name\":\"Blink\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Self — Roll a d20 at the end of each of your turns for the duration of the spell. On a roll of 11 or higher, you vanish from your current plane of existence \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nRoll a d20 at the end of each of your turns for the duration of the spell. On a roll of 11 or higher, you vanish from your current plane of existence and appear in the Ethereal Plane (the spell fails and the casting is wasted if you were already on that plane). At the start of your next turn, and when the spell ends if you are on the Ethereal Plane, you return to an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within 10 feet of the space you vanished from. If no unoccupied space is available within that range, you appear in the nearest unoccupied space (chosen at random if more than one space is equally near). You can dismiss this spell as an action.\\n\\nWhile on the Ethereal Plane, you can see and hear the plane you originated from, which is cast in shades of gray, and you can't see anything there more than 60 feet away. You can only affect and be affected by other creatures on the Ethereal Plane. Creatures that aren't there can't perceive you or interact with you, unless they have the ability to do so.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blur_phb\",\"name\":\"Blur\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • Self — Your body becomes blurred, shifting and wavering to all who can see you. For the duration, any creature has disadvantage on attack rolls against you. \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYour body becomes blurred, shifting and wavering to all who can see you. For the duration, any creature has disadvantage on attack rolls against you. An attacker is immune to this effect if it doesn't rely on sight, as with blindsight, or can see through illusions, as with [[truesight]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Deep)|DMG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Svirfneblin Magic|MTF]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_branding_smite_phb\",\"name\":\"Branding Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — The next time you hit a creature with a weapon attack before this spell ends, the weapon gleams with astral radiance as you strike. The attack deals a\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe next time you hit a creature with a weapon attack before this spell ends, the weapon gleams with astral radiance as you strike. The attack deals an extra 2d6 radiant damage to the target, which becomes visible if it's [[invisible]], and the target sheds dim light in a 5-foot radius and can't become [[invisible]] until the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the extra damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Zariel)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_burning_hands_phb\",\"name\":\"Burning Hands\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • Self — As you hold your hands with thumbs touching and fingers spread, a thin sheet of flames shoots forth from your outstretched fingertips. Each creature i\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nAs you hold your hands with thumbs touching and fingers spread, a thin sheet of flames shoots forth from your outstretched fingertips. Each creature in a 15-foot cone must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 3d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe fire ignites any flammable objects in the area that aren't being worn or carried.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Way of the Sun Soul|XGE]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Fire)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Fire)|MPMM]], [[Tiefling (Mephistopheles)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Hellfire)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Sweeping Cinder Strike|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_call_lightning_phb\",\"name\":\"Call Lightning\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — A storm cloud appears in the shape of a cylinder that is 10 feet tall with a 60-foot radius, centered on a point you can see within range directly abo\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA storm cloud appears in the shape of a cylinder that is 10 feet tall with a 60-foot radius, centered on a point you can see within range directly above you. The spell fails if you can't see a point in the air where the storm cloud could appear (for example, if you are in a room that can't accommodate the cloud).\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, choose a point you can see under the cloud. A bolt of lightning flashes down from the cloud to that point. Each creature within 5 feet of that point must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 3d10 lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. On each of your turns until the spell ends, you can use your action to call down lightning in this way again, targeting the same point or a different one.\\n\\nIf you are outdoors in stormy conditions when you cast this spell, the spell gives you control over the existing storm instead of creating a new one. Under such conditions, the spell's damage increases by 1d10.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th or higher level, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_calm_emotions_phb\",\"name\":\"Calm Emotions\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to suppress strong emotions in a group of people. Each humanoid in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range mus\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to suppress strong emotions in a group of people. Each humanoid in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range must make a Charisma saving throw; a creature can choose to fail this saving throw if it wishes. If a creature fails its saving throw, choose one of the following two effects.\\n\\nYou can suppress any effect causing a target to be [[charmed]] or [[frightened]]. When this spell ends, any suppressed effect resumes, provided that its duration has not expired in the meantime.\\n\\nAlternatively, you can make a target indifferent about creatures of your choice that it is hostile toward. This indifference ends if the target is attacked or harmed by a spell or if it witnesses any of its friends being harmed. When the spell ends, the creature becomes hostile again, unless the DM rules otherwise.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]], [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_chain_lightning_phb\",\"name\":\"Chain Lightning\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — You create a bolt of lightning that arcs toward a target of your choice that you can see within range. Three bolts then leap from that target to as ma\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fur; a piece of amber, glass, or a crystal rod; and three silver pins)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create a bolt of lightning that arcs toward a target of your choice that you can see within range. Three bolts then leap from that target to as many as three other targets, each of which must be within 30 feet of the first target. A target can be a creature or an object and can be targeted by only one of the bolts.\\n\\nA target must make a Dexterity saving throw. The target takes 10d8 lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, one additional bolt leaps from the first target to another target for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fur; a piece of amber, glass, or a crystal rod; and three silver pins)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d8\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_charm_person_phb\",\"name\":\"Charm Person\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You attempt to charm a humanoid you can see within range. It must make a Wisdom saving throw, and does so with advantage if you or your companions are\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou attempt to charm a humanoid you can see within range. It must make a Wisdom saving throw, and does so with advantage if you or your companions are fighting it. If it fails the saving throw, it is [[charmed]] by you until the spell ends or until you or your companions do anything harmful to it. The [[charmed]] creature regards you as a friendly acquaintance. When the spell ends, the creature knows it was [[charmed]] by you.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 1st. The creatures must be within 30 feet of each other when you target them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Fierna)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Devil's Tongue)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_chill_touch_phb\",\"name\":\"Chill Touch\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Necromancy Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — You create a ghostly, skeletal hand in the space of a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the creature to assail it with the chi\",\"content\":\"*Necromancy Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou create a ghostly, skeletal hand in the space of a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the creature to assail it with the chill of the grave. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 necrotic damage, and it can't regain hit points until the start of your next turn. Until then, the hand clings to the target.\\n\\nIf you hit an undead target, it also has disadvantage on attack rolls against you until the end of your next turn.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Zendikar; Mul Daya Nation)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Undertaker|AU]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_chromatic_orb_phb\",\"name\":\"Chromatic Orb\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — You hurl a 4-inch-diameter sphere of energy at a creature that you can see within range. You choose acid, cold, fire, lightning, poison, or thunder fo\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 50 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hurl a 4-inch-diameter sphere of energy at a creature that you can see within range. You choose acid, cold, fire, lightning, poison, or thunder for the type of orb you create, and then make a ranged spell attack against the target. If the attack hits, the creature takes 3d8 damage of the type you chose.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 50 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_circle_of_death_phb\",\"name\":\"Circle of Death\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • Action • 150 feet — A sphere of negative energy ripples out in a 60-foot-radius sphere from a point within range. Each creature in that area must make a Constitution savi\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (the powder of a crushed black pearl worth at least 500 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA sphere of negative energy ripples out in a 60-foot-radius sphere from a point within range. Each creature in that area must make a Constitution saving throw. A target takes 8d6 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the damage increases by 2d6 for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (the powder of a crushed black pearl worth at least 500 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_circle_of_power_phb\",\"name\":\"Circle of Power\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • Self — Divine energy radiates from you, distorting and diffusing magical energy within 30 feet of you. Until the spell ends, the sphere moves with you, cente\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nDivine energy radiates from you, distorting and diffusing magical energy within 30 feet of you. Until the spell ends, the sphere moves with you, centered on you. For the duration, each friendly creature in the area (including you) has advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects. Additionally, when an affected creature succeeds on a saving throw made against a spell or magical effect that allows it to make a saving throw to take only half damage, it instead takes no damage if it succeeds on the saving throw.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_clairvoyance_phb\",\"name\":\"Clairvoyance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Divination • 10 minutes • 1 mile — You create an invisible sensor within range in a location familiar to you (a place you have visited or seen before) or in an obvious location that is \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 1 mile\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a focus worth at least 100 gp, either a jeweled horn for hearing or a glass eye for seeing)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create an invisible sensor within range in a location familiar to you (a place you have visited or seen before) or in an obvious location that is unfamiliar to you (such as behind a door, around a corner, or in a grove of trees). The sensor remains in place for the duration, and it can't be attacked or otherwise interacted with.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, you choose seeing or hearing. You can use the chosen sense through the sensor as if you were in its space. As your action, you can switch between seeing and hearing.\\n\\nA creature that can see the sensor (such as a creature benefiting from [[see invisibility]] or [[truesight]]) sees a luminous, intangible orb about the size of your fist.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Ancestral Guardian|XGE]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]], [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"1 mile\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a focus worth at least 100 gp, either a jeweled horn for hearing or a glass eye for seeing)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_clone_phb\",\"name\":\"Clone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Necromancy • 1 hour • Touch — This spell grows an inert duplicate of a living creature as a safeguard against death. This clone forms inside the vessel used in the spell's casting \",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 1,000 gp and at least 1 cubic inch of flesh of the creature that is to be cloned, which the spell consumes, and a vessel worth at least 2,000 gp that has a sealable lid and is large enough to hold the creature being cloned, such as a huge urn, coffin, mud-filled cyst in the ground, or crystal container filled with salt water)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThis spell grows an inert duplicate of a living creature as a safeguard against death. This clone forms inside the vessel used in the spell's casting and grows to full size and maturity after 120 days; you can also choose to have the clone be a younger version of the same creature. It remains inert and endures indefinitely, as long as its vessel remains undisturbed.\\n\\nAt any time after the clone matures, if the original creature dies, its soul transfers to the clone, provided that the soul is free and willing to return. The clone is physically identical to the original and has the same personality, memories, and abilities, but none of the original's equipment. The original creature's physical remains, if they still exist, become inert and can't thereafter be restored to life, since the creature's soul is elsewhere.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 1,000 gp and at least 1 cubic inch of flesh of the creature that is to be cloned, which the spell consumes, and a vessel worth at least 2,000 gp that has a sealable lid and is large enough to hold the creature being cloned, such as a huge urn, coffin, mud-filled cyst in the ground, or crystal container filled with salt water)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 8\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cloud_of_daggers_phb\",\"name\":\"Cloud of Daggers\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You fill the air with spinning daggers in a cube 5 feet on each side, centered on a point you choose within range. A creature takes 4d4 slashing damag\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sliver of glass)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou fill the air with spinning daggers in a cube 5 feet on each side, centered on a point you choose within range. A creature takes 4d4 slashing damage when it enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 2d4 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sliver of glass)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d4\",\"damageType\":\"Slashing\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Slashing Damage\",\"Slashing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cloudkill_phb\",\"name\":\"Cloudkill\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — You create a 20-foot-radius sphere of poisonous, yellow-green fog centered on a point you choose within range. The fog spreads around corners. It last\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a 20-foot-radius sphere of poisonous, yellow-green fog centered on a point you choose within range. The fog spreads around corners. It lasts for the duration or until strong wind disperses the fog, ending the spell. Its area is heavily obscured.\\n\\nWhen a creature enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, that creature must make a Constitution saving throw. The creature takes 5d8 poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Creatures are affected even if they hold their breath or don't need to breathe.\\n\\nThe fog moves 10 feet away from you at the start of each of your turns, rolling along the surface of the ground. The vapors, being heavier than air, sink to the lowest level of the land, even pouring down openings.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d8\",\"damageType\":\"Poison\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Poison Damage\",\"Poison\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_color_spray_phb\",\"name\":\"Color Spray\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Illusion • Action • Self — A dazzling array of flashing, colored light springs from your hand. Roll 6d10; the total is how many hit points of creatures this spell can effect. Cr\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of powder or sand that is colored red, yellow, and blue)\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nA dazzling array of flashing, colored light springs from your hand. Roll 6d10; the total is how many hit points of creatures this spell can effect. Creatures in a 15-foot cone originating from you are affected in ascending order of their current hit points (ignoring [[unconscious]] creatures and creatures that can't see).\\n\\nStarting with the creature that has the lowest current hit points, each creature affected by this spell is [[blinded]] until the end of your next turn. Subtract each creature's hit points from the total before moving on to the creature with the next lowest hit points. A creature's hit points must be equal to or less than the remaining total for that creature to be affected.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, roll an additional 2d10 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of powder or sand that is colored red, yellow, and blue)\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_command_phb\",\"name\":\"Command\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You speak a one-word command to a creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or follow the command on its nex\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou speak a one-word command to a creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or follow the command on its next turn. The spell has no effect if the target is undead, if it doesn't understand your language, or if your command is directly harmful to it.\\n\\nSome typical commands and their effects follow. You might issue a command other than one described here. If you do so, the DM determines how the target behaves. If the target can't follow your command, the spell ends.\\n\\n***Approach.*** The target moves toward you by the shortest and most direct route, ending its turn if it moves within 5 feet of you.\\n\\n***Drop.*** The target drops whatever it is holding and then ends its turn.\\n\\n***Flee.*** The target spends its turn moving away from you by the fastest available means.\\n\\n***Grovel.*** The target falls [[prone]] and then ends its turn.\\n\\n***Halt.*** The target doesn't move and takes no actions. A flying creature stays aloft, provided that it is able to do so. If it must move to stay aloft, it flies the minimum distance needed to remain in the air.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can affect one additional creature for each slot level above 1st. The creatures must be within 30 feet of each other when you target them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Glamour|XGE]] ([[Bard|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Bard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_commune_phb\",\"name\":\"Commune\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — You contact your deity or a divine proxy and ask up to three questions that can be answered with a yes or no. You must ask your questions before the s\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (incense and a vial of holy or unholy water)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou contact your deity or a divine proxy and ask up to three questions that can be answered with a yes or no. You must ask your questions before the spell ends. You receive a correct answer for each question.\\n\\nDivine beings aren't necessarily omniscient, so you might receive \\\"unclear\\\" as an answer if a question pertains to information that lies beyond the deity's knowledge. In a case where a one-word answer could be misleading or contrary to the deity's interests, the DM might offer a short phrase as an answer instead.\\n\\nIf you cast the spell two or more times before finishing your next long rest, there is a cumulative 25 percent chance for each casting after the first that you get no answer. The DM makes this roll in secret.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (incense and a vial of holy or unholy water)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_commune_with_nature_phb\",\"name\":\"Commune with Nature\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — You briefly become one with nature and gain knowledge of the surrounding territory. In the outdoors, the spell gives you knowledge of the land within \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou briefly become one with nature and gain knowledge of the surrounding territory. In the outdoors, the spell gives you knowledge of the land within 3 miles of you. In caves and other natural underground settings, the radius is limited to 300 feet. The spell doesn't function where nature has been replaced by construction, such as in dungeons and towns.\\n\\nYou instantly gain knowledge of up to three facts of your choice about any of the following subjects as they relate to the area:\\n\\n- terrain and bodies of water\\n- prevalent plants, minerals, animals, or peoples\\n- powerful celestials, fey, fiends, elementals, or undead\\n- influence from other planes of existence\\n- buildings\\n\\nFor example, you could determine the location of powerful undead in the area, the location of major sources of safe drinking water, and the location of any nearby towns.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Totem Warrior|PHB]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_compelled_duel_phb\",\"name\":\"Compelled Duel\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Bonus action • 30 feet — You attempt to compel a creature into a duel. One creature that you can see within range must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the creatu\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to compel a creature into a duel. One creature that you can see within range must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the creature is drawn to you, compelled by your divine demand. For the duration, it has disadvantage on attack rolls against creatures other than you, and must make a Wisdom saving throw each time it attempts to move to a space that is more than 30 feet away from you; if it succeeds on this saving throw, this spell doesn't restrict the target's movement for that turn.\\n\\nThe spell ends if you attack any other creature, if you cast a spell that targets a hostile creature other than the target, if a creature friendly to you damages the target or casts a harmful spell on it, or if you end your turn more than 30 feet away from the target.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_comprehend_languages_phb\",\"name\":\"Comprehend Languages\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — For the duration, you understand the literal meaning of any spoken language that you hear. You also understand any written language that you see, but \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of soot and salt)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nFor the duration, you understand the literal meaning of any spoken language that you hear. You also understand any written language that you see, but you must be touching the surface on which the words are written. It takes about 1 minute to read one page of text.\\n\\nThis spell doesn't decode secret messages in a text or a glyph, such as an arcane sigil, that isn't part of a written language.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of soot and salt)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_compulsion_phb\",\"name\":\"Compulsion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — Creatures of your choice that you can see within range and that can hear you must make a Wisdom saving throw. A target automatically succeeds on this \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nCreatures of your choice that you can see within range and that can hear you must make a Wisdom saving throw. A target automatically succeeds on this saving throw if it can't be [[charmed]]. On a failed save, a target is affected by this spell. Until the spell ends, you can use a bonus action on each of your turns to designate a direction that is horizontal to you. Each affected target must use as much of its movement as possible to move in that direction on its next turn. It can take its action before it moves. After moving in this way, it can make another Wisdom saving throw to try to end the effect.\\n\\nA target isn't compelled to move into an obviously deadly hazard, such as a fire or pit, but it will provoke opportunity attacks to move in the designated direction.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Bewitching Whispers|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cone_of_cold_phb\",\"name\":\"Cone of Cold\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • Self — A blast of cold air erupts from your hands. Each creature in a 60-foot cone must make a Constitution saving throw. A creature takes 8d8 cold damage on\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small crystal or glass cone)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA blast of cold air erupts from your hands. Each creature in a 60-foot cone must make a Constitution saving throw. A creature takes 8d8 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nA creature killed by this spell becomes a frozen statue until it thaws.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Breath of Winter|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small crystal or glass cone)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d8\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Druid\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_confusion_phb\",\"name\":\"Confusion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • 90 feet — This spell assaults and twists creatures' minds, spawning delusions and provoking uncontrolled action. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius sphere center\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (three nut shells)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThis spell assaults and twists creatures' minds, spawning delusions and provoking uncontrolled action. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw when you cast this spell or be affected by it.\\n\\nAn affected target can't take reactions and must roll a d10 at the start of each of its turns to determine its behavior for that turn.\\n\\n##### Confusion Behavior\\n|  d10 | Behavior                                                                                                                                                                                        |\\n|:----:|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\\n|   1  | The creature uses all its movement to move in a random direction. To determine the direction, roll a d8 and assign a direction to each die face. The creature doesn't take an action this turn. |\\n|  2-6 | The creature doesn't move or take actions this turn.                                                                                                                                            |\\n|  7-8 | The creature uses its action to make a melee attack against a randomly determined creature within its reach. If there is no creature within its reach, the creature does nothing this turn.     |\\n| 9-10 | The creature can act and move normally.                                                                                                                                                         |\\n\\nAt the end of each of its turns, an affected target can make a Wisdom saving throw. If it succeeds, this effect ends for that target.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the radius of the sphere increases by 5 feet for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Dreadful Word|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (three nut shells)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_animals_phb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Animals\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You summon fey spirits that take the form of beasts and appear in unoccupied spaces that you can see within range. Choose one of the following options\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou summon fey spirits that take the form of beasts and appear in unoccupied spaces that you can see within range. Choose one of the following options for what appears:\\n\\n- One beast of challenge rating 2 or lower\\n- Two beasts of challenge rating 1 or lower\\n- Four beasts of challenge rating 1/2 or lower\\n- Eight beasts of challenge rating 1/4 or lower\\n\\nEach beast is also considered fey, and it disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe summoned creatures are friendly to you and your companions. Roll initiative for the summoned creatures as a group, which has its own turns. They obey any verbal commands that you issue to them (no action required by you). If you don't issue any commands to them, they defend themselves from hostile creatures, but otherwise take no actions.\\n\\nThe DM has the creatures' statistics.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using certain higher-level spell slots, you choose one of the summoning options above, and more creatures appear: twice as many with a 5th-level slot, three times as many with a 7th-level slot, and four times as many with a 9th-level slot.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_barrage_phb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Barrage\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • Self — You throw a nonmagical weapon or fire a piece of nonmagical ammunition into the air to create a cone of identical weapons that shoot forward and then \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (one piece of ammunition or a thrown weapon)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou throw a nonmagical weapon or fire a piece of nonmagical ammunition into the air to create a cone of identical weapons that shoot forward and then disappear. Each creature in a 60-foot cone must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 3d8 damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. The damage type is the same as that of the weapon or ammunition used as a component.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (one piece of ammunition or a thrown weapon)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_celestial_phb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Celestial\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • 1 minute • 90 feet — You summon a celestial of challenge rating 4 or lower, which appears in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The celestial disappears wh\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou summon a celestial of challenge rating 4 or lower, which appears in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The celestial disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe celestial is friendly to you and your companions for the duration. Roll initiative for the celestial, which has its own turns. It obeys any verbal commands that you issue to it (no action required by you), as long as they don't violate its alignment. If you don't issue any commands to the celestial, it defends itself from hostile creatures but otherwise takes no actions.\\n\\nThe DM has [[couatl||the celestial]]'s statistics.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a 9th-level spell slot, you summon a celestial of challenge rating 5 or lower.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_elemental_phb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Elemental\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • 1 minute • 90 feet — You call forth an elemental servant. Choose an area of air, earth, fire, or water that fills a 10-foot cube within range. An elemental of challenge ra\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (burning incense for air, soft clay for earth, sulfur and phosphorus for fire, or water and sand for water)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth an elemental servant. Choose an area of air, earth, fire, or water that fills a 10-foot cube within range. An elemental of challenge rating 5 or lower appropriate to the area you chose appears in an unoccupied space within 10 feet of it. For example, a [[fire elemental]] emerges from a bonfire, and an [[earth elemental]] rises up from the ground. The elemental disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe elemental is friendly to you and your companions for the duration. Roll initiative for the elemental, which has its own turns. It obeys any verbal commands that you issue to it (no action required by you). If you don't issue any commands to the elemental, it defends itself from hostile creatures but otherwise takes no actions.\\n\\nIf your [[concentration]] is broken, the elemental doesn't disappear. Instead, you lose control of the elemental, it becomes hostile toward you and your companions, and it might attack. An uncontrolled elemental can't be dismissed by you, and it disappears 1 hour after you summoned it.\\n\\nThe DM has the elemental's statistics.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the challenge rating increases by 1 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]], [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Minions of Chaos|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (burning incense for air, soft clay for earth, sulfur and phosphorus for fire, or water and sand for water)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_fey_phb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Fey\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • 1 minute • 90 feet — You summon a fey creature of challenge rating 6 or lower, or a fey spirit that takes the form of a beast of challenge rating 6 or lower. It appears in\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou summon a fey creature of challenge rating 6 or lower, or a fey spirit that takes the form of a beast of challenge rating 6 or lower. It appears in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The fey creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe fey creature is friendly to you and your companions for the duration. Roll initiative for the creature, which has its own turns. It obeys any verbal commands that you issue to it (no action required by you), as long as they don't violate its alignment. If you don't issue any commands to the fey creature, it defends itself from hostile creatures but otherwise takes no actions.\\n\\nIf your [[concentration]] is broken, the fey creature doesn't disappear. Instead, you lose control of the fey creature, it becomes hostile toward you and your companions, and it might attack. An uncontrolled fey creature can't be dismissed by you, and it disappears 1 hour after you summoned it.\\n\\nThe DM has the fey creature's statistics.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the challenge rating increases by 1 for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_minor_elementals_phb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Minor Elementals\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • 1 minute • 90 feet — You summon elementals that appear in unoccupied spaces that you can see within range. You choose one of the following options for what appears: - One \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou summon elementals that appear in unoccupied spaces that you can see within range. You choose one of the following options for what appears:\\n\\n- One elemental of challenge rating 2 or lower\\n- Two elementals of challenge rating 1 or lower\\n- Four elementals of challenge rating 1/2 or lower\\n- Eight elementals of challenge rating 1/4 or lower.\\n\\nAn elemental summoned by this spell disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe summoned creatures are friendly to you and your companions. Roll initiative for the summoned creatures as a group, which has its own turns. They obey any verbal commands that you issue to them (no action required by you). If you don't issue any commands to them, they defend themselves from hostile creatures, but otherwise take no actions.\\n\\nThe DM has the creatures' statistics.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using certain higher-level spell slots, you choose one of the summoning options above, and more creatures appear: twice as many with a 6th-level slot and three times as many with an 8th-level slot.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_volley_phb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Volley\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 150 feet — You fire a piece of nonmagical ammunition from a ranged weapon or throw a nonmagical weapon into the air and choose a point within range. Hundreds of \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (one piece of ammunition or one thrown weapon)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou fire a piece of nonmagical ammunition from a ranged weapon or throw a nonmagical weapon into the air and choose a point within range. Hundreds of duplicates of the ammunition or weapon fall in a volley from above and then disappear. Each creature in a 40-foot-radius, 20-foot-high cylinder centered on that point must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 8d8 damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. The damage type is the same as that of the ammunition or weapon.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (one piece of ammunition or one thrown weapon)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_woodland_beings_phb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Woodland Beings\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You summon fey creatures that appear in unoccupied spaces that you can see within range. Choose one of the following options for what appears: - One f\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (one holly berry per creature summoned)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou summon fey creatures that appear in unoccupied spaces that you can see within range. Choose one of the following options for what appears:\\n\\n- One fey creature of challenge rating 2 or lower\\n- Two fey creatures of challenge rating 1 or lower\\n- Four fey creatures of challenge rating 1/2 or lower\\n- Eight fey creatures of challenge rating 1/4 or lower\\n\\nA summoned creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe summoned creatures are friendly to you and your companions. Roll initiative for the summoned creatures as a group, which have their own turns. They obey any verbal commands that you issue to them (no action required by you). If you don't issue any commands to them, they defend themselves from hostile creatures, but otherwise take no actions.\\n\\nThe DM has the creatures' statistics.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using certain higher-level spell slots, you choose one of the summoning options above, and more creatures appear: twice as many with a 6th-level slot and three times as many with an 8th-level slot.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (one holly berry per creature summoned)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_contact_other_plane_phb\",\"name\":\"Contact Other Plane\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — You mentally contact a demigod, the spirit of a long-dead sage, or some other mysterious entity from another plane. Contacting this extraplanar intell\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou mentally contact a demigod, the spirit of a long-dead sage, or some other mysterious entity from another plane. Contacting this extraplanar intelligence can strain or even break your mind. When you cast this spell, make a DC 15 Intelligence saving throw. On a failure, you take 6d6 psychic damage and are insane until you finish a long rest. While insane, you can't take actions, can't understand what other creatures say, can't read, and speak only in gibberish. A [[greater restoration]] spell cast on you ends this effect.\\n\\nOn a successful save, you can ask the entity up to five questions. You must ask your questions before the spell ends. The DM answers each question with one word, such as \\\"yes,\\\" \\\"no,\\\" \\\"maybe,\\\" \\\"never,\\\" \\\"irrelevant,\\\" or \\\"unclear\\\" (if the entity doesn't know the answer to the question). If a one-word answer would be misleading, the DM might instead offer a short phrase as an answer.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"6d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_contagion_phb\",\"name\":\"Contagion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Action • Touch — Your touch inflicts disease. Make a melee spell attack against a creature within your reach. On a hit, the target is poisoned. At the end of each of t\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 7 days\\nYour touch inflicts disease. Make a melee spell attack against a creature within your reach. On a hit, the target is [[poisoned]].\\n\\nAt the end of each of the [[poisoned]] target's turns, the target must make a Constitution saving throw. If the target succeeds on three of these saves, it is no longer [[poisoned]], and the spell ends. If the target fails three of these saves, the target is no longer [[poisoned]], but choose one of the diseases below. The target is subjected to the chosen disease for the spell's duration.\\n\\nSince this spell induces a natural disease in its target, any effect that removes a disease or otherwise ameliorates a disease's effects apply to it.\\n\\n***Blinding Sickness.*** Pain grips the creature's mind, and its eyes turn milky white. The creature has disadvantage on Wisdom checks and Wisdom saving throws and is [[blinded]].\\n\\n***Filth Fever.*** A raging fever sweeps through the creature's body. The creature has disadvantage on Strength checks, Strength saving throws, and attack rolls that use Strength.\\n\\n***Flesh Rot.*** The creature's flesh decays. The creature has disadvantage on Charisma checks and vulnerability to all damage.\\n\\n***Mindfire.*** The creature's mind becomes feverish. The creature has disadvantage on Intelligence checks and Intelligence saving throws, and the creature behaves as if under the effects of the [[confusion]] spell during combat.\\n\\n***Seizure.*** The creature is overcome with shaking. The creature has disadvantage on Dexterity checks, Dexterity saving throws, and attack rolls that use Dexterity.\\n\\n***Slimy Doom.*** The creature begins to bleed uncontrollably. The creature has disadvantage on Constitution checks and Constitution saving throws. In addition, whenever the creature takes damage, it is [[stunned]] until the end of its next turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"7 days\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_contingency_phb\",\"name\":\"Contingency\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • 10 minutes • Self — Choose a spell of 5th level or lower that you can cast, that has a casting time of 1 action, and that can target you. You cast that spell—called the c\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a statuette of yourself carved from ivory and decorated with gems worth at least 1,500 gp)\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nChoose a spell of 5th level or lower that you can cast, that has a casting time of 1 action, and that can target you. You cast that spell—called the contingent spell—as part of casting contingency, expending spell slots for both, but the contingent spell doesn't come into effect. Instead, it takes effect when a certain circumstance occurs. You describe that circumstance when you cast the two spells. For example, a contingency cast with [[water breathing]] might stipulate that [[water breathing]] comes into effect when you are engulfed in water or a similar liquid.\\n\\nThe contingent spell takes effect immediately after the circumstance is met for the first time, whether or not you want it to, and then contingency ends.\\n\\nThe contingent spell takes effect only on you, even if it can normally target others. You can use only one contingency spell at a time. If you cast this spell again, the effect of another contingency spell on you ends. Also, contingency ends on you if its material component is ever not on your person.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a statuette of yourself carved from ivory and decorated with gems worth at least 1,500 gp)\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_continual_flame_phb\",\"name\":\"Continual Flame\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • Touch — A flame, equivalent in brightness to a torch, springs forth from an object that you touch. The effect looks like a regular flame, but it creates no he\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (ruby dust worth 50 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nA flame, equivalent in brightness to a torch, springs forth from an object that you touch. The effect looks like a regular flame, but it creates no heat and doesn't use oxygen. A continual flame can be covered or hidden but not smothered or quenched.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (ruby dust worth 50 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_control_water_phb\",\"name\":\"Control Water\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Action • 300 feet — Until the spell ends, you control any freestanding water inside an area you choose that is a cube up to 100 feet on a side. You can choose from any of\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of water and a pinch of dust)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nUntil the spell ends, you control any freestanding water inside an area you choose that is a cube up to 100 feet on a side. You can choose from any of the following effects when you cast this spell. As an action on your turn, you can repeat the same effect or choose a different one.\\n\\n***Flood.*** You cause the water level of all standing water in the area to rise by as much as 20 feet. If the area includes a shore, the flooding water spills over onto dry land.\\n\\nIf you choose an area in a large body of water, you instead create a 20-foot tall wave that travels from one side of the area to the other and then crashes down. Any Huge or smaller vehicles in the wave's path are carried with it to the other side. Any Huge or smaller vehicles struck by the wave have a 25 percent chance of capsizing.\\n\\nThe water level remains elevated until the spell ends or you choose a different effect. If this effect produced a wave, the wave repeats on the start of your next turn while the flood effect lasts.\\n\\n***Part Water.*** You cause water in the area to move apart and create a trench. The trench extends across the spell's area, and the separated water forms a wall to either side. The trench remains until the spell ends or you choose a different effect. The water then slowly fills in the trench over the course of the next round until the normal water level is restored.\\n\\n***Redirect Flow.*** You cause flowing water in the area to move in a direction you choose, even if the water has to flow over obstacles, up walls, or in other unlikely directions. The water in the area moves as you direct it, but once it moves beyond the spell's area, it resumes its flow based on the terrain conditions. The water continues to move in the direction you chose until the spell ends or you choose a different effect.\\n\\n***Whirlpool.*** This effect requires a body of water at least 50 feet square and 25 feet deep. You cause a whirlpool to form in the center of the area. The whirlpool forms a vortex that is 5 feet wide at the base, up to 50 feet wide at the top, and 25 feet tall. Any creature or object in the water and within 25 feet of the vortex is pulled 10 feet toward it. A creature can swim away from the vortex by making a Strength ([[Athletics]]) check against your spell save DC.\\n\\nWhen a creature enters the vortex for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 2d8 bludgeoning damage and is caught in the vortex until the spell ends. On a successful save, the creature takes half damage, and isn't caught in the vortex. A creature caught in the vortex can use its action to try to swim away from the vortex as described above, but has disadvantage on the Strength ([[Athletics]]) check to do so.\\n\\nThe first time each turn that an object enters the vortex, the object takes 2d8 bludgeoning damage; this damage occurs each round it remains in the vortex.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of water and a pinch of dust)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_control_weather_phb\",\"name\":\"Control Weather\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Transmutation • 10 minutes • Self — You take control of the weather within 5 miles of you for the duration. You must be outdoors to cast this spell. Moving to a place where you don't hav\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (burning incense and bits of earth and wood mixed in water)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 8 hours\\nYou take control of the weather within 5 miles of you for the duration. You must be outdoors to cast this spell. Moving to a place where you don't have a clear path to the sky ends the spell early.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, you change the current weather conditions, which are determined by the DM based on the climate and season. You can change precipitation, temperature, and wind. It takes 1d4 × 10 minutes for the new conditions to take effect. Once they do so, you can change the conditions again. When the spell ends, the weather gradually returns to normal.\\n\\nWhen you change the weather conditions, find a current condition on the following tables and change its stage by one, up or down. When changing the wind, you can change its direction.\\n\\n##### Precipitation\\n| Stage | Condition                                  |\\n|:-----:|--------------------------------------------|\\n|   1   | Clear                                      |\\n|   2   | Light clouds                               |\\n|   3   | Overcast or ground fog                     |\\n|   4   | Rain, hail, or snow                        |\\n|   5   | Torrential rain, driving hail, or blizzard |\\n\\n##### Temperature\\n| Stage | Condition       |\\n|:-----:|-----------------|\\n|   1   | Unbearable heat |\\n|   2   | Hot             |\\n|   3   | Warm            |\\n|   4   | Cool            |\\n|   5   | Cold            |\\n|   6   | Arctic cold     |\\n\\n##### Wind\\n| Stage | Condition     |\\n|:-----:|---------------|\\n|   1   | Calm          |\\n|   2   | Moderate wind |\\n|   3   | Strong wind   |\\n|   4   | Gale          |\\n|   5   | Storm         |\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (burning incense and bits of earth and wood mixed in water)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 8\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cordon_of_arrows_phb\",\"name\":\"Cordon of Arrows\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 5 feet — You plant four pieces of nonmagical ammunition—arrows or crossbow bolts—in the ground within range and lay magic upon them to protect an area. Until t\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 5 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (four or more arrows or bolts)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou plant four pieces of nonmagical ammunition—[[arrow|PHB|arrows]] or [[crossbow bolt|PHB|crossbow bolts]]—in the ground within range and lay magic upon them to protect an area. Until the spell ends, whenever a creature other than you comes within 30 feet of the ammunition for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there, one piece of ammunition flies up to strike it. The creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d6 piercing damage. The piece of ammunition is then destroyed. The spell ends when no ammunition remains.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can designate any creatures you choose, and the spell ignores them.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the amount of ammunition that can be affected increases by two for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"5 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (four or more arrows or bolts)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ranger\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_counterspell_phb\",\"name\":\"Counterspell\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Reaction, which you take when you see a creature within 60 feet of you casting a spell • 60 feet — You attempt to interrupt a creature in the process of casting a spell. If the creature is casting a spell of 3rd level or lower, its spell fails and h\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when you see a creature within 60 feet of you casting a spell\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou attempt to interrupt a creature in the process of casting a spell. If the creature is casting a spell of 3rd level or lower, its spell fails and has no effect. If it is casting a spell of 4th level or higher, make an ability check using your spellcasting ability. The DC equals 10 + the spell's level. On a success, the creature's spell fails and has no effect.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the interrupted spell has no effect if its level is less than or equal to the level of the spell slot you used.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when you see a creature within 60 feet of you casting a spell\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Reaction\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_food_and_water_phb\",\"name\":\"Create Food and Water\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — You create 45 pounds of food and 30 gallons of water on the ground or in containers within range, enough to sustain up to fifteen humanoids or five st\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create 45 pounds of food and 30 gallons of water on the ground or in containers within range, enough to sustain up to fifteen humanoids or five steeds for 24 hours. The food is bland but nourishing, and spoils if uneaten after 24 hours. The water is clean and doesn't go bad.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_or_destroy_water_phb\",\"name\":\"Create or Destroy Water\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — You either create or destroy water. Create Water You create up to 10 gallons of clean water within range in an open container. Alternatively, the wate\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of water if creating water or a few grains of sand if destroying it)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou either create or destroy water.\\n\\n***Create Water.*** You create up to 10 gallons of clean water within range in an open container. Alternatively, the water falls as rain in a 30-foot cube within range, extinguishing exposed flames in the area.\\n\\n***Destroy Water.*** You destroy up to 10 gallons of water in an open container within range. Alternatively, you destroy fog in a 30-foot cube within range.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you create or destroy 10 additional gallons of water, or the size of the cube increases by 5 feet, for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Water)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Water)|MPMM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of water if creating water or a few grains of sand if destroying it)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_undead_phb\",\"name\":\"Create Undead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • 1 minute • 10 feet — You can cast this spell only at night. Choose up to three corpses of Medium or Small humanoids within range. Each corpse becomes a ghoul under your co\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (one clay pot filled with grave dirt, one clay pot filled with brackish water, and one 150 gp black onyx stone for each corpse)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou can cast this spell only at night. Choose up to three corpses of Medium or Small humanoids within range. Each corpse becomes a [[ghoul]] under your control. (The DM has game statistics for these creatures.)\\n\\nAs a bonus action on each of your turns, you can mentally command any creature you animated with this spell if the creature is within 120 feet of you (if you control multiple creatures, you can command any or all of them at the same time, issuing the same command to each one). You decide what action the creature will take and where it will move during its next turn, or you can issue a general command, such as to guard a particular chamber or corridor. If you issue no commands, the creature only defends itself against hostile creatures. Once given an order, the creature continues to follow it until its task is complete.\\n\\nThe creature is under your control for 24 hours, after which it stops obeying any command you have given it. To maintain control of the creature for another 24 hours, you must cast this spell on the creature before the current 24-hour period ends. This use of the spell reasserts your control over up to three creatures you have animated with this spell, rather than animating new ones.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a 7th-level spell slot, you can animate or reassert control over four [[ghoul||ghouls]]. When you cast this spell using an 8th-level spell slot, you can animate or reassert control over five [[ghoul||ghouls]] or two [[ghast||ghasts]] or [[wight||wights]]. When you cast this spell using a 9th-level spell slot, you can animate or reassert control over six [[ghoul||ghouls]], three [[ghast||ghasts]] or [[wight||wights]], or two [[mummy||mummies]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (one clay pot filled with grave dirt, one clay pot filled with brackish water, and one 150 gp black onyx stone for each corpse)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_creation_phb\",\"name\":\"Creation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Illusion • 1 minute • 30 feet — You pull wisps of shadow material from the Shadowfell to create a nonliving object of vegetable matter within range: soft goods, rope, wood, or someth\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny piece of matter of the same type of the item you plan to create)\\n- **Duration:** Special\\nYou pull wisps of shadow material from the Shadowfell to create a nonliving object of vegetable matter within range: soft goods, rope, wood, or something similar. You can also use this spell to create mineral objects such as stone, crystal, or metal. The object created must be no larger than a 5-foot cube, and the object must be of a form and material that you have seen before.\\n\\nThe duration depends on the object's material. If the object is composed of multiple materials, use the shortest duration.\\n\\n##### Creation\\n| Material              | Duration   |\\n|-----------------------|------------|\\n| Vegetable matter      | 1 day      |\\n| Stone or crystal      | 12 hours   |\\n| Precious metals       | 1 hour     |\\n| Gems                  | 10 minutes |\\n| Adamantine or mithral | 1 minute   |\\n\\nUsing any material created by this spell as another spell's material component causes that spell to fail.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the cube increases by 5 feet for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny piece of matter of the same type of the item you plan to create)\",\"duration\":\"Special\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_crown_of_madness_phb\",\"name\":\"Crown of Madness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 120 feet — One humanoid of your choice that you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become charmed by you for the duration. While the t\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nOne humanoid of your choice that you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become [[charmed]] by you for the duration. While the target is [[charmed]] in this way, a twisted crown of jagged iron appears on its head, and a madness glows in its eyes.\\n\\nThe [[charmed]] target must use its action before moving on each of its turns to make a melee attack against a creature other than itself that you mentally choose. The target can act normally on its turn if you choose no creature or if none are within its reach.\\n\\nOn your subsequent turns, you must use your action to maintain control over the target, or the spell ends. Also, the target can make a Wisdom saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a success, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Baalzebul)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_crusader_s_mantle_phb\",\"name\":\"Crusader's Mantle\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Self — Holy power radiates from you in an aura with a 30-foot radius, awakening boldness in friendly creatures. Until the spell ends, the aura moves with you\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nHoly power radiates from you in an aura with a 30-foot radius, awakening boldness in friendly creatures. Until the spell ends, the aura moves with you, centered on you. While in the aura, each nonhostile creature in the aura (including you) deals an extra 1d4 radiant damage when it hits with a weapon attack.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cure_wounds_phb\",\"name\":\"Cure Wounds\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • Touch — A creature you touch regains a number of hit points equal to 1d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect on undead or construct\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA creature you touch regains a number of hit points equal to 1d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the healing increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Gift of the Metallic Dragon|FTD]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dancing_lights_phb\",\"name\":\"Dancing Lights\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — You create up to four torch-sized lights within range, making them appear as torches, lanterns, or glowing orbs that hover in the air for the duration\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus or wychwood, or a glowworm)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create up to four torch-sized lights within range, making them appear as torches, lanterns, or glowing orbs that hover in the air for the duration. You can also combine the four lights into one glowing vaguely humanoid form of Medium size. Whichever form you choose, each light sheds dim light in a 10-foot radius.\\n\\nAs a bonus action on your turn, you can move the lights up to 60 feet to a new spot within range. A light must be within 20 feet of another light created by this spell, and a light winks out if it exceeds the spell's range.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Astral Elf|AAG]], [[Elf (Drow)|PHB]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Drow Descent)|SCAG]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus or wychwood, or a glowworm)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_darkness_phb\",\"name\":\"Darkness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — Magical darkness spreads from a point you choose within range to fill a 15-foot-radius sphere for the duration. The darkness spreads around corners. A\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (bat fur and a drop of pitch or piece of coal)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nMagical darkness spreads from a point you choose within range to fill a 15-foot-radius sphere for the duration. The darkness spreads around corners. A creature with [[darkvision]] can't see through this darkness, and nonmagical light can't illuminate it.\\n\\nIf the point you choose is on an object you are holding or one that isn't being worn or carried, the darkness emanates from the object and moves with it. Completely covering the source of the darkness with an opaque object, such as a bowl or a helm, blocks the darkness.\\n\\nIf any of this spell's area overlaps with an area of light created by a spell of 2nd level or lower, the spell that created the light is dispelled.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Shadow Magic|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Drow)|PHB]], [[Tiefling|PHB]], [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Elf (Zendikar; Mul Daya Nation)|PSZ]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Drow Descent)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Hellfire)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Infernal Legacy)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling (Asmodeus)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Levistus)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (bat fur and a drop of pitch or piece of coal)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_darkvision_phb\",\"name\":\"Darkvision\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature to grant it the ability to see in the dark. For the duration, that creature has darkvision out to a range of 60 feet.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (either a pinch of dried carrot or an agate)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch a willing creature to grant it the ability to see in the dark. For the duration, that creature has [[darkvision]] out to a range of 60 feet.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (either a pinch of dried carrot or an agate)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_daylight_phb\",\"name\":\"Daylight\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — A 60-foot-radius sphere of light spreads out from a point you choose within range. The sphere is bright light and sheds dim light for an additional 60\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nA 60-foot-radius sphere of light spreads out from a point you choose within range. The sphere is bright light and sheds dim light for an additional 60 feet.\\n\\nIf you chose a point on an object you are holding or one that isn't being worn or carried, the light shines from the object and moves with it. Completely covering the affected object with an opaque object, such as a bowl or a helm, blocks the light.\\n\\nIf any of this spell's area overlaps with an area of darkness created by a spell of 3rd level or lower, the spell that created the darkness is dispelled.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Aasimar|DMG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_death_ward_phb\",\"name\":\"Death Ward\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a creature and grant it a measure of protection from death. The first time the target would drop to 0 hit points as a result of taking damag\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch a creature and grant it a measure of protection from death.\\n\\nThe first time the target would drop to 0 hit points as a result of taking damage, the target instead drops to 1 hit point, and the spell ends.\\n\\nIf the spell is still in effect when the target is subjected to an effect that would kill it instantaneously without dealing damage, that effect is instead negated against the target, and the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]], [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_delayed_blast_fireball_phb\",\"name\":\"Delayed Blast Fireball\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — A beam of yellow light flashes from your pointing finger, then condenses to linger at a chosen point within range as a glowing bead for the duration. \",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny ball of bat guano and sulfur)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA beam of yellow light flashes from your pointing finger, then condenses to linger at a chosen point within range as a glowing bead for the duration. When the spell ends, either because your [[concentration]] is broken or because you decide to end it, the bead blossoms with a low roar into an explosion of flame that spreads around corners. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes fire damage equal to the total accumulated damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe spell's base damage is 12d6. If at the end of your turn the bead has not yet detonated, the damage increases by 1d6.\\n\\nIf the glowing bead is touched before the interval has expired, the creature touching it must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the spell ends immediately, causing the bead to erupt in flame. On a successful save, the creature can throw the bead up to 40 feet. When it strikes a creature or a solid object, the spell ends, and the bead explodes.\\n\\nThe fire damages objects in the area and ignites flammable objects that aren't being worn or carried.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 8th level or higher, the base damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 7th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny ball of bat guano and sulfur)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_demiplane_phb\",\"name\":\"Demiplane\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You create a shadowy door on a flat solid surface that you can see within range. The door is large enough to allow Medium creatures to pass through un\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou create a shadowy door on a flat solid surface that you can see within range. The door is large enough to allow Medium creatures to pass through unhindered. When opened, the door leads to a demiplane that appears to be an empty room 30 feet in each dimension, made of wood or stone. When the spell ends, the door disappears, and any creatures or objects inside the demiplane remain trapped there, as the door also disappears from the other side.\\n\\nEach time you cast this spell, you can create a new demiplane, or have the shadowy door connect to a demiplane you created with a previous casting of this spell. Additionally, if you know the nature and contents of a demiplane created by a casting of this spell by another creature, you can have the shadowy door connect to its demiplane instead.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Sorcerer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_destructive_wave_phb\",\"name\":\"Destructive Wave\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • Self — You strike the ground, creating a burst of divine energy that ripples outward from you. Each creature you choose within 30 feet of you must succeed on\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou strike the ground, creating a burst of divine energy that ripples outward from you. Each creature you choose within 30 feet of you must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 5d6 thunder damage, as well as 5d6 radiant or necrotic damage (your choice), and be knocked [[prone]]. A creature that succeeds on its saving throw takes half as much damage and isn't knocked [[prone]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d6\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Paladin\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_detect_evil_and_good_phb\",\"name\":\"Detect Evil and Good\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action • Self — For the duration, you know if there is an aberration, celestial, elemental, fey, fiend, or undead within 30 feet of you, as well as where the creature\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, you know if there is an aberration, celestial, elemental, fey, fiend, or undead within 30 feet of you, as well as where the creature is located. Similarly, you know if there is a place or object within 30 feet of you that has been magically consecrated or desecrated.\\n\\nThe spell can penetrate most barriers, but it is blocked by 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of common metal, a thin sheet of lead, or 3 feet of wood or dirt.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_detect_magic_phb\",\"name\":\"Detect Magic\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — For the duration, you sense the presence of magic within 30 feet of you. If you sense magic in this way, you can use your action to see a faint aura a\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, you sense the presence of magic within 30 feet of you. If you sense magic in this way, you can use your action to see a faint aura around any visible creature or object in the area that bears magic, and you learn its *school of magic*, if any.\\n\\nThe spell can penetrate most barriers, but it is blocked by 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of common metal, a thin sheet of lead, or 3 feet of wood or dirt.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Firbolg|MPMM]], [[Firbolg|VGM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Drow High Magic|XGE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Eldritch Sight|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_detect_poison_and_disease_phb\",\"name\":\"Detect Poison and Disease\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — For the duration, you can sense the presence and location of poisons, poisonous creatures, and diseases within 30 feet of you. You also identify the k\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a yew leaf)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, you can sense the presence and location of poisons, poisonous creatures, and diseases within 30 feet of you. You also identify the kind of poison, poisonous creature, or disease in each case.\\n\\nThe spell can penetrate most barriers, but it is blocked by 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of common metal, a thin sheet of lead, or 3 feet of wood or dirt.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a yew leaf)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_detect_thoughts_phb\",\"name\":\"Detect Thoughts\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • Self — For the duration, you can read the thoughts of certain creatures. When you cast the spell and as your action on each turn until the spell ends, you ca\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a copper piece)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the duration, you can read the thoughts of certain creatures. When you cast the spell and as your action on each turn until the spell ends, you can focus your mind on any one creature that you can see within 30 feet of you. If the creature you choose has an Intelligence of 3 or lower or doesn't speak any language, the creature is unaffected.\\n\\nYou initially learn the surface thoughts of the creature—what is most on its mind in that moment. As an action, you can either shift your attention to another creature's thoughts or attempt to probe deeper into the same creature's mind. If you probe deeper, the target must make a Wisdom saving throw. If it fails, you gain insight into its reasoning (if any), its emotional state, and something that looms large in its mind (such as something it worries over, loves, or hates). If it succeeds, the spell ends. Either way, the target knows that you are probing into its mind, and unless you shift your attention to another creature's thoughts, the creature can use its action on its turn to make an Intelligence check contested by your Intelligence check; if it succeeds, the spell ends.\\n\\nQuestions verbally directed at the target creature naturally shape the course of its thoughts, so this spell is particularly effective as part of an interrogation.\\n\\nYou can also use this spell to detect the presence of thinking creatures you can't see. When you cast the spell or as your action during the duration, you can search for thoughts within 30 feet of you. The spell can penetrate barriers, but 2 feet of rock, 2 inches of any metal other than lead, or a thin sheet of lead blocks you. You can't detect a creature with an Intelligence of 3 or lower or one that doesn't speak any language.\\n\\nOnce you detect the presence of a creature in this way, you can read its thoughts for the rest of the duration as described above, even if you can't see it, but it must still be within range.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gith (Githzerai)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Dispater)|MTF]], [[Githzerai|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Telepathic|TCE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a copper piece)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dimension_door_phb\",\"name\":\"Dimension Door\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 500 feet — You teleport yourself from your current location to any other spot within range. You arrive at exactly the spot desired. It can be a place you can see\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 500 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou teleport yourself from your current location to any other spot within range. You arrive at exactly the spot desired. It can be a place you can see, one you can visualize, or one you can describe by stating distance and direction, such as \\\"200 feet straight downward\\\" or \\\"upward to the northwest at a 45-degree angle, 300 feet.\\\"\\n\\nYou can bring along objects as long as their weight doesn't exceed what you can carry. You can also bring one willing creature of your size or smaller who is carrying gear up to its carrying capacity. The creature must be within 5 feet of you when you cast this spell.\\n\\nIf you would arrive in a place already occupied by an object or a creature, you and any creature traveling with you each take 4d6 force damage, and the spell fails to teleport you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"500 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_disguise_self_phb\",\"name\":\"Disguise Self\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Illusion • Action • Self — You make yourself—including your clothing, armor, weapons, and other belongings on your person—look different until the spell ends or until you use yo\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou make yourself—including your clothing, armor, weapons, and other belongings on your person—look different until the spell ends or until you use your action to dismiss it. You can seem 1 foot shorter or taller and can appear thin, fat, or in between. You can't change your body type, so you must adopt a form that has the same basic arrangement of limbs. Otherwise, the extent of the illusion is up to you.\\n\\nThe changes wrought by this spell fail to hold up to physical inspection. For example, if you use this spell to add a hat to your outfit, objects pass through the hat, and anyone who touches it would feel nothing or would feel your head and hair. If you use this spell to appear thinner than you are, the hand of someone who reaches out to touch you would bump into you while it was seemingly still in midair.\\n\\nTo discern that you are disguised, a creature can use its action to inspect your appearance and must succeed on an Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Deep Gnome|MPMM]], [[Firbolg|MPMM]], [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Firbolg|VGM]], [[Gnome (Deep)|DMG]], [[Hexblood|VRGR]], [[Tiefling (Dispater)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Glasya)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Svirfneblin Magic|MTF]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Mask of Many Faces|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_disintegrate_phb\",\"name\":\"Disintegrate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — A thin green ray springs from your pointing finger to a target that you can see within range. The target can be a creature, an object, or a creation o\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a lodestone and a pinch of dust)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA thin green ray springs from your pointing finger to a target that you can see within range. The target can be a creature, an object, or a creation of magical force, such as the wall created by [[wall of force]].\\n\\nA creature targeted by this spell must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 10d6 + 40 force damage. The target is disintegrated if this damage leaves it with 0 hit points.\\n\\nA disintegrated creature and everything it is wearing and carrying, except magic items, are reduced to a pile of fine gray dust. The creature can be restored to life only by means of a [[true resurrection]] or a [[wish]] spell.\\n\\nThis spell automatically disintegrates a Large or smaller nonmagical object or a creation of magical force. If the target is a Huge or larger object or creation of force, this spell disintegrates a 10-foot-cube portion of it. A magic item is unaffected by this spell.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the damage increases by 3d6 for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a lodestone and a pinch of dust)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6 + 40\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dispel_evil_and_good_phb\",\"name\":\"Dispel Evil and Good\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • Self — Shimmering energy surrounds and protects you from fey, undead, and creatures originating from beyond the Material Plane. For the duration, celestials,\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (holy water or powdered silver and iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nShimmering energy surrounds and protects you from fey, undead, and creatures originating from beyond the Material Plane. For the duration, celestials, elementals, fey, fiends, and undead have disadvantage on attack rolls against you.\\n\\nYou can end the spell early by using either of the following special functions.\\n\\n***Break Enchantment.*** As your action, you touch a creature you can reach that is [[charmed]], [[frightened]], or possessed by a celestial, an elemental, a fey, a fiend, or an undead. The creature you touch is no longer [[charmed]], [[frightened]], or possessed by such creatures.\\n\\n***Dismissal.*** As your action, make a melee spell attack against a celestial, an elemental, a fey, a fiend, or an undead you can reach. On a hit, you attempt to drive the creature back to its home plane. The creature must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be sent back to its home plane (if it isn't there already). If they aren't on their home plane, undead are sent to the Shadowfell, and fey are sent to the Feywild.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (holy water or powdered silver and iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dispel_magic_phb\",\"name\":\"Dispel Magic\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • 120 feet — Choose one creature, object, or magical effect within range. Any spell of 3rd level or lower on the target ends. For each spell of 4th level or higher\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose one creature, object, or magical effect within range. Any spell of 3rd level or lower on the target ends. For each spell of 4th level or higher on the target, make an ability check using your spellcasting ability. The DC equals 10 + the spell's level. On a successful check, the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, you automatically end the effects of a spell on the target if the spell's level is equal to or less than the level of the spell slot you used.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Drow High Magic|XGE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dissonant_whispers_phb\",\"name\":\"Dissonant Whispers\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You whisper a discordant melody that only one creature of your choice within range can hear, wracking it with terrible pain. The target must make a Wi\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou whisper a discordant melody that only one creature of your choice within range can hear, wracking it with terrible pain. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 3d6 psychic damage and must immediately use its reaction, if available, to move as far as its speed allows away from you. The creature doesn't move into obviously dangerous ground, such as a fire or a pit. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage and doesn't have to move away. A [[deafened]] creature automatically succeeds on the save.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_divination_phb\",\"name\":\"Divination\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — Your magic and an offering put you in contact with a god or a god's servants. You ask a single question concerning a specific goal, event, or activity\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (incense and a sacrificial offering appropriate to your religion, together worth at least 25 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYour magic and an offering put you in contact with a god or a god's servants. You ask a single question concerning a specific goal, event, or activity to occur within 7 days. The DM offers a truthful reply. The reply might be a short phrase, a cryptic rhyme, or an omen.\\n\\nThe spell doesn't take into account any possible circumstances that might change the outcome, such as the casting of additional spells or the loss or gain of a companion.\\n\\nIf you cast the spell two or more times before finishing your next long rest, there is a cumulative 25 percent chance for each casting after the first that you get a random reading. The DM makes this roll in secret.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]], [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (incense and a sacrificial offering appropriate to your religion, together worth at least 25 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_divine_favor_phb\",\"name\":\"Divine Favor\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — Your prayer empowers you with divine radiance. Until the spell ends, your weapon attacks deal an extra 1d4 radiant damage on a hit.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYour prayer empowers you with divine radiance. Until the spell ends, your weapon attacks deal an extra 1d4 radiant damage on a hit.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_divine_word_phb\",\"name\":\"Divine Word\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Bonus action • 30 feet — You utter a divine word, imbued with the power that shaped the world at the dawn of creation. Choose any number of creatures you can see within range.\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou utter a divine word, imbued with the power that shaped the world at the dawn of creation. Choose any number of creatures you can see within range. Each creature that can hear you must make a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, a creature suffers an effect based on its current hit points:\\n\\n- 50 hit points or fewer: [[deafened]] for 1 minute\\n- 40 hit points or fewer: [[deafened]] and [[blinded]] for 10 minutes\\n- 30 hit points or fewer: [[blinded]], [[deafened]], and [[stunned]] for 1 hour\\n- 20 hit points or fewer: killed instantly\\n\\nRegardless of its current hit points, a celestial, an elemental, a fey, or a fiend that fails its save is forced back to its plane of origin (if it isn't there already) and can't return to your current plane for 24 hours by any means short of a [[wish]] spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dominate_beast_phb\",\"name\":\"Dominate Beast\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to beguile a beast that you can see within range. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be charmed by you for the duration. If you o\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to beguile a beast that you can see within range. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be [[charmed]] by you for the duration. If you or creatures that are friendly to you are fighting it, it has advantage on the saving throw.\\n\\nWhile the beast is [[charmed]], you have a telepathic link with it as long as the two of you are on the same plane of existence. You can use this telepathic link to issue commands to the creature while you are conscious (no action required), which it does its best to obey. You can specify a simple and general course of action, such as \\\"Attack that creature,\\\" \\\"Run over there,\\\" or \\\"Fetch that object.\\\" If the creature completes the order and doesn't receive further direction from you, it defends and preserves itself to the best of its ability.\\n\\nYou can use your action to take total and precise control of the target. Until the end of your next turn, the creature takes only the actions you choose, and doesn't do anything that you don't allow it to do. During this time, you can also cause the creature to use a reaction, but this requires you to use your own reaction as well.\\n\\nEach time the target takes damage, it makes a new Wisdom saving throw against the spell. If the saving throw succeeds, the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell with a 5th-level spell slot, the duration is [[concentration]], up to 10 minutes. When you use a 6th-level spell slot, the duration is [[concentration]], up to 1 hour. When you use a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the duration is [[concentration]], up to 8 hours.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dominate_monster_phb\",\"name\":\"Dominate Monster\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to beguile a creature that you can see within range. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be charmed by you for the duration. If yo\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou attempt to beguile a creature that you can see within range. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be [[charmed]] by you for the duration. If you or creatures that are friendly to you are fighting it, it has advantage on the saving throw.\\n\\nWhile the creature is [[charmed]], you have a telepathic link with it as long as the two of you are on the same plane of existence. You can use this telepathic link to issue commands to the creature while you are conscious (no action required), which it does its best to obey. You can specify a simple and general course of action, such as \\\"Attack that creature,\\\" \\\"Run over there,\\\" or \\\"Fetch that object.\\\" If the creature completes the order and doesn't receive further direction from you, it defends and preserves itself to the best of its ability.\\n\\nYou can use your action to take total and precise control of the target. Until the end of your next turn, the creature takes only the actions you choose, and doesn't do anything that you don't allow it to do. During this time, you can also cause the creature to use a reaction, but this requires you to use your own reaction as well.\\n\\nEach time the target takes damage, it makes a new Wisdom saving throw against the spell. If the saving throw succeeds, the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell with a 9th-level spell slot, the duration is [[concentration]], up to 8 hours.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dominate_person_phb\",\"name\":\"Dominate Person\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to beguile a humanoid that you can see within range. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be charmed by you for the duration. If yo\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to beguile a humanoid that you can see within range. It must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be [[charmed]] by you for the duration. If you or creatures that are friendly to you are fighting it, it has advantage on the saving throw.\\n\\nWhile the target is [[charmed]], you have a telepathic link with it as long as the two of you are on the same plane of existence. You can use this telepathic link to issue commands to the creature while you are conscious (no action required), which it does its best to obey. You can specify a simple and general course of action, such as \\\"Attack that creature,\\\" \\\"Run over there,\\\" or \\\"Fetch that object.\\\" If the creature completes the order and doesn't receive further direction from you, it defends and preserves itself to the best of its ability.\\n\\nYou can use your action to take total and precise control of the target. Until the end of your next turn, the creature takes only the actions you choose, and doesn't do anything that you don't allow it to do. During this time you can also cause the creature to use a reaction, but this requires you to use your own reaction as well.\\n\\nEach time the target takes damage, it makes a new Wisdom saving throw against the spell. If the saving throw succeeds, the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a 6th-level spell slot, the duration is [[concentration]], up to 10 minutes. When you use a 7th-level spell slot, the duration is [[concentration]], up to 1 hour. When you use a spell slot of 8th level or higher, the duration is [[concentration]], up to 8 hours.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_drawmij_s_instant_summons_phb\",\"name\":\"Drawmij's Instant Summons\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • 1 minute or Ritual • Touch — You touch an object weighing 10 pounds or less whose longest dimension is 6 feet or less. The spell leaves an invisible mark on its surface and invisi\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sapphire worth 1,000 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou touch an object weighing 10 pounds or less whose longest dimension is 6 feet or less. The spell leaves an invisible mark on its surface and invisibly inscribes the name of the item on the sapphire you use as the material component. Each time you cast this spell, you must use a different sapphire.\\n\\nAt any time thereafter, you can use your action to speak the item's name and crush the sapphire. The item instantly appears in your hand regardless of physical or planar distances, and the spell ends.\\n\\nIf another creature is holding or carrying the item, crushing the sapphire doesn't transport the item to you, but instead you learn who the creature possessing the object is and roughly where that creature is located at that moment.\\n\\n[[Dispel magic]] or a similar effect successfully applied to the sapphire ends this spell's effect.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sapphire worth 1,000 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dream_phb\",\"name\":\"Dream\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Illusion • 1 minute • Special — This spell shapes a creature's dreams. Choose a creature known to you as the target of this spell. The target must be on the same plane of existence a\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Special\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a handful of sand, a dab of ink, and a writing quill plucked from a sleeping bird)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nThis spell shapes a creature's dreams. Choose a creature known to you as the target of this spell. The target must be on the same plane of existence as you. Creatures that don't sleep, such as elves, can't be contacted by this spell. You, or a willing creature you touch, enters a trance state, acting as a messenger. While in the trance, the messenger is aware of his or her surroundings, but can't take actions or move.\\n\\nIf the target is asleep, the messenger appears in the target's dreams and can converse with the target as long as it remains asleep, through the duration of the spell. The messenger can also shape the environment of the dream, creating landscapes, objects, and other images. The messenger can emerge from the trance at any time, ending the effect of the spell early. The target recalls the dream perfectly upon waking. If the target is awake when you cast the spell, the messenger knows it, and can either end the trance (and the spell) or wait for the target to fall asleep, at which point the messenger appears in the target's dreams.\\n\\nYou can make the messenger appear monstrous and terrifying to the target. If you do, the messenger can deliver a message of no more than ten words and then the target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, echoes of the phantasmal monstrosity spawn a nightmare that lasts the duration of the target's sleep and prevents the target from gaining any benefit from that rest. In addition, when the target wakes up, it takes 3d6 psychic damage.\\n\\nIf you have a body part, lock of hair, clipping from a nail, or similar portion of the target's body, the target makes its saving throw with disadvantage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Special\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a handful of sand, a dab of ink, and a writing quill plucked from a sleeping bird)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_druidcraft_phb\",\"name\":\"Druidcraft\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — Whispering to the spirits of nature, you create one of the following effects within range: - You create a tiny, harmless sensory effect that predicts \",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nWhispering to the spirits of nature, you create one of the following effects within range:\\n\\n- You create a tiny, harmless sensory effect that predicts what the weather will be at your location for the next 24 hours. The effect might manifest as a golden orb for clear skies, a cloud for rain, falling snowflakes for snow, and so on. This effect persists for 1 round.\\n- You instantly make a flower blossom, a seed pod open, or a leaf bud bloom.\\n- You create an instantaneous, harmless sensory effect, such as falling leaves, a puff of wind, the sound of a small animal, or the faint odor of skunk. The effect must fit in a 5-foot cube.\\n- You instantly light or snuff out a candle, a torch, or a small campfire.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Giant|BGG]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Arcane Archer|XGE]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Faerie|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Fairy|MPMM]], [[Fairy|WBtW]], [[Halfling (Lotusden)|EGW]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]], [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_earthquake_phb\",\"name\":\"Earthquake\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Evocation • Action • 500 feet — You create a seismic disturbance at a point on the ground that you can see within range. For the duration, an intense tremor rips through the ground i\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 500 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of dirt, a piece of rock, and a lump of clay)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a seismic disturbance at a point on the ground that you can see within range. For the duration, an intense tremor rips through the ground in a 100-foot-radius circle centered on that point and shakes creatures and structures in contact with the ground in that area.\\n\\nThe ground in the area becomes difficult terrain. Each creature on the ground that is [[concentration||concentrating]] must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the creature's [[concentration]] is broken.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell and at the end of each turn you spend [[concentration||concentrating]] on it, each creature on the ground in the area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the creature is knocked [[prone]].\\n\\nThis spell can have additional effects depending on the terrain in the area, as determined by the DM.\\n\\n***Fissures.*** Fissures open throughout the spell's area at the start of your next turn after you cast the spell. A total of 1d6 such fissures open in locations chosen by the DM. Each is 1d10 × 10 feet deep, 10 feet wide, and extends from one edge of the spell's area to the opposite side. A creature standing on a spot where a fissure opens must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or fall in. A creature that successfully saves moves with the fissure's edge as it opens.\\n\\nA fissure that opens beneath a structure causes it to automatically collapse (see below).\\n\\n***Structures.*** The tremor deals 50 bludgeoning damage to any structure in contact with the ground in the area when you cast the spell and at the start of each of your turns until the spell ends. If a structure drops to 0 hit points, it collapses and potentially damages nearby creatures. A creature within half the distance of a structure's height must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 5d6 bludgeoning damage, is knocked [[prone]], and is buried in the rubble, requiring a DC 20 Strength ([[Athletics]]) check as an action to escape. The DM can adjust the DC higher or lower, depending on the nature of the rubble. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage and doesn't fall [[prone]] or become buried.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"500 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of dirt, a piece of rock, and a lump of clay)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_eldritch_blast_phb\",\"name\":\"Eldritch Blast\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — A beam of crackling energy streaks toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 forc\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA beam of crackling energy streaks toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 force damage.\\n\\nThe spell creates more than one beam when you reach higher levels: two beams at 5th level, three beams at 11th level, and four beams at 17th level. You can direct the beams at the same target or at different ones. Make a separate attack roll for each beam.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_elemental_weapon_phb\",\"name\":\"Elemental Weapon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Touch — A nonmagical weapon you touch becomes a magic weapon. Choose one of the following damage types: acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder. For the durat\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nA nonmagical weapon you touch becomes a magic weapon. Choose one of the following damage types: acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder. For the duration, the weapon has a +1 bonus to attack rolls and deals an extra 1d4 damage of the chosen type when it hits.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th or 6th level, the bonus to attack rolls increases to +2 and the extra damage increases to 2d4. When you use a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the bonus increases to +3 and the extra damage increases to 3d4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_enhance_ability_phb\",\"name\":\"Enhance Ability\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a creature and bestow upon it a magical enhancement. Choose one of the following effects; the target gains that effect until the spell ends.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (fur or a feather from a beast)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou touch a creature and bestow upon it a magical enhancement. Choose one of the following effects; the target gains that effect until the spell ends.\\n\\n***Bear's Endurance.*** The target has advantage on Constitution checks. It also gains 2d6 temporary hit points, which are lost when the spell ends.\\n\\n***Bull's Strength.*** The target has advantage on Strength checks, and his or her carrying capacity doubles.\\n\\n***Cat's Grace.*** The target has advantage on Dexterity checks. It also doesn't take damage from falling 20 feet or less if it isn't [[incapacitated]].\\n\\n***Eagle's Splendor.*** The target has advantage on Charisma checks.\\n\\n***Fox's Cunning.*** The target has advantage on Intelligence checks.\\n\\n***Owl's Wisdom.*** The target has advantage on Wisdom checks.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (fur or a feather from a beast)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Artificer\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_enlarge_reduce_phb\",\"name\":\"Enlarge/Reduce\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — You cause a creature or an object you can see within range to grow larger or smaller for the duration. Choose either a creature or an object that is n\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of powdered iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou cause a creature or an object you can see within range to grow larger or smaller for the duration. Choose either a creature or an object that is neither worn nor carried. If the target is unwilling, it can make a Constitution saving throw. On a success, the spell has no effect.\\n\\nIf the target is a creature, everything it is wearing and carrying changes size with it. Any item dropped by an affected creature returns to normal size at once.\\n\\n***Enlarge.*** The target's size doubles in all dimensions, and its weight is multiplied by eight. This growth increases its size by one category—from Medium to Large, for example. If there isn't enough room for the target to double its size, the creature or object attains the maximum possible size in the space available. Until the spell ends, the target also has advantage on Strength checks and Strength saving throws. The target's weapons also grow to match its new size. While these weapons are enlarged, the target's attacks with them deal 1d4 extra damage.\\n\\n***Reduce.*** The target's size is halved in all dimensions, and its weight is reduced to one-eighth of normal. This reduction decreases its size by one category—from Medium to Small, for example. Until the spell ends, the target also has disadvantage on Strength checks and Strength saving throws. The target's weapons also shrink to match its new size. While these weapons are reduced, the target's attacks with them deal 1d4 less damage (this can't reduce the damage below 1).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Duergar|MPMM]], [[Fairy|MPMM]], [[Dwarf (Duergar)|MTF]], [[Faerie|LFL]], [[Fairy|WBtW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]], [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of powdered iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ensnaring_strike_phb\",\"name\":\"Ensnaring Strike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Bonus action • Self — The next time you hit a creature with a weapon attack before this spell ends, a writhing mass of thorny vines appears at the point of impact, and the \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe next time you hit a creature with a weapon attack before this spell ends, a writhing mass of thorny vines appears at the point of impact, and the target must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be [[restrained]] by the magical vines until the spell ends. A Large or larger creature has advantage on this saving throw. If the target succeeds on the save, the vines shrivel away.\\n\\nWhile [[restrained]] by this spell, the target takes 1d6 piercing damage at the start of each of its turns. A creature [[restrained]] by the vines or one that can touch the creature can use its action to make a Strength check against your spell save DC. On a success, the target is freed.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** If you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Ranger\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_entangle_phb\",\"name\":\"Entangle\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — Grasping weeds and vines sprout from the ground in a 20-foot square starting from a point within range. For the duration, these plants turn the ground\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nGrasping weeds and vines sprout from the ground in a 20-foot square starting from a point within range. For the duration, these plants turn the ground in the area into difficult terrain.\\n\\nA creature in the area when you cast the spell must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be [[restrained]] by the entangling plants until the spell ends. A creature [[restrained]] by the plants can use its action to make a Strength check against your spell save DC. On a success, it frees itself.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the conjured plants wilt away.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Lotusden)|EGW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]], [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_enthrall_phb\",\"name\":\"Enthrall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You weave a distracting string of words, causing creatures of your choice that you can see within range and that can hear you to make a Wisdom saving \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou weave a distracting string of words, causing creatures of your choice that you can see within range and that can hear you to make a Wisdom saving throw. Any creature that can't be [[charmed]] succeeds on this saving throw automatically, and if you or your companions are fighting a creature, it has advantage on the save. On a failed save, the target has disadvantage on Wisdom ([[Perception]]) checks made to perceive any creature other than you until the spell ends or until the target can no longer hear you. The spell ends if you are [[incapacitated]] or can no longer speak.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Variant; Devil's Tongue)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_etherealness_phb\",\"name\":\"Etherealness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • Action • Self — You step into the border regions of the Ethereal Plane, in the area where it overlaps with your current plane. You remain in the Border Ethereal for t\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Up to 8 hours\\nYou step into the border regions of the Ethereal Plane, in the area where it overlaps with your current plane. You remain in the Border Ethereal for the duration or until you use your action to dismiss the spell. During this time, you can move in any direction. If you move up or down, every foot of movement costs an extra foot. You can see and hear the plane you originated from, but everything there looks gray, and you can't see anything more than 60 feet away.\\n\\nWhile on the Ethereal Plane, you can only affect and be affected by other creatures on that plane. Creatures that aren't on the Ethereal Plane can't perceive you and can't interact with you, unless a special ability or magic has given them the ability to do so.\\n\\nYou ignore all objects and effects that aren't on the Ethereal Plane, allowing you to move through objects you perceive on the plane you originated from.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, you immediately return to the plane you originated from in the spot you currently occupy. If you occupy the same spot as a solid object or creature when this happens, you are immediately shunted to the nearest unoccupied space that you can occupy and take force damage equal to twice the number of feet you are moved.\\n\\nThis spell has no effect if you cast it while you are on the Ethereal Plane or a plane that doesn't border it, such as one of the Outer Planes.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 8th level or higher, you can target up to three willing creatures (including you) for each slot level above 7th. The creatures must be within 10 feet of you when you cast the spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Up to 8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_evard_s_black_tentacles_phb\",\"name\":\"Evard's Black Tentacles\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — Squirming, ebony tentacles fill a 20-foot square on ground that you can see within range. For the duration, these tentacles turn the ground in the are\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of tentacle from a giant octopus or a giant squid)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nSquirming, ebony tentacles fill a 20-foot square on ground that you can see within range. For the duration, these tentacles turn the ground in the area into difficult terrain.\\n\\nWhen a creature enters the affected area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, the creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 3d6 bludgeoning damage and be [[restrained]] by the tentacles until the spell ends. A creature that starts its turn in the area and is already [[restrained]] by the tentacles takes 3d6 bludgeoning damage.\\n\\nA creature [[restrained]] by the tentacles can use its action to make a Strength or Dexterity check (its choice) against your spell save DC. On a success, it frees itself.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of tentacle from a giant octopus or a giant squid)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_expeditious_retreat_phb\",\"name\":\"Expeditious Retreat\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — This spell allows you to move at an incredible pace. When you cast this spell, and then as a bonus action on each of your turns until the spell ends, \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nThis spell allows you to move at an incredible pace. When you cast this spell, and then as a bonus action on each of your turns until the spell ends, you can take the [[Dash]] action.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_eyebite_phb\",\"name\":\"Eyebite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • Action • Self — For the spell's duration, your eyes become an inky void imbued with dread power. One creature of your choice within 60 feet of you that you can see mu\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the spell's duration, your eyes become an inky void imbued with dread power. One creature of your choice within 60 feet of you that you can see must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be affected by one of the following effects of your choice for the duration. On each of your turns until the spell ends, you can use your action to target another creature but can't target a creature again if it has succeeded on a saving throw against this casting of eyebite.\\n\\n***Asleep.*** The target falls [[unconscious]]. It wakes up if it takes any damage or if another creature uses its action to shake the sleeper awake.\\n\\n***Panicked.*** The target is [[frightened]] of you. On each of its turns, the [[frightened]] creature must take the [[Dash]] action and move away from you by the safest and shortest available route, unless there is nowhere to move. If the target moves to a place at least 60 feet away from you where it can no longer see you, this effect ends.\\n\\n***Sickened.*** The target has disadvantage on attack rolls and ability checks. At the end of each of its turns, it can make another Wisdom saving throw. If it succeeds, the effect ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fabricate_phb\",\"name\":\"Fabricate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • 10 minutes • 120 feet — You convert raw materials into products of the same material. For example, you can fabricate a wooden bridge from a clump of trees, a rope from a patc\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou convert raw materials into products of the same material. For example, you can fabricate a wooden bridge from a clump of trees, a rope from a patch of hemp, and clothes from flax or wool.\\n\\nChoose raw materials that you can see within range. You can fabricate a Large or smaller object (contained within a 10-foot cube, or eight connected 5-foot cubes), given a sufficient quantity of raw material. If you are working with metal, stone, or another mineral substance, however, the fabricated object can be no larger than Medium (contained within a single 5-foot cube). The quality of objects made by the spell is commensurate with the quality of the raw materials.\\n\\nCreatures or magic items can't be created or transmuted by this spell. You also can't use it to create items that ordinarily require a high degree of craftsmanship, such as jewelry, weapons, glass, or armor, unless you have proficiency with the type of artisan's tools used to craft such objects.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_faerie_fire_phb\",\"name\":\"Faerie Fire\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — Each object in a 20-foot cube within range is outlined in blue, green, or violet light (your choice). Any creature in the area when the spell is cast \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nEach object in a 20-foot cube within range is outlined in blue, green, or violet light (your choice). Any creature in the area when the spell is cast is also outlined in light if it fails a Dexterity saving throw. For the duration, objects and affected creatures shed dim light in a 10-foot radius.\\n\\nAny attack roll against an affected creature or object has advantage if the attacker can see it, and the affected creature or object can't benefit from being [[invisible]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Drow)|PHB]], [[Faerie|LFL]], [[Fairy|MPMM]], [[Fairy|WBtW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Drow Descent)|SCAG]], [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_false_life_phb\",\"name\":\"False Life\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Necromancy • Action • Self — Bolstering yourself with a necromantic facsimile of life, you gain 1d4 + 4 temporary hit points for the duration.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small amount of alcohol or distilled spirits)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nBolstering yourself with a necromantic facsimile of life, you gain 1d4 + 4 temporary hit points for the duration.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you gain 5 additional temporary hit points for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Fiendish Vigor|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small amount of alcohol or distilled spirits)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fear_phb\",\"name\":\"Fear\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Illusion • Action • Self — You project a phantasmal image of a creature's worst fears. Each creature in a 30-foot cone must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or drop whatever it \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a white feather or the heart of a hen)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou project a phantasmal image of a creature's worst fears. Each creature in a 30-foot cone must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or drop whatever it is holding and become [[frightened]] for the duration.\\n\\nWhile [[frightened]] by this spell, a creature must take the [[Dash]] action and move away from you by the safest available route on each of its turns, unless there is nowhere to move. If the creature ends its turn in a location where it doesn't have line of sight to you, the creature can make a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the spell ends for that creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a white feather or the heart of a hen)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_feather_fall_phb\",\"name\":\"Feather Fall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Reaction, which you take when you or a creature within 60 feet of you falls • 60 feet — Choose up to five falling creatures within range. A falling creature's rate of descent slows to 60 feet per round until the spell ends. If the creatur\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when you or a creature within 60 feet of you falls\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a small feather or a piece of down)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nChoose up to five falling creatures within range. A falling creature's rate of descent slows to 60 feet per round until the spell ends. If the creature lands before the spell ends, it takes no falling damage and can land on its feet, and the spell ends for that creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Air)|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when you or a creature within 60 feet of you falls\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a small feather or a piece of down)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Reaction\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_feeblemind_phb\",\"name\":\"Feeblemind\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Enchantment • Action • 150 feet — You blast the mind of a creature that you can see within range, attempting to shatter its intellect and personality. The target takes 4d6 psychic dama\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a handful of clay, crystal, glass, or mineral spheres)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou blast the mind of a creature that you can see within range, attempting to shatter its intellect and personality. The target takes 4d6 psychic damage and must make an Intelligence saving throw.\\n\\nOn a failed save, the creature's Intelligence and Charisma scores become 1. The creature can't cast spells, activate magic items, understand language, or communicate in any intelligible way. The creature can, however, identify its friends, follow them, and even protect them.\\n\\nAt the end of every 30 days, the creature can repeat its saving throw against this spell. If it succeeds on its saving throw, the spell ends.\\n\\nThe spell can also be ended by [[greater restoration]], [[heal]], or [[wish]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a handful of clay, crystal, glass, or mineral spheres)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_feign_death_phb\",\"name\":\"Feign Death\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action or Ritual • Touch — You touch a willing creature and put it into a cataleptic state that is indistinguishable from death. For the spell's duration, or until you use an ac\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of graveyard dirt)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a willing creature and put it into a cataleptic state that is indistinguishable from death.\\n\\nFor the spell's duration, or until you use an action to touch the target and dismiss the spell, the target appears dead to all outward inspection and to spells used to determine the target's status. The target is [[blinded]] and [[incapacitated]], and its speed drops to 0. The target has resistance to all damage except psychic damage. If the target is diseased or [[poisoned]] when you cast the spell, or becomes diseased or [[poisoned]] while under the spell's effect, the disease and poison have no effect until the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of graveyard dirt)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_find_familiar_phb\",\"name\":\"Find Familiar\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • 1 hour or Ritual • 10 feet — You gain the service of a familiar, a spirit that takes an animal form you choose: bat, cat, crab, frog (toad), hawk, lizard, octopus, owl, poisonous \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (10 gp worth of charcoal, incense, and herbs that must be consumed by fire in a brass brazier)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou gain the service of a familiar, a spirit that takes an animal form you choose: [[bat]], [[cat]], [[crab]], [[frog]] (toad), [[hawk]], [[lizard]], [[octopus]], [[owl]], [[poisonous snake]], fish ([[quipper]]), [[rat]], [[raven]], [[sea horse]], [[spider]], or [[weasel]]. Appearing in an unoccupied space within range, the familiar has the statistics of the chosen form, though it is a celestial, fey, or fiend (your choice) instead of a beast.\\n\\n*Additional animal form choices may be available at the DM's discretion.*\\n\\nYour familiar acts independently of you, but it always obeys your commands. In combat, it rolls its own initiative and acts on its own turn. A familiar can't attack, but it can take other actions as normal.\\n\\nWhen the familiar drops to 0 hit points, it disappears, leaving behind no physical form. It reappears after you cast this spell again. As an action, you can temporarily dismiss the familiar to a pocket dimension. Alternatively, you can dismiss it forever. As an action while it is temporarily dismissed, you can cause it to reappear in any unoccupied space within 30 feet of you. Whenever the familiar drops to 0 hit points or disappears into the pocket dimension, it leaves behind in its space anything it was wearing or carrying.\\n\\nWhile your familiar is within 100 feet of you, you can communicate with it telepathically. Additionally, as an action, you can see through your familiar's eyes and hear what it hears until the start of your next turn, gaining the benefits of any special senses that the familiar has. During this time, you are [[deafened||deaf]] and [[blinded||blind]] with regard to your own senses.\\n\\nYou can't have more than one familiar at a time. If you cast this spell while you already have a familiar, you instead cause it to adopt a new form. Choose one of the forms from the above list. Your familiar transforms into the chosen creature.\\n\\nFinally, when you cast a spell with a range of touch, your familiar can deliver the spell as if it had cast the spell. Your familiar must be within 100 feet of you, and it must use its reaction to deliver the spell when you cast it. If the spell requires an attack roll, you use your attack modifier for the roll.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Servo Crafting|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Strixhaven Mascot|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Chain|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour or Ritual\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (10 gp worth of charcoal, incense, and herbs that must be consumed by fire in a brass brazier)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_find_steed_phb\",\"name\":\"Find Steed\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • 10 minutes • 30 feet — You summon a spirit that assumes the form of an unusually intelligent, strong, and loyal steed, creating a long-lasting bond with it. Appearing in an \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou summon a spirit that assumes the form of an unusually intelligent, strong, and loyal steed, creating a long-lasting bond with it. Appearing in an unoccupied space within range, the steed takes on a form that you choose: a [[warhorse]], a [[pony]], a [[camel]], an [[elk]], or a [[mastiff]]. (Your DM might allow other animals to be summoned as steeds.) The steed has the statistics of the chosen form, though it is a celestial, fey, or fiend (your choice) instead of its normal type. Additionally, if your steed has an Intelligence of 5 or less, its Intelligence becomes 6, and it gains the ability to understand one language of your choice that you speak.\\n\\nYour steed serves you as a mount, both in combat and out, and you have an instinctive bond with it that allows you to fight as a seamless unit. While mounted on your steed, you can make any spell you cast that targets only you also target your steed.\\n\\nWhen the steed drops to 0 hit points, it disappears, leaving behind no physical form. You can also dismiss your steed at any time as an action, causing it to disappear. In either case, casting this spell again summons the same steed, restored to its hit point maximum.\\n\\nWhile your steed is within 1 mile of you, you can communicate with each other telepathically.\\n\\nYou can't have more than one steed bonded by this spell at a time. As an action, you can release the steed from its bond at any time, causing it to disappear.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_find_the_path_phb\",\"name\":\"Find the Path\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Divination • 1 minute • Self — This spell allows you to find the shortest, most direct physical route to a specific fixed location that you are familiar with on the same plane of ex\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a set of divinatory tools—such as bones, ivory sticks, cards, teeth, or carved runes—worth 100 gp and an object from the location you wish to find)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 day\\nThis spell allows you to find the shortest, most direct physical route to a specific fixed location that you are familiar with on the same plane of existence. If you name a destination on another plane of existence, a destination that moves (such as a mobile fortress), or a destination that isn't specific (such as \\\"a green dragon's lair\\\"), the spell fails.\\n\\nFor the duration, as long as you are on the same plane of existence as the destination, you know how far it is and in what direction it lies. While you are traveling there, whenever you are presented with a choice of paths along the way, you automatically determine which path is the shortest and most direct route (but not necessarily the safest route) to the destination.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a set of divinatory tools—such as bones, ivory sticks, cards, teeth, or carved runes—worth 100 gp and an object from the location you wish to find)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 day\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_find_traps_phb\",\"name\":\"Find Traps\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • 120 feet — You sense the presence of any trap within range that is within line of sight. A trap, for the purpose of this spell, includes anything that would infl\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou sense the presence of any trap within range that is within line of sight. A trap, for the purpose of this spell, includes anything that would inflict a sudden or unexpected effect you consider harmful or undesirable, which was specifically intended as such by its creator. Thus, the spell would sense an area affected by the [[alarm]] spell, a [[glyph of warding]], or a mechanical pit trap, but it would not reveal a natural weakness in the floor, an unstable ceiling, or a hidden sinkhole.\\n\\nThis spell merely reveals that a trap is present. You don't learn the location of each trap, but you do learn the general nature of the danger posed by a trap you sense.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_finger_of_death_phb\",\"name\":\"Finger of Death\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You send negative energy coursing through a creature that you can see within range, causing it searing pain. The target must make a Constitution savin\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou send negative energy coursing through a creature that you can see within range, causing it searing pain. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. It takes 7d8 + 30 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nA humanoid killed by this spell rises at the start of your next turn as a [[zombie]] that is permanently under your command, following your verbal orders to the best of its ability.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"7d8 + 30\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fire_bolt_phb\",\"name\":\"Fire Bolt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — You hurl a mote of fire at a creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 fire dama\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hurl a mote of fire at a creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 fire damage. A flammable object hit by this spell ignites if it isn't being worn or carried.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d10 when you reach 5th level (2d10), 11th level (3d10), and 17th level (4d10).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fire_shield_phb\",\"name\":\"Fire Shield\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • Self — Thin and wispy flames wreathe your body for the duration, shedding bright light in a 10-foot radius and dim light for an additional 10 feet. You can e\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus or a firefly)\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nThin and wispy flames wreathe your body for the duration, shedding bright light in a 10-foot radius and dim light for an additional 10 feet. You can end the spell early by using an action to dismiss it.\\n\\nThe flames provide you with a warm shield or a chill shield, as you choose. The warm shield grants you resistance to cold damage, and the chill shield grants you resistance to fire damage.\\n\\nIn addition, whenever a creature within 5 feet of you hits you with a melee attack, the shield erupts with flame. The attacker takes 2d8 fire damage from a warm shield, or 2d8 cold damage from a cold shield.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus or a firefly)\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fire_storm_phb\",\"name\":\"Fire Storm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — A storm made up of sheets of roaring flame appears in a location you choose within range. The area of the storm consists of up to ten 10-foot cubes, w\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA storm made up of sheets of roaring flame appears in a location you choose within range. The area of the storm consists of up to ten 10-foot cubes, which you can arrange as you wish. Each cube must have at least one face adjacent to the face of another cube. Each creature in the area must make a Dexterity saving throw. It takes 7d10 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe fire damages objects in the area and ignites flammable objects that aren't being worn or carried. If you choose, plant life in the area is unaffected by this spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"7d10\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fireball_phb\",\"name\":\"Fireball\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — A bright streak flashes from your pointing finger to a point you choose within range and then blossoms with a low roar into an explosion of flame. Eac\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny ball of bat guano and sulfur)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA bright streak flashes from your pointing finger to a point you choose within range and then blossoms with a low roar into an explosion of flame. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a Dexterity saving throw. A target takes 8d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe fire spreads around corners. It ignites flammable objects in the area that aren't being worn or carried.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Flames of the Phoenix|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny ball of bat guano and sulfur)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flame_blade_phb\",\"name\":\"Flame Blade\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — You evoke a fiery blade in your free hand. The blade is similar in size and shape to a scimitar, and it lasts for the duration. If you let go of the b\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (leaf of sumac)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou evoke a fiery blade in your free hand. The blade is similar in size and shape to a scimitar, and it lasts for the duration. If you let go of the blade, it disappears, but you can evoke the blade again as a bonus action.\\n\\nYou can use your action to make a melee spell attack with the fiery blade. On a hit, the target takes 3d6 fire damage.\\n\\nThe flaming blade sheds bright light in a 10-foot radius and dim light for an additional 10 feet.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for every two slot levels above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Fire)|MPMM]], [[Tiefling (Mephistopheles)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (leaf of sumac)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flame_strike_phb\",\"name\":\"Flame Strike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — A vertical column of divine fire roars down from the heavens in a location you specify. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high cylinder cente\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (pinch of sulfur)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA vertical column of divine fire roars down from the heavens in a location you specify. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high cylinder centered on a point within range must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 4d6 fire damage and 4d6 radiant damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the fire damage or the radiant damage (your choice) increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (pinch of sulfur)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flaming_sphere_phb\",\"name\":\"Flaming Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — A 5-foot-diameter sphere of fire appears in an unoccupied space of your choice within range and lasts for the duration. Any creature that ends its tur\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of tallow, a pinch of brimstone, and a dusting of powdered iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA 5-foot-diameter sphere of fire appears in an unoccupied space of your choice within range and lasts for the duration. Any creature that ends its turn within 5 feet of the sphere must make a Dexterity saving throw. The creature takes 2d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nAs a bonus action, you can move the sphere up to 30 feet. If you ram the sphere into a creature, that creature must make the saving throw against the sphere's damage, and the sphere stops moving this turn.\\n\\nWhen you move the sphere, you can direct it over barriers up to 5 feet tall and jump it across pits up to 10 feet wide. The sphere ignites flammable objects not being worn or carried, and it sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius and dim light for an additional 20 feet.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of tallow, a pinch of brimstone, and a dusting of powdered iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flesh_to_stone_phb\",\"name\":\"Flesh to Stone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to turn one creature that you can see within range into stone. If the target's body is made of flesh, the creature must make a Constitutio\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of lime, water, and earth)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to turn one creature that you can see within range into stone. If the target's body is made of flesh, the creature must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it is [[restrained]] as its flesh begins to harden. On a successful save, the creature isn't affected.\\n\\nA creature [[restrained]] by this spell must make another Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves against this spell three times, the spell ends. If it fails its saves three times, it is turned to stone and subjected to the [[petrified]] condition for the duration. The successes and failures don't need to be consecutive; keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind.\\n\\nIf the creature is physically broken while [[petrified]], it suffers from similar deformities if it reverts to its original state.\\n\\nIf you maintain your [[concentration]] on this spell for the entire possible duration, the creature is turned to stone until the effect is removed.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of lime, water, and earth)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fly_phb\",\"name\":\"Fly\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature. The target gains a flying speed of 60 feet for the duration. When the spell ends, the target falls if it is still aloft,\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a wing feather from any bird)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou touch a willing creature. The target gains a flying speed of 60 feet for the duration. When the spell ends, the target falls if it is still aloft, unless it can stop the fall.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Ride the Wind|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a wing feather from any bird)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fog_cloud_phb\",\"name\":\"Fog Cloud\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — You create a 20-foot-radius sphere of fog centered on a point within range. The sphere spreads around corners, and its area is heavily obscured. It la\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou create a 20-foot-radius sphere of fog centered on a point within range. The sphere spreads around corners, and its area is heavily obscured. It lasts for the duration or until a wind of moderate or greater speed (at least 10 miles per hour) disperses it.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the radius of the fog increases by 20 feet for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]], [[Triton|MOT]], [[Triton|MPMM]], [[Triton|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_forbiddance_phb\",\"name\":\"Forbiddance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • 10 minutes or Ritual • Touch — You create a ward against magical travel that protects up to 40,000 square feet of floor space to a height of 30 feet above the floor. For the duratio\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sprinkling of holy water, rare incense, and powdered ruby worth at least 1,000 gp)\\n- **Duration:** 1 day\\nYou create a ward against magical travel that protects up to 40,000 square feet of floor space to a height of 30 feet above the floor. For the duration, creatures can't teleport into the area or use portals, such as those created by the [[gate]] spell, to enter the area. The spell proofs the area against planar travel, and therefore prevents creatures from accessing the area by way of the Astral Plane, Ethereal Plane, Feywild, Shadowfell, or the [[plane shift]] spell.\\n\\nIn addition, the spell damages types of creatures that you choose when you cast it. Choose one or more of the following: celestials, elementals, fey, fiends, and undead. When a chosen creature enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, the creature takes 5d10 radiant or necrotic damage (your choice when you cast this spell).\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can designate a password. A creature that speaks the password as it enters the area takes no damage from the spell.\\n\\nThe spell's area can't overlap with the area of another forbiddance spell. If you cast forbiddance every day for 30 days in the same location, the spell lasts until it is dispelled, and the material components are consumed on the last casting.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sprinkling of holy water, rare incense, and powdered ruby worth at least 1,000 gp)\",\"duration\":\"1 day\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"5d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_forcecage_phb\",\"name\":\"Forcecage\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • 100 feet — An immobile, invisible, cube-shaped prison composed of magical force springs into existence around an area you choose within range. The prison can be \",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 100 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (ruby dust worth 1,500 gp)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nAn immobile, invisible, cube-shaped prison composed of magical force springs into existence around an area you choose within range. The prison can be a cage or a solid box as you choose.\\n\\nA prison in the shape of a cage can be up to 20 feet on a side and is made from 1/2-inch diameter bars spaced 1/2 inch apart.\\n\\nA prison in the shape of a box can be up to 10 feet on a side, creating a solid barrier that prevents any matter from passing through it and blocking any spells cast into or out from the area.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, any creature that is completely inside the cage's area is trapped. Creatures only partially within the area, or those too large to fit inside the area, are pushed away from the center of the area until they are completely outside the area.\\n\\nA creature inside the cage can't leave it by nonmagical means. If the creature tries to use teleportation or interplanar travel to leave the cage, it must first make a Charisma saving throw. On a success, the creature can use that magic to exit the cage. On a failure, the creature can't exit the cage and wastes the use of the spell or effect. The cage also extends into the Ethereal Plane, blocking ethereal travel.\\n\\nThis spell can't be dispelled by [[dispel magic]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"100 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (ruby dust worth 1,500 gp)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_foresight_phb\",\"name\":\"Foresight\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Divination • 1 minute • Touch — You touch a willing creature and bestow a limited ability to see into the immediate future. For the duration, the target can't be surprised and has ad\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a hummingbird feather)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch a willing creature and bestow a limited ability to see into the immediate future. For the duration, the target can't be [[surprised]] and has advantage on attack rolls, ability checks, and saving throws. Additionally, other creatures have disadvantage on attack rolls against the target for the duration.\\n\\nThis spell immediately ends if you cast it again before its duration ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a hummingbird feather)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 9\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_freedom_of_movement_phb\",\"name\":\"Freedom of Movement\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature. For the duration, the target's movement is unaffected by difficult terrain, and spells and other magical effects can nei\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a leather strap, bound around the arm or a similar appendage)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a willing creature. For the duration, the target's movement is unaffected by difficult terrain, and spells and other magical effects can neither reduce the target's speed nor cause the target to be [[paralyzed]] or [[restrained]].\\n\\nThe target can also spend 5 feet of movement to automatically escape from nonmagical restraints, such as manacles or a creature that has it [[grappled]]. Finally, being underwater imposes no penalties on the target's movement or attacks.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]], [[Simic Scientist|GGR]], [[Prismari Student|SCC]], [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Trickster's Escape|XGE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a leather strap, bound around the arm or a similar appendage)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_friends_phb\",\"name\":\"Friends\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Enchantment Cantrip • Action • Self — For the duration, you have advantage on all Charisma checks directed at one creature of your choice that isn't hostile toward you. When the spell ends\",\"content\":\"*Enchantment Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S, M (a small amount of makeup applied to the face as this spell is cast)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the duration, you have advantage on all Charisma checks directed at one creature of your choice that isn't hostile toward you. When the spell ends, the creature realizes that you used magic to influence its mood and becomes hostile toward you. A creature prone to violence might attack you. Another creature might seek retribution in other ways (at the DM's discretion), depending on the nature of your interaction with it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Siren|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Tiefling (Fierna)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S, M (a small amount of makeup applied to the face as this spell is cast)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gaseous_form_phb\",\"name\":\"Gaseous Form\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You transform a willing creature you touch, along with everything it's wearing and carrying, into a misty cloud for the duration. The spell ends if th\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of gauze and a wisp of smoke)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou transform a willing creature you touch, along with everything it's wearing and carrying, into a misty cloud for the duration. The spell ends if the creature drops to 0 hit points. An incorporeal creature isn't affected.\\n\\nWhile in this form, the target's only method of movement is a flying speed of 10 feet. The target can enter and occupy the space of another creature. The target has resistance to nonmagical damage, and it has advantage on Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution saving throws. The target can pass through small holes, narrow openings, and even mere cracks, though it treats liquids as though they were solid surfaces. The target can't fall and remains hovering in the air even when [[stunned]] or otherwise [[incapacitated]].\\n\\nWhile in the form of a misty cloud, the target can't talk or manipulate objects, and any objects it was carrying or holding can't be dropped, used, or otherwise interacted with. The target can't attack or cast spells.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]], [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Mist Stance|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of gauze and a wisp of smoke)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gate_phb\",\"name\":\"Gate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You conjure a portal linking an unoccupied space you can see within range to a precise location on a different plane of existence. The portal is a cir\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 5,000 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou conjure a portal linking an unoccupied space you can see within range to a precise location on a different plane of existence. The portal is a circular opening, which you can make 5 to 20 feet in diameter. You can orient the portal in any direction you choose. The portal lasts for the duration.\\n\\nThe portal has a front and a back on each plane where it appears. Travel through the portal is possible only by moving through its front. Anything that does so is instantly transported to the other plane, appearing in the unoccupied space nearest to the portal.\\n\\nDeities and other planar rulers can prevent portals created by this spell from opening in their presence or anywhere within their domains.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can speak the name of a specific creature (a pseudonym, title, or nickname doesn't work). If that creature is on a plane other than the one you are on, the portal opens in the named creature's immediate vicinity and draws the creature through it to the nearest unoccupied space on your side of the portal. You gain no special power over the creature, and it is free to act as the DM deems appropriate. It might leave, attack you, or help you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 5,000 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_geas_phb\",\"name\":\"Geas\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • 1 minute • 60 feet — You place a magical command on a creature that you can see within range, forcing it to carry out some service or refrain from some action or course of\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 30 days\\nYou place a magical command on a creature that you can see within range, forcing it to carry out some service or refrain from some action or course of activity as you decide. If the creature can understand you, it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become [[charmed]] by you for the duration. While the creature is [[charmed]] by you, it takes 5d10 psychic damage each time it acts in a manner directly counter to your instructions, but no more than once each day. A creature that can't understand you is unaffected by the spell.\\n\\nYou can issue any command you choose, short of an activity that would result in certain death. Should you issue a suicidal command, the spell ends.\\n\\nYou can end the spell early by using an action to dismiss it. A [[remove curse]], [[greater restoration]], or [[wish]] spell also ends it.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th or 8th level, the duration is 1 year. When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 9th level, the spell lasts until it is ended by one of the spells mentioned above.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"30 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"5d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gentle_repose_phb\",\"name\":\"Gentle Repose\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Necromancy • Action or Ritual • Touch — You touch a corpse or other remains. For the duration, the target is protected from decay and can't become undead. The spell also effectively extends \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of salt and one copper piece placed on each of the corpse's eyes, which must remain there for the duration)\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nYou touch a corpse or other remains. For the duration, the target is protected from decay and can't become undead.\\n\\nThe spell also effectively extends the time limit on raising the target from the dead, since days spent under the influence of this spell don't count against the time limit of spells such as [[raise dead]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of salt and one copper piece placed on each of the corpse's eyes, which must remain there for the duration)\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_giant_insect_phb\",\"name\":\"Giant Insect\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — You transform up to ten centipedes, three spiders, five wasps, or one scorpion within range into giant versions of their natural forms for the duratio\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou transform up to ten centipedes, three spiders, five wasps, or one scorpion within range into giant versions of their natural forms for the duration. A centipede becomes a [[giant centipede]], a spider becomes a [[giant spider]], a wasp becomes a [[giant wasp]], and a scorpion becomes a [[giant scorpion]].\\n\\nEach creature obeys your verbal commands, and in combat, they act on your turn each round. The DM has the statistics for these creatures and resolves their actions and movement.\\n\\nA creature remains in its giant size for the duration, until it drops to 0 hit points, or until you use an action to dismiss the effect on it.\\n\\nThe DM might allow you to choose different targets. For example, if you transform a bee, its giant version might have the same statistics as a [[giant wasp]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_glibness_phb\",\"name\":\"Glibness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Transmutation • Action • Self — Until the spell ends, when you make a Charisma check, you can replace the number you roll with a 15. Additionally, no matter what you say, magic that \",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nUntil the spell ends, when you make a Charisma check, you can replace the number you roll with a 15. Additionally, no matter what you say, magic that would determine if you are telling the truth indicates that you are being truthful.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_globe_of_invulnerability_phb\",\"name\":\"Globe of Invulnerability\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • Action • Self — An immobile, faintly shimmering barrier springs into existence in a 10-foot radius around you and remains for the duration. Any spell of 5th level or \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a glass or crystal bead that shatters when the spell ends)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nAn immobile, faintly shimmering barrier springs into existence in a 10-foot radius around you and remains for the duration.\\n\\nAny spell of 5th level or lower cast from outside the barrier can't affect creatures or objects within it, even if the spell is cast using a higher level spell slot. Such a spell can target creatures and objects within the barrier, but the spell has no effect on them. Similarly, the area within the barrier is excluded from the areas affected by such spells.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the barrier blocks spells of one level higher for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a glass or crystal bead that shatters when the spell ends)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_glyph_of_warding_phb\",\"name\":\"Glyph of Warding\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • 1 hour • Touch — When you cast this spell, you inscribe a glyph that later unleashes a magical effect. You inscribe it either on a surface (such as a table or a sectio\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (incense and powdered diamond worth at least 200 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled or triggered\\nWhen you cast this spell, you inscribe a glyph that later unleashes a magical effect. You inscribe it either on a surface (such as a table or a section of floor or wall) or within an object that can be closed (such as a book, a scroll, or a treasure chest) to conceal the glyph. The glyph can cover an area no larger than 10 feet in diameter. If the surface or object is moved more than 10 feet from where you cast this spell, the glyph is broken, and the spell ends without being triggered.\\n\\nThe glyph is nearly invisible and requires a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC to be found.\\n\\nYou decide what triggers the glyph when you cast the spell. For glyphs inscribed on a surface, the most typical triggers include touching or standing on the glyph, removing another object covering the glyph, approaching within a certain distance of the glyph, or manipulating the object on which the glyph is inscribed. For glyphs inscribed within an object, the most common triggers include opening that object, approaching within a certain distance of the object, or seeing or reading the glyph. Once a glyph is triggered, this spell ends.\\n\\nYou can further refine the trigger so the spell activates only under certain circumstances or according to physical characteristics (such as height or weight), creature kind (for example, the ward could be set to affect aberrations or drow), or alignment. You can also set conditions for creatures that don't trigger the glyph, such as those who say a certain password.\\n\\nWhen you inscribe the glyph, choose explosive runes or a spell glyph.\\n\\n***Explosive Runes.*** When triggered, the glyph erupts with magical energy in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on the glyph. The sphere spreads around corners. Each creature in the area must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 5d8 acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder damage on a failed saving throw (your choice when you create the glyph), or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***Spell Glyph.*** You can store a prepared spell of 3rd level or lower in the glyph by casting it as part of creating the glyph. The spell must target a single creature or an area. The spell being stored has no immediate effect when cast in this way. When the glyph is triggered, the stored spell is cast. If the spell has a target, it targets the creature that triggered the glyph. If the spell affects an area, the area is centered on that creature. If the spell summons hostile creatures or creates harmful objects or traps, they appear as close as possible to the intruder and attack it. If the spell requires [[concentration]], it lasts until the end of its full duration.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage of an explosive runes glyph increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 3rd. If you create a spell glyph, you can store any spell of up to the same level as the slot you use for the glyph of warding.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (incense and powdered diamond worth at least 200 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled or triggered\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"5d8\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_goodberry_phb\",\"name\":\"Goodberry\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action • Touch — Up to ten berries appear in your hand and are infused with magic for the duration. A creature can use its action to eat one berry. Eating a berry rest\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sprig of mistletoe)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nUp to ten berries appear in your hand and are infused with magic for the duration. A creature can use its action to eat one berry. Eating a berry restores 1 hit point, and the berry provides enough nourishment to sustain a creature for one day.\\n\\nThe berries lose their potency if they have not been consumed within 24 hours of the casting of this spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sprig of mistletoe)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"1\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_grasping_vine_phb\",\"name\":\"Grasping Vine\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Bonus action • 30 feet — You conjure a vine that sprouts from the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within range. When you cast this spell, you can\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou conjure a vine that sprouts from the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within range. When you cast this spell, you can direct the vine to lash out at a creature within 30 feet of it that you can see. That creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be pulled 20 feet directly toward the vine.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can direct the vine to lash out at the same creature or another one as a bonus action on each of your turns.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_grease_phb\",\"name\":\"Grease\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — Slick grease covers the ground in a 10-foot square centered on a point within range and turns it into difficult terrain for the duration. When the gre\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of pork rind or butter)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nSlick grease covers the ground in a 10-foot square centered on a point within range and turns it into difficult terrain for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the grease appears, each creature standing in its area must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or fall [[prone]]. A creature that enters the area or ends its turn there must also succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or fall [[prone]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of pork rind or butter)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Sorcerer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_greater_invisibility_phb\",\"name\":\"Greater Invisibility\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Illusion • Action • Touch — You or a creature you touch becomes invisible until the spell ends. Anything the target is wearing or carrying is invisible as long as it is on the ta\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou or a creature you touch becomes [[invisible]] until the spell ends. Anything the target is wearing or carrying is [[invisible]] as long as it is on the target's person.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_greater_restoration_phb\",\"name\":\"Greater Restoration\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You imbue a creature you touch with positive energy to undo a debilitating effect. You can reduce the target's exhaustion level by one, or end one of \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (diamond dust worth at least 100 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou imbue a creature you touch with positive energy to undo a debilitating effect. You can reduce the target's [[exhaustion]] level by one, or end one of the following effects on the target:\\n\\n- One effect that [[charmed]] or [[petrified]] the target\\n- One curse, including the target's attunement to a cursed magic item\\n- Any reduction to one of the target's ability scores\\n- One effect reducing the target's hit point maximum\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (diamond dust worth at least 100 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_guardian_of_faith_phb\",\"name\":\"Guardian of Faith\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — A Large spectral guardian appears and hovers for the duration in an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within range. The guardian occupi\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nA Large spectral guardian appears and hovers for the duration in an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within range. The guardian occupies that space and is indistinct except for a gleaming sword and shield emblazoned with the symbol of your deity.\\n\\nAny creature hostile to you that moves to a space within 10 feet of the guardian for the first time on a turn must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw. The creature takes 20 radiant damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. The guardian vanishes when it has dealt a total of 60 damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_guards_and_wards_phb\",\"name\":\"Guards and Wards\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • 10 minutes • Touch — You create a ward that protects up to 2,500 square feet of floor space (an area 50 feet square, or one hundred 5-foot squares or twenty-five 10-foot s\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (burning incense, a small measure of brimstone and oil, a knotted string, a small amount of umber hulk blood, and a small silver rod worth at least 10 gp)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou create a ward that protects up to 2,500 square feet of floor space (an area 50 feet square, or one hundred 5-foot squares or twenty-five 10-foot squares). The warded area can be up to 20 feet tall, and shaped as you desire. You can ward several stories of a stronghold by dividing the area among them, as long as you can walk into each contiguous area while you are casting the spell.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can specify individuals that are unaffected by any or all of the effects that you choose. You can also specify a password that, when spoken aloud, makes the speaker immune to these effects.\\n\\nGuards and wards creates the following effects within the warded area.\\n\\n***Corridors.*** Fog fills all the warded corridors, making them heavily obscured. In addition, at each intersection or branching passage offering a choice of direction, there is a 50 percent chance that a creature other than you will believe it is going in the opposite direction from the one it chooses.\\n\\n***Doors.*** All doors in the warded area are magically locked, as if sealed by an [[arcane lock]] spell. In addition, you can cover up to ten doors with an illusion (equivalent to the illusory object function of the [[minor illusion]] spell) to make them appear as plain sections of wall.\\n\\n***Stairs.*** Webs fill all stairs in the warded area from top to bottom, as the [[web]] spell. These strands regrow in 10 minutes if they are burned or torn away while guards and wards lasts.\\n\\n***Other Spell Effect.*** You can place your choice of one of the following magical effects within the warded area of the stronghold.\\n\\n- Place [[dancing lights]] in four corridors. You can designate a simple program that the lights repeat as long as guards and wards lasts.\\n- Place [[magic mouth]] in two locations.\\n- Place [[stinking cloud]] in two locations. The vapors appear in the places you designate; they return within 10 minutes if dispersed by wind while guards and wards lasts.\\n- Place a constant [[gust of wind]] in one corridor or room.\\n- Place a [[suggestion]] in one location. You select an area of up to 5 feet square, and any creature that enters or passes through the area receives the suggestion mentally.\\n\\nThe whole warded area radiates magic. A [[dispel magic]] cast on a specific effect, if successful, removes only that effect.\\n\\nYou can create a permanently guarded and warded structure by casting this spell there every day for one year.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (burning incense, a small measure of brimstone and oil, a knotted string, a small amount of umber hulk blood, and a small silver rod worth at least 10 gp)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_guidance_phb\",\"name\":\"Guidance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Divination Cantrip • Action • Touch — You touch one willing creature. Once before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to one ability check of its choice. It \",\"content\":\"*Divination Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou touch one willing creature. Once before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to one ability check of its choice. It can roll the die before or after making the ability check. The spell then ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Spirits|VRGR]] ([[Bard|PHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Circle of Stars|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_guiding_bolt_phb\",\"name\":\"Guiding Bolt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A flash of light streaks toward a creature of your choice within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 4d6 \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nA flash of light streaks toward a creature of your choice within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 4d6 radiant damage, and the next attack roll made against this target before the end of your next turn has advantage, thanks to the mystical dim light glittering on the target until then.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Stars|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gust_of_wind_phb\",\"name\":\"Gust of Wind\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • Self — A line of strong wind 60 feet long and 10 feet wide blasts from you in a direction you choose for the spell's duration. Each creature that starts its \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a legume seed)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA line of strong wind 60 feet long and 10 feet wide blasts from you in a direction you choose for the spell's duration. Each creature that starts its turn in the line must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pushed 15 feet away from you in a direction following the line.\\n\\nAny creature in the line must spend 2 feet of movement for every 1 foot it moves when moving closer to you.\\n\\nThe gust disperses gas or vapor, and it extinguishes candles, torches, and similar unprotected flames in the area. It causes protected flames, such as those of lanterns, to dance wildly and has a 50 percent chance to extinguish them.\\n\\nAs a bonus action on each of your turns before the spell ends, you can change the direction in which the line blasts from you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Aarakocra|MPMM]], [[Triton|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]], [[Triton|MOT]], [[Triton|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Rush of the Gale Spirits|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a legume seed)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hail_of_thorns_phb\",\"name\":\"Hail of Thorns\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Bonus action • Self — The next time you hit a creature with a ranged weapon attack before the spell ends, this spell creates a rain of thorns that sprouts from your ranged \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe next time you hit a creature with a ranged weapon attack before the spell ends, this spell creates a rain of thorns that sprouts from your ranged weapon or ammunition. In addition to the normal effect of the attack, the target of the attack and each creature within 5 feet of it must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 1d10 piercing damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** If you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 1st (to a maximum of 6d10).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Ranger\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hallow_phb\",\"name\":\"Hallow\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • 24 hours • Touch — You touch a point and infuse an area around it with holy (or unholy) power. The area can have a radius up to 60 feet, and the spell fails if the radiu\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 24 hours\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (herbs, oils, and incense worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou touch a point and infuse an area around it with holy (or unholy) power. The area can have a radius up to 60 feet, and the spell fails if the radius includes an area already under the effect a hallow spell. The affected area is subject to the following effects.\\n\\nFirst, celestials, elementals, fey, fiends, and undead can't enter the area, nor can such creatures charm, frighten, or possess creatures within it. Any creature [[charmed]], [[frightened]], or possessed by such a creature is no longer [[charmed]], [[frightened]], or possessed upon entering the area. You can exclude one or more of those types of creatures from this effect.\\n\\nSecond, you can bind an extra effect to the area. Choose the effect from the following list, or choose an effect offered by the DM. Some of these effects apply to creatures in the area; you can designate whether the effect applies to all creatures, creatures that follow a specific deity or leader, or creatures of a specific sort, such as orcs or trolls. When a creature that would be affected enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it can make a Charisma saving throw. On a success, the creature ignores the extra effect until it leaves the area.\\n\\n***Courage.*** Affected creatures can't be [[frightened]] while in the area.\\n\\n***Darkness.*** Darkness fills the area. Normal light, as well as magical light created by spells of a lower level than the slot you used to cast this spell, can't illuminate the area.\\n\\n***Daylight.*** Bright light fills the area. Magical darkness created by spells of a lower level than the slot you used to cast this spell can't extinguish the light.\\n\\n***Energy Protection.*** Affected creatures in the area have resistance to one damage type of your choice, except for bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing.\\n\\n***Energy Vulnerability.*** Affected creatures in the area have vulnerability to one damage type of your choice, except for bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing.\\n\\n***Everlasting Rest.*** Dead bodies interred in the area can't be turned into undead.\\n\\n***Extradimensional Interference.*** Affected creatures can't move or travel using teleportation or by extradimensional or interplanar means.\\n\\n***Fear.*** Affected creatures are [[frightened]] while in the area.\\n\\n***Silence.*** No sound can emanate from within the area, and no sound can reach into it.\\n\\n***Tongues.*** Affected creatures can communicate with any other creature in the area, even if they don't share a common language.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"24 hours\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (herbs, oils, and incense worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hallucinatory_terrain_phb\",\"name\":\"Hallucinatory Terrain\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Illusion • 10 minutes • 300 feet — You make natural terrain in a 150-foot cube in range look, sound, and smell like some other sort of natural terrain. Thus, open fields or a road can b\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a stone, a twig, and a bit of green plant)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou make natural terrain in a 150-foot cube in range look, sound, and smell like some other sort of natural terrain. Thus, open fields or a road can be made to resemble a swamp, hill, crevasse, or some other difficult or impassable terrain. A pond can be made to seem like a grassy meadow, a precipice like a gentle slope, or a rock-strewn gully like a wide and smooth road. Manufactured structures, equipment, and creatures within the area aren't changed in appearance.\\n\\nThe tactile characteristics of the terrain are unchanged, so creatures entering the area are likely to see through the illusion. If the difference isn't obvious by touch, a creature carefully examining the illusion can attempt an Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC to disbelieve it. A creature who discerns the illusion for what it is, sees it as a vague image superimposed on the terrain.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a stone, a twig, and a bit of green plant)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"150-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 4\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_harm_phb\",\"name\":\"Harm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You unleash a virulent disease on a creature that you can see within range. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it tak\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash a virulent disease on a creature that you can see within range. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 14d6 necrotic damage, or half as much damage on a successful save. The damage can't reduce the target's hit points below 1. If the target fails the saving throw, its hit point maximum is reduced for 1 hour by an amount equal to the necrotic damage it took. Any effect that removes a disease allows a creature's hit point maximum to return to normal before that time passes.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"14d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_haste_phb\",\"name\":\"Haste\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — Choose a willing creature that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, the target's speed is doubled, it gains a +2 bonus to AC, it has advant\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a shaving of licorice root)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose a willing creature that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, the target's speed is doubled, it gains a +2 bonus to AC, it has advantage on Dexterity saving throws, and it gains an additional action on each of its turns. That action can be used only to take the [[Attack]] (one weapon attack only), [[Dash]], [[Disengage]], [[Hide]], or [[Use an Object]] action.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the target can't move or take actions until after its next turn, as a wave of lethargy sweeps over it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]], [[Quandrix Student|SCC]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a shaving of licorice root)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_heal_phb\",\"name\":\"Heal\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — Choose a creature that you can see within range. A surge of positive energy washes through the creature, causing it to regain 70 hit points. This spel\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose a creature that you can see within range. A surge of positive energy washes through the creature, causing it to regain 70 hit points. This spell also ends [[blinded||blindness]], [[deafened||deafness]], and any diseases affecting the target. This spell has no effect on constructs or undead.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the amount of healing increases by 10 for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"70\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_healing_word_phb\",\"name\":\"Healing Word\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Bonus action • 60 feet — A creature of your choice that you can see within range regains hit points equal to 1d4 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA creature of your choice that you can see within range regains hit points equal to 1d4 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the healing increases by 1d4 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"healing\":\"1d4\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_heat_metal_phb\",\"name\":\"Heat Metal\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — Choose a manufactured metal object, such as a metal weapon or a suit of heavy or medium metal armor, that you can see within range. You cause the obje\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of iron and a flame)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose a manufactured metal object, such as a metal weapon or a suit of heavy or medium metal armor, that you can see within range. You cause the object to glow red-hot. Any creature in physical contact with the object takes 2d8 fire damage when you cast the spell. Until the spell ends, you can use a bonus action on each of your subsequent turns to cause this damage again.\\n\\nIf a creature is holding or wearing the object and takes the damage from it, the creature must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or drop the object if it can. If it doesn't drop the object, it has disadvantage on attack rolls and ability checks until the start of your next turn.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of iron and a flame)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hellish_rebuke_phb\",\"name\":\"Hellish Rebuke\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Reaction, which you take in response to being damaged by a creature within 60 feet of you that you can see • 60 feet — You point your finger, and the creature that damaged you is momentarily surrounded by hellish flames. The creature must make a Dexterity saving throw.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take in response to being damaged by a creature within 60 feet of you that you can see\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou point your finger, and the creature that damaged you is momentarily surrounded by hellish flames. The creature must make a Dexterity saving throw. It takes 2d10 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling|PHB]], [[Tiefling (Asmodeus)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Infernal Legacy)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take in response to being damaged by a creature within 60 feet of you that you can see\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Reaction\",\"Warlock\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_heroes_feast_phb\",\"name\":\"Heroes' Feast\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • 10 minutes • 30 feet — You bring forth a great feast, including magnificent food and drink. The feast takes 1 hour to consume and disappears at the end of that time, and the\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gem-encrusted bowl worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou bring forth a great feast, including magnificent food and drink. The feast takes 1 hour to consume and disappears at the end of that time, and the beneficial effects don't set in until this hour is over. Up to twelve creatures can partake of the feast.\\n\\nA creature that partakes of the feast gains several benefits. The creature is cured of all diseases and poison, becomes immune to poison and being [[frightened]], and makes all Wisdom saving throws with advantage. Its hit point maximum also increases by 2d10, and it gains the same number of hit points. These benefits last for 24 hours.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gem-encrusted bowl worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Bard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_heroism_phb\",\"name\":\"Heroism\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • Touch — A willing creature you touch is imbued with bravery. Until the spell ends, the creature is immune to being frightened and gains temporary hit points e\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA willing creature you touch is imbued with bravery. Until the spell ends, the creature is immune to being [[frightened]] and gains temporary hit points equal to your spellcasting ability modifier at the start of each of its turns. When the spell ends, the target loses any remaining temporary hit points from this spell.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hex_phb\",\"name\":\"Hex\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Bonus action • 90 feet — You place a curse on a creature that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 necrotic damage to the target whenever you \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (the petrified eye of a newt)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou place a curse on a creature that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 necrotic damage to the target whenever you hit it with an attack. Also, choose one ability when you cast the spell. The target has disadvantage on ability checks made with the chosen ability.\\n\\nIf the target drops to 0 hit points before this spell ends, you can use a bonus action on a subsequent turn of yours to curse a new creature.\\n\\nA [[remove curse]] cast on the target ends this spell early.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd or 4th level, you can maintain your [[concentration]] on the spell for up to 8 hours. When you use a spell slot of 5th level or higher, you can maintain your [[concentration]] on the spell for up to 24 hours.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Zendikar; Mul Daya Nation)|PSZ]], [[Hexblood|VRGR]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (the petrified eye of a newt)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hold_monster_phb\",\"name\":\"Hold Monster\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • Action • 90 feet — Choose a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be paralyzed for the duration. This spell has no \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small, straight piece of iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be [[paralyzed]] for the duration. This spell has no effect on undead. At the end of each of its turns, the target can make another Wisdom saving throw. On a success, the spell ends on the target.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 5th. The creatures must be within 30 feet of each other when you target them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Chains of Carceri|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small, straight piece of iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hold_person_phb\",\"name\":\"Hold Person\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — Choose a humanoid that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be paralyzed for the duration. At the end of each\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small, straight piece of iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose a humanoid that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be [[paralyzed]] for the duration. At the end of each of its turns, the target can make another Wisdom saving throw. On a success, the spell ends on the target.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you can target one additional humanoid for each slot level above 2nd. The humanoids must be within 30 feet of each other when you target them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Clench of the North Wind|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small, straight piece of iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_holy_aura_phb\",\"name\":\"Holy Aura\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Abjuration • Action • Self — Divine light washes out from you and coalesces in a soft radiance in a 30-foot radius around you. Creatures of your choice in that radius when you cas\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny reliquary worth at least 1,000 gp containing a sacred relic, such as a scrap of cloth from a saint's robe or a piece of parchment from a religious text)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nDivine light washes out from you and coalesces in a soft radiance in a 30-foot radius around you. Creatures of your choice in that radius when you cast this spell shed dim light in a 5-foot radius and have advantage on all saving throws, and other creatures have disadvantage on attack rolls against them until the spell ends. In addition, when a fiend or an undead hits an affected creature with a melee attack, the aura flashes with brilliant light. The attacker must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or be [[blinded]] until the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny reliquary worth at least 1,000 gp containing a sacred relic, such as a scrap of cloth from a saint's robe or a piece of parchment from a religious text)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hunger_of_hadar_phb\",\"name\":\"Hunger of Hadar\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 150 feet — You open a gateway to the dark between the stars, a region infested with unknown horrors. A 20-foot-radius sphere of blackness and bitter cold appears\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pickled octopus tentacle)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou open a gateway to the dark between the stars, a region infested with unknown horrors. A 20-foot-radius sphere of blackness and bitter cold appears, centered on a point within range and lasting for the duration. This void is filled with a cacophony of soft whispers and slurping noises that can be heard up to 30 feet away. No light, magical or otherwise, can illuminate the area, and creatures fully within the area are [[blinded]].\\n\\nThe void creates a warp in the fabric of space, and the area is difficult terrain. Any creature that starts its turn in the area takes 2d6 cold damage. Any creature that ends its turn in the area must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 2d6 acid damage as milky, otherworldly tentacles rub against it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pickled octopus tentacle)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hunter_s_mark_phb\",\"name\":\"Hunter's Mark\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Bonus action • 90 feet — You choose a creature you can see within range and mystically mark it as your quarry. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 damage to the target\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou choose a creature you can see within range and mystically mark it as your quarry. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 damage to the target whenever you hit it with a weapon attack, and you have advantage on any Wisdom ([[Perception]]) or Wisdom ([[Survival]]) check you make to find it. If the target drops to 0 hit points before this spell ends, you can use a bonus action on a subsequent turn of yours to mark a new creature.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd or 4th level, you can maintain your [[concentration]] on the spell for up to 8 hours. When you use a spell slot of 5th level or higher, you can maintain your [[concentration]] on the spell for up to 24 hours.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hypnotic_pattern_phb\",\"name\":\"Hypnotic Pattern\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You create a twisting pattern of colors that weaves through the air inside a 30-foot cube within range. The pattern appears for a moment and vanishes.\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a glowing stick of incense or a crystal vial filled with phosphorescent material)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a twisting pattern of colors that weaves through the air inside a 30-foot cube within range. The pattern appears for a moment and vanishes. Each creature in the area who sees the pattern must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the creature becomes [[charmed]] for the duration. While [[charmed]] by this spell, the creature is [[incapacitated]] and has a speed of 0.\\n\\nThe spell ends for an affected creature if it takes any damage or if someone else uses an action to shake the creature out of its stupor.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a glowing stick of incense or a crystal vial filled with phosphorescent material)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ice_storm_phb\",\"name\":\"Ice Storm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 300 feet — A hail of rock-hard ice pounds to the ground in a 20-foot-radius, 40-foot-high cylinder centered on a point within range. Each creature in the cylinde\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of dust and a few drops of water)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA hail of rock-hard ice pounds to the ground in a 20-foot-radius, 40-foot-high cylinder centered on a point within range. Each creature in the cylinder must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 2d8 bludgeoning damage and 4d6 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nHailstones turn the storm's area of effect into difficult terrain until the end of your next turn.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the bludgeoning damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of dust and a few drops of water)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_identify_phb\",\"name\":\"Identify\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Touch — You choose one object that you must touch throughout the casting of the spell. If it is a magic item or some other magic-imbued object, you learn its \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pearl worth at least 100 gp and an owl feather)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou choose one object that you must touch throughout the casting of the spell. If it is a magic item or some other magic-imbued object, you learn its properties and how to use them, whether it requires attunement to use, and how many charges it has, if any. You learn whether any spells are affecting the item and what they are. If the item was created by a spell, you learn which spell created it.\\n\\nIf you instead touch a creature throughout the casting, you learn what spells, if any, are currently affecting it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pearl worth at least 100 gp and an owl feather)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_illusory_script_phb\",\"name\":\"Illusory Script\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Illusion • 1 minute or Ritual • Touch — You write on parchment, paper, or some other suitable writing material and imbue it with a potent illusion that lasts for the duration. To you and any\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** S, M (a lead-based ink worth at least 10 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nYou write on parchment, paper, or some other suitable writing material and imbue it with a potent illusion that lasts for the duration.\\n\\nTo you and any creatures you designate when you cast the spell, the writing appears normal, written in your hand, and conveys whatever meaning you intended when you wrote the text. To all others, the writing appears as if it were written in an unknown or magical script that is unintelligible. Alternatively, you can cause the writing to appear to be an entirely different message, written in a different hand and language, though the language must be one you know.\\n\\nShould the spell be dispelled, the original script and the illusion both disappear.\\n\\nA creature with [[truesight]] can read the hidden message.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"S, M (a lead-based ink worth at least 10 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_imprisonment_phb\",\"name\":\"Imprisonment\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Abjuration • 1 minute • 30 feet — You create a magical restraint to hold a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be bound by the s\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a vellum depiction or a carved statuette in the likeness of the target, and a special component that varies according to the version of the spell you choose, worth at least 500 gp per Hit Die of the target)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou create a magical restraint to hold a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be bound by the spell; if it succeeds, it is immune to this spell if you cast it again. While affected by this spell, the creature doesn't need to breathe, eat, or drink, and it doesn't age. Divination spells can't locate or perceive the target.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, you choose one of the following forms of imprisonment.\\n\\n***Burial.*** The target is entombed far beneath the earth in a sphere of magical force that is just large enough to contain the target. Nothing can pass through the sphere, nor can any creature teleport or use planar travel to get into or out of it.\\n\\nThe special component for this version of the spell is a small mithral orb.\\n\\n***Chaining.*** Heavy chains, firmly rooted in the ground, hold the target in place. The target is [[restrained]] until the spell ends, and it can't move or be moved by any means until then.\\n\\nThe special component for this version of the spell is a fine chain of precious metal.\\n\\n***Hedged Prison.*** The spell transports the target into a tiny demiplane that is warded against teleportation and planar travel. The demiplane can be a labyrinth, a cage, a tower, or any similar confined structure or area of your choice.\\n\\nThe special component for this version of the spell is a miniature representation of the prison made from jade.\\n\\n***Minimus Containment.*** The target shrinks to a height of 1 inch and is imprisoned inside a gemstone or similar object. Light can pass through the gemstone normally (allowing the target to see out and other creatures to see in), but nothing else can pass through, even by means of teleportation or planar travel. The gemstone can't be cut or broken while the spell remains in effect.\\n\\nThe special component for this version of the spell is a large, transparent gemstone, such as a corundum, diamond, or ruby.\\n\\n***Slumber.*** The target falls asleep and can't be awoken.\\n\\nThe special component for this version of the spell consists of rare soporific herbs.\\n\\n***Ending the Spell.*** During the casting of the spell, in any of its versions, you can specify a condition that will cause the spell to end and release the target. The condition can be as specific or as elaborate as you choose, but the DM must agree that the condition is reasonable and has a likelihood of coming to pass. The conditions can be based on a creature's name, identity, or deity but otherwise must be based on observable actions or qualities and not based on intangibles such as level, class, or hit points.\\n\\nA [[dispel magic]] spell can end the spell only if it is cast as a 9th-level spell, targeting either the prison or the special component used to create it.\\n\\nYou can use a particular special component to create only one prison at a time. If you cast the spell again using the same component, the target of the first casting is immediately freed from its binding.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a vellum depiction or a carved statuette in the likeness of the target, and a special component that varies according to the version of the spell you choose, worth at least 500 gp per Hit Die of the target)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Special\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_incendiary_cloud_phb\",\"name\":\"Incendiary Cloud\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • Action • 150 feet — A swirling cloud of smoke shot through with white-hot embers appears in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point within range. The cloud spreads ar\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA swirling cloud of smoke shot through with white-hot embers appears in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point within range. The cloud spreads around corners and is heavily obscured. It lasts for the duration or until a wind of moderate or greater speed (at least 10 miles per hour) disperses it.\\n\\nWhen the cloud appears, each creature in it must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 10d8 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature must also make this saving throw when it enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there.\\n\\nThe cloud moves 10 feet directly away from you in a direction that you choose at the start of each of your turns.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Druid\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_inflict_wounds_phb\",\"name\":\"Inflict Wounds\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Necromancy • Action • Touch — Make a melee spell attack against a creature you can reach. On a hit, the target takes 3d10 necrotic damage.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nMake a melee spell attack against a creature you can reach. On a hit, the target takes 3d10 necrotic damage.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_insect_plague_phb\",\"name\":\"Insect Plague\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 300 feet — Swarming, biting locusts fill a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range. The sphere spreads around corners. The sphere remai\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a few grains of sugar, some kernels of grain, and a smear of fat)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nSwarming, biting locusts fill a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range. The sphere spreads around corners. The sphere remains for the duration, and its area is lightly obscured. The sphere's area is difficult terrain.\\n\\nWhen the area appears, each creature in it must make a Constitution saving throw. A creature takes 4d10 piercing damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature must also make this saving throw when it enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a few grains of sugar, some kernels of grain, and a smear of fat)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d10\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_invisibility_phb\",\"name\":\"Invisibility\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • Touch — A creature you touch becomes invisible until the spell ends. Anything the target is wearing or carrying is invisible as long as it is on the target's \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an eyelash encased in gum arabic)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nA creature you touch becomes [[invisible]] until the spell ends. Anything the target is wearing or carrying is [[invisible]] as long as it is on the target's person. The spell ends for a target that attacks or casts a spell.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Duergar|MPMM]], [[Dwarf (Duergar)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Glasya)|MTF]], [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Elf (Pallid)|EGW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Shroud of Shadow|XGE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an eyelash encased in gum arabic)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_jump_phb\",\"name\":\"Jump\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a creature. The creature's jump distance is tripled until the spell ends.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a grasshopper's hind leg)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou touch a creature. The creature's *jump distance* is tripled until the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gith (Githyanki)|MTF]], [[Githyanki|MPMM]], [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Otherworldly Leap|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a grasshopper's hind leg)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_knock_phb\",\"name\":\"Knock\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — Choose an object that you can see within range. The object can be a door, a box, a chest, a set of manacles, a padlock, or another object that contain\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose an object that you can see within range. The object can be a door, a box, a [[chest|PHB]], a set of [[manacles|PHB]], a padlock, or another object that contains a mundane or magical means that prevents access.\\n\\nA target that is held shut by a mundane lock or that is stuck or barred becomes unlocked, unstuck, or unbarred. If the object has multiple locks, only one of them is unlocked.\\n\\nIf you choose a target that is held shut with [[arcane lock]], that spell is suppressed for 10 minutes, during which time the target can be opened and shut normally.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, a loud knock, audible from as far away as 300 feet, emanates from the target object.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_legend_lore_phb\",\"name\":\"Legend Lore\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 10 minutes • Self — Name or describe a person, place, or object. The spell brings to your mind a brief summary of the significant lore about the thing you named. The lore\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (incense worth at least 250 gp, which the spell consumes, and four ivory strips worth at least 50 gp each)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nName or describe a person, place, or object. The spell brings to your mind a brief summary of the significant lore about the thing you named. The lore might consist of current tales, forgotten stories, or even secret lore that has never been widely known. If the thing you named isn't of legendary importance, you gain no information. The more information you already have about the thing, the more precise and detailed the information you receive is.\\n\\nThe information you learn is accurate but might be couched in figurative language. For example, if you have a mysterious magic axe on hand, the spell might yield this information: \\\"Woe to the evildoer whose hand touches the axe, for even the haft slices the hand of the evil ones. Only a true Child of Stone, lover and beloved of Moradin, may awaken the true powers of the axe, and only with the sacred word Rudnogg on the lips.\\\"\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (incense worth at least 250 gp, which the spell consumes, and four ivory strips worth at least 50 gp each)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_leomund_s_secret_chest_phb\",\"name\":\"Leomund's Secret Chest\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • Touch — You hide a chest, and all its contents, on the Ethereal Plane. You must touch the chest and the miniature replica that serves as a material component \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an exquisite chest, 3 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet, constructed from rare materials worth at least 5,000 gp, and a Tiny replica made from the same materials worth at least 50 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hide a chest, and all its contents, on the Ethereal Plane. You must touch the chest and the miniature replica that serves as a material component for the spell. The chest can contain up to 12 cubic feet of nonliving material (3 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet).\\n\\nWhile the chest remains on the Ethereal Plane, you can use an action and touch the replica to recall the chest. It appears in an unoccupied space on the ground within 5 feet of you. You can send the chest back to the Ethereal Plane by using an action and touching both the chest and the replica.\\n\\nAfter 60 days, there is a cumulative 5 percent chance per day that the spell's effect ends. This effect ends if you cast this spell again, if the smaller replica chest is destroyed, or if you choose to end the spell as an action. If the spell ends and the larger chest is on the Ethereal Plane, it is irretrievably lost.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an exquisite chest, 3 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet, constructed from rare materials worth at least 5,000 gp, and a Tiny replica made from the same materials worth at least 50 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_leomund_s_tiny_hut_phb\",\"name\":\"Leomund's Tiny Hut\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — A 10-foot-radius immobile dome of force springs into existence around and above you and remains stationary for the duration. The spell ends if you lea\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small crystal bead)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nA 10-foot-radius immobile dome of force springs into existence around and above you and remains stationary for the duration. The spell ends if you leave its area.\\n\\nNine creatures of Medium size or smaller can fit inside the dome with you. The spell fails if its area includes a larger creature or more than nine creatures. Creatures and objects within the dome when you cast this spell can move through it freely. All other creatures and objects are barred from passing through it. Spells and other magical effects can't extend through the dome or be cast through it. The atmosphere inside the space is comfortable and dry, regardless of the weather outside.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can command the interior to become dimly lit or dark. The dome is opaque from the outside, of any color you choose, but it is transparent from the inside.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small crystal bead)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_lesser_restoration_phb\",\"name\":\"Lesser Restoration\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a creature and can end either one disease or one condition afflicting it. The condition can be blinded, deafened, paralyzed, or poisoned.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a creature and can end either one disease or one condition afflicting it. The condition can be [[blinded]], [[deafened]], [[paralyzed]], or [[poisoned]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Aasimar|DMG]], [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_levitate_phb\",\"name\":\"Levitate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — One creature or loose object of your choice that you can see within range rises vertically, up to 20 feet, and remains suspended there for the duratio\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (either a small leather loop or a piece of golden wire bent into a cup shape with a long shank on one end)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nOne creature or loose object of your choice that you can see within range rises vertically, up to 20 feet, and remains suspended there for the duration. The spell can levitate a target that weighs up to 500 pounds. An unwilling creature that succeeds on a Constitution saving throw is unaffected.\\n\\nThe target can move only by pushing or pulling against a fixed object or surface within reach (such as a wall or a ceiling), which allows it to move as if it were climbing. You can change the target's altitude by up to 20 feet in either direction on your turn. If you are the target, you can move up or down as part of your move. Otherwise, you can use your action to move the target, which must remain within the spell's range.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the target floats gently to the ground if it is still aloft.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Air)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Air)|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Drow High Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Ascendant Step|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (either a small leather loop or a piece of golden wire bent into a cup shape with a long shank on one end)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_light_phb\",\"name\":\"Light\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • Touch — You touch one object that is no larger than 10 feet in any dimension. Until the spell ends, the object sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius and dim \",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, M (a firefly or phosphorescent moss)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch one object that is no larger than 10 feet in any dimension. Until the spell ends, the object sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius and dim light for an additional 20 feet. The light can be colored as you like. Completely covering the object with something opaque blocks the light. The spell ends if you cast it again or dismiss it as an action.\\n\\nIf you target an object held or worn by a hostile creature, that creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw to avoid the spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Aasimar|DMG]], [[Aasimar|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Aasimar (Fallen)|VGM]], [[Aasimar (Protector)|VGM]], [[Aasimar (Scourge)|VGM]], [[Astral Elf|AAG]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf (Pallid)|EGW]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, M (a firefly or phosphorescent moss)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_lightning_arrow_phb\",\"name\":\"Lightning Arrow\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — The next time you make a ranged weapon attack during the spell's duration, the weapon's ammunition, or the weapon itself if it's a thrown weapon, tran\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe next time you make a ranged weapon attack during the spell's duration, the weapon's ammunition, or the weapon itself if it's a thrown weapon, transforms into a bolt of lightning. Make the attack roll as normal. The target takes 4d8 lightning damage on a hit, or half as much damage on a miss, instead of the weapon's normal damage.\\n\\nWhether you hit or miss, each creature within 10 feet of the target must make a Dexterity saving throw. Each of these creatures takes 2d8 lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe piece of ammunition or weapon then returns to its normal form.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage for both effects of the spell increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Ranger\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_lightning_bolt_phb\",\"name\":\"Lightning Bolt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Self — A stroke of lightning forming a line 100 feet long and 5 feet wide blasts out from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the line must make \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fur and a rod of amber, crystal, or glass)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA stroke of lightning forming a line 100 feet long and 5 feet wide blasts out from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the line must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 8d6 lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe lightning ignites flammable objects in the area that aren't being worn or carried.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fur and a rod of amber, crystal, or glass)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d6\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_locate_animals_or_plants_phb\",\"name\":\"Locate Animals or Plants\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — Describe or name a specific kind of beast or plant. Concentrating on the voice of nature in your surroundings, you learn the direction and distance to\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fur from a bloodhound)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nDescribe or name a specific kind of beast or plant. Concentrating on the voice of nature in your surroundings, you learn the direction and distance to the closest creature or plant of that kind within 5 miles, if any are present.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fur from a bloodhound)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_locate_creature_phb\",\"name\":\"Locate Creature\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Divination • Action • Self — Describe or name a creature that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the creature's location, as long as that creature is within 1,000 feet\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fur from a bloodhound)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nDescribe or name a creature that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the creature's location, as long as that creature is within 1,000 feet of you. If the creature is moving, you know the direction of its movement.\\n\\nThe spell can locate a specific creature known to you, or the nearest creature of a specific kind (such as a human or a [[unicorn]]), so long as you have seen such a creature up close—within 30 feet—at least once. If the creature you described or named is in a different form, such as being under the effects of a [[polymorph]] spell, this spell doesn't locate the creature.\\n\\nThis spell can't locate a creature if running water at least 10 feet wide blocks a direct path between you and the creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fur from a bloodhound)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_locate_object_phb\",\"name\":\"Locate Object\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • Self — Describe or name an object that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the object's location, as long as that object is within 1,000 feet of y\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a forked twig)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nDescribe or name an object that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the object's location, as long as that object is within 1,000 feet of you. If the object is in motion, you know the direction of its movement.\\n\\nThe spell can locate a specific object known to you, as long as you have seen it up close—within 30 feet—at least once. Alternatively, the spell can locate the nearest object of a particular kind, such as a certain kind of apparel, jewelry, furniture, tool, or weapon.\\n\\nThis spell can't locate an object if any thickness of lead, even a thin sheet, blocks a direct path between you and the object.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a forked twig)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_longstrider_phb\",\"name\":\"Longstrider\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a creature. The target's speed increases by 10 feet until the spell ends.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of dirt)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a creature. The target's speed increases by 10 feet until the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of dirt)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mage_armor_phb\",\"name\":\"Mage Armor\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature who isn't wearing armor, and a protective magical force surrounds it until the spell ends. The target's base AC becomes 1\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of cured leather)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch a willing creature who isn't wearing armor, and a protective magical force surrounds it until the spell ends. The target's base AC becomes 13 + its Dexterity modifier. The spell ends if the target dons armor or if you dismiss the spell as an action.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Armor of Shadows|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of cured leather)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mage_hand_phb\",\"name\":\"Mage Hand\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Conjuration Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — A spectral, floating hand appears at a point you choose within range. The hand lasts for the duration or until you dismiss it as an action. The hand v\",\"content\":\"*Conjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nA spectral, floating hand appears at a point you choose within range. The hand lasts for the duration or until you dismiss it as an action. The hand vanishes if it is ever more than 30 feet away from you or if you cast this spell again.\\n\\nYou can use your action to control the hand. You can use the hand to manipulate an object, open an unlocked door or container, stow or retrieve an item from an open container, or pour the contents out of a vial. You can move the hand up to 30 feet each time you use it.\\n\\nThe hand can't attack, activate magic items, or carry more than 10 pounds.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Gith (Githyanki)|MTF]], [[Gith (Githzerai)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Mammon)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Mephistopheles)|MTF]], [[Githyanki|MPMM]], [[Githzerai|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Telekinetic|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_circle_phb\",\"name\":\"Magic Circle\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • 1 minute • 10 feet — You create a 10-foot-radius, 20-foot-tall cylinder of magical energy centered on a point on the ground that you can see within range. Glowing runes ap\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (holy water or powdered silver and iron worth at least 100 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou create a 10-foot-radius, 20-foot-tall cylinder of magical energy centered on a point on the ground that you can see within range. Glowing runes appear wherever the cylinder intersects with the floor or other surface.\\n\\nChoose one or more of the following types of creatures: celestials, elementals, fey, fiends, or undead. The circle affects a creature of the chosen type in the following ways:\\n\\n- The creature can't willingly enter the cylinder by nonmagical means. If the creature tries to use teleportation or interplanar travel to do so, it must first succeed on a Charisma saving throw.\\n- The creature has disadvantage on attack rolls against targets within the cylinder.\\n- Targets within the cylinder can't be [[charmed]], [[frightened]], or possessed by the creature.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can elect to cause its magic to operate in the reverse direction, preventing a creature of the specified type from leaving the cylinder and protecting targets outside it.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the duration increases by 1 hour for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (holy water or powdered silver and iron worth at least 100 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_jar_phb\",\"name\":\"Magic Jar\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • 1 minute • Self — Your body falls into a catatonic state as your soul leaves it and enters the container you used for the spell's material component. While your soul in\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gem, crystal, reliquary, or some other ornamental container worth at least 500 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYour body falls into a catatonic state as your soul leaves it and enters the container you used for the spell's material component. While your soul inhabits the container, you are aware of your surroundings as if you were in the container's space. You can't move or use reactions. The only action you can take is to project your soul up to 100 feet out of the container, either returning to your living body (and ending the spell) or attempting to possess a humanoid's body.\\n\\nYou can attempt to possess any humanoid within 100 feet of you that you can see (creatures warded by a [[protection from evil and good]] or [[magic circle]] spell can't be possessed). The target must make a Charisma saving throw. On a failure, your soul moves into the target's body, and the target's soul becomes trapped in the container. On a success, the target resists your efforts to possess it, and you can't attempt to possess it again for 24 hours.\\n\\nOnce you possess a creature's body, you control it. Your game statistics are replaced by the statistics of the creature, though you retain your alignment and your Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores. You retain the benefit of your own class features. If the target has any class levels, you can't use any of its class features.\\n\\nMeanwhile, the possessed creature's soul can perceive from the container using its own senses, but it can't move or take actions at all.\\n\\nWhile possessing a body, you can use your action to return from the host body to the container if it is within 100 feet of you, returning the host creature's soul to its body. If the host body dies while you're in it, the creature dies, and you must make a Charisma saving throw against your own spellcasting DC. On a success, you return to the container if it is within 100 feet of you. Otherwise, you die.\\n\\nIf the container is destroyed or the spell ends, your soul immediately returns to your body. If your body is more than 100 feet away from you or if your body is dead when you attempt to return to it, you die. If another creature's soul is in the container when it is destroyed, the creature's soul returns to its body if the body is alive and within 100 feet. Otherwise, that creature dies.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the container is destroyed.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gem, crystal, reliquary, or some other ornamental container worth at least 500 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_missile_phb\",\"name\":\"Magic Missile\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You create three glowing darts of magical force. Each dart hits a creature of your choice that you can see within range. A dart deals 1d4 + 1 force da\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create three glowing darts of magical force. Each dart hits a creature of your choice that you can see within range. A dart deals 1d4 + 1 force damage to its target. The darts all strike simultaneously, and you can direct them to hit one creature or several.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the spell creates one more dart for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4 + 1\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_mouth_phb\",\"name\":\"Magic Mouth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • 1 minute or Ritual • 30 feet — You implant a message within an object in range, a message that is uttered when a trigger condition is met. Choose an object that you can see and that\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small bit of honeycomb and jade dust worth at least 10 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou implant a message within an object in range, a message that is uttered when a trigger condition is met. Choose an object that you can see and that isn't being worn or carried by another creature. Then speak the message, which must be 25 words or less, though it can be delivered over as long as 10 minutes. Finally, determine the circumstance that will trigger the spell to deliver your message.\\n\\nWhen that circumstance occurs, a magical mouth appears on the object and recites the message in your voice and at the same volume you spoke. If the object you chose has a mouth or something that looks like a mouth (for example, the mouth of a statue), the magical mouth appears there so that the words appear to come from the object's mouth. When you cast this spell, you can have the spell end after it delivers its message, or it can remain and repeat its message whenever the trigger occurs.\\n\\nThe triggering circumstance can be as general or as detailed as you like, though it must be based on visual or audible conditions that occur within 30 feet of the object. For example, you could instruct the mouth to speak when any creature moves within 30 feet of the object or when a silver bell rings within 30 feet of it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small bit of honeycomb and jade dust worth at least 10 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_weapon_phb\",\"name\":\"Magic Weapon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Bonus action • Touch — You touch a nonmagical weapon. Until the spell ends, that weapon becomes a magic weapon with a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou touch a nonmagical weapon. Until the spell ends, that weapon becomes a magic weapon with a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the bonus increases to +2. When you use a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the bonus increases to +3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_major_image_phb\",\"name\":\"Major Image\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 20-foot cube. The image appears at a spot tha\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 20-foot cube. The image appears at a spot that you can see within range and lasts for the duration. It seems completely real, including sounds, smells, and temperature appropriate to the thing depicted. You can't create sufficient heat or cold to cause damage, a sound loud enough to deal thunder damage or deafen a creature, or a smell that might sicken a creature (like a [[troglodyte||troglodyte's]] stench).\\n\\nAs long as you are within range of the illusion, you can use your action to cause the image to move to any other spot within range. As the image changes location, you can alter its appearance so that its movements appear natural for the image. For example, if you create an image of a creature and move it, you can alter the image so that it appears to be walking. Similarly, you can cause the illusion to make different sounds at different times, even making it carry on a conversation, for example.\\n\\nPhysical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, because things can pass through it. A creature that uses its action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image, and its other sensory qualities become faint to the creature.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the spell lasts until dispelled, without requiring your [[concentration]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mass_cure_wounds_phb\",\"name\":\"Mass Cure Wounds\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — A wave of healing energy washes out from a point of your choice within range. Choose up to six creatures in a 30-foot-radius sphere centered on that p\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA wave of healing energy washes out from a point of your choice within range. Choose up to six creatures in a 30-foot-radius sphere centered on that point. Each target regains hit points equal to 3d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the healing increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"3d8\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mass_heal_phb\",\"name\":\"Mass Heal\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — A flood of healing energy flows from you into injured creatures around you. You restore up to 700 hit points, divided as you choose among any number o\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA flood of healing energy flows from you into injured creatures around you. You restore up to 700 hit points, divided as you choose among any number of creatures that you can see within range. Creatures healed by this spell are also cured of all diseases and any effect making them [[blinded]] or [[deafened]]. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mass_healing_word_phb\",\"name\":\"Mass Healing Word\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Bonus action • 60 feet — As you call out words of restoration, up to six creatures of your choice that you can see within range regain hit points equal to 1d4 + your spellcast\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nAs you call out words of restoration, up to six creatures of your choice that you can see within range regain hit points equal to 1d4 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the healing increases by 1d4 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"healing\":\"1d4\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Bard\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mass_suggestion_phb\",\"name\":\"Mass Suggestion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You suggest a course of activity (limited to a sentence or two) and magically influence up to twelve creatures of your choice that you can see within \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a snake's tongue and either a bit of honeycomb or a drop of sweet oil)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou suggest a course of activity (limited to a sentence or two) and magically influence up to twelve creatures of your choice that you can see within range and that can hear and understand you. Creatures that can't be [[charmed]] are immune to this effect. The suggestion must be worded in such a manner as to make the course of action sound reasonable. Asking the creature to stab itself, throw itself onto a spear, immolate itself, or do some other obviously harmful act automatically negates the effect of the spell.\\n\\nEach target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, it pursues the course of action you described to the best of its ability. The suggested course of action can continue for the entire duration. If the suggested activity can be completed in a shorter time, the spell ends when the subject finishes what it was asked to do.\\n\\nYou can also specify conditions that will trigger a special activity during the duration. For example, you might suggest that a group of soldiers give all their money to the first beggar they meet. If the condition isn't met before the spell ends, the activity isn't performed.\\n\\nIf you or any of your companions damage a creature affected by this spell, the spell ends for that creature.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a 7th-level spell slot, the duration is 10 days. When you use an 8th-level spell slot, the duration is 30 days. When you use a 9th-level spell slot, the duration is a year and a day.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a snake's tongue and either a bit of honeycomb or a drop of sweet oil)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_maze_phb\",\"name\":\"Maze\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You banish a creature that you can see within range into a labyrinthine demiplane. The target remains there for the duration or until it escapes the m\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou banish a creature that you can see within range into a labyrinthine demiplane. The target remains there for the duration or until it escapes the maze.\\n\\nThe target can use its action to attempt to escape. When it does so, it makes a DC 20 Intelligence check. If it succeeds, it escapes, and the spell ends (a [[minotaur]] or [[goristro]] demon automatically succeeds).\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the target reappears in the space it left or, if that space is occupied, in the nearest unoccupied space.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_meld_into_stone_phb\",\"name\":\"Meld into Stone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action or Ritual • Touch — You step into a stone object or surface large enough to fully contain your body, melding yourself and all the equipment you carry with the stone for t\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou step into a stone object or surface large enough to fully contain your body, melding yourself and all the equipment you carry with the stone for the duration. Using your movement, you step into the stone at a point you can touch. Nothing of your presence remains visible or otherwise detectable by nonmagical senses.\\n\\nWhile merged with the stone, you can't see what occurs outside it, and any Wisdom ([[Perception]]) checks you make to hear sounds outside it are made with disadvantage. You remain aware of the passage of time and can cast spells on yourself while merged in the stone. You can use your movement to leave the stone where you entered it, which ends the spell. You otherwise can't move.\\n\\nMinor physical damage to the stone doesn't harm you, but its partial destruction or a change in its shape (to the extent that you no longer fit within it) expels you and deals 6d6 bludgeoning damage to you. The stone's complete destruction (or transmutation into a different substance) expels you and deals 50 bludgeoning damage to you. If expelled, you fall [[prone]] in an unoccupied space closest to where you first entered.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_melf_s_acid_arrow_phb\",\"name\":\"Melf's Acid Arrow\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — A shimmering green arrow streaks toward a target within range and bursts in a spray of acid. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (powdered rhubarb leaf and an adder's stomach)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA shimmering green arrow streaks toward a target within range and bursts in a spray of acid. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 4d4 acid damage immediately and 2d4 acid damage at the end of its next turn. On a miss, the arrow splashes the target with acid for half as much of the initial damage and no damage at the end of its next turn.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage (both initial and later) increases by 1d4 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (powdered rhubarb leaf and an adder's stomach)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d4\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mending_phb\",\"name\":\"Mending\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • 1 minute • Touch — This spell repairs a single break or tear in an object you touch, such as broken chain link, two halves of a broken key, a torn cloak, or a leaking wi\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (two lodestones)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThis spell repairs a single break or tear in an object you touch, such as broken chain link, two halves of a broken key, a torn cloak, or a leaking wineskin. As long as the break or tear is no larger than 1 foot in any dimension, you mend it, leaving no trace of the former damage.\\n\\nThis spell can physically repair a magic item or construct, but the spell can't restore magic to such an object.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (two lodestones)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_message_phb\",\"name\":\"Message\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — You point your finger toward a creature within range and whisper a message. The target (and only the target) hears the message and can reply in a whis\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a short piece of copper wire)\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou point your finger toward a creature within range and whisper a message. The target (and only the target) hears the message and can reply in a whisper that only you can hear.\\n\\nYou can cast this spell through solid objects if you are familiar with the target and know it is beyond the barrier. Magical silence, 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of common metal, a thin sheet of lead, or 3 feet of wood blocks the spell. The spell doesn't have to follow a straight line and can travel freely around corners or through openings.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a short piece of copper wire)\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_meteor_swarm_phb\",\"name\":\"Meteor Swarm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Evocation • Action • 1 mile — Blazing orbs of fire plummet to the ground at four different points you can see within range. Each creature in a 40-foot-radius sphere centered on eac\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 1 mile\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nBlazing orbs of fire plummet to the ground at four different points you can see within range. Each creature in a 40-foot-radius sphere centered on each point you choose must make a Dexterity saving throw. The sphere spreads around corners. A creature takes 20d6 fire damage and 20d6 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature in the area of more than one fiery burst is affected only once.\\n\\nThe spell damages objects in the area and ignites flammable objects that aren't being worn or carried.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"1 mile\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"20d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"40-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mind_blank_phb\",\"name\":\"Mind Blank\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Abjuration • Action • Touch — Until the spell ends, one willing creature you touch is immune to psychic damage, any effect that would sense its emotions or read its thoughts, divin\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nUntil the spell ends, one willing creature you touch is immune to psychic damage, any effect that would sense its emotions or read its thoughts, divination spells, and the [[charmed]] condition. The spell even foils [[wish]] spells and spells or effects of similar power used to affect the target's mind or to gain information about the target.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_minor_illusion_phb\",\"name\":\"Minor Illusion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Illusion Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You create a sound or an image of an object within range that lasts for the duration. The illusion also ends if you dismiss it as an action or cast th\",\"content\":\"*Illusion Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a bit of fleece)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou create a sound or an image of an object within range that lasts for the duration. The illusion also ends if you dismiss it as an action or cast this spell again.\\n\\nIf you create a sound, its volume can range from a whisper to a scream. It can be your voice, someone else's voice, a lion's roar, a beating of drums, or any other sound you choose. The sound continues unabated throughout the duration, or you can make discrete sounds at different times before the spell ends.\\n\\nIf you create an image of an object—such as a chair, muddy footprints, or a small chest—it must be no larger than a 5-foot cube. The image can't create sound, light, smell, or any other sensory effect. Physical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, because things can pass through it.\\n\\nIf a creature uses its action to examine the sound or image, the creature can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the illusion becomes faint to the creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[School of Illusion|PHB]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Gnome (Forest)|PHB]], [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Tiefling (Glasya)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a bit of fleece)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mirage_arcane_phb\",\"name\":\"Mirage Arcane\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Illusion • 10 minutes • Sight — You make terrain in an area up to 1 mile square look, sound, smell, and even feel like some other sort of terrain. The terrain's general shape remains\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Sight\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nYou make terrain in an area up to 1 mile square look, sound, smell, and even feel like some other sort of terrain. The terrain's general shape remains the same, however. Open fields or a road could be made to resemble a swamp, hill, crevasse, or some other difficult or impassable terrain. A pond can be made to seem like a grassy meadow, a precipice like a gentle slope, or a rock-strewn gully like a wide and smooth road.\\n\\nSimilarly, you can alter the appearance of structures, or add them where none are present. The spell doesn't disguise, conceal, or add creatures.\\n\\nThe illusion includes audible, visual, tactile, and olfactory elements, so it can turn clear ground into difficult terrain (or vice versa) or otherwise impede movement through the area. Any piece of the illusory terrain (such as a rock or stick) that is removed from the spell's area disappears immediately.\\n\\nCreatures with [[truesight]] can see through the illusion to the terrain's true form; however, all other elements of the illusion remain, so while the creature is aware of the illusion's presence, the creature can still physically interact with the illusion.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Sight\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mirror_image_phb\",\"name\":\"Mirror Image\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • Self — Three illusory duplicates of yourself appear in your space. Until the spell ends, the duplicates move with you and mimic your actions, shifting positi\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nThree illusory duplicates of yourself appear in your space. Until the spell ends, the duplicates move with you and mimic your actions, shifting position so it's impossible to track which image is real. You can use your action to dismiss the illusory duplicates.\\n\\nEach time a creature targets you with an attack during the spell's duration, roll a d20 to determine whether the attack instead targets one of your duplicates.\\n\\nIf you have three duplicates, you must roll a 6 or higher to change the attack's target to a duplicate. With two duplicates, you must roll an 8 or higher. With one duplicate, you must roll an 11 or higher.\\n\\nA duplicate's AC equals 10 + your Dexterity modifier. If an attack hits a duplicate, the duplicate is destroyed. A duplicate can be destroyed only by an attack that hits it. It ignores all other damage and effects. The spell ends when all three duplicates are destroyed.\\n\\nA creature is unaffected by this spell if it can't see, if it relies on senses other than sight, such as blindsight, or if it can perceive illusions as false, as with [[truesight]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Bard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mislead_phb\",\"name\":\"Mislead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Illusion • Action • Self — You become invisible at the same time that an illusory double of you appears where you are standing. The double lasts for the duration, but the invisi\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou become [[invisible]] at the same time that an illusory double of you appears where you are standing. The double lasts for the duration, but the invisibility ends if you attack or cast a spell.\\n\\nYou can use your action to move your illusory double up to twice your speed and make it gesture, speak, and behave in whatever way you choose.\\n\\nYou can see through its eyes and hear through its ears as if you were located where it is. On each of your turns as a bonus action, you can switch from using its senses to using your own, or back again. While you are using its senses, you are [[blinded]] and [[deafened]] in regard to your own surroundings.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_misty_step_phb\",\"name\":\"Misty Step\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Bonus action • Self — Briefly surrounded by silvery mist, you teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space that you can see.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nBriefly surrounded by silvery mist, you teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space that you can see.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Eladrin)|DMG]], [[Gith (Githyanki)|MTF]], [[Githyanki|MPMM]], [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Fey Teleportation|XGE]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Outlands Envoy|SatO]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_modify_memory_phb\",\"name\":\"Modify Memory\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You attempt to reshape another creature's memories. One creature that you can see must make a Wisdom saving throw. If you are fighting the creature, i\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to reshape another creature's memories. One creature that you can see must make a Wisdom saving throw. If you are fighting the creature, it has advantage on the saving throw. On a failed save, the target becomes [[charmed]] by you for the duration. The [[charmed]] target is [[incapacitated]] and unaware of its surroundings, though it can still hear you. If it takes any damage or is targeted by another spell, this spell ends, and none of the target's memories are modified.\\n\\nWhile this charm lasts, you can affect the target's memory of an event that it experienced within the last 24 hours and that lasted no more than 10 minutes. You can permanently eliminate all memory of the event, allow the target to recall the event with perfect clarity and exacting detail, change its memory of the details of the event, or create a memory of some other event.\\n\\nYou must speak to the target to describe how its memories are affected, and it must be able to understand your language for the modified memories to take root. Its mind fills in any gaps in the details of your description. If the spell ends before you have finished describing the modified memories, the creature's memory isn't altered. Otherwise, the modified memories take hold when the spell ends.\\n\\nA modified memory doesn't necessarily affect how a creature behaves, particularly if the memory contradicts the creature's natural inclinations, alignment, or beliefs. An illogical modified memory, such as implanting a memory of how much the creature enjoyed dousing itself in acid, is dismissed, perhaps as a bad dream. The DM might deem a modified memory too nonsensical to affect a creature in a significant manner.\\n\\nA [[remove curse]] or [[greater restoration]] spell cast on the target restores the creature's true memory.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** If you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, you can alter the target's memories of an event that took place up to 7 days ago (6th level), 30 days ago (7th level), 1 year ago (8th level), or any time in the creature's past (9th level).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_moonbeam_phb\",\"name\":\"Moonbeam\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A silvery beam of pale light shines down in a 5-foot-radius, 40-foot-high cylinder centered on a point within range. Until the spell ends, dim light f\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (several seeds of any moonseed plant and a piece of opalescent feldspar)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA silvery beam of pale light shines down in a 5-foot-radius, 40-foot-high cylinder centered on a point within range. Until the spell ends, dim light fills the cylinder.\\n\\nWhen a creature enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it is engulfed in ghostly flames that cause searing pain, and it must make a Constitution saving throw. It takes 2d10 radiant damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nA shapechanger makes its saving throw with disadvantage. If it fails, it also instantly reverts to its original form and can't assume a different form until it leaves the spell's light.\\n\\nOn each of your turns after you cast this spell, you can use an action to move the beam up to 60 feet in any direction.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (several seeds of any moonseed plant and a piece of opalescent feldspar)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mordenkainen_s_faithful_hound_phb\",\"name\":\"Mordenkainen's Faithful Hound\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — You conjure a phantom watchdog in an unoccupied space that you can see within range, where it remains for the duration, until you dismiss it as an act\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny silver whistle, a piece of bone, and a thread)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou conjure a phantom watchdog in an unoccupied space that you can see within range, where it remains for the duration, until you dismiss it as an action, or until you move more than 100 feet away from it.\\n\\nThe hound is [[invisible]] to all creatures except you and can't be harmed. When a Small or larger creature comes within 30 feet of it without first speaking the password that you specify when you cast this spell, the hound starts barking loudly. The hound sees [[invisible]] creatures and can see into the Ethereal Plane. It ignores illusions.\\n\\nAt the start of each of your turns, the hound attempts to bite one creature within 5 feet of it that is hostile to you. The hound's attack bonus is equal to your spellcasting ability modifier + your proficiency bonus. On a hit, it deals 4d8 piercing damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny silver whistle, a piece of bone, and a thread)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mordenkainen_s_magnificent_mansion_phb\",\"name\":\"Mordenkainen's Magnificent Mansion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • 1 minute • 300 feet — You conjure an extradimensional dwelling in range that lasts for the duration. You choose where its one entrance is located. The entrance shimmers fai\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature portal carved from ivory, a small piece of polished marble, and a tiny silver spoon, each item worth at least 5 gp)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou conjure an extradimensional dwelling in range that lasts for the duration. You choose where its one entrance is located. The entrance shimmers faintly and is 5 feet wide and 10 feet tall. You and any creature you designate when you cast the spell can enter the extradimensional dwelling as long as the portal remains open. You can open or close the portal if you are within 30 feet of it. While closed, the portal is invisible.\\n\\nBeyond the portal is a magnificent foyer with numerous chambers beyond. The atmosphere is clean, fresh, and warm.\\n\\nYou can create any floor plan you like, but the space can't exceed 50 cubes, each cube being 10 feet on each side. The place is furnished and decorated as you choose. It contains sufficient food to serve a nine course banquet for up to 100 people. A staff of 100 near-transparent servants attends all who enter. You decide the visual appearance of these servants and their attire. They are completely obedient to your orders. Each servant can perform any task a normal human servant could perform, but they can't attack or take any action that would directly harm another creature. Thus the servants can fetch things, clean, mend, fold clothes, light fires, serve food, pour wine, and so on. The servants can go anywhere in the mansion but can't leave it. Furnishings and other objects created by this spell dissipate into smoke if removed from the mansion. When the spell ends, any creatures or objects left inside the extradimensional space are expelled into the open spaces nearest to the entrance.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature portal carved from ivory, a small piece of polished marble, and a tiny silver spoon, each item worth at least 5 gp)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mordenkainen_s_private_sanctum_phb\",\"name\":\"Mordenkainen's Private Sanctum\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • 10 minutes • 120 feet — You make an area within range magically secure. The area is a cube that can be as small as 5 feet to as large as 100 feet on each side. The spell last\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a thin sheet of lead, a piece of opaque glass, a wad of cotton or cloth, and powdered chrysolite)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou make an area within range magically secure. The area is a cube that can be as small as 5 feet to as large as 100 feet on each side. The spell lasts for the duration or until you use an action to dismiss it.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, you decide what sort of security the spell provides, choosing any or all of the following properties:\\n\\n- Sound can't pass through the barrier at the edge of the warded area.\\n- The barrier of the warded area appears dark and foggy, preventing vision (including [[darkvision]]) through it.\\n- Sensors created by divination spells can't appear inside the protected area or pass through the barrier at its perimeter.\\n- Creatures in the area can't be targeted by divination spells.\\n- Nothing can teleport into or out of the warded area.\\n- Planar travel is blocked within the warded area.\\n\\nCasting this spell on the same spot every day for a year makes this effect permanent.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, you can increase the size of the cube by 100 feet for each slot level beyond 4th. Thus you could protect a cube that can be up to 200 feet on one side by using a spell slot of 5th level.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a thin sheet of lead, a piece of opaque glass, a wad of cotton or cloth, and powdered chrysolite)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mordenkainen_s_sword_phb\",\"name\":\"Mordenkainen's Sword\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — You create a sword-shaped plane of force that hovers within range. It lasts for the duration. When the sword appears, you make a melee spell attack ag\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature platinum sword with a grip and pommel of copper and zinc, worth 250 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a sword-shaped plane of force that hovers within range. It lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the sword appears, you make a melee spell attack against a target of your choice within 5 feet of the sword. On a hit, the target takes 3d10 force damage. Until the spell ends, you can use a bonus action on each of your turns to move the sword up to 20 feet to a spot you can see and repeat this attack against the same target or a different one.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature platinum sword with a grip and pommel of copper and zinc, worth 250 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_move_earth_phb\",\"name\":\"Move Earth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — Choose an area of terrain no larger than 40 feet on a side within range. You can reshape dirt, sand, or clay in the area in any manner you choose for \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an iron blade and a small bag containing a mixture of soils—clay, loam, and sand)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 2 hours\\nChoose an area of terrain no larger than 40 feet on a side within range. You can reshape dirt, sand, or clay in the area in any manner you choose for the duration. You can raise or lower the area's elevation, create or fill in a trench, erect or flatten a wall, or form a pillar. The extent of any such changes can't exceed half the area's largest dimension. So, if you affect a 40-foot square, you can create a pillar up to 20 feet high, raise or lower the square's elevation by up to 20 feet, dig a trench up to 20 feet deep, and so on. It takes 10 minutes for these changes to complete.\\n\\nAt the end of every 10 minutes you spend [[concentration||concentrating]] on the spell, you can choose a new area of terrain to affect.\\n\\nBecause the terrain's transformation occurs slowly, creatures in the area can't usually be trapped or injured by the ground's movement.\\n\\nThis spell can't manipulate natural stone or stone construction. Rocks and structures shift to accommodate the new terrain. If the way you shape the terrain would make a structure unstable, it might collapse.\\n\\nSimilarly, this spell doesn't directly affect plant growth. The moved earth carries any plants along with it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an iron blade and a small bag containing a mixture of soils—clay, loam, and sand)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 2 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"40-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_nondetection_phb\",\"name\":\"Nondetection\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • Touch — For the duration, you hide a target that you touch from divination magic. The target can be a willing creature or a place or an object no larger than \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of diamond dust worth 25 gp sprinkled over the target, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nFor the duration, you hide a target that you touch from divination magic. The target can be a willing creature or a place or an object no larger than 10 feet in any dimension. The target can't be targeted by any divination magic or perceived through magical scrying sensors.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Deep Gnome|MPMM]], [[Gnome (Deep)|DMG]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Svirfneblin Magic|MTF]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of diamond dust worth 25 gp sprinkled over the target, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_nystul_s_magic_aura_phb\",\"name\":\"Nystul's Magic Aura\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • Touch — You place an illusion on a creature or an object you touch so that divination spells reveal false information about it. The target can be a willing cr\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small square of silk)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou place an illusion on a creature or an object you touch so that divination spells reveal false information about it. The target can be a willing creature or an object that isn't being carried or worn by another creature.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, choose one or both of the following effects. The effect lasts for the duration. If you cast this spell on the same creature or object every day for 30 days, placing the same effect on it each time, the illusion lasts until it is dispelled.\\n\\n***False Aura.*** You change the way the target appears to spells and magical effects, such as [[detect magic]], that detect magical auras. You can make a nonmagical object appear magical, a magical object appear nonmagical, or change the object's magical aura so that it appears to belong to a specific school of magic that you choose. When you use this effect on an object, you can make the false magic apparent to any creature that handles the item.\\n\\n***Mask.*** You change the way the target appears to spells and magical effects that detect creature types, such as a paladin's [[Divine Sense (Paladin)|PHB|Divine Sense]] or the trigger of a [[symbol]] spell. You choose a creature type and other spells and magical effects treat the target as if it were a creature of that type or of that alignment.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small square of silk)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_otiluke_s_freezing_sphere_phb\",\"name\":\"Otiluke's Freezing Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • 300 feet — A frigid globe of cold energy streaks from your fingertips to a point of your choice within range, where it explodes in a 60-foot-radius sphere. Each \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small crystal sphere)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA frigid globe of cold energy streaks from your fingertips to a point of your choice within range, where it explodes in a 60-foot-radius sphere. Each creature within the area must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 10d6 cold damage. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage.\\n\\nIf the globe strikes a body of water or a liquid that is principally water (not including water-based creatures), it freezes the liquid to a depth of 6 inches over an area 30 feet square. This ice lasts for 1 minute. Creatures that were swimming on the surface of frozen water are trapped in the ice. A trapped creature can use an action to make a Strength check against your spell save DC to break free.\\n\\nYou can refrain from firing the globe after completing the spell, if you wish. A small globe about the size of a sling stone, cool to the touch, appears in your hand. At any time, you or a creature you give the globe to can throw the globe (to a range of 40 feet) or hurl it with a sling (to the sling's normal range). It shatters on impact, with the same effect as the normal casting of the spell. You can also set the globe down without shattering it. After 1 minute, if the globe hasn't already shattered, it explodes.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small crystal sphere)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_otiluke_s_resilient_sphere_phb\",\"name\":\"Otiluke's Resilient Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 30 feet — A sphere of shimmering force encloses a creature or object of Large size or smaller within range. An unwilling creature must make a Dexterity saving t\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a hemispherical piece of clear crystal and a matching hemispherical piece of gum arabic)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA sphere of shimmering force encloses a creature or object of Large size or smaller within range. An unwilling creature must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the creature is enclosed for the duration.\\n\\nNothing—not physical objects, energy, or other spell effects—can pass through the barrier, in or out, though a creature in the sphere can breathe there. The sphere is immune to all damage, and a creature or object inside can't be damaged by attacks or effects originating from outside, nor can a creature inside the sphere damage anything outside it.\\n\\nThe sphere is weightless and just large enough to contain the creature or object inside. An enclosed creature can use its action to push against the sphere's walls and thus roll the sphere at up to half the creature's speed. Similarly, the globe can be picked up and moved by other creatures.\\n\\nA [[disintegrate]] spell targeting the globe destroys it without harming anything inside it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a hemispherical piece of clear crystal and a matching hemispherical piece of gum arabic)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_otto_s_irresistible_dance_phb\",\"name\":\"Otto's Irresistible Dance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — Choose one creature that you can see within range. The target begins a comic dance in place: shuffling, tapping its feet, and capering for the duratio\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose one creature that you can see within range. The target begins a comic dance in place: shuffling, tapping its feet, and capering for the duration. Creatures that can't be [[charmed]] are immune to this spell.\\n\\nA dancing creature must use all its movement to dance without leaving its space and has disadvantage on Dexterity saving throws and attack rolls. While the target is affected by this spell, other creatures have advantage on attack rolls against it. As an action, a dancing creature makes a Wisdom saving throw to regain control of itself. On a successful save, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_pass_without_trace_phb\",\"name\":\"Pass without Trace\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • Self — A veil of shadows and silence radiates from you, masking you and your companions from detection. For the duration, each creature you choose within 30 \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (ashes from a burned leaf of mistletoe and a sprig of spruce)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nA veil of shadows and silence radiates from you, masking you and your companions from detection. For the duration, each creature you choose within 30 feet of you (including you) has a +10 bonus to Dexterity ([[Stealth]]) checks and can't be tracked except by magical means. A creature that receives this bonus leaves behind no tracks or other traces of its passage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]], [[Genasi (Earth)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Earth)|MPMM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (ashes from a burned leaf of mistletoe and a sprig of spruce)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_passwall_phb\",\"name\":\"Passwall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — A passage appears at a point of your choice that you can see on a wooden, plaster, or stone surface (such as a wall, a ceiling, or a floor) within ran\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of sesame seeds)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nA passage appears at a point of your choice that you can see on a wooden, plaster, or stone surface (such as a wall, a ceiling, or a floor) within range, and lasts for the duration. You choose the opening's dimensions: up to 5 feet wide, 8 feet tall, and 20 feet deep. The passage creates no instability in a structure surrounding it.\\n\\nWhen the opening disappears, any creatures or objects still in the passage created by the spell are safely ejected to an unoccupied space nearest to the surface on which you cast the spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of sesame seeds)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_phantasmal_force_phb\",\"name\":\"Phantasmal Force\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • 60 feet — You craft an illusion that takes root in the mind of a creature that you can see within range. The target must make an Intelligence saving throw. On a\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou craft an illusion that takes root in the mind of a creature that you can see within range. The target must make an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, you create a phantasmal object, creature, or other visible phenomenon of your choice that is no larger than a 10-foot cube and that is perceivable only to the target for the duration. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n\\nThe phantasm includes sound, temperature, and other stimuli, also evident only to the creature.\\n\\nThe target can use its action to examine the phantasm with an Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC. If the check succeeds, the target realizes that the phantasm is an illusion, and the spell ends.\\n\\nWhile a target is affected by the spell, the target treats the phantasm as if it were real. The target rationalizes any illogical outcomes from interacting with the phantasm. For example, a target attempting to walk across a phantasmal bridge that spans a chasm falls once it steps onto the bridge. If the target survives the fall, it still believes that the bridge exists and comes up with some other explanation for its fall—it was pushed, it slipped, or a strong wind might have knocked it off.\\n\\nAn affected target is so convinced of the phantasm's reality that it can even take damage from the illusion. A phantasm created to appear as a creature can attack the target. Similarly, a phantasm created to appear as fire, a pool of acid, or lava can burn the target. Each round on your turn, the phantasm can deal 1d6 psychic damage to the target if it is in the phantasm's area or within 5 feet of the phantasm, provided that the illusion is of a creature or hazard that could logically deal damage, such as by attacking. The target perceives the damage as a type appropriate to the illusion.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_phantasmal_killer_phb\",\"name\":\"Phantasmal Killer\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You tap into the nightmares of a creature you can see within range and create an illusory manifestation of its deepest fears, visible only to that cre\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou tap into the nightmares of a creature you can see within range and create an illusory manifestation of its deepest fears, visible only to that creature. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the target becomes [[frightened]] for the duration. At the end of each of the target's turns before the spell ends, the target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or take 4d10 psychic damage. On a successful save, the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Bard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_phantom_steed_phb\",\"name\":\"Phantom Steed\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Illusion • 1 minute or Ritual • 30 feet — A Large quasi-real, horselike creature appears on the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice within range. You decide the creature's appearance,\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nA Large quasi-real, horselike creature appears on the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice within range. You decide the creature's appearance, but it is equipped with a saddle, bit, and bridle. Any of the equipment created by the spell vanishes in a puff of smoke if it is carried more than 10 feet away from the steed.\\n\\nFor the duration, you or a creature you choose can ride the steed. The creature uses the statistics for a [[riding horse]], except it has a speed of 100 feet and can travel 10 miles in an hour, or 13 miles at a fast pace. When the spell ends, the steed gradually fades, giving the rider 1 minute to dismount. The spell ends if you use an action to dismiss it or if the steed takes any damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_planar_ally_phb\",\"name\":\"Planar Ally\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • 10 minutes • 60 feet — You beseech an otherworldly entity for aid. The being must be known to you: a god, a primordial, a demon prince, or some other being of cosmic power. \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou beseech an otherworldly entity for aid. The being must be known to you: a god, a primordial, a demon prince, or some other being of cosmic power. That entity sends a celestial, an elemental, or a fiend loyal to it to aid you, making the creature appear in an unoccupied space within range. If you know a specific creature's name, you can speak that name when you cast this spell to request that creature, though you might get a different creature anyway (DM's choice).\\n\\nWhen the creature appears, it is under no compulsion to behave in any particular way. You can ask the creature to perform a service in exchange for payment, but it isn't obliged to do so. The requested task could range from simple (fly us across the chasm, or help us fight a battle) to complex (spy on our enemies, or protect us during our foray into the dungeon). You must be able to communicate with the creature to bargain for its services.\\n\\nPayment can take a variety of forms. A celestial might require a sizable donation of gold or magic items to an allied temple, while a fiend might demand a living sacrifice or a gift of treasure. Some creatures might exchange their service for a quest undertaken by you.\\n\\nAs a rule of thumb, a task that can be measured in minutes requires a payment worth 100 gp per minute. A task measured in hours requires 1,000 gp per hour. And a task measured in days (up to 10 days) requires 10,000 gp per day. The DM can adjust these payments based on the circumstances under which you cast the spell. If the task is aligned with the creature's ethos, the payment might be halved or even waived. Nonhazardous tasks typically require only half the suggested payment, while especially dangerous tasks might require a greater gift. Creatures rarely accept tasks that seem suicidal.\\n\\nAfter the creature completes the task, or when the agreed-upon duration of service expires, the creature returns to its home plane after reporting back to you, if appropriate to the task and if possible. If you are unable to agree on a price for the creature's service, the creature immediately returns to its home plane.\\n\\nA creature enlisted to join your group counts as a member of it, receiving a full share of experience points awarded.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_planar_binding_phb\",\"name\":\"Planar Binding\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • 1 hour • 60 feet — With this spell, you attempt to bind a celestial, an elemental, a fey, or a fiend to your service. The creature must be within range for the entire ca\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a jewel worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nWith this spell, you attempt to bind a celestial, an elemental, a fey, or a fiend to your service. The creature must be within range for the entire casting of the spell. (Typically, the creature is first summoned into the center of an inverted [[magic circle]] in order to keep it trapped while this spell is cast.) At the completion of the casting, the target must make a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, it is bound to serve you for the duration. If the creature was summoned or created by another spell, that spell's duration is extended to match the duration of this spell.\\n\\nA bound creature must follow your instructions to the best of its ability. You might command the creature to accompany you on an adventure, to guard a location, or to deliver a message. The creature obeys the letter of your instructions, but if the creature is hostile to you, it strives to twist your words to achieve its own objectives. If the creature carries out your instructions completely before the spell ends, it travels to you to report this fact if you are on the same plane of existence. If you are on a different plane of existence, it returns to the place where you bound it and remains there until the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of a higher level, the duration increases to 10 days with a 6th-level slot, to 30 days with a 7th-level slot, to 180 days with an 8th-level slot, and to a year and a day with a 9th-level spell slot.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a jewel worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_plane_shift_phb\",\"name\":\"Plane Shift\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • Action • Touch — You and up to eight willing creatures who link hands in a circle are transported to a different plane of existence. You can specify a target destinati\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a forked, metal rod worth at least 250 gp, attuned to a particular plane of existence)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou and up to eight willing creatures who link hands in a circle are transported to a different plane of existence. You can specify a target destination in general terms, such as the City of Brass on the Elemental Plane of Fire or the palace of Dispater on the second level of the Nine Hells, and you appear in or near that destination. If you are trying to reach the City of Brass, for example, you might arrive in its Street of Steel, before its Gate of Ashes, or looking at the city from across the Sea of Fire, at the DM's discretion.\\n\\nAlternatively, if you know the sigil sequence of a teleportation circle on another plane of existence, this spell can take you to that circle. If the teleportation circle is too small to hold all the creatures you transported, they appear in the closest unoccupied spaces next to the circle.\\n\\nYou can use this spell to banish an unwilling creature to another plane. Choose a creature within your reach and make a melee spell attack against it. On a hit, the creature must make a Charisma saving throw. If the creature fails this save, it is transported to a random location on the plane of existence you specify. A creature so transported must find its own way back to your current plane of existence.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a forked, metal rod worth at least 250 gp, attuned to a particular plane of existence)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_plant_growth_phb\",\"name\":\"Plant Growth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action or 8 hours • 150 feet — This spell channels vitality into plants within a specific area. There are two possible uses for the spell, granting either immediate or long-term ben\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or 8 hours\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThis spell channels vitality into plants within a specific area. There are two possible uses for the spell, granting either immediate or long-term benefits.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell using 1 action, choose a point within range. All normal plants in a 100-foot radius centered on that point become thick and overgrown. A creature moving through the area must spend 4 feet of movement for every 1 foot it moves.\\n\\nYou can exclude one or more areas of any size within the spell's area from being affected.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell over 8 hours, you enrich the land. All plants in a half-mile radius centered on a point within range become enriched for 1 year. The plants yield twice the normal amount of food when harvested.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or 8 hours\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_poison_spray_phb\",\"name\":\"Poison Spray\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Conjuration Cantrip • Action • 10 feet — You extend your hand toward a creature you can see within range and project a puff of noxious gas from your palm. The creature must succeed on a Const\",\"content\":\"*Conjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou extend your hand toward a creature you can see within range and project a puff of noxious gas from your palm. The creature must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 1d12 poison damage.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d12 when you reach 5th level (2d12), 11th level (3d12), and 17th level (4d12).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Yuan-Ti|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Yuan-ti Pureblood|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d12\",\"damageType\":\"Poison\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Poison Damage\",\"Poison\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_polymorph_phb\",\"name\":\"Polymorph\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — This spell transforms a creature that you can see within range into a new form. An unwilling creature must make a Wisdom saving throw to avoid the eff\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a caterpillar cocoon)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nThis spell transforms a creature that you can see within range into a new form. An unwilling creature must make a Wisdom saving throw to avoid the effect. The spell has no effect on a shapechanger or a creature with 0 hit points.\\n\\nThe transformation lasts for the duration, or until the target drops to 0 hit points or dies. The new form can be any beast whose challenge rating is equal to or less than the target's (or the target's level, if it doesn't have a challenge rating). The target's game statistics, including mental ability scores, are replaced by the statistics of the chosen beast. It retains its alignment and personality.\\n\\nThe target assumes the hit points of its new form. When it reverts to its normal form, the creature returns to the number of hit points it had before it transformed. If it reverts as a result of dropping to 0 hit points, any excess damage carries over to its normal form. As long as the excess damage doesn't reduce the creature's normal form to 0 hit points, it isn't knocked unconscious.\\n\\nThe creature is limited in the actions it can perform by the nature of its new form, and it can't speak, cast spells, or take any other action that requires hands or speech.\\n\\nThe target's gear melds into the new form. The creature can't activate, use, wield, or otherwise benefit from any of its equipment.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Sculptor of Flesh|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a caterpillar cocoon)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_power_word_heal_phb\",\"name\":\"Power Word Heal\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Evocation • Action • Touch — A wave of healing energy washes over the creature you touch. The target regains all its hit points. If the creature is charmed, frightened, paralyzed,\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA wave of healing energy washes over the creature you touch. The target regains all its hit points. If the creature is [[charmed]], [[frightened]], [[paralyzed]], or [[stunned]], the condition ends. If the creature is [[prone]], it can use its reaction to stand up. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_power_word_kill_phb\",\"name\":\"Power Word Kill\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You utter a word of power that can compel one creature you can see within range to die instantly. If the creature you choose has 100 hit points or few\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou utter a word of power that can compel one creature you can see within range to die instantly. If the creature you choose has 100 hit points or fewer, it dies. Otherwise, the spell has no effect.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_power_word_stun_phb\",\"name\":\"Power Word Stun\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You speak a word of power that can overwhelm the mind of one creature you can see within range, leaving it dumbfounded. If the target has 150 hit poin\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou speak a word of power that can overwhelm the mind of one creature you can see within range, leaving it dumbfounded. If the target has 150 hit points or fewer, it is [[stunned]]. Otherwise, the spell has no effect.\\n\\nThe [[stunned]] target must make a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a successful save, this stunning effect ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_prayer_of_healing_phb\",\"name\":\"Prayer of Healing\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • 10 minutes • 30 feet — Up to six creatures of your choice that you can see within range each regain hit points equal to 2d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nUp to six creatures of your choice that you can see within range each regain hit points equal to 2d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the healing increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"healing\":\"2d8\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_prestidigitation_phb\",\"name\":\"Prestidigitation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 10 feet — This spell is a minor magical trick that novice spellcasters use for practice. You create one of the following magical effects within range: - You cre\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Up to 1 hour\\nThis spell is a minor magical trick that novice spellcasters use for practice. You create one of the following magical effects within range:\\n\\n- You create an instantaneous, harmless sensory effect, such as a shower of sparks, a puff of wind, faint musical notes, or an odd odor.\\n- You instantaneously light or snuff out a candle, a torch, or a small campfire.\\n- You instantaneously clean or soil an object no larger than 1 cubic foot.\\n- You chill, warm, or flavor up to 1 cubic foot of nonliving material for 1 hour.\\n- You make a color, a small mark, or a symbol appear on an object or a surface for 1 hour.\\n- You create a nonmagical trinket or an illusory image that can fit in your hand and that lasts until the end of your next turn.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell multiple times, you can have up to three of its non-instantaneous effects active at a time, and you can dismiss such an effect as an action.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Archer|XGE]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cartomancer|BMT]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_prismatic_spray_phb\",\"name\":\"Prismatic Spray\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • Self — Eight multicolored rays of light flash from your hand. Each ray is a different color and has a different power and purpose. Each creature in a 60-foot\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nEight multicolored rays of light flash from your hand. Each ray is a different color and has a different power and purpose. Each creature in a 60-foot cone must make a Dexterity saving throw. For each target, roll a d8 to determine which color ray affects it.\\n\\n***1-Red.*** The target takes 10d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***2-Orange.*** The target takes 10d6 acid damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***3-Yellow.*** The target takes 10d6 lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***4-Green.*** The target takes 10d6 poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***5-Blue.*** The target takes 10d6 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***6-Indigo.*** On a failed save, the target is [[restrained]]. It must then make a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves three times, the spell ends. If it fails its save three times, it permanently turns to stone and is subjected to the [[petrified]] condition. The successes and failures don't need to be consecutive, keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind.\\n\\n***7-Violet.*** On a failed save, the target is [[blinded]]. It must then make a Wisdom saving throw at the start of your next turn. A successful save ends the blindness. If it fails that save, the creature is transported to another plane of existence of the DM's choosing and is no longer [[blinded]]. (Typically, a creature that is on a plane that isn't its home plane is banished home, while other creatures are usually cast into the Astral or Ethereal planes.)\\n\\n***8-Special.*** The target is struck by two rays. Roll twice more, rerolling any 8.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_prismatic_wall_phb\",\"name\":\"Prismatic Wall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Abjuration • Action • 60 feet — A shimmering, multicolored plane of light forms a vertical opaque wall—up to 90 feet long, 30 feet high, and 1 inch thick—centered on a point you can \",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nA shimmering, multicolored plane of light forms a vertical opaque wall—up to 90 feet long, 30 feet high, and 1 inch thick—centered on a point you can see within range. Alternatively, you can shape the wall into a sphere up to 30 feet in diameter centered on a point you choose within range. The wall remains in place for the duration. If you position the wall so that it passes through a space occupied by a creature, the spell fails, and your action and the spell slot are wasted.\\n\\nThe wall sheds bright light out to a range of 100 feet and dim light for an additional 100 feet. You and creatures you designate at the time you cast the spell can pass through and remain near the wall without harm. If another creature that can see the wall moves to within 20 feet of it or starts its turn there, the creature must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or become [[blinded]] for 1 minute.\\n\\nThe wall consists of seven layers, each with a different color. When a creature attempts to reach into or pass through the wall, it does so one layer at a time through all the wall's layers. As it passes or reaches through each layer, the creature must make a Dexterity saving throw or be affected by that layer's properties as described below.\\n\\nThe wall can be destroyed, also one layer at a time, in order from red to violet, by means specific to each layer. Once a layer is destroyed, it remains so for the duration of the spell. [[Antimagic field]] has no effect on the wall, and [[dispel magic]] can affect only the violet layer.\\n\\n***Red.*** The creature takes 10d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. While this layer is in place, nonmagical ranged attacks can't pass through the wall. The layer can be destroyed by dealing at least 25 cold damage to it.\\n\\n***Orange.*** The creature takes 10d6 acid damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. While this layer is in place, magical ranged attacks can't pass through the wall. The layer is destroyed by a strong wind.\\n\\n***Yellow.*** The creature takes 10d6 lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. This layer can be destroyed by dealing at least 60 force damage to it.\\n\\n***Green.*** The creature takes 10d6 poison damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A [[passwall]] spell, or another spell of equal or greater level that can open a portal on a solid surface, destroys this layer.\\n\\n***Blue.*** The creature takes 10d6 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. This layer can be destroyed by dealing at least 25 fire damage to it.\\n\\n***Indigo.*** On a failed save, the creature is [[restrained]]. It must then make a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves three times, the spell ends. If it fails its save three times, it permanently turns to stone and is subjected to the [[petrified]] condition. The successes and failures don't need to be consecutive; keep track of both until the creature collects three of a kind.\\n\\nWhile this layer is in place, spells can't be cast through the wall. The layer is destroyed by bright light shed by a [[daylight]] spell or a similar spell of equal or higher level.\\n\\n***Violet.*** On a failed save, the creature is [[blinded]]. It must then make a Wisdom saving throw at the start of your next turn. A successful save ends the blindness. If it fails that save, the creature is transported to another plane of the DM's choosing and is no longer [[blinded]]. (Typically, a creature that is on a plane that isn't its home plane is banished home, while other creatures are usually cast into the Astral or Ethereal planes.) This layer is destroyed by a [[dispel magic]] spell or a similar spell of equal or higher level that can end spells and magical effects.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Bard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_produce_flame_phb\",\"name\":\"Produce Flame\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Conjuration Cantrip • Action • Self — A flickering flame appears in your hand. The flame remains there for the duration and harms neither you nor your equipment. The flame sheds bright lig\",\"content\":\"*Conjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nA flickering flame appears in your hand. The flame remains there for the duration and harms neither you nor your equipment. The flame sheds bright light in a 10-foot radius and dim light for an additional 10 feet. The spell ends if you dismiss it as an action or if you cast it again.\\n\\nYou can also attack with the flame, although doing so ends the spell. When you cast this spell, or as an action on a later turn, you can hurl the flame at a creature within 30 feet of you. Make a ranged spell attack. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 fire damage.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Genasi (Fire)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Fire)|MPMM]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]], [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_programmed_illusion_phb\",\"name\":\"Programmed Illusion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You create an illusion of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon within range that activates when a specific condition occurs. The il\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fleece and jade dust worth at least 25 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou create an illusion of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon within range that activates when a specific condition occurs. The illusion is imperceptible until then. It must be no larger than a 30-foot cube, and you decide when you cast the spell how the illusion behaves and what sounds it makes. This scripted performance can last up to 5 minutes.\\n\\nWhen the condition you specify occurs, the illusion springs into existence and performs in the manner you described. Once the illusion finishes performing, it disappears and remains dormant for 10 minutes. After this time, the illusion can be activated again.\\n\\nThe triggering condition can be as general or as detailed as you like, though it must be based on visual or audible conditions that occur within 30 feet of the area. For example, you could create an illusion of yourself to appear and warn off others who attempt to open a trapped door, or you could set the illusion to trigger only when a creature says the correct word or phrase.\\n\\nPhysical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, because things can pass through it. A creature that uses its action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image, and any noise it makes sounds hollow to the creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fleece and jade dust worth at least 25 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_project_image_phb\",\"name\":\"Project Image\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Illusion • Action • 500 miles — You create an illusory copy of yourself that lasts for the duration. The copy can appear at any location within range that you have seen before, regar\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 500 miles\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small replica of you made from materials worth at least 5 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 day\\nYou create an illusory copy of yourself that lasts for the duration. The copy can appear at any location within range that you have seen before, regardless of intervening obstacles. The illusion looks and sounds like you but is intangible. If the illusion takes any damage, it disappears, and the spell ends.\\n\\nYou can use your action to move this illusion up to twice your speed, and make it gesture, speak, and behave in whatever way you choose. It mimics your mannerisms perfectly.\\n\\nYou can see through its eyes and hear through its ears as if you were in its space. On your turn as a bonus action, you can switch from using its senses to using your own, or back again. While you are using its senses, you are [[blinded]] and [[deafened]] in regard to your own surroundings.\\n\\nPhysical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, because things can pass through it. A creature that uses its action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image, and any noise it makes sounds hollow to the creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"500 miles\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small replica of you made from materials worth at least 5 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 day\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_protection_from_energy_phb\",\"name\":\"Protection from Energy\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • Touch — For the duration, the willing creature you touch has resistance to one damage type of your choice: acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder.\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nFor the duration, the willing creature you touch has resistance to one damage type of your choice: acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_protection_from_evil_and_good_phb\",\"name\":\"Protection from Evil and Good\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Action • Touch — Until the spell ends, one willing creature you touch is protected against certain types of creatures: aberrations, celestials, elementals, fey, fiends\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (holy water or powdered silver and iron, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nUntil the spell ends, one willing creature you touch is protected against certain types of creatures: aberrations, celestials, elementals, fey, fiends, and undead.\\n\\nThe protection grants several benefits. Creatures of those types have disadvantage on attack rolls against the target. The target also can't be [[charmed]], [[frightened]], or possessed by them. If the target is already [[charmed]], [[frightened]], or possessed by such a creature, the target has advantage on any new saving throw against the relevant effect.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (holy water or powdered silver and iron, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_protection_from_poison_phb\",\"name\":\"Protection from Poison\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a creature. If it is poisoned, you neutralize the poison. If more than one poison afflicts the target, you neutralize one poison that you kn\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a creature. If it is [[poisoned]], you neutralize the poison. If more than one poison afflicts the target, you neutralize one poison that you know is present, or you neutralize one at random.\\n\\nFor the duration, the target has advantage on saving throws against being [[poisoned]], and it has resistance to poison damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_purify_food_and_drink_phb\",\"name\":\"Purify Food and Drink\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action or Ritual • 10 feet — All nonmagical food and drink within a 5-foot-radius sphere centered on a point of your choice within range is purified and rendered free of poison an\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nAll nonmagical food and drink within a 5-foot-radius sphere centered on a point of your choice within range is purified and rendered free of poison and disease.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_raise_dead_phb\",\"name\":\"Raise Dead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • 1 hour • Touch — You return a dead creature you touch to life, provided that it has been dead no longer than 10 days. If the creature's soul is both willing and at lib\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 500 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou return a dead creature you touch to life, provided that it has been dead no longer than 10 days. If the creature's soul is both willing and at liberty to rejoin the body, the creature returns to life with 1 hit point.\\n\\nThis spell also neutralizes any poisons and cures nonmagical diseases that affected the creature at the time it died. This spell doesn't, however, remove magical diseases, curses, or similar effects; if these aren't first removed prior to casting the spell, they take effect when the creature returns to life. The spell can't return an undead creature to life.\\n\\nThis spell closes all mortal wounds, but it doesn't restore missing body parts. If the creature is lacking body parts or organs integral for its survival—its head, for instance—the spell automatically fails.\\n\\nComing back from the dead is an ordeal. The target takes a −4 penalty to all attack rolls, saving throws, and ability checks. Every time the target finishes a long rest, the penalty is reduced by 1 until it disappears.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 500 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_rary_s_telepathic_bond_phb\",\"name\":\"Rary's Telepathic Bond\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — You forge a telepathic link among up to eight willing creatures of your choice within range, psychically linking each creature to all the others for t\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (pieces of eggshell from two different kinds of creatures)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou forge a telepathic link among up to eight willing creatures of your choice within range, psychically linking each creature to all the others for the duration. Creatures with Intelligence scores of 2 or less aren't affected by this spell.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, the targets can communicate telepathically through the bond whether or not they have a common language. The communication is possible over any distance, though it can't extend to other planes of existence.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (pieces of eggshell from two different kinds of creatures)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Wizard\",\"Bard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ray_of_enfeeblement_phb\",\"name\":\"Ray of Enfeeblement\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — A black beam of enervating energy springs from your finger toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, th\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA black beam of enervating energy springs from your finger toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target deals only half damage with weapon attacks that use Strength until the spell ends.\\n\\nAt the end of each of the target's turns, it can make a Constitution saving throw against the spell. On a success, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ray_of_frost_phb\",\"name\":\"Ray of Frost\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — A frigid beam of blue-white light streaks toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 1d8 cold d\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA frigid beam of blue-white light streaks toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 1d8 cold damage, and its speed is reduced by 10 feet until the start of your next turn.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Tiefling (Levistus)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ray_of_sickness_phb\",\"name\":\"Ray of Sickness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — A ray of sickening greenish energy lashes out toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target take\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA ray of sickening greenish energy lashes out toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 2d8 poison damage and must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it is also [[poisoned]] until the end of your next turn.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Baalzebul)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Poison\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Poison Damage\",\"Poison\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_regenerate_phb\",\"name\":\"Regenerate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • 1 minute • Touch — You touch a creature and stimulate its natural healing ability. The target regains 4d8 + 15 hit points. For the duration of the spell, the target rega\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a prayer wheel and holy water)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a creature and stimulate its natural healing ability. The target regains 4d8 + 15 hit points. For the duration of the spell, the target regains 1 hit point at the start of each of its turns (10 hit points each minute).\\n\\nThe target's severed body members (fingers, legs, tails, and so on), if any, are restored after 2 minutes. If you have the severed part and hold it to the stump, the spell instantaneously causes the limb to knit to the stump.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a prayer wheel and holy water)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"healing\":\"4d8 + 15\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_reincarnate_phb\",\"name\":\"Reincarnate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • 1 hour • Touch — You touch a dead humanoid or a piece of a dead humanoid. Provided that the creature has been dead no longer than 10 days, the spell forms a new adult \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (rare oils and unguents worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a dead humanoid or a piece of a dead humanoid. Provided that the creature has been dead no longer than 10 days, the spell forms a new adult body for it and then calls the soul to enter that body. If the target's soul isn't free or willing to do so, the spell fails.\\n\\nThe magic fashions a new body for the creature to inhabit, which likely causes the creature's race to change. The DM rolls a d100 and consults the following table to determine what form the creature takes when restored to life, or the DM chooses a form.\\n\\n##### Reincarnate Races\\n|  d100 | Race                                          |\\n|:-----:|-----------------------------------------------|\\n| 01-04 | [[Dragonborn]]                                |\\n| 05-13 | [[dwarf (hill)||Dwarf, hill]]                 |\\n| 14-21 | [[dwarf (mountain)||Dwarf, mountain]]         |\\n| 22-25 | [[elf (drow)||Elf, dark]]                     |\\n| 26-34 | [[elf (high)||Elf, high]]                     |\\n| 35-42 | [[elf (wood)||Elf, wood]]                     |\\n| 43-46 | [[gnome (forest)||Gnome, forest]]             |\\n| 47-52 | [[gnome (rock)||Gnome, rock]]                 |\\n| 53-56 | [[Half-elf]]                                  |\\n| 57-60 | [[Half-orc]]                                  |\\n| 61-68 | [[halfling (lightfoot)||Halfling, lightfoot]] |\\n| 69-76 | [[halfling (stout)||Halfling, stout]]         |\\n| 77-96 | [[Human]]                                     |\\n| 97-00 | [[Tiefling]]                                  |\\n\\nThe reincarnated creature recalls its former life and experiences. It retains the capabilities it had in its original form, except it exchanges its original race for the new one and changes its racial traits accordingly.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (rare oils and unguents worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_remove_curse_phb\",\"name\":\"Remove Curse\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • Touch — At your touch, all curses affecting one creature or object end. If the object is a cursed magic item, its curse remains, but the spell breaks its owne\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nAt your touch, all curses affecting one creature or object end. If the object is a cursed magic item, its curse remains, but the spell breaks its owner's attunement to the object so it can be removed or discarded.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_resistance_phb\",\"name\":\"Resistance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Abjuration Cantrip • Action • Touch — You touch one willing creature. Once before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to one saving throw of its choice. It c\",\"content\":\"*Abjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature cloak)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou touch one willing creature. Once before the spell ends, the target can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to one saving throw of its choice. It can roll the die before or after making the saving throw. The spell then ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature cloak)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_resurrection_phb\",\"name\":\"Resurrection\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Necromancy • 1 hour • Touch — You touch a dead creature that has been dead for no more than a century, that didn't die of old age, and that isn't undead. If its soul is free and wi\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a dead creature that has been dead for no more than a century, that didn't die of old age, and that isn't undead. If its soul is free and willing, the target returns to life with all its hit points.\\n\\nThis spell neutralizes any poisons and cures normal diseases afflicting the creature when it died. It doesn't, however, remove magical diseases, curses, and the like; if such effects aren't removed prior to casting the spell, they afflict the target on its return to life.\\n\\nThis spell closes all mortal wounds and restores any missing body parts.\\n\\nComing back from the dead is an ordeal. The target takes a −4 penalty to all attack rolls, saving throws, and ability checks. Every time the target finishes a long rest, the penalty is reduced by 1 until it disappears.\\n\\nCasting this spell to restore life to a creature that has been dead for one year or longer taxes you greatly. Until you finish a long rest, you can't cast spells again, and you have disadvantage on all attack rolls, ability checks, and saving throws.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_reverse_gravity_phb\",\"name\":\"Reverse Gravity\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • Action • 100 feet — This spell reverses gravity in a 50-foot-radius, 100-foot-high cylinder centered on a point within range. All creatures and objects that aren't someho\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 100 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a lodestone and iron filings)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThis spell reverses gravity in a 50-foot-radius, 100-foot-high cylinder centered on a point within range. All creatures and objects that aren't somehow anchored to the ground in the area fall upward and reach the top of the area when you cast this spell. A creature can make a Dexterity saving throw to grab onto a fixed object it can reach, thus avoiding the fall.\\n\\nIf some solid object (such as a ceiling) is encountered in this fall, falling objects and creatures strike it just as they would during a normal downward fall. If an object or creature reaches the top of the area without striking anything, it remains there, oscillating slightly, for the duration.\\n\\nAt the end of the duration, affected objects and creatures fall back down.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"100 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a lodestone and iron filings)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_revivify_phb\",\"name\":\"Revivify\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • Touch — You touch a creature that has died within the last minute. That creature returns to life with 1 hit point. This spell can't return to life a creature \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (diamonds worth 300 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a creature that has died within the last minute. That creature returns to life with 1 hit point. This spell can't return to life a creature that has died of old age, nor can it restore any missing body parts.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (diamonds worth 300 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_rope_trick_phb\",\"name\":\"Rope Trick\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a length of rope that is up to 60 feet long. One end of the rope then rises into the air until the whole rope hangs perpendicular to the gro\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (powdered corn extract and a twisted loop of parchment)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a length of rope that is up to 60 feet long. One end of the rope then rises into the air until the whole rope hangs perpendicular to the ground. At the upper end of the rope, an invisible entrance opens to an extradimensional space that lasts until the spell ends.\\n\\nThe extradimensional space can be reached by climbing to the top of the rope. The space can hold as many as eight Medium or smaller creatures. The rope can be pulled into the space, making the rope disappear from view outside the space.\\n\\nAttacks and spells can't cross through the entrance into or out of the extradimensional space, but those inside can see out of it as if through a 3-foot-by-5-foot window centered on the rope.\\n\\nAnything inside the extradimensional space drops out when the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (powdered corn extract and a twisted loop of parchment)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sacred_flame_phb\",\"name\":\"Sacred Flame\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — Flame-like radiance descends on a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d8 radiant dama\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nFlame-like radiance descends on a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d8 radiant damage. The target gains no benefit from cover for this saving throw.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Astral Elf|AAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]]\\n**Feats:** [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sanctuary_phb\",\"name\":\"Sanctuary\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Bonus action • 30 feet — You ward a creature within range against attack. Until the spell ends, any creature who targets the warded creature with an attack or a harmful spell \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small silver mirror)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou ward a creature within range against attack. Until the spell ends, any creature who targets the warded creature with an attack or a harmful spell must first make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the creature must choose a new target or lose the attack or spell. This spell doesn't protect the warded creature from area effects, such as the explosion of a [[fireball]].\\n\\nIf the warded creature makes an attack, casts a spell that affects an enemy, or deals damage to another creature, this spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Way of the Open Hand|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small silver mirror)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_scorching_ray_phb\",\"name\":\"Scorching Ray\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You create three rays of fire and hurl them at targets within range. You can hurl them at one target or several. Make a ranged spell attack for each r\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create three rays of fire and hurl them at targets within range. You can hurl them at one target or several.\\n\\nMake a ranged spell attack for each ray. On a hit, the target takes 2d6 fire damage.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you create one additional ray for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_scrying_phb\",\"name\":\"Scrying\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 10 minutes • Self — You can see and hear a particular creature you choose that is on the same plane of existence as you. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw, which\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a focus worth at least 1,000 gp, such as a crystal ball, a silver mirror, or a font filled with holy water)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou can see and hear a particular creature you choose that is on the same plane of existence as you. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw, which is modified by how well you know the target and the sort of physical connection you have to it. If a target knows you're casting this spell, it can fail the saving throw voluntarily if it wants to be observed.\\n\\n##### Knowledge of Target\\n| Knowledge                                 | Save Modifier |\\n|-------------------------------------------|:-------------:|\\n| Secondhand (you have heard of the target) |       +5      |\\n| Firsthand (you have met the target)       |       +0      |\\n| Familiar (you know the target well)       |       -5      |\\n\\n##### Connection to Target\\n| Connection                                        | Save Modifier |\\n|---------------------------------------------------|:-------------:|\\n| Likeness or picture                               |       -2      |\\n| Possession or garment                             |       -4      |\\n| Body part, lock of hair, bit of nail, or the like |      -10      |\\n\\nOn a successful save, the target isn't affected, and you can't use this spell against it again for 24 hours.\\n\\nOn a failed save, the spell creates an invisible sensor within 10 feet of the target. You can see and hear through the sensor as if you were there. The sensor moves with the target, remaining within 10 feet of it for the duration. A creature that can see [[invisible]] objects sees the sensor as a luminous orb about the size of your fist.\\n\\nInstead of targeting a creature, you can choose a location you have seen before as the target of this spell. When you do, the sensor appears at that location and doesn't move.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a focus worth at least 1,000 gp, such as a crystal ball, a silver mirror, or a font filled with holy water)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_searing_smite_phb\",\"name\":\"Searing Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — The next time you hit a creature with a melee weapon attack during the spell's duration, your weapon flares with white-hot intensity, and the attack d\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe next time you hit a creature with a melee weapon attack during the spell's duration, your weapon flares with white-hot intensity, and the attack deals an extra 1d6 fire damage to the target and causes the target to ignite in flames. At the start of each of its turns until the spell ends, the target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 1d6 fire damage. On a successful save, the spell ends. If the target or a creature within 5 feet of it uses an action to put out the flames, or if some other effect douses the flames (such as the target being submerged in water), the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the initial extra damage dealt by the attack increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Zariel)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Ranger\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_see_invisibility_phb\",\"name\":\"See Invisibility\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • Self — For the duration, you see invisible creatures and objects as if they were visible, and you can see into the Ethereal Plane. Ethereal creatures and obj\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of talc and a small sprinkling of powdered silver)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nFor the duration, you see [[invisible]] creatures and objects as if they were visible, and you can see into the Ethereal Plane. Ethereal creatures and objects appear ghostly and translucent.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of talc and a small sprinkling of powdered silver)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_seeming_phb\",\"name\":\"Seeming\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Illusion • Action • 30 feet — This spell allows you to change the appearance of any number of creatures that you can see within range. You give each target you choose a new, illuso\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nThis spell allows you to change the appearance of any number of creatures that you can see within range. You give each target you choose a new, illusory appearance. An unwilling target can make a Charisma saving throw, and if it succeeds, it is unaffected by this spell.\\n\\nThe spell disguises physical appearance as well as clothing, armor, weapons, and equipment. You can make each creature seem 1 foot shorter or taller and appear thin, fat, or in between. You can't change a target's body type, so you must choose a form that has the same basic arrangement of limbs. Otherwise, the extent of the illusion is up to you. The spell lasts for the duration, unless you use your action to dismiss it sooner.\\n\\nThe changes wrought by this spell fail to hold up to physical inspection. For example, if you use this spell to add a hat to a creature's outfit, objects pass through the hat, and anyone who touches it would feel nothing or would feel the creature's head and hair. If you use this spell to appear thinner than you are, the hand of someone who reaches out to touch you would bump into you while it was seemingly still in midair.\\n\\nA creature can use its action to inspect a target and make an Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC. If it succeeds, it becomes aware that the target is disguised.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sending_phb\",\"name\":\"Sending\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Unlimited — You send a short message of twenty-five words or less to a creature with which you are familiar. The creature hears the message in its mind, recognize\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Unlimited\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a short piece of fine copper wire)\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou send a short message of twenty-five words or less to a creature with which you are familiar. The creature hears the message in its mind, recognizes you as the sender if it knows you, and can answer in a like manner immediately. The spell enables creatures with Intelligence scores of at least 1 to understand the meaning of your message.\\n\\nYou can send the message across any distance and even to other planes of existence, but if the target is on a different plane than you, there is a 5 percent chance that the message doesn't arrive.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Far Scribe|TCE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Unlimited\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a short piece of fine copper wire)\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sequester_phb\",\"name\":\"Sequester\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • Action • Touch — By means of this spell, a willing creature or an object can be hidden away, safe from detection for the duration. When you cast the spell and touch th\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a powder composed of diamond, emerald, ruby, and sapphire dust worth at least 5,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nBy means of this spell, a willing creature or an object can be hidden away, safe from detection for the duration. When you cast the spell and touch the target, it becomes [[invisible]] and can't be targeted by divination spells or perceived through scrying sensors created by divination spells.\\n\\nIf the target is a creature, it falls into a state of suspended animation. Time ceases to flow for it, and it doesn't grow older.\\n\\nYou can set a condition for the spell to end early. The condition can be anything you choose, but it must occur or be visible within 1 mile of the target. Examples include \\\"after 1,000 years\\\" or \\\"when the [[tarrasque]] awakens.\\\" This spell also ends if the target takes any damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a powder composed of diamond, emerald, ruby, and sapphire dust worth at least 5,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shapechange_phb\",\"name\":\"Shapechange\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Transmutation • Action • Self — You assume the form of a different creature for the duration. The new form can be of any creature with a challenge rating equal to your level or lower\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a jade circlet worth at least 1,500 gp, which you must place on your head before you cast the spell)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou assume the form of a different creature for the duration. The new form can be of any creature with a challenge rating equal to your level or lower. The creature can't be a construct or an undead, and you must have seen the sort of creature at least once. You transform into an average example of that creature, one without any class levels or the Spellcasting trait.\\n\\nYour game statistics are replaced by the statistics of the chosen creature, though you retain your alignment and Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores. You also retain all of your skill and saving throw proficiencies, in addition to gaining those of the creature. If the creature has the same proficiency as you and the bonus listed in its statistics is higher than yours, use the creature's bonus in place of yours. You can't use any legendary actions or lair actions of the new form.\\n\\nYou assume the hit points and Hit Dice of the new form. When you revert to your normal form, you return to the number of hit points you had before you transformed. If you revert as a result of dropping to 0 hit points, any excess damage carries over to your normal form. As long as the excess damage doesn't reduce your normal form to 0 hit points, you aren't knocked [[unconscious]].\\n\\nYou retain the benefit of any features from your class, race, or other source and can use them, provided that your new form is physically capable of doing so. You can't use any special senses you have (for example, [[darkvision]]) unless your new form also has that sense. You can only speak if the creature can normally speak.\\n\\nWhen you transform, you choose whether your equipment falls to the ground, merges into the new form, or is worn by it. Worn equipment functions as normal. The DM determines whether it is practical for the new form to wear a piece of equipment, based on the creature's shape and size. Your equipment doesn't change shape or size to match the new form, and any equipment that the new form can't wear must either fall to the ground or merge into your new form. Equipment that merges has no effect in that state.\\n\\nDuring this spell's duration, you can use your action to assume a different form following the same restrictions and rules for the original form, with one exception: if your new form has more hit points than your current one, your hit points remain at their current value.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a jade circlet worth at least 1,500 gp, which you must place on your head before you cast the spell)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shatter_phb\",\"name\":\"Shatter\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — A sudden loud ringing noise, painfully intense, erupts from a point of your choice within range. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a chip of mica)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA sudden loud ringing noise, painfully intense, erupts from a point of your choice within range. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a Constitution saving throw. A creature takes 3d8 thunder damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature made of inorganic material such as stone, crystal, or metal has disadvantage on this saving throw.\\n\\nA nonmagical object that isn't being worn or carried also takes the damage if it's in the spell's area.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Gong of the Summit|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a chip of mica)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shield_phb\",\"name\":\"Shield\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Reaction, which you take when you are hit by an attack or targeted by the <a href=\\\"spells.html#magic%20missile_phb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"spells.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"PHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"magic%20missile_phb\\\" data-vet-is-allow-redirect=\\\"true\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >magic missile</a> spell • Self — An invisible barrier of magical force appears and protects you. Until the start of your next turn, you have a +5 bonus to AC, including against the tr\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when you are hit by an attack or targeted by the <a href=\\\"spells.html#magic%20missile_phb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"spells.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"PHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"magic%20missile_phb\\\" data-vet-is-allow-redirect=\\\"true\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >magic missile</a> spell\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nAn invisible barrier of magical force appears and protects you. Until the start of your next turn, you have a +5 bonus to AC, including against the triggering attack, and you take no damage from [[magic missile]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gith (Githzerai)|MTF]], [[Githzerai|MPMM]], [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when you are hit by an attack or targeted by the <a href=\\\"spells.html#magic%20missile_phb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"spells.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"PHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"magic%20missile_phb\\\" data-vet-is-allow-redirect=\\\"true\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >magic missile</a> spell\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Reaction\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shield_of_faith_phb\",\"name\":\"Shield of Faith\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Bonus action • 60 feet — A shimmering field appears and surrounds a creature of your choice within range, granting it a +2 bonus to AC for the duration.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small parchment with a bit of holy text written on it)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA shimmering field appears and surrounds a creature of your choice within range, granting it a +2 bonus to AC for the duration.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small parchment with a bit of holy text written on it)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shillelagh_phb\",\"name\":\"Shillelagh\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Bonus action • Touch — The wood of a club or quarterstaff you are holding is imbued with nature's power. For the duration, you can use your spellcasting ability instead of S\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (mistletoe, a shamrock leaf, and a club or quarterstaff)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nThe wood of a [[club|PHB]] or [[quarterstaff|PHB]] you are holding is imbued with nature's power. For the duration, you can use your spellcasting ability instead of Strength for the attack and damage rolls of melee attacks using that weapon, and the weapon's damage die becomes a d8. The weapon also becomes magical, if it isn't already. The spell ends if you cast it again or if you let go of the weapon.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (mistletoe, a shamrock leaf, and a club or quarterstaff)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shocking_grasp_phb\",\"name\":\"Shocking Grasp\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • Touch — Lightning springs from your hand to deliver a shock to a creature you try to touch. Make a melee spell attack against the target. You have advantage o\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nLightning springs from your hand to deliver a shock to a creature you try to touch. Make a melee spell attack against the target. You have advantage on the attack roll if the target is wearing armor made of metal. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 lightning damage, and it can't take reactions until the start of its next turn.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Genasi (Air)|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_silence_phb\",\"name\":\"Silence\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action or Ritual • 120 feet — For the duration, no sound can be created within or pass through a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range. Any creature or \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, no sound can be created within or pass through a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range. Any creature or object entirely inside the sphere is immune to thunder damage, and creatures are [[deafened]] while entirely inside it. Casting a spell that includes a verbal component is impossible there.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_silent_image_phb\",\"name\":\"Silent Image\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Illusion • Action • 60 feet — You create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 15-foot cube. The image appears at a spot wit\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 15-foot cube. The image appears at a spot within range and lasts for the duration. The image is purely visual; it isn't accompanied by sound, smell, or other sensory effects.\\n\\nYou can use your action to cause the image to move to any spot within range. As the image changes location, you can alter its appearance so that its movements appear natural for the image. For example, if you create an image of a creature and move it, you can alter the image so that it appears to be walking.\\n\\nPhysical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, because things can pass through it. A creature that uses its action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Misty Visions|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_simulacrum_phb\",\"name\":\"Simulacrum\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Illusion • 12 hours • Touch — You shape an illusory duplicate of one beast or humanoid that is within range for the entire casting time of the spell. The duplicate is a creature, p\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 12 hours\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (snow or ice in quantities sufficient to make a life-size copy of the duplicated creature; some hair, fingernail clippings, or other piece of that creature's body placed inside the snow or ice; and powdered ruby worth 1,500 gp, sprinkled over the duplicate and consumed by the spell)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou shape an illusory duplicate of one beast or humanoid that is within range for the entire casting time of the spell. The duplicate is a creature, partially real and formed from ice or snow, and it can take actions and otherwise be affected as a normal creature. It appears to be the same as the original, but it has half the creature's hit point maximum and is formed without any equipment. Otherwise, the illusion uses all the statistics of the creature it duplicates, except that it is a construct.\\n\\nThe simulacrum is friendly to you and creatures you designate. It obeys your spoken commands, moving and acting in accordance with your wishes and acting on your turn in combat. The simulacrum lacks the ability to learn or become more powerful, so it never increases its level or other abilities, nor can it regain expended spell slots.\\n\\nIf the simulacrum is damaged, you can repair it in an alchemical laboratory, using rare herbs and minerals worth 100 gp per hit point it regains. The simulacrum lasts until it drops to 0 hit points, at which point it reverts to snow and melts instantly.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell again, any currently active duplicates you created with this spell are instantly destroyed.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"12 hours\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (snow or ice in quantities sufficient to make a life-size copy of the duplicated creature; some hair, fingernail clippings, or other piece of that creature's body placed inside the snow or ice; and powdered ruby worth 1,500 gp, sprinkled over the duplicate and consumed by the spell)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sleep_phb\",\"name\":\"Sleep\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 90 feet — This spell sends creatures into a magical slumber. Roll 5d8; the total is how many hit points of creatures this spell can affect. Creatures within 20 \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of fine sand, rose petals, or a cricket)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nThis spell sends creatures into a magical slumber. Roll 5d8; the total is how many hit points of creatures this spell can affect. Creatures within 20 feet of a point you choose within range are affected in ascending order of their current hit points (ignoring [[unconscious]] creatures).\\n\\nStarting with the creature that has the lowest current hit points, each creature affected by this spell falls [[unconscious]] until the spell ends, the sleeper takes damage, or someone uses an action to shake or slap the sleeper awake. Subtract each creature's hit points from the total before moving on to the creature with the next lowest hit points. A creature's hit points must be equal to or less than the remaining total for that creature to be affected.\\n\\nUndead and creatures immune to being [[charmed]] aren't affected by this spell.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, roll an additional 2d8 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Pallid)|EGW]], [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of fine sand, rose petals, or a cricket)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sleet_storm_phb\",\"name\":\"Sleet Storm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 150 feet — Until the spell ends, freezing rain and sleet fall in a 20-foot-tall cylinder with a 40-foot radius centered on a point you choose within range. The a\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of dust and a few drops of water)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nUntil the spell ends, freezing rain and sleet fall in a 20-foot-tall cylinder with a 40-foot radius centered on a point you choose within range. The area is heavily obscured, and exposed flames in the area are doused.\\n\\nThe ground in the area is covered with slick ice, making it difficult terrain. When a creature enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, it falls [[prone]].\\n\\nIf a creature starts its turn in the spell's area and is [[concentration||concentrating]] on a spell, the creature must make a successful Constitution saving throw against your spell save DC or lose [[concentration]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of dust and a few drops of water)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_slow_phb\",\"name\":\"Slow\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — You alter time around up to six creatures of your choice in a 40-foot cube within range. Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be affec\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of molasses)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou alter time around up to six creatures of your choice in a 40-foot cube within range. Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be affected by this spell for the duration.\\n\\nAn affected target's speed is halved, it takes a −2 penalty to AC and Dexterity saving throws, and it can't use reactions. On its turn, it can use either an action or a bonus action, not both. Regardless of the creature's abilities or magic items, it can't make more than one melee or ranged attack during its turn.\\n\\nIf the creature attempts to cast a spell with a casting time of 1 action, roll a d20. On an 11 or higher, the spell doesn't take effect until the creature's next turn, and the creature must use its action on that turn to complete the spell. If it can't, the spell is wasted.\\n\\nA creature affected by this spell makes another Wisdom saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a successful save, the effect ends for it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Mire the Mind|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of molasses)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"40-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spare_the_dying_phb\",\"name\":\"Spare the Dying\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Necromancy Cantrip • Action • Touch — You touch a living creature that has 0 hit points. The creature becomes stable. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\",\"content\":\"*Necromancy Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a living creature that has 0 hit points. The creature becomes stable. This spell has no effect on undead or constructs.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Khoravar|EFA]]\\n**Feats:** [[Arcane Undertaker|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_speak_with_animals_phb\",\"name\":\"Speak with Animals\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — You gain the ability to comprehend and verbally communicate with beasts for the duration. The knowledge and awareness of many beasts is limited by the\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou gain the ability to comprehend and verbally communicate with beasts for the duration. The knowledge and awareness of many beasts is limited by their intelligence, but at minimum, beasts can give you information about nearby locations and monsters, including whatever they can perceive or have perceived within the past day. You might be able to persuade a beast to perform a small favor for you, at the DM's discretion.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Totem Warrior|PHB]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Beast Speech|PHB]], [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_speak_with_dead_phb\",\"name\":\"Speak with Dead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • 10 feet — You grant the semblance of life and intelligence to a corpse of your choice within range, allowing it to answer the questions you pose. The corpse mus\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (burning incense)\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou grant the semblance of life and intelligence to a corpse of your choice within range, allowing it to answer the questions you pose. The corpse must still have a mouth and can't be undead. The spell fails if the corpse was the target of this spell within the last 10 days.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can ask the corpse up to five questions. The corpse knows only what it knew in life, including the languages it knew. Answers are usually brief, cryptic, or repetitive, and the corpse is under no compulsion to offer a truthful answer if you are hostile to it or it recognizes you as an enemy. This spell doesn't return the creature's soul to its body, only its animating spirit. Thus, the corpse can't learn new information, doesn't comprehend anything that has happened since it died, and can't speculate about future events.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Whispers of the Grave|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (burning incense)\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_speak_with_plants_phb\",\"name\":\"Speak with Plants\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Self — You imbue plants within 30 feet of you with limited sentience and animation, giving them the ability to communicate with you and follow your simple co\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou imbue plants within 30 feet of you with limited sentience and animation, giving them the ability to communicate with you and follow your simple commands. You can question plants about events in the spell's area within the past day, gaining information about creatures that have passed, weather, and other circumstances.\\n\\nYou can also turn difficult terrain caused by plant growth (such as thickets and undergrowth) into ordinary terrain that lasts for the duration. Or you can turn ordinary terrain where plants are present into difficult terrain that lasts for the duration, causing vines and branches to hinder pursuers, for example.\\n\\nPlants might be able to perform other tasks on your behalf, at the DM's discretion. The spell doesn't enable plants to uproot themselves and move about, but they can freely move branches, tendrils, and stalks.\\n\\nIf a plant creature is in the area, you can communicate with it as if you shared a common language, but you gain no magical ability to influence it.\\n\\nThis spell can cause the plants created by the [[entangle]] spell to release a [[restrained]] creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spider_climb_phb\",\"name\":\"Spider Climb\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — Until the spell ends, one willing creature you touch gains the ability to move up, down, and across vertical surfaces and upside down along ceilings, \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of bitumen and a spider)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nUntil the spell ends, one willing creature you touch gains the ability to move up, down, and across vertical surfaces and upside down along ceilings, while leaving its hands free. The target also gains a climbing speed equal to its walking speed.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of bitumen and a spider)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spike_growth_phb\",\"name\":\"Spike Growth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 150 feet — The ground in a 20-foot radius centered on a point within range twists and sprouts hard spikes and thorns. The area becomes difficult terrain for the \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (seven sharp thorns or seven small twigs, each sharpened to a point)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nThe ground in a 20-foot radius centered on a point within range twists and sprouts hard spikes and thorns. The area becomes difficult terrain for the duration. When a creature moves into or within the area, it takes 2d4 piercing damage for every 5 feet it travels.\\n\\nThe transformation of the ground is camouflaged to look natural. Any creature that can't see the area at the time the spell is cast must make a Wisdom ([[Perception]]) check against your spell save DC to recognize the terrain as hazardous before entering it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Lotusden)|EGW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (seven sharp thorns or seven small twigs, each sharpened to a point)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spirit_guardians_phb\",\"name\":\"Spirit Guardians\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • Self — You call forth spirits to protect you. They flit around you to a distance of 15 feet for the duration. If you are good or neutral, their spectral form\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a holy symbol)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou call forth spirits to protect you. They flit around you to a distance of 15 feet for the duration. If you are good or neutral, their spectral form appears angelic or fey (your choice). If you are evil, they appear fiendish.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can designate any number of creatures you can see to be unaffected by it. An affected creature's speed is halved in the area, and when the creature enters the area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 3d8 radiant damage (if you are good or neutral) or 3d8 necrotic damage (if you are evil). On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a holy symbol)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spiritual_weapon_phb\",\"name\":\"Spiritual Weapon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Bonus action • 60 feet — You create a floating, spectral weapon within range that lasts for the duration or until you cast this spell again. When you cast the spell, you can m\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou create a floating, spectral weapon within range that lasts for the duration or until you cast this spell again. When you cast the spell, you can make a melee spell attack against a creature within 5 feet of the weapon. On a hit, the target takes force damage equal to 1d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\nAs a bonus action on your turn, you can move the weapon up to 20 feet and repeat the attack against a creature within 5 feet of it.\\n\\nThe weapon can take whatever form you choose. Clerics of deities who are associated with a particular weapon (as St. Cuthbert is known for his mace and Thor for his hammer) make this spell's effect resemble that weapon.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for every two slot levels above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_staggering_smite_phb\",\"name\":\"Staggering Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — The next time you hit a creature with a melee weapon attack during this spell's duration, your weapon pierces both body and mind, and the attack deals\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe next time you hit a creature with a melee weapon attack during this spell's duration, your weapon pierces both body and mind, and the attack deals an extra 4d6 psychic damage to the target. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, it has disadvantage on attack rolls and ability checks, and can't take reactions, until the end of its next turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_stinking_cloud_phb\",\"name\":\"Stinking Cloud\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You create a 20-foot-radius sphere of yellow, nauseating gas centered on a point within range. The cloud spreads around corners, and its area is heavi\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a rotten egg or several skunk cabbage leaves)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a 20-foot-radius sphere of yellow, nauseating gas centered on a point within range. The cloud spreads around corners, and its area is heavily obscured. The cloud lingers in the air for the duration.\\n\\nEach creature that is completely within the cloud at the start of its turn must make a Constitution saving throw against poison. On a failed save, the creature spends its action that turn retching and reeling. Creatures that don't need to breathe or are immune to poison automatically succeed on this saving throw.\\n\\nA moderate wind (at least 10 miles per hour) disperses the cloud after 4 rounds. A strong wind (at least 20 miles per hour) disperses it after 1 round.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a rotten egg or several skunk cabbage leaves)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_stone_shape_phb\",\"name\":\"Stone Shape\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a stone object of Medium size or smaller or a section of stone no more than 5 feet in any dimension and form it into any shape that suits yo\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (soft clay, which must be worked into roughly the desired shape of the stone object)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a stone object of Medium size or smaller or a section of stone no more than 5 feet in any dimension and form it into any shape that suits your purpose. So, for example, you could shape a large rock into a weapon, idol, or coffer, or make a small passage through a wall, as long as the wall is less than 5 feet thick. You could also shape a stone door or its frame to seal the door shut. The object you create can have up to two hinges and a latch, but finer mechanical detail isn't possible.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (soft clay, which must be worked into roughly the desired shape of the stone object)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_stoneskin_phb\",\"name\":\"Stoneskin\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • Touch — This spell turns the flesh of a willing creature you touch as hard as stone. Until the spell ends, the target has resistance to nonmagical bludgeoning\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (diamond dust worth 100 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nThis spell turns the flesh of a willing creature you touch as hard as stone. Until the spell ends, the target has resistance to nonmagical bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Eternal Mountain Defense|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (diamond dust worth 100 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_storm_of_vengeance_phb\",\"name\":\"Storm of Vengeance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Conjuration • Action • Sight — A churning storm cloud forms, centered on a point you can see and spreading to a radius of 360 feet. Lightning flashes in the area, thunder booms, and\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Sight\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA churning storm cloud forms, centered on a point you can see and spreading to a radius of 360 feet. Lightning flashes in the area, thunder booms, and strong winds roar. Each creature under the cloud (no more than 5,000 feet beneath the cloud) when it appears must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d6 thunder damage and becomes [[deafened]] for 5 minutes.\\n\\nEach round you maintain [[concentration]] on this spell, the storm produces different effects on your turn.\\n\\n***Round 2.*** Acidic rain falls from the cloud. Each creature and object under the cloud takes 1d6 acid damage.\\n\\n***Round 3.*** You call six bolts of lightning from the cloud to strike six creatures or objects of your choice beneath the cloud. A given creature or object can't be struck by more than one bolt. A struck creature must make a Dexterity saving throw. The creature takes 10d6 lightning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***Round 4.*** Hailstones rain down from the cloud. Each creature under the cloud takes 2d6 bludgeoning damage.\\n\\n***Round 5–10.*** Gusts and freezing rain assail the area under the cloud. The area becomes difficult terrain and is heavily obscured. Each creature there takes 1d6 cold damage. Ranged weapon attacks in the area are impossible. The wind and rain count as a severe distraction for the purposes of maintaining [[concentration]] on spells. Finally, gusts of strong wind (ranging from 20 to 50 miles per hour) automatically disperse fog, mists, and similar phenomena in the area, whether mundane or magical.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Sight\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_suggestion_phb\",\"name\":\"Suggestion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You suggest a course of activity (limited to a sentence or two) and magically influence a creature you can see within range that can hear and understa\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a snake's tongue and either a bit of honeycomb or a drop of sweet oil)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 8 hours\\nYou suggest a course of activity (limited to a sentence or two) and magically influence a creature you can see within range that can hear and understand you. Creatures that can't be [[charmed]] are immune to this effect. The suggestion must be worded in such a manner as to make the course of action sound reasonable. Asking the creature to stab itself, throw itself onto a spear, immolate itself, or do some other obviously harmful act ends the spell.\\n\\nThe target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, it pursues the course of action you described to the best of its ability. The suggested course of action can continue for the entire duration. If the suggested activity can be completed in a shorter time, the spell ends when the subject finishes what it was asked to do.\\n\\nYou can also specify conditions that will trigger a special activity during the duration. For example, you might suggest that a knight give her warhorse to the first beggar she meets. If the condition isn't met before the spell expires, the activity isn't performed.\\n\\nIf you or any of your companions damage the target, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Fierna)|MTF]], [[Yuan-Ti|MPMM]], [[Yuan-ti Pureblood|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a snake's tongue and either a bit of honeycomb or a drop of sweet oil)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sunbeam_phb\",\"name\":\"Sunbeam\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • Self — A beam of brilliant light flashes out from your hand in a 5-foot-wide, 60-foot-long line. Each creature in the line must make a Constitution saving th\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a magnifying glass)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA beam of brilliant light flashes out from your hand in a 5-foot-wide, 60-foot-long line. Each creature in the line must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 6d8 radiant damage and is [[blinded]] until your next turn. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage and isn't [[blinded]] by this spell. Undead and oozes have disadvantage on this saving throw.\\n\\nYou can create a new line of radiance as your action on any turn until the spell ends.\\n\\nFor the duration, a mote of brilliant radiance shines in your hand. It sheds bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. This light is sunlight.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a magnifying glass)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sunburst_phb\",\"name\":\"Sunburst\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — Brilliant sunlight flashes in a 60-foot radius centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in that light must make a Constitution savin\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (fire and a piece of sunstone)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nBrilliant sunlight flashes in a 60-foot radius centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in that light must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 12d6 radiant damage and is [[blinded]] for 1 minute. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage and isn't [[blinded]] by this spell. Undead and oozes have disadvantage on this saving throw.\\n\\nA creature [[blinded]] by this spell makes another Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a successful save, it is no longer [[blinded]].\\n\\nThis spell dispels any darkness in its area that was created by a spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (fire and a piece of sunstone)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_swift_quiver_phb\",\"name\":\"Swift Quiver\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Bonus action • Touch — You transmute your quiver so it produces an endless supply of nonmagical ammunition, which seems to leap into your hand when you reach for it. On each\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a quiver containing at least one piece of ammunition)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou transmute your quiver so it produces an endless supply of nonmagical ammunition, which seems to leap into your hand when you reach for it.\\n\\nOn each of your turns until the spell ends, you can use a bonus action to make two attacks with a weapon that uses ammunition from the quiver. Each time you make such a ranged attack, your quiver magically replaces the piece of ammunition you used with a similar piece of nonmagical ammunition. Any pieces of ammunition created by this spell disintegrate when the spell ends. If the quiver leaves your possession, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a quiver containing at least one piece of ammunition)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_symbol_phb\",\"name\":\"Symbol\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Abjuration • 1 minute • Touch — When you cast this spell, you inscribe a harmful glyph either on a surface (such as a section of floor, a wall, or a table) or within an object that c\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (mercury, phosphorus, and powdered diamond and opal with a total value of at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled or triggered\\nWhen you cast this spell, you inscribe a harmful glyph either on a surface (such as a section of floor, a wall, or a table) or within an object that can be closed to conceal the glyph (such as a book, a scroll, or a treasure chest). If you choose a surface, the glyph can cover an area of the surface no larger than 10 feet in diameter. If you choose an object, that object must remain in its place; if the object is moved more than 10 feet from where you cast this spell, the glyph is broken, and the spell ends without being triggered.\\n\\nThe glyph is nearly invisible, requiring an Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC to find it.\\n\\nYou decide what triggers the glyph when you cast the spell. For glyphs inscribed on a surface, the most typical triggers include touching or stepping on the glyph, removing another object covering it, approaching within a certain distance of it, or manipulating the object that holds it. For glyphs inscribed within an object, the most common triggers are opening the object, approaching within a certain distance of it, or seeing or reading the glyph.\\n\\nYou can further refine the trigger so the spell is activated only under certain circumstances or according to a creature's physical characteristics (such as height or weight), or physical kind (for example, the ward could be set to affect hags or shapechangers). You can also specify creatures that don't trigger the glyph, such as those who say a certain password.\\n\\nWhen you inscribe the glyph, choose one of the options below for its effect. Once triggered, the glyph glows, filling a 60-foot-radius sphere with dim light for 10 minutes, after which time the spell ends. Each creature in the sphere when the glyph activates is targeted by its effect, as is a creature that enters the sphere for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there.\\n\\n***Death.*** Each target must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 10d10 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful save.\\n\\n***Discord.*** Each target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a target bickers and argues with other creatures for 1 minute. During this time, it is incapable of meaningful communication and has disadvantage on attack rolls and ability checks.\\n\\n***Fear.*** Each target must make a Wisdom saving throw and becomes [[frightened]] for 1 minute on a failed save. While [[frightened]], the target drops whatever it is holding and must move at least 30 feet away from the glyph on each of its turns, if able.\\n\\n***Hopelessness.*** Each target must make a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, the target is overwhelmed with despair for 1 minute. During this time, it can't attack or target any creature with harmful abilities, spells, or other magical effects.\\n\\n***Insanity.*** Each target must make an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, the target is driven insane for 1 minute. An insane creature can't take actions, can't understand what other creatures say, can't read, and speaks only in gibberish. The DM controls its movement, which is erratic.\\n\\n***Pain.*** Each target must make a Constitution saving throw and becomes [[incapacitated]] with excruciating pain for 1 minute on a failed save.\\n\\n***Sleep.*** Each target must make a Wisdom saving throw and falls [[unconscious]] for 10 minutes on a failed save. A creature awakens if it takes damage or if someone uses an action to shake or slap it awake.\\n\\n***Stunning.*** Each target must make a Wisdom saving throw and becomes [[stunned]] for 1 minute on a failed save.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (mercury, phosphorus, and powdered diamond and opal with a total value of at least 1,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled or triggered\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"10d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Druid\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tasha_s_hideous_laughter_phb\",\"name\":\"Tasha's Hideous Laughter\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — A creature of your choice that you can see within range perceives everything as hilariously funny and falls into fits of laughter if this spell affect\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (tiny tarts and a feather that is waved in the air)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA creature of your choice that you can see within range perceives everything as hilariously funny and falls into fits of laughter if this spell affects it. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or fall [[prone]], becoming [[incapacitated]] and unable to stand up for the duration. A creature with an Intelligence score of 4 or less isn't affected.\\n\\nAt the end of each of its turns, and each time it takes damage, the target can make another Wisdom saving throw. The target has advantage on the saving throw if it's triggered by damage. On a success, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (tiny tarts and a feather that is waved in the air)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_telekinesis_phb\",\"name\":\"Telekinesis\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — You gain the ability to move or manipulate creatures or objects by thought. When you cast the spell, and as your action each round for the duration, y\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou gain the ability to move or manipulate creatures or objects by thought. When you cast the spell, and as your action each round for the duration, you can exert your will on one creature or object that you can see within range, causing the appropriate effect below. You can affect the same target round after round, or choose a new one at any time. If you switch targets, the prior target is no longer affected by the spell.\\n\\n***Creature.*** You can try to move a Huge or smaller creature. Make an ability check with your spellcasting ability contested by the creature's Strength check. If you win the contest, you move the creature up to 30 feet in any direction, including upward but not beyond the range of this spell. Until the end of your next turn, the creature is [[restrained]] in your telekinetic grip. A creature lifted upward is suspended in mid-air.\\n\\nOn subsequent rounds, you can use your action to attempt to maintain your telekinetic grip on the creature by repeating the contest.\\n\\n***Object.*** You can try to move an object that weighs up to 1,000 pounds. If the object isn't being worn or carried, you automatically move it up to 30 feet in any direction, but not beyond the range of this spell.\\n\\nIf the object is worn or carried by a creature, you must make an ability check with your spellcasting ability contested by that creature's Strength check. If you succeed, you pull the object away from that creature and can move it up to 30 feet in any direction but not beyond the range of this spell.\\n\\nYou can exert fine control on objects with your telekinetic grip, such as manipulating a simple tool, opening a door or a container, stowing or retrieving an item from an open container, or pouring the contents from a vial.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Psi Warrior|TCE]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_telepathy_phb\",\"name\":\"Telepathy\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Evocation • Action • Unlimited — You create a telepathic link between yourself and a willing creature with which you are familiar. The creature can be anywhere on the same plane of ex\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Unlimited\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pair of linked silver rings)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou create a telepathic link between yourself and a willing creature with which you are familiar. The creature can be anywhere on the same plane of existence as you. The spell ends if you or the target are no longer on the same plane.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you and the target can instantaneously share words, images, sounds, and other sensory messages with one another through the link, and the target recognizes you as the creature it is communicating with. The spell enables a creature with an Intelligence score of at least 1 to understand the meaning of your words and take in the scope of any sensory messages you send to it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Unlimited\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pair of linked silver rings)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_teleport_phb\",\"name\":\"Teleport\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • Action • 10 feet — This spell instantly transports you and up to eight willing creatures of your choice that you can see within range, or a single object that you can se\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThis spell instantly transports you and up to eight willing creatures of your choice that you can see within range, or a single object that you can see within range, to a destination you select. If you target an object, it must be able to fit entirely inside a 10-foot cube, and it can't be held or carried by an unwilling creature.\\n\\nThe destination you choose must be known to you, and it must be on the same plane of existence as you. Your familiarity with the destination determines whether you arrive there successfully. The DM rolls d100 and consults the table.\\n\\n##### Teleportation\\n| Familiarity       | Mishap | Similar Area | Off Target | On Target |\\n|-------------------|:------:|:------------:|:----------:|:---------:|\\n| Permanent circle  |    —   |       —      |      —     |   01–100  |\\n| Associated object |    —   |       —      |      —     |   01–100  |\\n| Very familiar     |  01–05 |     06–13    |    14–24   |   25–100  |\\n| Seen casually     |  01–33 |     34–43    |    44–53   |   54–100  |\\n| Viewed once       |  01–43 |     44–53    |    54–73   |   74–100  |\\n| Description       |  01–43 |     44–53    |    54–73   |   74–100  |\\n| False destination |  01–50 |    51–100    |      —     |     —     |\\n\\n***Familiarity.*** \\\"Permanent circle\\\" means a permanent teleportation circle whose sigil sequence you know. \\\"Associated object\\\" means that you possess an object taken from the desired destination within the last six months, such as a book from a wizard's library, bed linen from a royal suite, or a chunk of marble from a lich's secret tomb.\\n\\n\\\"Very familiar\\\" is a place you have been very often, a place you have carefully studied, or a place you can see when you cast the spell. \\\"Seen casually\\\" is someplace you have seen more than once but with which you aren't very familiar. \\\"Viewed once\\\" is a place you have seen once, possibly using magic. \\\"Description\\\" is a place whose location and appearance you know through someone else's description, perhaps from a map.\\n\\n\\\"False destination\\\" is a place that doesn't exist. Perhaps you tried to scry an enemy's sanctum but instead viewed an illusion, or you are attempting to teleport to a familiar location that no longer exists.\\n\\n***On Target.*** You and your group (or the target object) appear where you want to.\\n\\n***Off Target.*** You and your group (or the target object) appear a random distance away from the destination in a random direction. Distance off target is 1d10 × 1d10 percent of the distance that was to be traveled. For example, if you tried to travel 120 miles, landed off target, and rolled a 5 and 3 on the two d10s, then you would be off target by 15 percent, or 18 miles. The DM determines the direction off target randomly by rolling a d8 and designating 1 as north, 2 as northeast, 3 as east, and so on around the points of the compass. If you were teleporting to a coastal city and wound up 18 miles out at sea, you could be in trouble.\\n\\n***Similar Area.*** You and your group (or the target object) wind up in a different area that's visually or thematically similar to the target area. If you are heading for your home laboratory, for example, you might wind up in another wizard's laboratory or in an alchemical supply shop that has many of the same tools and implements as your laboratory. Generally, you appear in the closest similar place, but since the spell has no range limit, you could conceivably wind up anywhere on the plane.\\n\\n***Mishap.*** The spell's unpredictable magic results in a difficult journey. Each teleporting creature (or the target object) takes 3d10 force damage, and the DM rerolls on the table to see where you wind up (multiple mishaps can occur, dealing damage each time).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_teleportation_circle_phb\",\"name\":\"Teleportation Circle\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • 1 minute • 10 feet — As you cast the spell, you draw a 10-foot-diameter circle on the ground inscribed with sigils that link your location to a permanent teleportation cir\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (rare chalks and inks infused with precious gems worth 50 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nAs you cast the spell, you draw a 10-foot-diameter circle on the ground inscribed with sigils that link your location to a permanent teleportation circle of your choice whose sigil sequence you know and that is on the same plane of existence as you. A shimmering portal opens within the circle you drew and remains open until the end of your next turn. Any creature that enters the portal instantly appears within 5 feet of the destination circle or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied.\\n\\nMany major temples, guilds, and other important places have permanent teleportation circles inscribed somewhere within their confines. Each such circle includes a unique sigil sequence—a string of magical runes arranged in a particular pattern. When you first gain the ability to cast this spell, you learn the sigil sequences for two destinations on the Material Plane, determined by the DM. You can learn additional sigil sequences during your adventures. You can commit a new sigil sequence to memory after studying it for 1 minute.\\n\\nYou can create a permanent teleportation circle by casting this spell in the same location every day for one year. You need not use the circle to teleport when you cast the spell in this way.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (rare chalks and inks infused with precious gems worth 50 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tenser_s_floating_disk_phb\",\"name\":\"Tenser's Floating Disk\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — This spell creates a circular, horizontal plane of force, 3 feet in diameter and 1 inch thick, that floats 3 feet above the ground in an unoccupied sp\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of mercury)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell creates a circular, horizontal plane of force, 3 feet in diameter and 1 inch thick, that floats 3 feet above the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within range. The disk remains for the duration, and can hold up to 500 pounds. If more weight is placed on it, the spell ends, and everything on the disk falls to the ground.\\n\\nThe disk is immobile while you are within 20 feet of it. If you move more than 20 feet away from it, the disk follows you so that it remains within 20 feet of you. It can move across uneven terrain, up or down stairs, slopes and the like, but it can't cross an elevation change of 10 feet or more. For example, the disk can't move across a 10-foot-deep pit, nor could it leave such a pit if it was created at the bottom.\\n\\nIf you move more than 100 feet from the disk (typically because it can't move around an obstacle to follow you), the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]], [[Tiefling (Mammon)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of mercury)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thaumaturgy_phb\",\"name\":\"Thaumaturgy\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You manifest a minor wonder, a sign of supernatural power, within range. You create one of the following magical effects within range: - Your voice bo\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Up to 1 minute\\nYou manifest a minor wonder, a sign of supernatural power, within range. You create one of the following magical effects within range:\\n\\n- Your voice booms up to three times as loud as normal for 1 minute.\\n- You cause flames to flicker, brighten, dim, or change color for 1 minute.\\n- You cause harmless tremors in the ground for 1 minute.\\n- You create an instantaneous sound that originates from a point of your choice within range, such as a rumble of thunder, the cry of a raven, or ominous whispers.\\n- You instantaneously cause an unlocked door or window to fly open or slam shut.\\n- You alter the appearance of your eyes for 1 minute.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell multiple times, you can have up to three of its 1-minute effects active at a time, and you can dismiss such an effect as an action.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Giant|BGG]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Drakewarden|FTD]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Tiefling|PHB]], [[Tiefling (Asmodeus)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Baalzebul)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Dispater)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Zariel)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Hellfire)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Infernal Legacy)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thorn_whip_phb\",\"name\":\"Thorn Whip\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You create a long, vine-like whip covered in thorns that lashes out at your command toward a creature in range. Make a melee spell attack against the \",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (the stem of a plant with thorns)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create a long, vine-like whip covered in thorns that lashes out at your command toward a creature in range. Make a melee spell attack against the target. If the attack hits, the creature takes 1d6 piercing damage, and if the creature is Large or smaller, you pull the creature up to 10 feet closer to you.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d6 when you reach 5th level (2d6), 11th level (3d6), and 17th level (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (the stem of a plant with thorns)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thunderous_smite_phb\",\"name\":\"Thunderous Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — The first time you hit with a melee weapon attack during this spell's duration, your weapon rings with thunder that is audible within 300 feet of you,\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe first time you hit with a melee weapon attack during this spell's duration, your weapon rings with thunder that is audible within 300 feet of you, and the attack deals an extra 2d6 thunder damage to the target. Additionally, if the target is a creature, it must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pushed 10 feet away from you and knocked [[prone]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thunderwave_phb\",\"name\":\"Thunderwave\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • Self — A wave of thunderous force sweeps out from you. Each creature in a 15-foot cube originating from you must make a Constitution saving throw. On a faile\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA wave of thunderous force sweeps out from you. Each creature in a 15-foot cube originating from you must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d8 thunder damage and is pushed 10 feet away from you. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage and isn't pushed.\\n\\nIn addition, unsecured objects that are completely within the area of effect are automatically pushed 10 feet away from you by the spell's effect, and the spell emits a thunderous boom audible out to 300 feet.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]], [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Fist of Four Thunders|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_time_stop_phb\",\"name\":\"Time Stop\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Transmutation • Action • Self — You briefly stop the flow of time for everyone but yourself. No time passes for other creatures, while you take 1d4 + 1 turns in a row, during which y\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou briefly stop the flow of time for everyone but yourself. No time passes for other creatures, while you take 1d4 + 1 turns in a row, during which you can use actions and move as normal.\\n\\nThis spell ends if one of the actions you use during this period, or any effects that you create during this period, affects a creature other than you or an object being worn or carried by someone other than you. In addition, the spell ends if you move to a place more than 1,000 feet from the location where you cast it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tongues_phb\",\"name\":\"Tongues\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Divination • Action • Touch — This spell grants the creature you touch the ability to understand any spoken language it hears. Moreover, when the target speaks, any creature that k\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, M (a small clay model of a ziggurat)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell grants the creature you touch the ability to understand any spoken language it hears. Moreover, when the target speaks, any creature that knows at least one language and can hear the target understands what it says.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Outlands Envoy|SatO]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, M (a small clay model of a ziggurat)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_transport_via_plants_phb\",\"name\":\"Transport via Plants\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 10 feet — This spell creates a magical link between a Large or larger inanimate plant within range and another plant, at any distance, on the same plane of exis\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nThis spell creates a magical link between a Large or larger inanimate plant within range and another plant, at any distance, on the same plane of existence. You must have seen or touched the destination plant at least once before. For the duration, any creature can step into the target plant and exit from the destination plant by using 5 feet of movement.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tree_stride_phb\",\"name\":\"Tree Stride\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • Self — You gain the ability to enter a tree and move from inside it to inside another tree of the same kind within 500 feet. Both trees must be living and at\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou gain the ability to enter a tree and move from inside it to inside another tree of the same kind within 500 feet. Both trees must be living and at least the same size as you. You must use 5 feet of movement to enter a tree. You instantly know the location of all other trees of the same kind within 500 feet and, as part of the move used to enter the tree, can either pass into one of those trees or step out of the tree you're in. You appear in a spot of your choice within 5 feet of the destination tree, using another 5 feet of movement. If you have no movement left, you appear within 5 feet of the tree you entered.\\n\\nYou can use this transportation ability once per round for the duration. You must end each turn outside a tree.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_true_polymorph_phb\",\"name\":\"True Polymorph\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — Choose one creature or nonmagical object that you can see within range. You transform the creature into a different creature, the creature into a nonm\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of mercury, a dollop of gum arabic, and a wisp of smoke)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nChoose one creature or nonmagical object that you can see within range. You transform the creature into a different creature, the creature into a nonmagical object, or the object into a creature (the object must be neither worn nor carried by another creature). The transformation lasts for the duration, or until the target drops to 0 hit points or dies. If you concentrate on this spell for the full duration, the transformation lasts until it is dispelled.\\n\\nThis spell has no effect on a shapechanger or a creature with 0 hit points. An unwilling creature can make a Wisdom saving throw, and if it succeeds, it isn't affected by this spell.\\n\\n***Creature into Creature.*** If you turn a creature into another kind of creature, the new form can be any kind you choose whose challenge rating is equal to or less than the target's (or its level, if the target doesn't have a challenge rating). The target's game statistics, including mental ability scores, are replaced by the statistics of the new form. It retains its alignment and personality.\\n\\nThe target assumes the hit points of its new form, and when it reverts to its normal form, the creature returns to the number of hit points it had before it transformed. If it reverts as a result of dropping to 0 hit points, any excess damage carries over to its normal form. As long as the excess damage doesn't reduce the creature's normal form to 0 hit points, it isn't knocked [[unconscious]].\\n\\nThe creature is limited in the actions it can perform by the nature of its new form, and it can't speak, cast spells, or take any other action that requires hands or speech unless its new form is capable of such actions.\\n\\nThe target's gear melds into the new form. The creature can't activate, use, wield, or otherwise benefit from any of its equipment.\\n\\n***Object into Creature.*** You can turn an object into any kind of creature, as long as the creature's size is no larger than the object's size and the creature's challenge rating is 9 or lower. The creature is friendly to you and your companions. It acts on each of your turns. You decide what action it takes and how it moves. The DM has the creature's statistics and resolves all of its actions and movement.\\n\\nIf the spell becomes permanent, you no longer control the creature. It might remain friendly to you, depending on how you have treated it.\\n\\n***Creature into Object.*** If you turn a creature into an object, it transforms along with whatever it is wearing and carrying into that form, as long as the object's size is no larger than the creature's size. The creature's statistics become those of the object, and the creature has no memory of time spent in this form, after the spell ends and it returns to its normal form.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of mercury, a dollop of gum arabic, and a wisp of smoke)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_true_resurrection_phb\",\"name\":\"True Resurrection\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Necromancy • 1 hour • Touch — You touch a creature that has been dead for no longer than 200 years and that died for any reason except old age. If the creature's soul is free and w\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sprinkle of holy water and diamonds worth at least 25,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a creature that has been dead for no longer than 200 years and that died for any reason except old age. If the creature's soul is free and willing, the creature is restored to life with all its hit points.\\n\\nThis spell closes all wounds, neutralizes any poison, cures all diseases, and lifts any curses affecting the creature when it died. The spell replaces damaged or missing organs and limbs. If the creature was undead, it is restored to its non-undead form.\\n\\nThe spell can even provide a new body if the original no longer exists, in which case you must speak the creature's name. The creature then appears in an unoccupied space you choose within 10 feet of you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sprinkle of holy water and diamonds worth at least 25,000 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 9\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_true_seeing_phb\",\"name\":\"True Seeing\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Divination • Action • Touch — This spell gives the willing creature you touch the ability to see things as they actually are. For the duration, the creature has truesight, notices \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an ointment for the eyes that costs 25 gp; is made from mushroom powder, saffron, and fat; and is consumed by the spell)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell gives the willing creature you touch the ability to see things as they actually are. For the duration, the creature has [[truesight]], notices secret doors hidden by magic, and can see into the Ethereal Plane, all out to a range of 120 feet.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an ointment for the eyes that costs 25 gp; is made from mushroom powder, saffron, and fat; and is consumed by the spell)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_true_strike_phb\",\"name\":\"True Strike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Divination Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You extend your hand and point a finger at a target in range. Your magic grants you a brief insight into the target's defenses. On your next turn, you\",\"content\":\"*Divination Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 round\\nYou extend your hand and point a finger at a target in range. Your magic grants you a brief insight into the target's defenses. On your next turn, you gain advantage on your first attack roll against the target, provided that this spell hasn't ended.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Divination\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tsunami_phb\",\"name\":\"Tsunami\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • 1 minute • Sight — A wall of water springs into existence at a point you choose within range. You can make the wall up to 300 feet long, 300 feet high, and 50 feet thick\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Sight\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 6 rounds\\nA wall of water springs into existence at a point you choose within range. You can make the wall up to 300 feet long, 300 feet high, and 50 feet thick. The wall lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the wall appears, each creature within its area must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 6d10 bludgeoning damage, or half as much damage on a successful save.\\n\\nAt the start of each of your turns after the wall appears, the wall, along with any creatures in it, moves 50 feet away from you. Any Huge or smaller creature inside the wall or whose space the wall enters when it moves must succeed on a Strength saving throw or take 5d10 bludgeoning damage. A creature can take this damage only once per round. At the end of the turn, the wall's height is reduced by 50 feet, and the damage creatures take from the spell on subsequent rounds is reduced by 1d10. When the wall reaches 0 feet in height, the spell ends.\\n\\nA creature caught in the wall can move by swimming. Because of the force of the wave, though, the creature must make a successful Strength ([[Athletics]]) check against your spell save DC in order to move at all. If it fails the check, it can't move. A creature that moves out of the area falls to the ground.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Sight\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 6 rounds\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"6d10\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_unseen_servant_phb\",\"name\":\"Unseen Servant\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action or Ritual • 60 feet — This spell creates an invisible, mindless, shapeless, Medium force that performs simple tasks at your command until the spell ends. The servant spring\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of string and a bit of wood)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell creates an [[invisible]], mindless, shapeless, Medium force that performs simple tasks at your command until the spell ends. The servant springs into existence in an unoccupied space on the ground within range. It has AC 10, 1 hit point, and a Strength of 2, and it can't attack. If it drops to 0 hit points, the spell ends.\\n\\nOnce on each of your turns as a bonus action, you can mentally command the servant to move up to 15 feet and interact with an object. The servant can perform simple tasks that a human servant could do, such as fetching things, cleaning, mending, folding clothes, lighting fires, serving food, and pouring wine. Once you give the command, the servant performs the task to the best of its ability until it completes the task, then waits for your next command.\\n\\nIf you command the servant to perform a task that would move it more than 60 feet away from you, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of string and a bit of wood)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_vampiric_touch_phb\",\"name\":\"Vampiric Touch\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • Self — The touch of your shadow-wreathed hand can siphon life force from others to heal your wounds. Make a melee spell attack against a creature within your\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe touch of your shadow-wreathed hand can siphon life force from others to heal your wounds. Make a melee spell attack against a creature within your reach. On a hit, the target takes 3d6 necrotic damage, and you regain hit points equal to half the amount of necrotic damage dealt. Until the spell ends, you can make the attack again on each of your turns as an action.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_vicious_mockery_phb\",\"name\":\"Vicious Mockery\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Enchantment Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You unleash a string of insults laced with subtle enchantments at a creature you can see within range. If the target can hear you (though it need not \",\"content\":\"*Enchantment Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash a string of insults laced with subtle enchantments at a creature you can see within range. If the target can hear you (though it need not understand you), it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or take 1d4 psychic damage and have disadvantage on the next attack roll it makes before the end of its next turn.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d4 when you reach 5th level (2d4), 11th level (3d4), and 17th level (4d4).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Species / Races:** [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Devil's Tongue)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_fire_phb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Fire\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You create a wall of fire on a solid surface within range. You can make the wall up to 60 feet long, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick, or a ringed wall \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small piece of phosphorus)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a wall of fire on a solid surface within range. You can make the wall up to 60 feet long, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick, or a ringed wall up to 20 feet in diameter, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick. The wall is opaque and lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the wall appears, each creature within its area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 5d8 fire damage, or half as much damage on a successful save.\\n\\nOne side of the wall, selected by you when you cast this spell, deals 5d8 fire damage to each creature that ends its turn within 10 feet of that side or inside the wall. A creature takes the same damage when it enters the wall for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there. The other side of the wall deals no damage.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]], [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[River of Hungry Flame|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small piece of phosphorus)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_force_phb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Force\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — An invisible wall of force springs into existence at a point you choose within range. The wall appears in any orientation you choose, as a horizontal \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of powder made by crushing a clear gemstone)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nAn invisible wall of force springs into existence at a point you choose within range. The wall appears in any orientation you choose, as a horizontal or vertical barrier or at an angle. It can be free floating or resting on a solid surface. You can form it into a hemispherical dome or a sphere with a radius of up to 10 feet, or you can shape a flat surface made up of ten 10-foot-by-10-foot panels. Each panel must be contiguous with another panel. In any form, the wall is 1/4 inch thick. It lasts for the duration. If the wall cuts through a creature's space when it appears, the creature is pushed to one side of the wall (your choice which side).\\n\\nNothing can physically pass through the wall. It is immune to all damage and can't be dispelled by [[dispel magic]]. A [[disintegrate]] spell destroys the wall instantly, however. The wall also extends into the Ethereal Plane, blocking ethereal travel through the wall.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of powder made by crushing a clear gemstone)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_ice_phb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Ice\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You create a wall of ice on a solid surface within range. You can form it into a hemispherical dome or a sphere with a radius of up to 10 feet, or you\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small piece of quartz)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a wall of ice on a solid surface within range. You can form it into a hemispherical dome or a sphere with a radius of up to 10 feet, or you can shape a flat surface made up of ten 10-foot-square panels. Each panel must be contiguous with another panel. In any form, the wall is 1 foot thick and lasts for the duration.\\n\\nIf the wall cuts through a creature's space when it appears, the creature within its area is pushed to one side of the wall and must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 10d6 cold damage, or half as much damage on a successful save.\\n\\nThe wall is an object that can be damaged and thus breached. It has AC 12 and 30 hit points per 10-foot section, and it is vulnerable to fire damage. Reducing a 10-foot section of wall to 0 hit points destroys it and leaves behind a sheet of frigid air in the space the wall occupied. A creature moving through the sheet of frigid air for the first time on a turn must make a Constitution saving throw. That creature takes 5d6 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the damage the wall deals when it appears increases by 2d6, and the damage from passing through the sheet of frigid air increases by 1d6, for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small piece of quartz)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_stone_phb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Stone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A nonmagical wall of solid stone springs into existence at a point you choose within range. The wall is 6 inches thick and is composed of ten 10-foot-\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small block of granite)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA nonmagical wall of solid stone springs into existence at a point you choose within range. The wall is 6 inches thick and is composed of ten 10-foot-by-10-foot panels. Each panel must be contiguous with at least one other panel. Alternatively, you can create 10-foot-by-20-foot panels that are only 3 inches thick.\\n\\nIf the wall cuts through a creature's space when it appears, the creature is pushed to one side of the wall (your choice). If a creature would be surrounded on all sides by the wall (or the wall and another solid surface), that creature can make a Dexterity saving throw. On a success, it can use its reaction to move up to its speed so that it is no longer enclosed by the wall.\\n\\nThe wall can have any shape you desire, though it can't occupy the same space as a creature or object. The wall doesn't need to be vertical or rest on any firm foundation. It must, however, merge with and be solidly supported by existing stone. Thus, you can use this spell to bridge a chasm or create a ramp.\\n\\nIf you create a span greater than 20 feet in length, you must halve the size of each panel to create supports. You can crudely shape the wall to create crenellations, battlements, and so on.\\n\\nThe wall is an object made of stone that can be damaged and thus breached. Each panel has AC 15 and 30 hit points per inch of thickness. Reducing a panel to 0 hit points destroys it and might cause connected panels to collapse at the DM's discretion.\\n\\nIf you maintain your [[concentration]] on this spell for its whole duration, the wall becomes permanent and can't be dispelled. Otherwise, the wall disappears when the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Wave of Rolling Earth|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small block of granite)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_thorns_phb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Thorns\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — You create a wall of tough, pliable, tangled brush bristling with needle-sharp thorns. The wall appears within range on a solid surface and lasts for \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a handful of thorns)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a wall of tough, pliable, tangled brush bristling with needle-sharp thorns. The wall appears within range on a solid surface and lasts for the duration. You choose to make the wall up to 60 feet long, 10 feet high, and 5 feet thick or a circle that has a 20-foot diameter and is up to 20 feet high and 5 feet thick. The wall blocks line of sight.\\n\\nWhen the wall appears, each creature within its area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 7d8 piercing damage, or half as much damage on a successful save.\\n\\nA creature can move through the wall, albeit slowly and painfully. For every 1 foot a creature moves through the wall, it must spend 4 feet of movement. Furthermore, the first time a creature enters the wall on a turn or ends its turn there, the creature must make a Dexterity saving throw. It takes 7d8 slashing damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, both types of damage increase by 1d8 for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a handful of thorns)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"7d8\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_warding_bond_phb\",\"name\":\"Warding Bond\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • Touch — This spell wards a willing creature you touch and creates a mystic connection between you and the target until the spell ends. While the target is wit\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pair of platinum rings worth at least 50 gp each, which you and the target must wear for the duration)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell wards a willing creature you touch and creates a mystic connection between you and the target until the spell ends. While the target is within 60 feet of you, it gains a +1 bonus to AC and saving throws, and it has resistance to all damage. Also, each time it takes damage, you take the same amount of damage.\\n\\nThe spell ends if you drop to 0 hit points or if you and the target become separated by more than 60 feet. It also ends if the spell is cast again on either of the connected creatures. You can also dismiss the spell as an action.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pair of platinum rings worth at least 50 gp each, which you and the target must wear for the duration)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_water_breathing_phb\",\"name\":\"Water Breathing\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — This spell grants up to ten willing creatures you can see within range the ability to breathe underwater until the spell ends. Affected creatures also\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a short reed or piece of straw)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nThis spell grants up to ten willing creatures you can see within range the ability to breathe underwater until the spell ends. Affected creatures also retain their normal mode of respiration.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Gift of the Depths|XGE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a short reed or piece of straw)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_water_walk_phb\",\"name\":\"Water Walk\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — This spell grants the ability to move across any liquid surface—such as water, acid, mud, snow, quicksand, or lava—as if it were harmless solid ground\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of cork)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell grants the ability to move across any liquid surface—such as water, acid, mud, snow, quicksand, or lava—as if it were harmless solid ground (creatures crossing molten lava can still take damage from the heat). Up to ten willing creatures you can see within range gain this ability for the duration.\\n\\nIf you target a creature submerged in a liquid, the spell carries the target to the surface of the liquid at a rate of 60 feet per round.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Water)|MPMM]], [[Triton|MPMM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of cork)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_web_phb\",\"name\":\"Web\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You conjure a mass of thick, sticky webbing at a point of your choice within range. The webs fill a 20-foot cube from that point for the duration. The\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of spiderweb)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou conjure a mass of thick, sticky webbing at a point of your choice within range. The webs fill a 20-foot cube from that point for the duration. The webs are difficult terrain and lightly obscure their area.\\n\\nIf the webs aren't anchored between two solid masses (such as walls or trees) or layered across a floor, wall, or ceiling, the conjured web collapses on itself, and the spell ends at the start of your next turn. Webs layered over a flat surface have a depth of 5 feet.\\n\\nEach creature that starts its turn in the webs or that enters them during its turn must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the creature is [[restrained]] as long as it remains in the webs or until it breaks free.\\n\\nA creature [[restrained]] by the webs can use its action to make a Strength check against your spell save DC. If it succeeds, it is no longer [[restrained]].\\n\\nThe webs are flammable. Any 5-foot cube of webs exposed to fire burns away in 1 round, dealing 2d4 fire damage to any creature that starts its turn in the fire.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of spiderweb)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_weird_phb\",\"name\":\"Weird\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — Drawing on the deepest fears of a group of creatures, you create illusory creatures in their minds, visible only to them. Each creature in a 30-foot-r\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nDrawing on the deepest fears of a group of creatures, you create illusory creatures in their minds, visible only to them. Each creature in a 30-foot-radius sphere centered on a point of your choice within range must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, a creature becomes [[frightened]] for the duration. The illusion calls on the creature's deepest fears, manifesting its worst nightmares as an implacable threat. At the end of each of the [[frightened]] creature's turns, it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or take 4d10 psychic damage. On a successful save, the spell ends for that creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Warlock\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wind_walk_phb\",\"name\":\"Wind Walk\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • 1 minute • 30 feet — You and up to ten willing creatures you can see within range assume a gaseous form for the duration, appearing as wisps of cloud. While in this cloud \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (fire and holy water)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou and up to ten willing creatures you can see within range assume a gaseous form for the duration, appearing as wisps of cloud. While in this cloud form, a creature has a flying speed of 300 feet and has resistance to damage from nonmagical weapons. The only actions a creature can take in this form are the [[Dash]] action or to revert to its normal form. Reverting takes 1 minute, during which time a creature is [[incapacitated]] and can't move. Until the spell ends, a creature can revert to cloud form, which also requires the 1-minute transformation.\\n\\nIf a creature is in cloud form and flying when the effect ends, the creature descends 60 feet per round for 1 minute until it lands, which it does safely. If it can't land after 1 minute, the creature falls the remaining distance.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (fire and holy water)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wind_wall_phb\",\"name\":\"Wind Wall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A wall of strong wind rises from the ground at a point you choose within range. You can make the wall up to 50 feet long, 15 feet high, and 1 foot thi\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny fan and a feather of exotic origin)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA wall of strong wind rises from the ground at a point you choose within range. You can make the wall up to 50 feet long, 15 feet high, and 1 foot thick. You can shape the wall in any way you choose so long as it makes one continuous path along the ground. The wall lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the wall appears, each creature within its area must make a Strength saving throw. A creature takes 3d8 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe strong wind keeps fog, smoke, and other gases at bay. Small or smaller flying creatures or objects can't pass through the wall. Loose, lightweight materials brought into the wall fly upward. Arrows, bolts, and other ordinary projectiles launched at targets behind the wall are deflected upward and automatically miss. (Boulders hurled by giants or siege engines, and similar projectiles, are unaffected.) Creatures in [[gaseous form]] can't pass through it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny fan and a feather of exotic origin)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wish_phb\",\"name\":\"Wish\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Conjuration • Action • Self — Wish is the mightiest spell a mortal creature can cast. By simply speaking aloud, you can alter the very foundations of reality in accord with your de\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nWish is the mightiest spell a mortal creature can cast. By simply speaking aloud, you can alter the very foundations of reality in accord with your desires.\\n\\nThe basic use of this spell is to duplicate any other spell of 8th level or lower. You don't need to meet any requirements in that spell, including costly components. The spell simply takes effect. Alternatively, you can create one of the following effects of your choice:\\n\\n- You create one object of up to 25,000 gp in value that isn't a magic item. The object can be no more than 300 feet in any dimension, and it appears in an unoccupied space you can see on the ground.\\n- You allow up to twenty creatures that you can see to regain all hit points, and you end all effects on them described in the [[greater restoration]] spell.\\n- You grant up to ten creatures that you can see resistance to a damage type you choose.\\n- You grant up to ten creatures you can see immunity to a single spell or other magical effect for 8 hours. For instance, you could make yourself and all your companions immune to a [[lich]]'s life drain attack.\\n- You undo a single recent event by forcing a reroll of any roll made within the last round (including your last turn). Reality reshapes itself to accommodate the new result. For example, a [[wish]] spell could undo an opponent's successful save, a foe's critical hit, or a friend's failed save. You can force the reroll to be made with advantage or disadvantage, and you can choose whether to use the reroll or the original roll.\\n\\nYou might be able to achieve something beyond the scope of the above examples. State your wish to the DM as precisely as possible. The DM has great latitude in ruling what occurs in such an instance; the greater the wish, the greater the likelihood that something goes wrong. This spell might simply fail, the effect you desire might only be partly achieved, or you might suffer some unforeseen consequence as a result of how you worded the wish. For example, wishing that a villain were dead might propel you forward in time to a period when that villain is no longer alive, effectively removing you from the game. Similarly, wishing for a legendary magic item or artifact might instantly transport you to the presence of the item's current owner.\\n\\nThe stress of casting this spell to produce any effect other than duplicating another spell weakens you. After enduring that stress, each time you cast a spell until you finish a long rest, you take 1d10 necrotic damage per level of that spell. This damage can't be reduced or prevented in any way. In addition, your Strength drops to 3, if it isn't 3 or lower already, for 2d4 days. For each of those days that you spend resting and doing nothing more than light activity, your remaining recovery time decreases by 2 days. Finally, there is a 33 percent chance that you are unable to cast wish ever again if you suffer this stress.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_witch_bolt_phb\",\"name\":\"Witch Bolt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 30 feet — A beam of crackling, blue energy lances out toward a creature within range, forming a sustained arc of lightning between you and the target. Make a ra\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a twig from a tree that has been struck by lightning)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA beam of crackling, blue energy lances out toward a creature within range, forming a sustained arc of lightning between you and the target. Make a ranged spell attack against that creature. On a hit, the target takes 1d12 lightning damage, and on each of your turns for the duration, you can use your action to deal 1d12 lightning damage to the target automatically. The spell ends if you use your action to do anything else. The spell also ends if the target is ever outside the spell's range or if it has total cover from you.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the initial damage increases by 1d12 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a twig from a tree that has been struck by lightning)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d12\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_word_of_recall_phb\",\"name\":\"Word of Recall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 5 feet — You and up to five willing creatures within 5 feet of you instantly teleport to a previously designated sanctuary. You and any creatures that teleport\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 5 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou and up to five willing creatures within 5 feet of you instantly teleport to a previously designated sanctuary. You and any creatures that teleport with you appear in the nearest unoccupied space to the spot you designated when you prepared your sanctuary (see below). If you cast this spell without first preparing a sanctuary, the spell has no effect.\\n\\nYou must designate a sanctuary by casting this spell within a location, such as a temple, dedicated to or strongly linked to your deity. If you attempt to cast the spell in this manner in an area that isn't dedicated to your deity, the spell has no effect.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"5 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wrathful_smite_phb\",\"name\":\"Wrathful Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — The next time you hit with a melee weapon attack during this spell's duration, your attack deals an extra 1d6 psychic damage. Additionally, if the tar\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe next time you hit with a melee weapon attack during this spell's duration, your attack deals an extra 1d6 psychic damage. Additionally, if the target is a creature, it must make a Wisdom saving throw or be [[frightened]] of you until the spell ends. As an action, the creature can make a Wisdom check against your spell save DC to steel its resolve and end this spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_zone_of_truth_phb\",\"name\":\"Zone of Truth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"PHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You create a magical zone that guards against deception in a 15-foot-radius sphere centered on a point of your choice within range. Until the spell en\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou create a magical zone that guards against deception in a 15-foot-radius sphere centered on a point of your choice within range. Until the spell ends, a creature that enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there must make a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, a creature can't speak a deliberate lie while in the radius. You know whether each creature succeeds or fails on its saving throw.\\n\\nAn affected creature is aware of the spell and can thus avoid answering questions to which it would normally respond with a lie. Such creatures can be evasive in its answers as long as it remains within the boundaries of the truth.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"PHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gate_seal_sato\",\"name\":\"Gate Seal\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"SatO\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • 1 minute • 60 feet — You fortify the fabric of the planes in a 30-foot cube you can see within range. Within that area, portals close and can't be opened for the duration.\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a broken portal key, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou fortify the fabric of the planes in a 30-foot cube you can see within range. Within that area, portals close and can't be opened for the duration. Spells and other effects that allow planar travel or open portals, such as [[gate]] or [[plane shift]], fail if used to enter or leave the area. The cube is stationary.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the spell lasts until dispelled.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a broken portal key, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"SatO\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Special\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_warp_sense_sato\",\"name\":\"Warp Sense\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"SatO\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • Self — For the duration, you sense the presence of portals, even inactive ones, within 30 feet of yourself. If you detect a portal in this way, you can use y\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a razorvine leaf)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the duration, you sense the presence of portals, even inactive ones, within 30 feet of yourself.\\n\\nIf you detect a portal in this way, you can use your action to study it. Make a DC 15 ability check using your spellcasting ability. On a successful check, you learn the destination plane of the portal and what portal key it requires, then the spell ends. On a failed check, you learn nothing and can't study that portal again using this spell until you cast it again.\\n\\nThe spell can penetrate most barriers but is blocked by 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of common metal, a thin sheet of lead, or 3 feet of wood or dirt.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a razorvine leaf)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"SatO\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_borrowed_knowledge_scc\",\"name\":\"Borrowed Knowledge\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"SCC\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • Self — You draw on knowledge from spirits of the past. Choose one skill in which you lack proficiency. For the spell's duration, you have proficiency in the \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a book worth at least 25 gp)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou draw on knowledge from spirits of the past. Choose one skill in which you lack proficiency. For the spell's duration, you have proficiency in the chosen skill. The spell ends early if you cast it again.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a book worth at least 25 gp)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"SCC\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_kinetic_jaunt_scc\",\"name\":\"Kinetic Jaunt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"SCC\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — You magically empower your movement with dance-like steps, giving yourself the following benefits for the duration. - Your walking speed increases by \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou magically empower your movement with dance-like steps, giving yourself the following benefits for the duration.\\n\\n- Your walking speed increases by 10 feet.\\n- You don't provoke opportunity attacks.\\n- You can move through the space of another creature, and it doesn't count as difficult terrain. If you end your turn in another creature's space, you are shunted to the last unoccupied space you occupied, and you take 1d8 force damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"SCC\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_silvery_barbs_scc\",\"name\":\"Silvery Barbs\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"SCC\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Reaction, which you take when a creature you can see within 60 feet of yourself succeeds on an attack roll, an ability check, or a saving throw • 60 feet — You magically distract the triggering creature and turn its momentary uncertainty into encouragement for another creature. The triggering creature mus\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when a creature you can see within 60 feet of yourself succeeds on an attack roll, an ability check, or a saving throw\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou magically distract the triggering creature and turn its momentary uncertainty into encouragement for another creature. The triggering creature must reroll the d20 and use the lower roll.\\n\\nYou can then choose a different creature you can see within range (you can choose yourself). The chosen creature has advantage on the next attack roll, ability check, or saving throw it makes within 1 minute. A creature can be empowered by only one use of this spell at a time.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when a creature you can see within 60 feet of yourself succeeds on an attack roll, an ability check, or a saving throw\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"SCC\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Reaction\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_vortex_warp_scc\",\"name\":\"Vortex Warp\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"SCC\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You magically twist space around another creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw (the target can cho\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou magically twist space around another creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw (the target can choose to fail), or the target is teleported to an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within range. The chosen space must be on a surface or in a liquid that can support the target without the target having to squeeze.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the range of the spell increases by 30 feet for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"SCC\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wither_and_bloom_scc\",\"name\":\"Wither and Bloom\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"SCC\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You invoke both death and life upon a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on a point within range. Each creature of your choice in that area must make a Co\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a withered vine twisted into a loop)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou invoke both death and life upon a 10-foot-radius sphere centered on a point within range. Each creature of your choice in that area must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 2d6 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Nonmagical vegetation in that area withers.\\n\\nIn addition, one creature of your choice in that area can spend and roll one of its unspent Hit Dice and regain a number of hit points equal to the roll plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot above the 2nd, and the number of Hit Dice that can be spent and added to the healing roll increases by one for each slot above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a withered vine twisted into a loop)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"SCC\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blade_of_disaster_tce\",\"name\":\"Blade of Disaster\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Conjuration • Bonus action • 60 feet — You create a blade-shaped planar rift about 3 feet long in an unoccupied space you can see within range. The blade lasts for the duration. When you ca\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a blade-shaped planar rift about 3 feet long in an unoccupied space you can see within range. The blade lasts for the duration. When you cast this spell, you can make up to two melee spell attacks with the blade, each one against a creature, loose object, or structure within 5 feet of the blade. On a hit, the target takes 4d12 force damage. This attack scores a critical hit if the number on the d20 is 18 or higher. On a critical hit, the blade deals an extra 8d12 force damage (for a total of 12d12 force damage).\\n\\nAs a bonus action on your turn, you can move the blade up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see and then make up to two melee spell attacks with it again.\\n\\nThe blade can harmlessly pass through any barrier, including a [[wall of force]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"4d12\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_booming_blade_tce\",\"name\":\"Booming Blade\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • Self — You brandish the weapon used in the spell's casting and make a melee attack with it against one creature within 5 feet of you. On a hit, the target su\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S, M (a melee weapon worth at least 1 sp)\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou brandish the weapon used in the spell's casting and make a melee attack with it against one creature within 5 feet of you. On a hit, the target suffers the weapon attack's normal effects and then becomes sheathed in booming energy until the start of your next turn. If the target willingly moves 5 feet or more before then, the target takes 1d8 thunder damage, and the spell ends.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases when you reach certain levels. At 5th level, the melee attack deals an extra 1d8 thunder damage to the target on a hit, and the damage the target takes for moving increases to 2d8. Both damage rolls increase by 1d8 at 11th level (2d8 and 3d8) and again at 17th level (3d8 and 4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S, M (a melee weapon worth at least 1 sp)\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Artificer\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dream_of_the_blue_veil_tce\",\"name\":\"Dream of the Blue Veil\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • 10 minutes • 20 feet — You and up to eight willing creatures within range fall unconscious for the spell's duration and experience visions of another world on the Material P\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 20 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a magic item or a willing creature from the destination world)\\n- **Duration:** 6 hours\\nYou and up to eight willing creatures within range fall [[unconscious]] for the spell's duration and experience visions of another world on the Material Plane, such as Oerth, Toril, Krynn, or Eberron. If the spell reaches its full duration, the visions conclude with each of you encountering and pulling back a mysterious blue curtain. The spell then ends with you mentally and physically transported to the world that was in the visions.\\n\\nTo cast this spell, you must have a magic item that originated on the world you wish to reach, and you must be aware of the world's existence, even if you don't know the world's name. Your destination in the other world is a safe location within 1 mile of where the magic item was created. Alternatively, you can cast the spell if one of the affected creatures was born on the other world, which causes your destination to be a safe location within 1 mile of where that creature was born.\\n\\nThe spell ends early on a creature if that creature takes any damage, and the creature isn't transported. If you take any damage, the spell ends for you and all the other creatures, with none of you being transported.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"20 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a magic item or a willing creature from the destination world)\",\"duration\":\"6 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_green_flame_blade_tce\",\"name\":\"Green-Flame Blade\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • Self — You brandish the weapon used in the spell's casting and make a melee attack with it against one creature within 5 feet of you. On a hit, the target su\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S, M (a melee weapon worth at least 1 sp)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou brandish the weapon used in the spell's casting and make a melee attack with it against one creature within 5 feet of you. On a hit, the target suffers the weapon attack's normal effects, and you can cause green fire to leap from the target to a different creature of your choice that you can see within 5 feet of it. The second creature takes fire damage equal to your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases when you reach certain levels. At 5th level, the melee attack deals an extra 1d8 fire damage to the target on a hit, and the fire damage to the second creature increases to 1d8 + your spellcasting ability modifier. Both damage rolls increase by 1d8 at 11th level (2d8 and 2d8) and 17th level (3d8 and 3d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S, M (a melee weapon worth at least 1 sp)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Artificer\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_intellect_fortress_tce\",\"name\":\"Intellect Fortress\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • 30 feet — For the duration, you or one willing creature you can see within range has resistance to psychic damage, as well as advantage on Intelligence, Wisdom,\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nFor the duration, you or one willing creature you can see within range has resistance to psychic damage, as well as advantage on Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma saving throws.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 3rd. The creatures must be within 30 feet of each other when you target them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA), [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Artificer\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_lightning_lure_tce\",\"name\":\"Lightning Lure\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • Self — You create a lash of lightning energy that strikes at one creature of your choice that you can see within 15 feet of you. The target must succeed on a\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create a lash of lightning energy that strikes at one creature of your choice that you can see within 15 feet of you. The target must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pulled up to 10 feet in a straight line toward you and then take 1d8 lightning damage if it is within 5 feet of you.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Artificer\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mind_sliver_tce\",\"name\":\"Mind Sliver\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Enchantment Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You drive a disorienting spike of psychic energy into the mind of one creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on an Intelligence sa\",\"content\":\"*Enchantment Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou drive a disorienting spike of psychic energy into the mind of one creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on an Intelligence saving throw or take 1d6 psychic damage and subtract 1d4 from the next saving throw it makes before the end of your next turn.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d6 when you reach certain levels: 5th level (2d6), 11th level (3d6), and 17th level (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Enchantment\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spirit_shroud_tce\",\"name\":\"Spirit Shroud\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Bonus action • Self — You call forth spirits of the dead, which flit around you for the spell's duration. The spirits are intangible and invulnerable. Until the spell ends,\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou call forth spirits of the dead, which flit around you for the spell's duration. The spirits are intangible and invulnerable.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, any attack you make deals 1d8 extra damage when you hit a creature within 10 feet of you. This damage is radiant, necrotic, or cold (your choice when you cast the spell). Any creature that takes this damage can't regain hit points until the start of your next turn.\\n\\nIn addition, any creature of your choice that you can see that starts its turn within 10 feet of you has its speed reduced by 10 feet until the start of your next turn.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for every two slot levels above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_aberration_tce\",\"name\":\"Summon Aberration\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth an aberrant spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Aberrant Spirit sta\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pickled tentacle and an eyeball in a platinum-inlaid vial worth at least 400 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth an aberrant spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the [[Aberrant Spirit|TCE]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose Beholderkin, Slaad, or Star Spawn. The creature resembles an aberration of that kind, which determines certain traits in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pickled tentacle and an eyeball in a platinum-inlaid vial worth at least 400 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_beast_tce\",\"name\":\"Summon Beast\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth a bestial spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Bestial Spirit stat b\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a feather, tuft of fur, and fish tail inside a gilded acorn worth at least 200 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a bestial spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the [[Bestial Spirit|TCE]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose an environment: Air, Land, or Water. The creature resembles an animal of your choice that is native to the chosen environment, which determines certain traits in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a feather, tuft of fur, and fish tail inside a gilded acorn worth at least 200 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_celestial_tce\",\"name\":\"Summon Celestial\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth a celestial spirit. It manifests in an angelic form in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a golden reliquary worth at least 500 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a celestial spirit. It manifests in an angelic form in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the [[Celestial Spirit|TCE]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose Avenger or Defender. Your choice determines the creature's attack in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a golden reliquary worth at least 500 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_construct_tce\",\"name\":\"Summon Construct\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth the spirit of a construct. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Construct Sp\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an ornate stone and metal lockbox worth at least 400 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth the spirit of a construct. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the [[Construct Spirit|TCE]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose a material: Clay, Metal, or Stone. The creature resembles a golem or a modron (your choice) made of the chosen material, which determines certain traits in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an ornate stone and metal lockbox worth at least 400 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Artificer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_elemental_tce\",\"name\":\"Summon Elemental\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth an elemental spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Elemental Spirit s\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (air, a pebble, ash, and water inside a gold-inlaid vial worth at least 400 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth an elemental spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the [[Elemental Spirit|TCE]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose an element: Air, Earth, Fire, or Water. The creature resembles a bipedal form wreathed in the chosen element, which determines certain traits in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (air, a pebble, ash, and water inside a gold-inlaid vial worth at least 400 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_fey_tce\",\"name\":\"Summon Fey\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth a fey spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Fey Spirit stat block. Wh\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gilded flower worth at least 300 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a fey spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the [[Fey Spirit|TCE]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose a mood: Fuming, Mirthful, or Tricksy. The creature resembles a fey creature of your choice marked by the chosen mood, which determines one of the traits in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gilded flower worth at least 300 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_fiend_tce\",\"name\":\"Summon Fiend\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth a fiendish spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Fiendish Spirit stat\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (humanoid blood inside a ruby vial worth at least 600 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a fiendish spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the [[Fiendish Spirit|TCE]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose Demon, Devil, or Yugoloth. The creature resembles a fiend of the chosen type, which determines certain traits in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (humanoid blood inside a ruby vial worth at least 600 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_shadowspawn_tce\",\"name\":\"Summon Shadowspawn\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth a shadowy spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Shadow Spirit stat bl\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (tears inside a gem worth at least 300 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a shadowy spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the [[Shadow Spirit|TCE]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose an emotion: Fury, Despair, or Fear. The creature resembles a misshapen biped marked by the chosen emotion, which determines certain traits in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (tears inside a gem worth at least 300 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_undead_tce\",\"name\":\"Summon Undead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • 90 feet — You call forth an undead spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the Undead Spirit stat bl\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gilded skull worth at least 300 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth an undead spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. This corporeal form uses the [[Undead Spirit|TCE]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose the creature's form: Ghostly, Putrid, or Skeletal. The spirit resembles an undead creature with the chosen form, which determines certain traits in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the creature shares your initiative count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge]] action and uses its move to avoid danger.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, use the higher level wherever the spell's level appears in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gilded skull worth at least 300 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sword_burst_tce\",\"name\":\"Sword Burst\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Conjuration Cantrip • Action • Self — You create a momentary circle of spectral blades that sweep around you. All other creatures within 5 feet of you must succeed on a Dexterity saving th\",\"content\":\"*Conjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create a momentary circle of spectral blades that sweep around you. All other creatures within 5 feet of you must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d6 force damage.\\n\\nThis spell's damage increases by 1d6 when you reach 5th level (2d6), 11th level (3d6), and 17th level (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Artificer\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tasha_s_caustic_brew_tce\",\"name\":\"Tasha's Caustic Brew\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • Self — A stream of acid emanates from you in a line 30 feet long and 5 feet wide in a direction you choose. Each creature in the line must succeed on a Dexte\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of rotten food)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA stream of acid emanates from you in a line 30 feet long and 5 feet wide in a direction you choose. Each creature in the line must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be covered in acid for the spell's duration or until a creature uses its action to scrape or wash the acid off itself or another creature. A creature covered in the acid takes 2d4 acid damage at start of each of its turns.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 2d4 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of rotten food)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Artificer\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tasha_s_mind_whip_tce\",\"name\":\"Tasha's Mind Whip\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 90 feet — You psychically lash out at one creature you can see within range. The target must make an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, the target tak\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou psychically lash out at one creature you can see within range. The target must make an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 3d6 psychic damage, and it can't take a reaction until the end of its next turn. Moreover, on its next turn, it must choose whether it gets a move, an action, or a bonus action; it gets only one of the three. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage and suffers none of the spell's other effects.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 2nd. The creatures must be within 30 feet of each other when you target them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tasha_s_otherworldly_guise_tce\",\"name\":\"Tasha's Otherworldly Guise\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"TCE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — Uttering an incantation, you draw on the magic of the Lower Planes or Upper Planes (your choice) to transform yourself. You gain the following benefit\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an object engraved with a symbol of the Outer Planes, worth at least 500 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nUttering an incantation, you draw on the magic of the Lower Planes or Upper Planes (your choice) to transform yourself. You gain the following benefits until the spell ends:\\n\\n- You are immune to fire and poison damage (Lower Planes) or radiant and necrotic damage (Upper Planes).\\n- You are immune to the [[poisoned]] condition (Lower Planes) or the [[charmed]] condition (Upper Planes).\\n- Spectral wings appear on your back, giving you a flying speed of 40 feet.\\n- You have a +2 bonus to AC.\\n- All your weapon attacks are magical, and when you make a weapon attack, you can use your spellcasting ability modifier, instead of Strength or Dexterity, for the attack and damage rolls.\\n- You can attack twice, instead of once, when you take the [[Attack]] action on your turn. You ignore this benefit if you already have a feature, like Extra Attack, that lets you attack more than once when you take the Attack action on your turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an object engraved with a symbol of the Outer Planes, worth at least 500 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"TCE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_abi_dalzim_s_horrid_wilting_xge\",\"name\":\"Abi-Dalzim's Horrid Wilting\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Necromancy • Action • 150 feet — You draw the moisture from every creature in a 30-foot cube centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in that area must make a Consti\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of sponge)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou draw the moisture from every creature in a 30-foot cube centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in that area must make a Constitution saving throw. Constructs and undead aren't affected, and plants and water elementals make this saving throw with disadvantage. A creature takes 12d8 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nNonmagical plants in the area that aren't creatures, such as trees and shrubs, wither and die instantly.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of sponge)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_absorb_elements_xge\",\"name\":\"Absorb Elements\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Reaction, which you take when you take acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder damage • Self — The spell captures some of the incoming energy, lessening its effect on you and storing it for your next melee attack. You have resistance to the trig\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when you take acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder damage\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nThe spell captures some of the incoming energy, lessening its effect on you and storing it for your next melee attack. You have resistance to the triggering damage type until the start of your next turn. Also, the first time you hit with a melee attack on your next turn, the target takes an extra 1d6 damage of the triggering type, and the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the extra damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when you take acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder damage\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Reaction\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aganazzar_s_scorcher_xge\",\"name\":\"Aganazzar's Scorcher\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 30 feet — A line of roaring flame 30 feet long and 5 feet wide emanates from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the line must make a Dexterity savi\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a red dragon's scale)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA line of roaring flame 30 feet long and 5 feet wide emanates from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the line must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 3d8 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a red dragon's scale)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_beast_bond_xge\",\"name\":\"Beast Bond\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action • Touch — You establish a telepathic link with one beast you touch that is friendly to you or charmed by you. The spell fails if the beast's Intelligence score \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fur wrapped in a cloth)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou establish a telepathic link with one beast you touch that is friendly to you or [[charmed]] by you. The spell fails if the beast's Intelligence score is 4 or higher. Until the spell ends, the link is active while you and the beast are within line of sight of each other. Through the link, the beast can understand your telepathic messages to it, and it can telepathically communicate simple emotions and concepts back to you. While the link is active, the beast gains advantage on attack rolls against any creature within 5 feet of you that you can see.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fur wrapped in a cloth)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_bones_of_the_earth_xge\",\"name\":\"Bones of the Earth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — You cause up to six pillars of stone to burst from places on the ground that you can see within range. Each pillar is a cylinder that has a diameter o\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou cause up to six pillars of stone to burst from places on the ground that you can see within range. Each pillar is a cylinder that has a diameter of 5 feet and a height of up to 30 feet. The ground where a pillar appears must be wide enough for its diameter, and you can target the ground under a creature if that creature is Medium or smaller. Each pillar has AC 5 and 30 hit points. When reduced to 0 hit points, a pillar crumbles into rubble, which creates an area of difficult terrain with a 10-foot radius that lasts until the rubble is cleared. Each 5-foot-diameter portion of the area requires at least 1 minute to clear by hand.\\n\\nIf a pillar is created under a creature, that creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be lifted by the pillar. A creature can choose to fail the save.\\n\\nIf a pillar is prevented from reaching its full height because of a ceiling or other obstacle, a creature on the pillar takes 6d6 bludgeoning damage and is [[restrained]], pinched between the pillar and the obstacle. The [[restrained]] creature can use an action to make a Strength or Dexterity check (the creature's choice) against the spell's save DC. On a success, the creature is no longer [[restrained]] and must either move off the pillar or fall off it.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, you can create two additional pillars for each slot level above 6th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_catapult_xge\",\"name\":\"Catapult\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — Choose one object weighing 1 to 5 pounds within range that isn't being worn or carried. The object flies in a straight line up to 90 feet in a directi\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose one object weighing 1 to 5 pounds within range that isn't being worn or carried. The object flies in a straight line up to 90 feet in a direction you choose before falling to the ground, stopping early if it impacts against a solid surface. If the object would strike a creature, that creature must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the object strikes the target and stops moving. When the object strikes something, the object and what it strikes each take 3d8 bludgeoning damage.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the maximum weight of objects that you can target with this spell increases by 5 pounds, and the damage increases by 1d8, for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_catnap_xge\",\"name\":\"Catnap\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You make a calming gesture, and up to three willing creatures of your choice that you can see within range fall unconscious for the spell's duration. \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a pinch of sand)\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou make a calming gesture, and up to three willing creatures of your choice that you can see within range fall [[unconscious]] for the spell's duration. The spell ends on a target early if it takes damage or someone uses an action to shake or slap it awake. If a target remains [[unconscious]] for the full duration, that target gains the benefit of a short rest, and it can't be affected by this spell again until it finishes a long rest.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, you can target one additional willing creature for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a pinch of sand)\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cause_fear_xge\",\"name\":\"Cause Fear\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You awaken the sense of mortality in one creature you can see within range. A construct or an undead is immune to this effect. The target must succeed\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou awaken the sense of mortality in one creature you can see within range. A construct or an undead is immune to this effect. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become [[frightened]] of you until the spell ends. The [[frightened]] target can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 1st. The creatures must be within 30 feet of each other when you target them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ceremony_xge\",\"name\":\"Ceremony\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • 1 hour or Ritual • Touch — You perform a special religious ceremony that is infused with magic. When you cast the spell, choose one of the following rites, the target of which m\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (25 gp worth of powdered silver, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou perform a special religious ceremony that is infused with magic. When you cast the spell, choose one of the following rites, the target of which must be within 10 feet of you throughout the casting.\\n\\n***Atonement.*** You touch one willing creature whose alignment has changed, and you make a DC 20 Wisdom ([[Insight]]) check. On a successful check, you restore the target to its original alignment.\\n\\n***Bless Water.*** You touch one [[vial|PHB]] of water and cause it to become [[Holy Water (flask)|PHB|holy water]].\\n\\n***Coming of Age.*** You touch one humanoid who is a young adult. For the next 24 hours, whenever the target makes an ability check, it can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to the ability check. A creature can benefit from this rite only once.\\n\\n***Dedication.*** You touch one humanoid who wishes to be dedicated to your god's service. For the next 24 hours, whenever the target makes a saving throw, it can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to the save. A creature can benefit from this rite only once.\\n\\n***Funeral Rite.*** You touch one corpse, and for the next 7 days, the target can't become undead by any means short of a [[wish]] spell.\\n\\n***Wedding.*** You touch adult humanoids willing to be bonded together in marriage. For the next 7 days, each target gains a +2 bonus to AC while they are within 30 feet of each other. A creature can benefit from this rite again only if widowed.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (25 gp worth of powdered silver, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_chaos_bolt_xge\",\"name\":\"Chaos Bolt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You hurl an undulating, warbling mass of chaotic energy at one creature in range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hurl an undulating, warbling mass of chaotic energy at one creature in range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 2d8 + 1d6 damage. Choose one of the d8s. The number rolled on that die determines the attack's damage type, as shown below.\\n\\n##### Chaos Bolt\\n|  d8 | Damage Type |\\n|:---:|-------------|\\n|  1  | Acid        |\\n|  2  | Cold        |\\n|  3  | Fire        |\\n|  4  | Force       |\\n|  5  | Lightning   |\\n|  6  | Poison      |\\n|  7  | Psychic     |\\n|  8  | Thunder     |\\n\\nIf you roll the same number on both d8s, the chaotic energy leaps from the target to a different creature of your choice within 30 feet of it. Make a new attack roll against the new target, and make a new damage roll, which could cause the chaotic energy to leap again.\\n\\nA creature can be targeted only once by each casting of this spell.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, each target takes 1d6 extra damage of the type rolled for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8 + 1\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_charm_monster_xge\",\"name\":\"Charm Monster\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You attempt to charm a creature you can see within range. It must make a Wisdom saving throw, and it does so with advantage if you or your companions \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou attempt to charm a creature you can see within range. It must make a Wisdom saving throw, and it does so with advantage if you or your companions are fighting it. If it fails the saving throw, it is [[charmed]] by you until the spell ends or until you or your companions do anything harmful to it. The [[charmed]] creature is friendly to you. When the spell ends, the creature knows it was [[charmed]] by you.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 4th. The creatures must be within 30 feet of each other when you target them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_control_flames_xge\",\"name\":\"Control Flames\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You choose nonmagical flame that you can see within range and that fits within a 5-foot cube. You affect it in one of the following ways: - You instan\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous or 1 hour (see below)\\nYou choose nonmagical flame that you can see within range and that fits within a 5-foot cube. You affect it in one of the following ways:\\n\\n- You instantaneously expand the flame 5 feet in one direction, provided that wood or other fuel is present in the new location.\\n- You instantaneously extinguish the flames within the cube.\\n- You double or halve the area of bright light and dim light cast by the flame, change its color, or both. The change lasts for 1 hour.\\n- You cause simple shapes—such as the vague form of a creature, an inanimate object, or a location—to appear within the flames and animate as you like. The shapes last for 1 hour.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell multiple times, you can have up to three non-instantaneous effects created by it active at a time, and you can dismiss such an effect as an action.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous or 1 hour (see below)\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_control_winds_xge\",\"name\":\"Control Winds\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • 300 feet — You take control of the air in a 100-foot cube that you can see within range. Choose one of the following effects when you cast the spell. The effect \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou take control of the air in a 100-foot cube that you can see within range. Choose one of the following effects when you cast the spell. The effect lasts for the spell's duration, unless you use your action on a later turn to switch to a different effect. You can also use your action to temporarily halt the effect or to restart one you've halted.\\n\\n***Gusts.*** A wind picks up within the cube, continually blowing in a horizontal direction you designate. You choose the intensity of the wind: calm, moderate, or strong. If the wind is moderate or strong, ranged weapon attacks that pass through it or that are made against targets within the cube have disadvantage on their attack rolls. If the wind is strong, any creature moving against the wind must spend 1 extra foot of movement for each foot moved.\\n\\n***Downdraft.*** You cause a sustained blast of strong wind to blow downward from the top of the cube. Ranged weapon attacks that pass through the cube or that are made against targets within it have disadvantage on their attack rolls. A creature must make a Strength saving throw if it flies into the cube for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there flying. On a failed save, the creature is knocked [[prone]].\\n\\n***Updraft.*** You cause a sustained updraft within the cube, rising upward from the cube's bottom side. Creatures that end a fall within the cube take only half damage from the fall. When a creature in the cube makes a vertical jump, the creature can jump up to 10 feet higher than normal.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"100-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_bonfire_xge\",\"name\":\"Create Bonfire\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Conjuration Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You create a bonfire on ground that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, the magic bonfire fills a 5-foot cube. Any creature in the bonfire\",\"content\":\"*Conjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a bonfire on ground that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, the magic bonfire fills a 5-foot cube. Any creature in the bonfire's space when you cast the spell must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d8 fire damage. A creature must also make the saving throw when it moves into the bonfire's space for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there.\\n\\nThe bonfire ignites flammable objects in its area that aren't being worn or carried.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by 1d8 when you reach 5th level (2d8), 11th level (3d8), and 17th level (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_homunculus_xge\",\"name\":\"Create Homunculus\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • 1 hour • Touch — While speaking an intricate incantation, you cut yourself with a jewel-encrusted dagger, taking 2d4 piercing damage that can't be reduced in any way. \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (clay, ash, and mandrake root, all of which the spell consumes, and a jewel-encrusted dagger worth at least 1,000 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nWhile speaking an intricate incantation, you cut yourself with a jewel-encrusted dagger, taking 2d4 piercing damage that can't be reduced in any way. You then drip your blood on the spell's other components and touch them, transforming them into a special construct called a [[homunculus]].\\n\\nThe statistics of the [[homunculus]] are in the Monster Manual. It is your faithful companion, and it dies if you die. Whenever you finish a long rest, you can spend up to half your Hit Dice if the homunculus is on the same plane of existence as you. When you do so, roll each die and add your Constitution modifier to it. Your hit point maximum is reduced by the total, and the homunculus's hit point maximum and current hit points are both increased by it. This process can reduce you to no lower than 1 hit point, and the change to your and the homunculus's hit points ends when you finish your next long rest. The reduction to your hit point maximum can't be removed by any means before then, except by the homunculus's death.\\n\\nYou can have only one homunculus at a time. If you cast this spell while your homunculus lives, the spell fails.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (clay, ash, and mandrake root, all of which the spell consumes, and a jewel-encrusted dagger worth at least 1,000 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_crown_of_stars_xge\",\"name\":\"Crown of Stars\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • Self — Seven star-like motes of light appear and orbit your head until the spell ends. You can use a bonus action to send one of the motes streaking toward o\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nSeven star-like motes of light appear and orbit your head until the spell ends. You can use a bonus action to send one of the motes streaking toward one creature or object within 120 feet of you. When you do so, make a ranged spell attack. On a hit, the target takes 4d12 radiant damage. Whether you hit or miss, the mote is expended. The spell ends early if you expend the last mote.\\n\\nIf you have four or more motes remaining, they shed bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. If you have one to three motes remaining, they shed dim light in a 30-foot radius.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 8th level or higher, the number of motes created increases by two for each slot level above 7th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d12\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_danse_macabre_xge\",\"name\":\"Danse Macabre\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — Threads of dark power leap from your fingers to pierce up to five Small or Medium corpses you can see within range. Each corpse immediately stands up \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nThreads of dark power leap from your fingers to pierce up to five Small or Medium corpses you can see within range. Each corpse immediately stands up and becomes undead. You decide whether it is a [[zombie]] or a [[skeleton]] (the statistics for [[zombie||zombies]] and [[skeleton||skeletons]] are in the Monster Manual), and it gains a bonus to its attack and damage rolls equal to your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\nYou can use a bonus action to mentally command the creatures you make with this spell, issuing the same command to all of them. To receive the command, a creature must be within 60 feet of you. You decide what action the creatures will take and where they will move during their next turn, or you can issue a general command, such as to guard a chamber or passageway against your foes. If you issue no commands, the creatures do nothing except defend themselves against hostile creatures. Once given an order, the creatures continue to follow it until their task is complete.\\n\\nThe creatures are under your control until the spell ends, after which they become inanimate once more.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, you animate up to two additional corpses for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dawn_xge\",\"name\":\"Dawn\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — The light of dawn shines down on a location you specify within range. Until the spell ends, a 30-foot-radius, 40-foot-high cylinder of bright light gl\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sunburst pendant worth at least 100 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe light of dawn shines down on a location you specify within range. Until the spell ends, a 30-foot-radius, 40-foot-high cylinder of bright light glimmers there. This light is sunlight.\\n\\nWhen the cylinder appears, each creature in it must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 4d10 radiant damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature must also make this saving throw whenever it ends its turn in the cylinder.\\n\\nIf you're within 60 feet of the cylinder, you can move it up to 60 feet as a bonus action on your turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sunburst pendant worth at least 100 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d10\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dragon_s_breath_xge\",\"name\":\"Dragon's Breath\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Bonus action • Touch — You touch one willing creature and imbue it with the power to spew magical energy from its mouth, provided it has one. Choose acid, cold, fire, lightn\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a hot pepper)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou touch one willing creature and imbue it with the power to spew magical energy from its mouth, provided it has one. Choose acid, cold, fire, lightning, or poison. Until the spell ends, the creature can use an action to exhale energy of the chosen type in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 damage of the chosen type on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a hot pepper)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_druid_grove_xge\",\"name\":\"Druid Grove\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • 10 minutes • Touch — You invoke the spirits of nature to protect an area outdoors or underground. The area can be as small as a 30-foot cube or as large as a 90-foot cube.\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (mistletoe, which the spell consumes, that was harvested with a golden sickle under the light of a full moon)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou invoke the spirits of nature to protect an area outdoors or underground. The area can be as small as a 30-foot cube or as large as a 90-foot cube. Buildings and other structures are excluded from the affected area. If you cast this spell in the same area every day for a year, the spell lasts until dispelled.\\n\\nThe spell creates the following effects within the area. When you cast this spell, you can specify creatures as friends who are immune to the effects. You can also specify a password that, when spoken aloud, makes the speaker immune to these effects.\\n\\nThe entire warded area radiates magic. A [[dispel magic]] cast on the area, if successful, removes only one of the following effects, not the entire area. That spell's caster chooses which effect to end. Only when all its effects are gone is this spell dispelled.\\n\\n***Solid Fog.*** You can fill any number of 5-foot squares on the ground with thick fog, making them heavily obscured. The fog reaches 10 feet high. In addition, every foot of movement through the fog costs 2 extra feet. To a creature immune to this effect, the fog obscures nothing and looks like soft mist, with motes of green light floating in the air.\\n\\n***Grasping Undergrowth.*** You can fill any number of 5-foot squares on the ground that aren't filled with fog with grasping weeds and vines, as if they were affected by an [[entangle]] spell. To a creature immune to this effect, the weeds and vines feel soft and reshape themselves to serve as temporary seats or beds.\\n\\n***Grove Guardians.*** You can animate up to four trees in the area, causing them to uproot themselves from the ground. These trees have the same statistics as an [[awakened tree]], which appears in the Monster Manual, except they can't speak, and their bark is covered with druidic symbols. If any creature not immune to this effect enters the warded area, the grove guardians fight until they have driven off or slain the intruders. The grove guardians also obey your spoken commands (no action required by you) that you issue while in the area. If you don't give them commands and no intruders are present, the grove guardians do nothing. The grove guardians can't leave the warded area. When the spell ends, the magic animating them disappears, and the trees take root again if possible.\\n\\n***Additional Spell Effect.*** You can place your choice of one of the following magical effects within the warded area:\\n\\n- A constant [[gust of wind]] in two locations of your choice\\n- [[Spike growth]] in one location of your choice\\n- [[Wind wall]] in two locations of your choice\\n\\nTo a creature immune to this effect, the winds are a fragrant, gentle breeze, and the area of [[spike growth]] is harmless.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (mistletoe, which the spell consumes, that was harvested with a golden sickle under the light of a full moon)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dust_devil_xge\",\"name\":\"Dust Devil\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — Choose an unoccupied 5-foot cube of air that you can see within range. An elemental force that resembles a dust devil appears in the cube and lasts fo\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of dust)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose an unoccupied 5-foot cube of air that you can see within range. An elemental force that resembles a dust devil appears in the cube and lasts for the spell's duration.\\n\\nAny creature that ends its turn within 5 feet of the dust devil must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 1d8 bludgeoning damage and is pushed 10 feet away from the dust devil. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage and isn't pushed.\\n\\nAs a bonus action, you can move the dust devil up to 30 feet in any direction. If the dust devil moves over sand, dust, loose dirt, or light gravel, it sucks up the material and forms a 10-foot-radius cloud of debris around itself that lasts until the start of your next turn. The cloud heavily obscures its area.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of dust)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_earth_tremor_xge\",\"name\":\"Earth Tremor\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 10 feet — You cause a tremor in the ground within range. Each creature other than you in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creat\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou cause a tremor in the ground within range. Each creature other than you in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 1d6 bludgeoning damage and is knocked [[prone]]. If the ground in that area is loose earth or stone, it becomes difficult terrain until cleared, with each 5-foot-diameter portion requiring at least 1 minute to clear by hand.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_earthbind_xge\",\"name\":\"Earthbind\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 300 feet — Choose one creature you can see within range. Yellow strips of magical energy loop around the creature. The target must succeed on a Strength saving t\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose one creature you can see within range. Yellow strips of magical energy loop around the creature. The target must succeed on a Strength saving throw, or its flying speed (if any) is reduced to 0 feet for the spell's duration. An airborne creature affected by this spell safely descends at 60 feet per round until it reaches the ground or the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_elemental_bane_xge\",\"name\":\"Elemental Bane\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Action • 90 feet — Choose one creature you can see within range, and choose one of the following damage types: acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder. The target must s\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose one creature you can see within range, and choose one of the following damage types: acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or be affected by the spell for its duration. The first time each turn the affected target takes damage of the chosen type, the target takes an extra 2d6 damage of that type. Moreover, the target loses any resistance to that damage type until the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, you can target one additional creature for each slot level above 4th. The creatures must be within 30 feet of each other when you target them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_enemies_abound_xge\",\"name\":\"Enemies Abound\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Enchantment • Action • 120 feet — You reach into the mind of one creature you can see and force it to make an Intelligence saving throw. A creature automatically succeeds if it is immu\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou reach into the mind of one creature you can see and force it to make an Intelligence saving throw. A creature automatically succeeds if it is immune to being [[frightened]]. On a failed save, the target loses the ability to distinguish friend from foe, regarding all creatures it can see as enemies until the spell ends. Each time the target takes damage, it can repeat the saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n\\nWhenever the affected creature chooses another creature as a target, it must choose the target at random from among the creatures it can see within range of the attack, spell, or other ability it's using. If an enemy provokes an opportunity attack from the affected creature, the creature must make that attack if it is able to.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_enervation_xge\",\"name\":\"Enervation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — A tendril of inky darkness reaches out from you, touching a creature you can see within range to drain life from it. The target must make a Dexterity \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA tendril of inky darkness reaches out from you, touching a creature you can see within range to drain life from it. The target must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a successful save, the target takes 2d8 necrotic damage, and the spell ends. On a failed save, the target takes 4d8 necrotic damage, and until the spell ends, you can use your action on each of your turns to automatically deal 4d8 necrotic damage to the target. The spell ends if you use your action to do anything else, if the target is ever outside the spell's range, or if the target has total cover from you.\\n\\nWhenever the spell deals damage to a target, you regain hit points equal to half the amount of necrotic damage the target takes.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_erupting_earth_xge\",\"name\":\"Erupting Earth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — Choose a point you can see on the ground within range. A fountain of churned earth and stone erupts in a 20-foot cube centered on that point. Each cre\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of obsidian)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose a point you can see on the ground within range. A fountain of churned earth and stone erupts in a 20-foot cube centered on that point. Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 3d12 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. Additionally, the ground in that area becomes difficult terrain until cleared. Each 5-foot-square portion of the area requires at least 1 minute to clear by hand.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d12 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of obsidian)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d12\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_far_step_xge\",\"name\":\"Far Step\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Bonus action • Self — You teleport up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space you can see. On each of your turns before the spell ends, you can use a bonus action to teleport in \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou teleport up to 60 feet to an unoccupied space you can see. On each of your turns before the spell ends, you can use a bonus action to teleport in this way again.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_find_greater_steed_xge\",\"name\":\"Find Greater Steed\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • 10 minutes • 30 feet — You summon a spirit that assumes the form of a loyal, majestic mount. Appearing in an unoccupied space within range, the spirit takes on a form you ch\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou summon a spirit that assumes the form of a loyal, majestic mount. Appearing in an unoccupied space within range, the spirit takes on a form you choose: a [[griffon]], a [[pegasus]], a [[peryton]], a [[dire wolf]], a [[rhinoceros]], or a [[saber-toothed tiger]]. The creature has the statistics provided in the Monster Manual for the chosen form, though it is a celestial, a fey, or a fiend (your choice) instead of its normal creature type. Additionally, if it has an Intelligence score of 5 or lower, its Intelligence becomes 6, and it gains the ability to understand one language of your choice that you speak.\\n\\nYou control the mount in combat. While the mount is within 1 mile of you, you can communicate with it telepathically. While mounted on it, you can make any spell you cast that targets only you also target the mount.\\n\\nThe mount disappears temporarily when it drops to 0 hit points or when you dismiss it as an action. Casting this spell again re-summons the bonded mount, with all its hit points restored and any conditions removed.\\n\\nYou can't have more than one mount bonded by this spell or [[find steed]] at the same time. As an action, you can release a mount from its bond, causing it to disappear permanently.\\n\\nWhenever the mount disappears, it leaves behind any objects it was wearing or carrying.\\n\\n##### Dragonnel Steeds\\n\\nWith the DM's permission, a paladin can summon a spirit in the form of a [[dragonnel|FTD]] using the find greater steed spell, which appears in *Xanathar's Guide to Everything*.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Special\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flame_arrows_xge\",\"name\":\"Flame Arrows\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a quiver containing arrows or bolts. When a target is hit by a ranged weapon attack using a piece of ammunition drawn from the quiver, the t\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou touch a quiver containing arrows or bolts. When a target is hit by a ranged weapon attack using a piece of ammunition drawn from the quiver, the target takes an extra 1d6 fire damage. The spell's magic ends on a piece of ammunition when it hits or misses, and the spell ends when twelve pieces of ammunition have been drawn from the quiver.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the number of pieces of ammunition you can affect with this spell increases by two for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_frostbite_xge\",\"name\":\"Frostbite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You cause numbing frost to form on one creature that you can see within range. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou cause numbing frost to form on one creature that you can see within range. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 1d6 cold damage, and it has disadvantage on the next weapon attack roll it makes before the end of its next turn.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by 1d6 when you reach 5th level (2d6), 11th level (3d6), and 17th level (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_guardian_of_nature_xge\",\"name\":\"Guardian of Nature\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — A nature spirit answers your call and transforms you into a powerful guardian. The transformation lasts until the spell ends. You choose one of the fo\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA nature spirit answers your call and transforms you into a powerful guardian. The transformation lasts until the spell ends. You choose one of the following forms to assume: Primal Beast or Great Tree.\\n\\n***Primal Beast.*** Bestial fur covers your body, your facial features become feral, and you gain the following benefits:\\n\\n- Your walking speed increases by 10 feet.\\n- You gain [[darkvision]] with a range of 120 feet.\\n- You make Strength-based attack rolls with advantage.\\n- Your melee weapon attacks deal an extra 1d6 force damage on a hit.\\n\\n***Great Tree.*** Your skin appears barky, leaves sprout from your hair, and you gain the following benefits:\\n\\n- You gain 10 temporary hit points.\\n- You make Constitution saving throws with advantage.\\n- You make Dexterity- and Wisdom-based attack rolls with advantage.\\n- While you are on the ground, the ground within 15 feet of you is difficult terrain for your enemies.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gust_xge\",\"name\":\"Gust\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You seize the air and compel it to create one of the following effects at a point you can see within range: - One Medium or smaller creature that you \",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou seize the air and compel it to create one of the following effects at a point you can see within range:\\n\\n- One Medium or smaller creature that you choose must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pushed up to 5 feet away from you.\\n- You create a small blast of air capable of moving one object that is neither held nor carried and that weighs no more than 5 pounds. The object is pushed up to 10 feet away from you. It isn't pushed with enough force to cause damage.\\n- You create a harmless sensory effect using air, such as causing leaves to rustle, wind to slam shutters closed, or your clothing to ripple in a breeze.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_healing_spirit_xge\",\"name\":\"Healing Spirit\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Bonus action • 60 feet — You call forth a nature spirit to soothe the wounded. The intangible spirit appears in a space that is a 5-foot cube you can see within range. The spi\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou call forth a nature spirit to soothe the wounded. The intangible spirit appears in a space that is a 5-foot cube you can see within range. The spirit looks like a transparent beast or fey (your choice).\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, whenever you or a creature you can see moves into the spirit's space for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, you can cause the spirit to restore 1d6 hit points to that creature (no action required). The spirit can't heal constructs or undead. The spirit can heal a number of times equal to 1 + your spellcasting ability modifier (minimum of twice). After healing that number of times, the spirit disappears.\\n\\nAs a bonus action on your turn, you can move the spirit up to 30 feet to a space you can see.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the healing increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"healing\":\"1d6\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_holy_weapon_xge\",\"name\":\"Holy Weapon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Bonus action • Touch — You imbue a weapon you touch with holy power. Until the spell ends, the weapon emits bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou imbue a weapon you touch with holy power. Until the spell ends, the weapon emits bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. In addition, weapon attacks made with it deal an extra 2d8 radiant damage on a hit. If the weapon isn't already a magic weapon, it becomes one for the duration.\\n\\nAs a bonus action on your turn, you can dismiss this spell and cause the weapon to emit a burst of radiance. Each creature of your choice that you can see within 30 feet of the weapon must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 4d8 radiant damage, and it is [[blinded]] for 1 minute. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage and isn't [[blinded]]. At the end of each of its turns, a [[blinded]] creature can make a Constitution saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Paladin|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ice_knife_xge\",\"name\":\"Ice Knife\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You create a shard of ice and fling it at one creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 pi\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a drop of water or piece of ice)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create a shard of ice and fling it at one creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 piercing damage. Hit or miss, the shard then explodes. The target and each creature within 5 feet of it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 2d6 cold damage.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 2nd level or higher, the cold damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 1st.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a drop of water or piece of ice)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_illusory_dragon_xge\",\"name\":\"Illusory Dragon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — By gathering threads of shadow material from the Shadowfell, you create a Huge shadowy dragon in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. Th\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nBy gathering threads of shadow material from the Shadowfell, you create a Huge shadowy dragon in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The illusion lasts for the spell's duration and occupies its space, as if it were a creature.\\n\\nWhen the illusion appears, any of your enemies that can see it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become [[frightened]] of it for 1 minute. If a [[frightened]] creature ends its turn in a location where it doesn't have line of sight to the illusion, it can repeat the saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n\\nAs a bonus action on your turn, you can move the illusion up to 60 feet. At any point during its movement, you can cause it to exhale a blast of energy in a 60-foot cone originating from its space. When you create the dragon, choose a damage type: acid, cold, fire, lightning, necrotic, or poison. Each creature in the cone must make an Intelligence saving throw, taking 7d6 damage of the chosen damage type on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe illusion is tangible because of the shadow stuff used to create it, but attacks miss it automatically, it succeeds on all saving throws, and it is immune to all damage and conditions. A creature that uses an action to examine the dragon can determine that it is an illusion by succeeding on an Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through it and has advantage on saving throws against its breath.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"7d6\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_immolation_xge\",\"name\":\"Immolation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — Flames wreathe one creature you can see within range. The target must make a Dexterity saving throw. It takes 8d6 fire damage on a failed save, or hal\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFlames wreathe one creature you can see within range. The target must make a Dexterity saving throw. It takes 8d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. On a failed save, the target also burns for the spell's duration. The burning target sheds bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the saving throw. It takes 4d6 fire damage on a failed save, and the spell ends on a successful one. These magical flames can't be extinguished by nonmagical means.\\n\\nIf damage from this spell kills a target, the target is turned to ash.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_infernal_calling_xge\",\"name\":\"Infernal Calling\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • 1 minute • 90 feet — Uttering a dark incantation, you summon a devil from the Nine Hells. You choose the devil's type, which must be one of challenge rating 6 or lower, su\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a ruby worth at least 999 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nUttering a dark incantation, you summon a devil from the Nine Hells. You choose the devil's type, which must be one of challenge rating 6 or lower, such as a [[barbed devil]] or a [[bearded devil]]. The devil appears in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The devil disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe devil is unfriendly toward you and your companions. Roll initiative for the devil, which has its own turns. It is under the Dungeon Master's control and acts according to its nature on each of its turns, which might result in its attacking you if it thinks it can prevail, or trying to tempt you to undertake an evil act in exchange for limited service. The DM has the creature's statistics.\\n\\nOn each of your turns, you can try to issue a verbal command to the devil (no action required by you). It obeys the command if the likely outcome is in accordance with its desires, especially if the result would draw you toward evil. Otherwise, you must make a Charisma ([[Deception]], [[Intimidation]], or [[Persuasion]]) check contested by its Wisdom ([[Insight]]) check. You make the check with advantage if you say the devil's true name. If your check fails, the devil becomes immune to your verbal commands for the duration of the spell, though it can still carry out your commands if it chooses. If your check succeeds, the devil carries out your command—such as \\\"attack my enemies,\\\" \\\"explore the room ahead,\\\" or \\\"bear this message to the queen\\\"—until it completes the activity, at which point it returns to you to report having done so.\\n\\nIf your [[concentration]] ends before the spell reaches its full duration, the devil doesn't disappear if it has become immune to your verbal commands. Instead, it acts in whatever manner it chooses for 3d6 minutes, and then it disappears.\\n\\nIf you possess an individual devil's talisman, you can summon that devil if it is of the appropriate challenge rating plus 1, and it obeys all your commands, with no Charisma checks required.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the challenge rating increases by 1 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a ruby worth at least 999 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_infestation_xge\",\"name\":\"Infestation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Conjuration Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You cause a cloud of mites, fleas, and other parasites to appear momentarily on one creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Co\",\"content\":\"*Conjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a living flea)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou cause a cloud of mites, fleas, and other parasites to appear momentarily on one creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw, or it takes 1d6 poison damage and moves 5 feet in a random direction if it can move and its speed is at least 5 feet. Roll a d4 for the direction: 1, north; 2, south; 3, east; or 4, west. This movement doesn't provoke opportunity attacks, and if the direction rolled is blocked, the target doesn't move.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by 1d6 when you reach 5th level (2d6), 11th level (3d6), and 17th level (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a living flea)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Poison\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Poison Damage\",\"Poison\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_investiture_of_flame_xge\",\"name\":\"Investiture of Flame\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • Self — Flames race across your body, shedding bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet for the spell's duration. The flames d\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFlames race across your body, shedding bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for an additional 30 feet for the spell's duration. The flames don't harm you. Until the spell ends, you gain the following benefits:\\n\\n- You are immune to fire damage and have resistance to cold damage.\\n- Any creature that moves within 5 feet of you for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there takes 1d10 fire damage.\\n- You can use your action to create a line of fire 15 feet long and 5 feet wide extending from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the line must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 4d8 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_investiture_of_ice_xge\",\"name\":\"Investiture of Ice\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • Self — Until the spell ends, ice rimes your body, and you gain the following benefits: - You are immune to cold damage and have resistance to fire damage. - \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nUntil the spell ends, ice rimes your body, and you gain the following benefits:\\n\\n- You are immune to cold damage and have resistance to fire damage.\\n- You can move across difficult terrain created by ice or snow without spending extra movement.\\n- The ground in a 10-foot radius around you is icy and is difficult terrain for creatures other than you. The radius moves with you.\\n- You can use your action to create a 15-foot cone of freezing wind extending from your outstretched hand in a direction you choose. Each creature in the cone must make a Constitution saving throw. A creature takes 4d6 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature that fails its save against this effect has its speed halved until the start of your next turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot cone\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_investiture_of_stone_xge\",\"name\":\"Investiture of Stone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • Self — Until the spell ends, bits of rock spread across your body, and you gain the following benefits: - You have resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and s\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nUntil the spell ends, bits of rock spread across your body, and you gain the following benefits:\\n\\n- You have resistance to bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage from nonmagical attacks.\\n- You can use your action to create a small earthquake on the ground in a 15-foot radius centered on you. Other creatures on that ground must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be knocked [[prone]].\\n- You can move across difficult terrain made of earth or stone without spending extra movement. You can move through solid earth or stone as if it was air and without destabilizing it, but you can't end your movement there. If you do so, you are ejected to the nearest unoccupied space, this spell ends, and you are [[stunned]] until the end of your next turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_investiture_of_wind_xge\",\"name\":\"Investiture of Wind\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • Self — Until the spell ends, wind whirls around you, and you gain the following benefits: - Ranged weapon attacks made against you have disadvantage on the a\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nUntil the spell ends, wind whirls around you, and you gain the following benefits:\\n\\n- Ranged weapon attacks made against you have disadvantage on the attack roll.\\n- You gain a flying speed of 60 feet. If you are still flying when the spell ends, you fall, unless you can somehow prevent it.\\n- You can use your action to create a 15-foot cube of swirling wind centered on a point you can see within 60 feet of you. Each creature in that area must make a Constitution saving throw. A creature takes 2d10 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. If a Large or smaller creature fails the save, that creature is also pushed up to 10 feet away from the center of the cube.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"15-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_invulnerability_xge\",\"name\":\"Invulnerability\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Abjuration • Action • Self — You are immune to all damage until the spell ends.\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small piece of adamantine worth at least 500 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou are immune to all damage until the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small piece of adamantine worth at least 500 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_life_transference_xge\",\"name\":\"Life Transference\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • 30 feet — You sacrifice some of your health to mend another creature's injuries. You take 4d8 necrotic damage, which can't be reduced in any way, and one creatu\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou sacrifice some of your health to mend another creature's injuries. You take 4d8 necrotic damage, which can't be reduced in any way, and one creature of your choice that you can see within range regains a number of hit points equal to twice the necrotic damage you take.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_maddening_darkness_xge\",\"name\":\"Maddening Darkness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — Magical darkness spreads from a point you choose within range to fill a 60-foot-radius sphere until the spell ends. The darkness spreads around corner\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a drop of pitch mixed with a drop of mercury)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nMagical darkness spreads from a point you choose within range to fill a 60-foot-radius sphere until the spell ends. The darkness spreads around corners. A creature with [[darkvision]] can't see through this darkness. Non-magical light, as well as light created by spells of 8th level or lower, can't illuminate the area.\\n\\nShrieks, gibbering, and mad laughter can be heard within the sphere. Whenever a creature starts its turn in the sphere, it must make a Wisdom saving throw, taking 8d8 psychic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a drop of pitch mixed with a drop of mercury)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d8\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_maelstrom_xge\",\"name\":\"Maelstrom\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A swirling mass of 5-foot-deep water appears in a 30-foot radius centered on a point you can see within range. The point must be on the ground or in a\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (paper or leaf in the shape of a funnel)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA swirling mass of 5-foot-deep water appears in a 30-foot radius centered on a point you can see within range. The point must be on the ground or in a body of water. Until the spell ends, that area is difficult terrain, and any creature that starts its turn there must succeed on a Strength saving throw or take 6d6 bludgeoning damage and be pulled 10 feet toward the center.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (paper or leaf in the shape of a funnel)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_stone_xge\",\"name\":\"Magic Stone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Bonus action • Touch — You touch one to three pebbles and imbue them with magic. You or someone else can make a ranged spell attack with one of the pebbles by throwing it or\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou touch one to three pebbles and imbue them with magic. You or someone else can make a ranged spell attack with one of the pebbles by throwing it or hurling it with a [[sling|PHB]]. If thrown, a pebble has a range of 60 feet. If someone else attacks with a pebble, that attacker adds your spellcasting ability modifier, not the attacker's, to the attack roll. On a hit, the target takes bludgeoning damage equal to 1d6 + your spellcasting ability modifier. Whether the attack hits or misses, the spell then ends on the stone.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell again, the spell ends on any pebbles still affected by your previous casting.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Artificer\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mass_polymorph_xge\",\"name\":\"Mass Polymorph\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — You transform up to ten creatures of your choice that you can see within range. An unwilling target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw to resist th\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a caterpillar cocoon)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou transform up to ten creatures of your choice that you can see within range. An unwilling target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw to resist the transformation. An unwilling shapechanger automatically succeeds on the save.\\n\\nEach target assumes a beast form of your choice, and you can choose the same form or different ones for each target. The new form can be any beast you have seen whose challenge rating is equal to or less than the target's (or half the target's level, if the target doesn't have a challenge rating). The target's game statistics, including mental ability scores, are replaced by the statistics of the chosen beast, but the target retains its hit points, alignment, and personality.\\n\\nEach target gains a number of temporary hit points equal to the hit points of its new form. These temporary hit points can't be replaced by temporary hit points from another source. A target reverts to its normal form when it has no more temporary hit points or it dies. If the spell ends before then, the creature loses all its temporary hit points and reverts to its normal form.\\n\\nThe creature is limited in the actions it can perform by the nature of its new form. It can't speak, cast spells, or do anything else that requires hands or speech.\\n\\nThe target's gear melds into the new form. The target can't activate, use, wield, or otherwise benefit from any of its equipment.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a caterpillar cocoon)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_maximilian_s_earthen_grasp_xge\",\"name\":\"Maximilian's Earthen Grasp\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — You choose a 5-foot-square unoccupied space on the ground that you can see within range. A Medium hand made from compacted soil rises there and reache\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature hand sculpted from clay)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou choose a 5-foot-square unoccupied space on the ground that you can see within range. A Medium hand made from compacted soil rises there and reaches for one creature you can see within 5 feet of it. The target must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 2d6 bludgeoning damage and is [[restrained]] for the spell's duration.\\n\\nAs an action, you can cause the hand to crush the [[restrained]] target, which must make a Strength saving throw. The target takes 2d6 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nTo break out, the [[restrained]] target can use its action to make a Strength check against your spell save DC. On a success, the target escapes and is no longer [[restrained]] by the hand.\\n\\nAs an action, you can cause the hand to reach for a different creature or to move to a different unoccupied space within range. The hand releases a [[restrained]] target if you do either.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature hand sculpted from clay)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_melf_s_minute_meteors_xge\",\"name\":\"Melf's Minute Meteors\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Self — You create six tiny meteors in your space. They float in the air and orbit you for the spell's duration. When you cast the spell—and as a bonus action\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (niter, sulfur, and pine tar formed into a bead)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create six tiny meteors in your space. They float in the air and orbit you for the spell's duration. When you cast the spell—and as a bonus action on each of your turns thereafter—you can expend one or two of the meteors, sending them streaking toward a point or points you choose within 120 feet of you. Once a meteor reaches its destination or impacts against a solid surface, the meteor explodes. Each creature within 5 feet of the point where the meteor explodes must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 2d6 fire damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the number of meteors created increases by two for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (niter, sulfur, and pine tar formed into a bead)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mental_prison_xge\",\"name\":\"Mental Prison\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Illusion • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to bind a creature within an illusory cell that only it perceives. One creature you can see within range must make an Intelligence saving \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to bind a creature within an illusory cell that only it perceives. One creature you can see within range must make an Intelligence saving throw. The target succeeds automatically if it is immune to being [[charmed]]. On a successful save, the target takes 5d10 psychic damage, and the spell ends. On a failed save, the target takes 5d10 psychic damage, and you make the area immediately around the target's space appear dangerous to it in some way. You might cause the target to perceive itself as being surrounded by fire, floating razors, or hideous maws filled with dripping teeth. Whatever form the illusion takes, the target can't see or hear anything beyond it and is [[restrained]] for the spell's duration. If the target is moved out of the illusion, makes a melee attack through it, or reaches any part of its body through it, the target takes 10d10 psychic damage, and the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mighty_fortress_xge\",\"name\":\"Mighty Fortress\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • 1 minute • 1 mile — A fortress of stone erupts from a square area of ground of your choice that you can see within range. The area is 120 feet on each side, and it must n\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 1 mile\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 500 gp, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA fortress of stone erupts from a square area of ground of your choice that you can see within range. The area is 120 feet on each side, and it must not have any buildings or other structures on it. Any creatures in the area are harmlessly lifted up as the fortress rises.\\n\\nThe fortress has four turrets with square bases, each one 20 feet on a side and 30 feet tall, with one turret on each corner. The turrets are connected to each other by stone walls that are each 80 feet long, creating an enclosed area. Each wall is 1 foot thick and is composed of panels that are 10 feet wide and 20 feet tall. Each panel is contiguous with two other panels or one other panel and a turret. You can place up to four stone doors in the fortress's outer wall.\\n\\nA small keep stands inside the enclosed area. The keep has a square base that is 50 feet on each side, and it has three floors with 10-foot-high ceilings. Each of the floors can be divided into as many rooms as you like, provided each room is at least 5 feet on each side. The floors of the keep are connected by stone staircases, its walls are 6 inches thick, and interior rooms can have stone doors or open archways as you choose. The keep is furnished and decorated however you like, and it contains sufficient food to serve a nine-course banquet for up to 100 people each day. Furnishings, food, and other objects created by this spell crumble to dust if removed from the fortress.\\n\\nA staff of one hundred invisible servants obeys any command given to them by creatures you designate when you cast the spell. Each servant functions as if created by the [[unseen servant]] spell.\\n\\nThe walls, turrets, and keep are all made of stone that can be damaged. Each 10-foot-by-10-foot section of stone has AC 15 and 30 hit points per inch of thickness. It is immune to poison and psychic damage. Reducing a section of stone to 0 hit points destroys it and might cause connected sections to buckle and collapse at the DM's discretion.\\n\\nAfter 7 days or when you cast this spell somewhere else, the fortress harmlessly crumbles and sinks back into the ground, leaving any creatures that were inside it safely on the ground.\\n\\nCasting this spell on the same spot once every 7 days for a year makes the fortress permanent.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"1 mile\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth at least 500 gp, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mind_spike_xge\",\"name\":\"Mind Spike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • 60 feet — You reach into the mind of one creature you can see within range. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw, taking 3d8 psychic damage on a failed sa\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou reach into the mind of one creature you can see within range. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw, taking 3d8 psychic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. On a failed save, you also always know the target's location until the spell ends, but only while the two of you are on the same plane of existence. While you have this knowledge, the target can't become hidden from you, and if it's [[invisible]], it gains no benefit from that condition against you.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mold_earth_xge\",\"name\":\"Mold Earth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You choose a portion of dirt or stone that you can see within range and that fits within a 5-foot cube. You manipulate it in one of the following ways\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous or 1 hour (see below)\\nYou choose a portion of dirt or stone that you can see within range and that fits within a 5-foot cube. You manipulate it in one of the following ways:\\n\\n- If you target an area of loose earth, you can instantaneously excavate it, move it along the ground, and deposit it up to 5 feet away. This movement doesn't involve enough force to cause damage.\\n- You cause shapes, colors, or both to appear on the dirt or stone, spelling out words, creating images, or shaping patterns. The changes last for 1 hour.\\n- If the dirt or stone you target is on the ground, you cause it to become difficult terrain. Alternatively, you can cause the ground to become normal terrain if it is already difficult terrain. This change lasts for 1 hour.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell multiple times, you can have no more than two of its non-instantaneous effects active at a time, and you can dismiss such an effect as an action.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous or 1 hour (see below)\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_negative_energy_flood_xge\",\"name\":\"Negative Energy Flood\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You send ribbons of negative energy at one creature you can see within range. Unless the target is undead, it must make a Constitution saving throw, t\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a broken bone and a square of black silk)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou send ribbons of negative energy at one creature you can see within range. Unless the target is undead, it must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 5d12 necrotic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. A target killed by this damage rises up as a [[zombie]] at the start of your next turn. The zombie pursues whatever creature it can see that is closest to it. Statistics for the [[zombie]] are in the Monster Manual.\\n\\nIf you target an undead with this spell, the target doesn't make a saving throw. Instead, roll 5d12. The target gains half the total as temporary hit points.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a broken bone and a square of black silk)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d12\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_power_word_pain_xge\",\"name\":\"Power Word Pain\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You speak a word of power that causes waves of intense pain to assail one creature you can see within range. If the target has 100 hit points or fewer\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou speak a word of power that causes waves of intense pain to assail one creature you can see within range. If the target has 100 hit points or fewer, it is subject to crippling pain. Otherwise, the spell has no effect on it. A target is also unaffected if it is immune to being [[charmed]].\\n\\nWhile the target is affected by crippling pain, any speed it has can be no higher than 10 feet. The target also has disadvantage on attack rolls, ability checks, and saving throws, other than Constitution saving throws. Finally, if the target tries to cast a spell, it must first succeed on a Constitution saving throw, or the casting fails and the spell is wasted.\\n\\nA target suffering this pain can make a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a successful save, the pain ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_primal_savagery_xge\",\"name\":\"Primal Savagery\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • Self — You channel primal magic to cause your teeth or fingernails to sharpen, ready to deliver a corrosive attack. Make a melee spell attack against one cre\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou channel primal magic to cause your teeth or fingernails to sharpen, ready to deliver a corrosive attack. Make a melee spell attack against one creature within 5 feet of you. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 acid damage. After you make the attack, your teeth or fingernails return to normal.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by 1d10 when you reach 5th level (2d10), 11th level (3d10), and 17th level (4d10).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_primordial_ward_xge\",\"name\":\"Primordial Ward\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • Action • Self — You have resistance to acid, cold, fire, lightning, and thunder damage for the spell's duration. When you take damage of one of those types, you can u\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou have resistance to acid, cold, fire, lightning, and thunder damage for the spell's duration.\\n\\nWhen you take damage of one of those types, you can use your reaction to gain immunity to that type of damage, including against the triggering damage. If you do so, the resistances end, and you have the immunity until the end of your next turn, at which time the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_psychic_scream_xge\",\"name\":\"Psychic Scream\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Enchantment • Action • 90 feet — You unleash the power of your mind to blast the intellect of up to ten creatures of your choice that you can see within range. Creatures that have an \",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash the power of your mind to blast the intellect of up to ten creatures of your choice that you can see within range. Creatures that have an Intelligence score of 2 or lower are unaffected.\\n\\nEach target must make an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 14d6 psychic damage and is [[stunned]]. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage and isn't [[stunned]]. If a target is killed by this damage, its head explodes, assuming it has one.\\n\\nA [[stunned]] target can make an Intelligence saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a successful save, the stunning effect ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"14d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_pyrotechnics_xge\",\"name\":\"Pyrotechnics\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — Choose an area of nonmagical flame that you can see and that fits within a 5-foot cube within range. You can extinguish the fire in that area, and you\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose an area of nonmagical flame that you can see and that fits within a 5-foot cube within range. You can extinguish the fire in that area, and you create either fireworks or smoke when you do so.\\n\\n***Fireworks.*** The target explodes with a dazzling display of colors. Each creature within 10 feet of the target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or become [[blinded]] until the end of your next turn.\\n\\n***Smoke.*** Thick black smoke spreads out from the target in a 20-foot radius, moving around corners. The area of the smoke is heavily obscured. The smoke persists for 1 minute or until a strong wind disperses it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_scatter_xge\",\"name\":\"Scatter\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — The air quivers around up to five creatures of your choice that you can see within range. An unwilling creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThe air quivers around up to five creatures of your choice that you can see within range. An unwilling creature must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw to resist this spell. You teleport each affected target to an unoccupied space that you can see within 120 feet of you. That space must be on the ground or on a floor.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shadow_blade_xge\",\"name\":\"Shadow Blade\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Bonus action • Self — You weave together threads of shadow to create a sword of solidified gloom in your hand. This magic sword lasts until the spell ends. It counts as a s\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou weave together threads of shadow to create a sword of solidified gloom in your hand. This magic sword lasts until the spell ends. It counts as a simple melee weapon with which you are proficient. It deals 2d8 psychic damage on a hit and has the finesse, light, and thrown properties (range 20/60). In addition, when you use the sword to attack a target that is in dim light or darkness, you make the attack roll with advantage.\\n\\nIf you drop the weapon or throw it, it dissipates at the end of the turn. Thereafter, while the spell persists, you can use a bonus action to cause the sword to reappear in your hand.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a 3rd- or 4th-level spell slot, the damage increases to 3d8. When you cast it using a 5th- or 6th-level spell slot, the damage increases to 4d8. When you cast it using a spell slot of 7th level or higher, the damage increases to 5d8.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shadow_of_moil_xge\",\"name\":\"Shadow of Moil\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Necromancy • Action • Self — Flame-like shadows wreathe your body until the spell ends, causing you to become heavily obscured to others. The shadows turn dim light within 10 feet\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an undead eyeball encased in a gem worth at least 150 gp)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFlame-like shadows wreathe your body until the spell ends, causing you to become heavily obscured to others. The shadows turn dim light within 10 feet of you into darkness, and bright light in the same area to dim light.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you have resistance to radiant damage. In addition, whenever a creature within 10 feet of you hits you with an attack, the shadows lash out at that creature, dealing it 2d8 necrotic damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an undead eyeball encased in a gem worth at least 150 gp)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shape_water_xge\",\"name\":\"Shape Water\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You choose an area of water that you can see within range and that fits within a 5-foot cube. You manipulate it in one of the following ways: - You in\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous or 1 hour (see below)\\nYou choose an area of water that you can see within range and that fits within a 5-foot cube. You manipulate it in one of the following ways:\\n\\n- You instantaneously move or otherwise change the flow of the water as you direct, up to 5 feet in any direction. This movement doesn't have enough force to cause damage.\\n- You cause the water to form into simple shapes and animate at your direction. This change lasts for 1 hour.\\n- You change the water's color or opacity. The water must be changed in the same way throughout. This change lasts for 1 hour.\\n- You freeze the water, provided that there are no creatures in it. The water unfreezes in 1 hour.\\n\\nIf you cast this spell multiple times, you can have no more than two of its non-instantaneous effects active at a time, and you can dismiss such an effect as an action.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Chronurgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Graviturgy Magic|EGW]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Genasi (Water)|EEPC]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous or 1 hour (see below)\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sickening_radiance_xge\",\"name\":\"Sickening Radiance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — Dim, greenish light spreads within a 30-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range. The light spreads around corners, and it lasts\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nDim, greenish light spreads within a 30-foot-radius sphere centered on a point you choose within range. The light spreads around corners, and it lasts until the spell ends.\\n\\nWhen a creature moves into the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, that creature must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 4d10 radiant damage, and it suffers one level of [[exhaustion]] and emits a dim, greenish light in a 5-foot radius. This light makes it impossible for the creature to benefit from being [[invisible]]. The light and any levels of [[exhaustion]] caused by this spell go away when the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d10\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"30-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_skill_empowerment_xge\",\"name\":\"Skill Empowerment\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • Touch — Your magic deepens a creature's understanding of its own talent. You touch one willing creature and give it expertise in one skill of your choice; unt\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYour magic deepens a creature's understanding of its own talent. You touch one willing creature and give it expertise in one skill of your choice; until the spell ends, the creature doubles its proficiency bonus for ability checks it makes that use the chosen skill.\\n\\nYou must choose a skill in which the target is proficient and that isn't already benefiting from an effect, such as Expertise, that doubles its proficiency bonus.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_skywrite_xge\",\"name\":\"Skywrite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action or Ritual • Sight — You cause up to ten words to form in a part of the sky you can see. The words appear to be made of cloud and remain in place for the spell's duration.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Sight\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou cause up to ten words to form in a part of the sky you can see. The words appear to be made of cloud and remain in place for the spell's duration. The words dissipate when the spell ends. A strong wind can disperse the clouds and end the spell early.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Sight\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_snare_xge\",\"name\":\"Snare\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • 1 minute • Touch — As you cast this spell, you use the rope to create a circle with a 5-foot radius on the ground or the floor. When you finish casting, the rope disappe\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** S, M (25 feet of rope, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nAs you cast this spell, you use the rope to create a circle with a 5-foot radius on the ground or the floor. When you finish casting, the rope disappears and the circle becomes a magic trap.\\n\\nThis trap is nearly invisible, requiring a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation]]) check against your spell save DC to be discerned.\\n\\nThe trap triggers when a Small, Medium, or Large creature moves onto the ground or the floor in the spell's radius. That creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be magically hoisted into the air, leaving it hanging upside down 3 feet above the ground or the floor. The creature is [[restrained]] there until the spell ends.\\n\\nA [[restrained]] creature can make a Dexterity saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. Alternatively, the creature or someone else who can reach it can use an action to make an Intelligence ([[Arcana]]) check against your spell save DC. On a success, the [[restrained]] effect ends.\\n\\nAfter the trap is triggered, the spell ends when no creature is [[restrained]] by it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"S, M (25 feet of rope, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_snilloc_s_snowball_swarm_xge\",\"name\":\"Snilloc's Snowball Swarm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — A flurry of magic snowballs erupts from a point you choose within range. Each creature in a 5-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a De\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of ice or a small white rock chip)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA flurry of magic snowballs erupts from a point you choose within range. Each creature in a 5-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 3d6 cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 3rd level or higher, the damage increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 2nd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of ice or a small white rock chip)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_soul_cage_xge\",\"name\":\"Soul Cage\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • Reaction, which you take when a humanoid you can see within 60 feet of you dies • 60 feet — This spell snatches the soul of a humanoid as it dies and traps it inside the tiny cage you use for the material component. A stolen soul remains insi\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when a humanoid you can see within 60 feet of you dies\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tiny silver cage worth 100 gp)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nThis spell snatches the soul of a humanoid as it dies and traps it inside the tiny cage you use for the material component. A stolen soul remains inside the cage until the spell ends or until you destroy the cage, which ends the spell. While you have a soul inside the cage, you can exploit it in any of the ways described below. You can use a trapped soul up to six times. Once you exploit a soul for the sixth time, it is released, and the spell ends. While a soul is trapped, the dead humanoid it came from can't be revived.\\n\\n***Steal Life.*** You can use a bonus action to drain vigor from the soul and regain 2d8 hit points.\\n\\n***Query Soul.*** You ask the soul a question (no action required) and receive a brief telepathic answer, which you can understand regardless of the language used. The soul knows only what it knew in life, but it must answer you truthfully and to the best of its ability. The answer is no more than a sentence or two and might be cryptic.\\n\\n***Borrow Experience.*** You can use a bonus action to bolster yourself with the soul's life experience, making your next attack roll, ability check, or saving throw with advantage. If you don't use this benefit before the start of your next turn, it is lost.\\n\\n***Eyes of the Dead.*** You can use an action to name a place the humanoid saw in life, which creates an invisible sensor somewhere in that place if it is on the plane of existence you're currently on. The sensor remains for as long as you concentrate, up to 10 minutes (as if you were [[concentration||concentrating]] on a spell). You receive visual and auditory information from the sensor as if you were in its space using your senses.\\n\\nA creature that can see the sensor (such as one using [[see invisibility]] or [[truesight]]) sees a translucent image of the tormented humanoid whose soul you caged.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when a humanoid you can see within 60 feet of you dies\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tiny silver cage worth 100 gp)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\",\"healing\":\"2d8\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Reaction\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_steel_wind_strike_xge\",\"name\":\"Steel Wind Strike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — You flourish the weapon used in the casting and then vanish to strike like the wind. Choose up to five creatures you can see within range. Make a mele\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a melee weapon worth at least 1 sp)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou flourish the weapon used in the casting and then vanish to strike like the wind. Choose up to five creatures you can see within range. Make a melee spell attack against each target. On a hit, a target takes 6d10 force damage.\\n\\nYou can then teleport to an unoccupied space you can see within 5 feet of one of the targets you hit or missed.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a melee weapon worth at least 1 sp)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_storm_sphere_xge\",\"name\":\"Storm Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — A 20-foot-radius sphere of whirling air springs into existence, centered on a point you choose within range. The sphere remains for the spell's durati\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA 20-foot-radius sphere of whirling air springs into existence, centered on a point you choose within range. The sphere remains for the spell's duration. Each creature in the sphere when it appears or that ends its turn there must succeed on a Strength saving throw or take 2d6 bludgeoning damage. The sphere's space is difficult terrain.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can use a bonus action on each of your turns to cause a bolt of lightning to leap from the center of the sphere toward one creature you choose within 60 feet of the center. Make a ranged spell attack. You have advantage on the attack roll if the target is in the sphere. On a hit, the target takes 4d6 lightning damage.\\n\\nCreatures within 30 feet of the sphere have disadvantage on Wisdom ([[Perception]]) checks made to listen.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the damage for each of its effects increases by 1d6 for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_greater_demon_xge\",\"name\":\"Summon Greater Demon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You utter foul words, summoning one demon from the chaos of the Abyss. You choose the demon's type, which must be one of challenge rating 5 or lower, \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a vial of blood from a humanoid killed within the past 24 hours)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou utter foul words, summoning one demon from the chaos of the Abyss. You choose the demon's type, which must be one of challenge rating 5 or lower, such as a [[shadow demon]] or a [[barlgura]]. The demon appears in an unoccupied space you can see within range, and the demon disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nRoll initiative for the demon, which has its own turns. When you summon it and on each of your turns thereafter, you can issue a verbal command to it (requiring no action on your part), telling it what it must do on its next turn. If you issue no command, it spends its turn attacking any creature within reach that has attacked it.\\n\\nAt the end of each of the demon's turns, it makes a Charisma saving throw. The demon has disadvantage on this saving throw if you say its true name. On a failed save, the demon continues to obey you. On a successful save, your control of the demon ends for the rest of the duration, and the demon spends its turns pursuing and attacking the nearest non-demons to the best of its ability. If you stop [[concentration||concentrating]] on the spell before it reaches its full duration, an uncontrolled demon doesn't disappear for 1d6 rounds if it still has hit points.\\n\\nAs part of casting the spell, you can form a circle on the ground with the blood used as a material component. The circle is large enough to encompass your space. While the spell lasts, the summoned demon can't cross the circle or harm it, and it can't target anyone within it. Using the material component in this manner consumes it when the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the challenge rating increases by 1 for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a vial of blood from a humanoid killed within the past 24 hours)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_lesser_demons_xge\",\"name\":\"Summon Lesser Demons\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You utter foul words, summoning demons from the chaos of the Abyss. Roll on the following table to determine what appears. | d6 | Demons Summoned | |:\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a vial of blood from a humanoid killed within the past 24 hours)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou utter foul words, summoning demons from the chaos of the Abyss. Roll on the following table to determine what appears.\\n\\n|  d6 | Demons Summoned                               |\\n|:---:|-----------------------------------------------|\\n| 1-2 | Two demons of challenge rating 1 or lower     |\\n| 3-4 | Four demons of challenge rating 1/2 or lower  |\\n| 5-6 | Eight demons of challenge rating 1/4 or lower |\\n\\nThe DM chooses the demons, such as [[manes]] or [[dretch||dretches]], and you choose the unoccupied spaces you can see within range where they appear. A summoned demon disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe demons are hostile to all creatures, including you. Roll initiative for the summoned demons as a group, which has its own turns. The demons pursue and attack the nearest non-demons to the best of their ability.\\n\\nAs part of casting the spell, you can form a circle on the ground with the blood used as a material component. The circle is large enough to encompass your space. While the spell lasts, the summoned demons can't cross the circle or harm it, and they can't target anyone within it. Using the material component in this manner consumes it when the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th or 7th level, you summon twice as many demons. If you cast it using a spell slot of 8th or 9th level, you summon three times as many demons.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a vial of blood from a humanoid killed within the past 24 hours)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_synaptic_static_xge\",\"name\":\"Synaptic Static\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • Action • 120 feet — You choose a point within range and cause psychic energy to explode there. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make a\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou choose a point within range and cause psychic energy to explode there. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius sphere centered on that point must make an Intelligence saving throw. A creature with an Intelligence score of 2 or lower can't be affected by this spell. A target takes 8d6 psychic damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nAfter a failed save, a target has muddled thoughts for 1 minute. During that time, it rolls a d6 and subtracts the number rolled from all its attack rolls and ability checks, as well as its Constitution saving throws to maintain [[concentration]]. The target can make an Intelligence saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_temple_of_the_gods_xge\",\"name\":\"Temple of the Gods\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • 1 hour • 120 feet — You cause a temple to shimmer into existence on ground you can see within range. The temple must fit within an unoccupied cube of space, up to 120 fee\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a holy symbol worth at least 5 gp)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou cause a temple to shimmer into existence on ground you can see within range. The temple must fit within an unoccupied cube of space, up to 120 feet on each side. The temple remains until the spell ends. It is dedicated to whatever god, pantheon, or philosophy is represented by the holy symbol used in the casting.\\n\\nYou make all decisions about the temple's appearance. The interior is enclosed by a floor, walls, and a roof, with one door granting access to the interior and as many windows as you wish. Only you and any creatures you designate when you cast the spell can open or close the door.\\n\\nThe temple's interior is an open space with an idol or altar at one end. You decide whether the temple is illuminated and whether that illumination is bright light or dim light. The smell of burning incense fills the air within, and the temperature is mild.\\n\\nThe temple opposes types of creatures you choose when you cast this spell. Choose one or more of the following: celestials, elementals, fey, fiends, or undead. If a creature of the chosen type attempts to enter the temple, that creature must make a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, it can't enter the temple for 24 hours. Even if the creature can enter the temple, the magic there hinders it; whenever it makes an attack roll, an ability check, or a saving throw inside the temple, it must roll a d4 and subtract the number rolled from the d20 roll.\\n\\nIn addition, the sensors created by divination spells can't appear inside the temple, and creatures within can't be targeted by divination spells.\\n\\nFinally, whenever any creature in the temple regains hit points from a spell of 1st level or higher, the creature regains additional hit points equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum 1 hit point).\\n\\nThe temple is made from opaque magical force that extends into the Ethereal Plane, thus blocking ethereal travel into the temple's interior. Nothing can physically pass through the temple's exterior. It can't be dispelled by [[dispel magic]], and [[antimagic field]] has no effect on it. A [[disintegrate]] spell destroys the temple instantly.\\n\\nCasting this spell on the same spot every day for a year makes this effect permanent.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a holy symbol worth at least 5 gp)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tenser_s_transformation_xge\",\"name\":\"Tenser's Transformation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • Self — You endow yourself with endurance and martial prowess fueled by magic. Until the spell ends, you can't cast spells, and you gain the following benefit\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a few hairs from a bull)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou endow yourself with endurance and martial prowess fueled by magic. Until the spell ends, you can't cast spells, and you gain the following benefits:\\n\\n- You gain 50 temporary hit points. If any of these remain when the spell ends, they are lost.\\n- You have advantage on attack rolls that you make with simple and martial weapons.\\n- When you hit a target with a weapon attack, that target takes an extra 2d12 force damage.\\n- You have proficiency with all armor, shields, simple weapons, and martial weapons.\\n- You have proficiency in Strength and Constitution saving throws.\\n- You can attack twice, instead of once, when you take the [[Attack]] action on your turn. You ignore this benefit if you already have a feature, like Extra Attack, that gives you extra attacks.\\n\\nImmediately after the spell ends, you must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or suffer one level of [[exhaustion]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a few hairs from a bull)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d12\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thunder_step_xge\",\"name\":\"Thunder Step\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You teleport yourself to an unoccupied space you can see within range. Immediately after you disappear, a thunderous boom sounds, and each creature wi\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou teleport yourself to an unoccupied space you can see within range. Immediately after you disappear, a thunderous boom sounds, and each creature within 10 feet of the space you left must make a Constitution saving throw, taking 3d10 thunder damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. The thunder can be heard from up to 300 feet away.\\n\\nYou can bring along objects as long as their weight doesn't exceed what you can carry. You can also teleport one willing creature of your size or smaller who is carrying gear up to its carrying capacity. The creature must be within 5 feet of you when you cast this spell, and there must be an unoccupied space within 5 feet of your destination space for the creature to appear in; otherwise, the creature is left behind.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d10 for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thunderclap_xge\",\"name\":\"Thunderclap\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 5 feet — You create a burst of thunderous sound that can be heard up to 100 feet away. Each creature within range, other than you, must make a Constitution sav\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 5 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create a burst of thunderous sound that can be heard up to 100 feet away. Each creature within range, other than you, must make a Constitution saving throw or take 1d6 thunder damage.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by 1d6 when you reach 5th level (2d6), 11th level (3d6), and 17th level (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"5 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tidal_wave_xge\",\"name\":\"Tidal Wave\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — You conjure up a wave of water that crashes down on an area within range. The area can be up to 30 feet long, up to 10 feet wide, and up to 10 feet ta\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of water)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou conjure up a wave of water that crashes down on an area within range. The area can be up to 30 feet long, up to 10 feet wide, and up to 10 feet tall. Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 4d8 bludgeoning damage and is knocked [[prone]]. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage and isn't knocked [[prone]]. The water then spreads out across the ground in all directions, extinguishing unprotected flames in its area and within 30 feet of it, and then it vanishes.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of water)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tiny_servant_xge\",\"name\":\"Tiny Servant\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • 1 minute • Touch — You touch one Tiny, nonmagical object that isn't attached to another object or a surface and isn't being carried by another creature. The target anima\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch one Tiny, nonmagical object that isn't attached to another object or a surface and isn't being carried by another creature. The target animates and sprouts little arms and legs, becoming a creature under your control until the spell ends or the creature drops to 0 hit points. See the [[tiny servant|XGE|stat block]] for its statistics.\\n\\nAs a bonus action, you can mentally command the creature if it is within 120 feet of you. (If you control multiple creatures with this spell, you can command any or all of them at the same time, issuing the same command to each one.) You decide what action the creature will take and where it will move during its next turn, or you can issue a simple, general command, such as to fetch a key, stand watch, or stack some books. If you issue no commands, the servant does nothing other than defend itself against hostile creatures. Once given an order, the servant continues to follow that order until its task is complete.\\n\\nWhen the creature drops to 0 hit points, it reverts to its original form, and any remaining damage carries over to that form.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 4th level or higher, you can animate two additional objects for each slot level above 3rd.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_toll_the_dead_xge\",\"name\":\"Toll the Dead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Necromancy Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You point at one creature you can see within range, and the sound of a dolorous bell fills the air around it for a moment. The target must succeed on \",\"content\":\"*Necromancy Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou point at one creature you can see within range, and the sound of a dolorous bell fills the air around it for a moment. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or take 1d8 necrotic damage. If the target is missing any of its hit points, it instead takes 1d12 necrotic damage.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by one die when you reach 5th level (2d8 or 2d12), 11th level (3d8 or 3d12), and 17th level (4d8 or 4d12).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Arcane Undertaker|AU]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Necromancy\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_transmute_rock_xge\",\"name\":\"Transmute Rock\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — You choose an area of stone or mud that you can see that fits within a 40-foot cube and is within range, and choose one of the following effects. Tran\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (clay and water)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou choose an area of stone or mud that you can see that fits within a 40-foot cube and is within range, and choose one of the following effects.\\n\\n***Transmute Rock to Mud.*** Nonmagical rock of any sort in the area becomes an equal volume of thick, flowing mud that remains for the spell's duration.\\n\\nThe ground in the spell's area becomes muddy enough that creatures can sink into it. Each foot that a creature moves through the mud costs 4 feet of movement, and any creature on the ground when you cast the spell must make a Strength saving throw. A creature must also make the saving throw when it moves into the area for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there. On a failed save, a creature sinks into the mud and is [[restrained]], though it can use an action to end the [[restrained]] condition on itself by pulling itself free of the mud.\\n\\nIf you cast the spell on a ceiling, the mud falls. Any creature under the mud when it falls must make a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 4d8 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***Transmute Mud to Rock.*** Nonmagical mud or quicksand in the area no more than 10 feet deep transforms into soft stone for the spell's duration. Any creature in the mud when it transforms must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a successful save, a creature is shunted safely to the surface in an unoccupied space. On a failed save, a creature becomes [[restrained]] by the rock. A [[restrained]] creature, or another creature within reach, can use an action to try to break the rock by succeeding on a DC 20 Strength check or by dealing damage to it. The rock has AC 15 and 25 hit points, and it is immune to poison and psychic damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Artificer|TCE]] (TCE), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (clay and water)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"40-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_vitriolic_sphere_xge\",\"name\":\"Vitriolic Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — You point at a location within range, and a glowing 1-foot-diameter ball of emerald acid streaks there and explodes in a 20-foot-radius sphere. Each c\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of giant slug bile)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou point at a location within range, and a glowing 1-foot-diameter ball of emerald acid streaks there and explodes in a 20-foot-radius sphere. Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 10d4 acid damage and another 5d4 acid damage at the end of its next turn. On a successful save, a creature takes half the initial damage and no damage at the end of its next turn.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 5th level or higher, the initial damage increases by 2d4 for each slot level above 4th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of giant slug bile)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d4\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot-radius sphere\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_light_xge\",\"name\":\"Wall of Light\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A shimmering wall of bright light appears at a point you choose within range. The wall appears in any orientation you choose: horizontally, vertically\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a hand mirror)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA shimmering wall of bright light appears at a point you choose within range. The wall appears in any orientation you choose: horizontally, vertically, or diagonally. It can be free floating, or it can rest on a solid surface. The wall can be up to 60 feet long, 10 feet high, and 5 feet thick. The wall blocks line of sight, but creatures and objects can pass through it. It emits bright light out to 120 feet and dim light for an additional 120 feet.\\n\\nWhen the wall appears, each creature in its area must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 4d8 radiant damage, and it is [[blinded]] for 1 minute. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage and isn't [[blinded]]. A [[blinded]] creature can make a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n\\nA creature that ends its turn in the wall's area takes 4d8 radiant damage.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can use an action to launch a beam of radiance from the wall at one creature you can see within 60 feet of it. Make a ranged spell attack. On a hit, the target takes 4d8 radiant damage. Whether you hit or miss, reduce the length of the wall by 10 feet. If the wall's length drops to 0 feet, the spell ends.\\n***At Higher Levels.*** When you cast this spell using a spell slot of 6th level or higher, the damage increases by 1d8 for each slot level above 5th.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Warlock|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a hand mirror)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_sand_xge\",\"name\":\"Wall of Sand\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — You create a wall of swirling sand on the ground at a point you can see within range. You can make the wall up to 30 feet long, 10 feet high, and 10 f\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a handful of sand)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a wall of swirling sand on the ground at a point you can see within range. You can make the wall up to 30 feet long, 10 feet high, and 10 feet thick, and it vanishes when the spell ends. It blocks line of sight but not movement. A creature is [[blinded]] while in the wall's space and must spend 3 feet of movement for every 1 foot it moves there.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a handful of sand)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_water_xge\",\"name\":\"Wall of Water\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — You create a wall of water on the ground at a point you can see within range. You can make the wall up to 30 feet long, 10 feet high, and 1 foot thick\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of water)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a wall of water on the ground at a point you can see within range. You can make the wall up to 30 feet long, 10 feet high, and 1 foot thick, or you can make a ringed wall up to 20 feet in diameter, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick. The wall vanishes when the spell ends. The wall's space is difficult terrain.\\n\\nAny ranged weapon attack that enters the wall's space has disadvantage on the attack roll, and fire damage is halved if the fire effect passes through the wall to reach its target. Spells that deal cold damage that pass through the wall cause the area of the wall they pass through to freeze solid (at least a 5-foot-square section is frozen). Each 5-foot-square frozen section has AC 5 and 15 hit points. Reducing a frozen section to 0 hit points destroys it. When a section is destroyed, the wall's water doesn't fill it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Triton|MOT]], [[Triton|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of water)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_warding_wind_xge\",\"name\":\"Warding Wind\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • Self — A strong wind (20 miles per hour) blows around you in a 10-foot radius and moves with you, remaining centered on you. The wind lasts for the spell's d\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA strong wind (20 miles per hour) blows around you in a 10-foot radius and moves with you, remaining centered on you. The wind lasts for the spell's duration.\\n\\nThe wind has the following effects:\\n\\n- It [[deafened||deafens]] you and other creatures in its area.\\n- It extinguishes unprotected flames in its area that are torch-sized or smaller.\\n- It hedges out vapor, gas, and fog that can be dispersed by strong wind.\\n- The area is difficult terrain for creatures other than you.\\n- The attack rolls of ranged weapon attacks have disadvantage if the attacks pass in or out of the wind.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_watery_sphere_xge\",\"name\":\"Watery Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You conjure up a sphere of water with a 5-foot radius at a point you can see within range. The sphere can hover but no more than 10 feet off the groun\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a droplet of water)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou conjure up a sphere of water with a 5-foot radius at a point you can see within range. The sphere can hover but no more than 10 feet off the ground. The sphere remains for the spell's duration.\\n\\nAny creature in the sphere's space must make a Strength saving throw. On a successful save, a creature is ejected from that space to the nearest unoccupied space of the creature's choice outside the sphere. A Huge or larger creature succeeds on the saving throw automatically, and a Large or smaller creature can choose to fail it. On a failed save, a creature is [[restrained]] by the sphere and is engulfed by the water. At the end of each of its turns, a [[restrained]] target can repeat the saving throw, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n\\nThe sphere can restrain as many as four Medium or smaller creatures or one Large creature. If the sphere restrains a creature that causes it to exceed this capacity, a random creature that was already [[restrained]] by the sphere falls out of it and lands [[prone]] in a space within 5 feet of it.\\n\\nAs an action, you can move the sphere up to 30 feet in a straight line. If it moves over a pit, a cliff, or other drop-off, it safely descends until it is hovering 10 feet above the ground. Any creature [[restrained]] by the sphere moves with it. You can ram the sphere into creatures, forcing them to make the saving throw.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the sphere falls to the ground and extinguishes all normal flames within 30 feet of it. Any creature [[restrained]] by the sphere is knocked [[prone]] in the space where it falls. The water then vanishes.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a droplet of water)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_whirlwind_xge\",\"name\":\"Whirlwind\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • 300 feet — A whirlwind howls down to a point that you can see on the ground within range. The whirlwind is a 10-foot-radius, 30-foot-high cylinder centered on th\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a piece of straw)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA whirlwind howls down to a point that you can see on the ground within range. The whirlwind is a 10-foot-radius, 30-foot-high cylinder centered on that point. Until the spell ends, you can use your action to move the whirlwind up to 30 feet in any direction along the ground. The whirlwind sucks up any Medium or smaller objects that aren't secured to anything and that aren't worn or carried by anyone.\\n\\nA creature must make a Dexterity saving throw the first time on a turn that it enters the whirlwind or that the whirlwind enters its space, including when the whirlwind first appears. A creature takes 10d6 bludgeoning damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one. In addition, a Large or smaller creature that fails the save must succeed on a Strength saving throw or become [[restrained]] in the whirlwind until the spell ends. When a creature starts its turn [[restrained]] by the whirlwind, the creature is pulled 5 feet higher inside it, unless the creature is at the top. A [[restrained]] creature moves with the whirlwind and falls when the spell ends, unless the creature has some means to stay aloft.\\n\\nA [[restrained]] creature can use an action to make a Strength or Dexterity check against your spell save DC. If successful, the creature is no longer [[restrained]] by the whirlwind and is hurled 3d6 × 10 feet away from it in a random direction.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Sorcerer|PHB]] (PHB), [[Wizard|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a piece of straw)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_word_of_radiance_xge\",\"name\":\"Word of Radiance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 5 feet — You utter a divine word, and burning radiance erupts from you. Each creature of your choice that you can see within range must succeed on a Constituti\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 5 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a holy symbol)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou utter a divine word, and burning radiance erupts from you. Each creature of your choice that you can see within range must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 1d6 radiant damage.\\n\\nThe spell's damage increases by 1d6 when you reach 5th level (2d6), 11th level (3d6), and 17th level (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|PHB]] (PHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Khoravar|EFA]]\\n**Feats:** [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"5 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a holy symbol)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wrath_of_nature_xge\",\"name\":\"Wrath of Nature\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You call out to the spirits of nature to rouse them against your enemies. Choose a point you can see within range. The spirits cause trees, rocks, and\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou call out to the spirits of nature to rouse them against your enemies. Choose a point you can see within range. The spirits cause trees, rocks, and grasses in a 60-foot cube centered on that point to become animated until the spell ends.\\n\\n***Grasses and Undergrowth.*** Any area of ground in the cube that is covered by grass or undergrowth is difficult terrain for your enemies.\\n\\n***Trees.*** At the start of each of your turns, each of your enemies within 10 feet of any tree in the cube must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 4d6 slashing damage from whipping branches.\\n\\n***Roots and Vines.*** At the end of each of your turns, one creature of your choice that is on the ground in the cube must succeed on a Strength saving throw or become [[restrained]] until the spell ends. A [[restrained]] creature can use an action to make a Strength ([[Athletics]]) check against your spell save DC, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n\\n***Rocks.*** As a bonus action on your turn, you can cause a loose rock in the cube to launch at a creature you can see in the cube. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 3d8 nonmagical bludgeoning damage, and it must succeed on a Strength saving throw or fall [[prone]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Slashing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"60-foot cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Slashing Damage\",\"Slashing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_zephyr_strike_xge\",\"name\":\"Zephyr Strike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XGE\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — You move like the wind. Until the spell ends, your movement doesn't provoke opportunity attacks. Once before the spell ends, you can give yourself adv\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou move like the wind. Until the spell ends, your movement doesn't provoke opportunity attacks.\\n\\nOnce before the spell ends, you can give yourself advantage on one weapon attack roll on your turn. That attack deals an extra 1d8 force damage on a hit. Whether you hit or miss, your walking speed increases by 30 feet until the end of that turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|PHB]] (PHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XGE\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Ranger\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_acid_splash_xphb\",\"name\":\"Acid Splash\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You create an acidic bubble at a point within range, where it explodes in a 5-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]. Each creature in th\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create an acidic bubble at a point within range, where it explodes in a 5-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]. Each creature in that [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d6 Acid damage.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Genasi (Water)|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aid_xphb\",\"name\":\"Aid\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • 30 feet — Choose up to three creatures within range. Each target's Hit Point maximum and current Hit Points increase by 5 for the duration.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a strip of white cloth)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nChoose up to three creatures within range. Each target's [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] maximum and current [[Hit Points|XPHB]] increase by 5 for the duration.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Each target's [[Hit Points|XPHB]] increase by 5 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a strip of white cloth)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_alarm_xphb\",\"name\":\"Alarm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • 1 minute or Ritual • 30 feet — You set an alarm against intrusion. Choose a door, a window, or an area within range that is no larger than a 20-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cub\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bell and silver wire)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou set an alarm against intrusion. Choose a door, a window, or an area within range that is no larger than a 20-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. Until the spell ends, an alarm alerts you whenever a creature touches or enters the warded area. When you cast the spell, you can designate creatures that won't set off the alarm. You also choose whether the alarm is audible or mental:\\n\\n- **Audible Alarm.** The alarm produces the sound of a handbell for 10 seconds within 60 feet of the warded area.\\n- **Mental Alarm.** You are alerted by a mental ping if you are within 1 mile of the warded area. This ping awakens you if you're asleep.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bell and silver wire)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_alter_self_xphb\",\"name\":\"Alter Self\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Self — You alter your physical form. Choose one of the following options. Its effects last for the duration, during which you can take a Magic action to repl\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou alter your physical form. Choose one of the following options. Its effects last for the duration, during which you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to replace the option you chose with a different one.\\n\\n***Aquatic Adaptation.*** You sprout gills and grow webs between your fingers. You can breathe underwater and gain a [[Swim Speed|XPHB]] equal to your [[Speed|XPHB]].\\n\\n***Change Appearance.*** You alter your appearance. You decide what you look like, including your height, weight, facial features, sound of your voice, hair length, coloration, and other distinguishing characteristics. You can make yourself appear as a member of another species, though none of your statistics change. You can't appear as a creature of a different size, and your basic shape stays the same; if you're bipedal, you can't use this spell to become quadrupedal, for instance. For the duration, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to change your appearance in this way again.\\n\\n***Natural Weapons.*** You grow claws (Slashing), fangs (Piercing), horns (Piercing), or hooves (Bludgeoning). When you use your [[Unarmed Strike|XPHB]] to deal damage with that new growth, it deals 1d6 damage of the type in parentheses instead of dealing the normal damage for your [[Unarmed Strike|XPHB]], and you use your spellcasting ability modifier for the attack and damage rolls rather than using Strength.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Hollow Warden|RHW]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Moon|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Second Skin|RHW]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Master of Myriad Forms|PHB]], [[Master of Myriad Forms|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animal_friendship_xphb\",\"name\":\"Animal Friendship\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — Target a Beast that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration. If you \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a morsel of food)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nTarget a Beast that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. If you or one of your allies deals damage to the target, the spell ends.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional Beast for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]], [[Yuan-Ti|MPMM]], [[Yuan-ti Pureblood|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a morsel of food)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animal_messenger_xphb\",\"name\":\"Animal Messenger\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — A Tiny Beast of your choice that you can see within range must succeed on a Charisma saving throw, or it attempts to deliver a message for you (if the\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a morsel of food)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nA Tiny Beast of your choice that you can see within range must succeed on a Charisma saving throw, or it attempts to deliver a message for you (if the target's [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]] isn't 0, it automatically succeeds). You specify a location you have visited and a recipient who matches a general description, such as \\\"a person dressed in the uniform of the town guard\\\" or \\\"a red-haired dwarf wearing a pointed hat.\\\" You also communicate a message of up to twenty-five words. The Beast travels for the duration toward the specified location, covering about 25 miles per 24 hours or 50 miles if the Beast can fly.\\n\\nWhen the Beast arrives, it delivers your message to the creature that you described, mimicking your communication. If the Beast doesn't reach its destination before the spell ends, the message is lost, and the Beast returns to where you cast the spell.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The spell's duration increases by 48 hours for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a morsel of food)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animal_shapes_xphb\",\"name\":\"Animal Shapes\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — Choose any number of willing creatures that you can see within range. Each target shape-shifts into a Large or smaller Beast of your choice that has a\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nChoose any number of willing creatures that you can see within range. Each target shape-shifts into a Large or smaller Beast of your choice that has a [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]] of 4 or lower. You can choose a different form for each target. On later turns, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to transform the targets again.\\n\\nA target's game statistics are replaced by the chosen Beast's statistics, but the target retains its creature type; [[Hit Points|XPHB]]; [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]]; alignment; ability to communicate; and Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores. The target's actions are limited by the Beast form's anatomy, and it can't cast spells. The target's equipment melds into the new form, and the target can't use any of that equipment while in that form.\\n\\nThe target gains a number of [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to the [[Hit Points|XPHB]] of the first form into which it shape-shifts. These [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] vanish if any remain when the spell ends. The transformation lasts for the duration or until the target ends it as a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animate_dead_xphb\",\"name\":\"Animate Dead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • 1 minute • 10 feet — Choose a pile of bones or a corpse of a Medium or Small Humanoid within range. The target becomes an Undead creature: a Skeleton if you chose bones or\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of blood, a piece of flesh, and a pinch of bone dust)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose a pile of bones or a corpse of a Medium or Small Humanoid within range. The target becomes an Undead creature: a [[Skeleton|XMM]] if you chose bones or a [[Zombie|XMM]] if you chose a corpse.\\n\\nOn each of your turns, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to mentally command any creature you made with this spell if the creature is within 60 feet of you (if you control multiple creatures, you can command any of them at the same time, issuing the same command to each one). You decide what action the creature will take and where it will move on its next turn, or you can issue a general command, such as to guard a chamber or corridor. If you issue no commands, the creature takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and moves only to avoid harm. Once given an order, the creature continues to follow it until its task is complete.\\n\\nThe creature is under your control for 24 hours, after which it stops obeying any command you've given it. To maintain control of the creature for another 24 hours, you must cast this spell on the creature again before the current 24-hour period ends. This use of the spell reasserts your control over up to four creatures you have animated with this spell rather than animating a new creature.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You animate or reassert control over two additional Undead creatures for each spell slot level above 3. Each of the creatures must come from a different corpse or pile of bones.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Undying Servitude|TCE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of blood, a piece of flesh, and a pinch of bone dust)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_animate_objects_xphb\",\"name\":\"Animate Objects\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — Objects animate at your command. Choose a number of nonmagical objects within range that aren't being worn or carried, aren't fixed to a surface, and \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nObjects animate at your command. Choose a number of nonmagical objects within range that aren't being worn or carried, aren't fixed to a surface, and aren't Gargantuan. The maximum number of objects is equal to your spellcasting ability modifier; for this number, a Medium or smaller target counts as one object, a Large target counts as two, and a Huge target counts as three.\\n\\nEach target animates, sprouts legs, and becomes a Construct that uses the [[Animated Object|XPHB]] stat block; this creature is under your control until the spell ends or until it is reduced to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]]. Each creature you make with this spell is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, it shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count and takes its turn immediately after yours.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to mentally command any creature you made with this spell if the creature is within 500 feet of you (if you control multiple creatures, you can command any of them at the same time, issuing the same command to each one). If you issue no commands, the creature takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and moves only to avoid harm. When the creature drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], it reverts to its object form, and any remaining damage carries over to that form.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The creature's Slam damage increases by 1d4 (Medium or smaller), 1d6 (Large), or 1d12 (Huge) for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Transmutation Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_antilife_shell_xphb\",\"name\":\"Antilife Shell\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • Self — An aura extends from you in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. The aura prevents creatures other than Construct\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nAn aura extends from you in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. The aura prevents creatures other than Constructs and Undead from passing or reaching through it. An affected creature can cast spells or make attacks with Ranged or Reach weapons through the barrier.\\n\\nIf you move so that an affected creature is forced to pass through the barrier, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_antimagic_field_xphb\",\"name\":\"Antimagic Field\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Abjuration • Action • Self — An aura of antimagic surrounds you in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. No one can cast spells, take Magic actions, or create o\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (iron filings)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nAn aura of antimagic surrounds you in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. No one can cast spells, take [[Magic|XPHB]] actions, or create other magical effects inside the aura, and those things can't target or otherwise affect anything inside it. Magical properties of magic items don't work inside the aura or on anything inside it.\\n\\nAreas of effect created by spells or other magic can't extend into the aura, and no one can teleport into or out of it or use planar travel there. Portals close temporarily while in the aura.\\n\\nOngoing spells, except those cast by an Artifact or a deity, are suppressed in the area. While an effect is suppressed, it doesn't function, but the time it spends suppressed counts against its duration.\\n\\n[[Dispel Magic|XPHB]] has no effect on the aura, and the auras created by different [[Antimagic Field|XPHB]] spells don't nullify each other.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (iron filings)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_antipathy_sympathy_xphb\",\"name\":\"Antipathy/Sympathy\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Enchantment • 1 hour • 60 feet — As you cast the spell, choose whether it creates antipathy or sympathy, and target one creature or object that is Huge or smaller. Then specify a kind\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a mix of vinegar and honey)\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nAs you cast the spell, choose whether it creates antipathy or sympathy, and target one creature or object that is Huge or smaller. Then specify a kind of creature, such as red dragons, goblins, or vampires. A creature of the chosen kind makes a Wisdom saving throw when it comes within 120 feet of the target. Your choice of antipathy or sympathy determines what happens to a creature when it fails that save:\\n\\n- **Antipathy.** The creature has the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition. The [[Frightened|XPHB]] creature must use its movement on its turns to get as far away as possible from the target, moving by the safest route.\\n- **Sympathy.** The creature has the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition. The [[Charmed|XPHB]] creature must use its movement on its turns to get as close as possible to the target, moving by the safest route. If the creature is within 5 feet of the target, the creature can't willingly move away. If the target damages the [[Charmed|XPHB]] creature, that creature can make a Wisdom saving throw to end the effect, as described below.\\n\\n***Ending the Effect.*** If the [[Frightened|XPHB]] or [[Charmed|XPHB]] creature ends its turn more than 120 feet away from the target, the creature makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the creature is no longer affected by the target. A creature that successfully saves against this effect is immune to it for 1 minute, after which it can be affected again.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a mix of vinegar and honey)\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 8\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_arcane_eye_xphb\",\"name\":\"Arcane Eye\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Divination • Action • 30 feet — You create an Invisible, invulnerable eye within range that hovers for the duration. You mentally receive visual information from the eye, which can s\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of bat fur)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou create an [[Invisible|XPHB]], invulnerable eye within range that hovers for the duration. You mentally receive visual information from the eye, which can see in every direction. It also has [[Darkvision|XPHB]] with a range of 30 feet.\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you can move the eye up to 30 feet in any direction. A solid barrier blocks the eye's movement, but the eye can pass through an opening as small as 1 inch in diameter.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]], [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Visions of Distant Realms|PHB]], [[Visions of Distant Realms|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of bat fur)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_arcane_gate_xphb\",\"name\":\"Arcane Gate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 500 feet — You create linked teleportation portals. Choose two Large, unoccupied spaces on the ground that you can see, one space within range and the other one \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 500 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create linked teleportation portals. Choose two Large, unoccupied spaces on the ground that you can see, one space within range and the other one within 10 feet of you. A circular portal opens in each of those spaces and remains for the duration.\\n\\nThe portals are two-dimensional glowing rings filled with mist that blocks sight. They hover inches from the ground and are perpendicular to it.\\n\\nA portal is open on only one side (you choose which). Anything entering the open side of a portal exits from the open side of the other portal as if the two were adjacent to each other. As a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you can change the facing of the open sides.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"500 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_arcane_lock_xphb\",\"name\":\"Arcane Lock\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a closed door, window, gate, container, or hatch and magically lock it for the duration. This lock can't be unlocked by any nonmagical means\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (gold dust worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou touch a closed door, window, gate, container, or hatch and magically lock it for the duration. This lock can't be unlocked by any nonmagical means. You and any creatures you designate when you cast the spell can open and close the object despite the lock. You can also set a password that, when spoken within 5 feet of the object, unlocks it for 1 minute.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]], [[Tiefling (Mammon)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (gold dust worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_arcane_vigor_xphb\",\"name\":\"Arcane Vigor\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Bonus action • Self — You tap into your life force to heal yourself. Roll one or two of your unexpended Hit Point Dice, and regain a number of Hit Points equal to the roll'\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou tap into your life force to heal yourself. Roll one or two of your unexpended [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]], and regain a number of [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to the roll's total plus your spellcasting ability modifier. Those dice are then expended.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The number of unexpended Hit Dice you can roll increases by one for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_armor_of_agathys_xphb\",\"name\":\"Armor of Agathys\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Bonus action • Self — Protective magical frost surrounds you. You gain 5 Temporary Hit Points. If a creature hits you with a melee attack roll before the spell ends, the cr\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a shard of blue glass)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nProtective magical frost surrounds you. You gain 5 [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]]. If a creature hits you with a melee attack roll before the spell ends, the creature takes 5 Cold damage. The spell ends early if you have no [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] and the Cold damage both increase by 5 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]], [[Tiefling (Levistus)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a shard of blue glass)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_arms_of_hadar_xphb\",\"name\":\"Arms of Hadar\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • Self — Invoking Hadar, you cause tendrils to erupt from yourself. Each creature in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from y\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nInvoking Hadar, you cause tendrils to erupt from yourself. Each creature in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you makes a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 2d6 Necrotic damage and can't take Reactions until the start of its next turn. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage only.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_astral_projection_xphb\",\"name\":\"Astral Projection\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Necromancy • 1 hour • 10 feet — You and up to eight willing creatures within range project your astral bodies into the Astral Plane (the spell ends instantly if you are already on th\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (for each of the spell's targets, one jacinth worth 1,000+ GP and one silver bar worth 100+ GP, all of which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou and up to eight willing creatures within range project your astral bodies into the Astral Plane (the spell ends instantly if you are already on that plane). Each target's body is left behind in a state of suspended animation; it has the [[Unconscious|XPHB]] condition, doesn't need food or air, and doesn't age.\\n\\nA target's astral form resembles its body in almost every way, replicating its game statistics and possessions. The principal difference is the addition of a silvery cord that trails from between the shoulder blades of the astral form. The cord fades from view after 1 foot. If the cord is cut—which happens only when an effect states that it does so—the target's body and astral form both die.\\n\\nA target's astral form can travel through the Astral Plane. The moment an astral form leaves that plane, the target's body and possessions travel along the silver cord, causing the target to re-enter its body on the new plane.\\n\\nAny damage or other effects that apply to an astral form have no effect on the target's body and vice versa. If a target's body or astral form drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], the spell ends for that target. The spell ends for all the targets if you take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to dismiss it.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends for a target who isn't dead, the target reappears in its body and exits the state of suspended animation.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (for each of the spell's targets, one jacinth worth 1,000+ GP and one silver bar worth 100+ GP, all of which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 9\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_augury_xphb\",\"name\":\"Augury\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — You receive an omen from an otherworldly entity about the results of a course of action that you plan to take within the next 30 minutes. The DM choos\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (specially marked sticks, bones, cards, or other divinatory tokens worth 25+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou receive an omen from an otherworldly entity about the results of a course of action that you plan to take within the next 30 minutes. The DM chooses the omen from the Omens table.\\n\\n##### Omens\\n| Omen         | For Results That Will Be... |\\n|--------------|-----------------------------|\\n| Weal         | Good                        |\\n| Woe          | Bad                         |\\n| Weal and woe | Good and bad                |\\n| Indifference | Neither good nor bad        |\\n\\nThe spell doesn't account for circumstances, such as other spells, that might change the results.\\n\\nIf you cast the spell more than once before finishing a [[Long Rest|XPHB]], there is a cumulative 25 percent chance for each casting after the first that you get no answer.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Ancestral Guardian|XGE]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Gathered Whispers|RHW]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (specially marked sticks, bones, cards, or other divinatory tokens worth 25+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aura_of_life_xphb\",\"name\":\"Aura of Life\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • Self — An aura radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and your allies have Res\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nAn aura radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and your allies have [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Necrotic damage, and your [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] maximums can't be reduced. If an ally with 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] starts its turn in the aura, that ally regains 1 [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]], [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"1\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aura_of_purity_xphb\",\"name\":\"Aura of Purity\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • Self — An aura radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and your allies have Res\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nAn aura radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and your allies have [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Poison damage and [[Advantage|XPHB]] on saving throws to avoid or end effects that include the [[Blinded|XPHB]], [[Charmed|XPHB]], [[Deafened|XPHB]], [[Frightened|XPHB]], [[Paralyzed|XPHB]], [[Poisoned|XPHB]], or [[Stunned|XPHB]] condition.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]], [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_aura_of_vitality_xphb\",\"name\":\"Aura of Vitality\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • Self — An aura radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. When you create the aura and at the start of ea\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nAn aura radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. When you create the aura and at the start of each of your turns while it persists, you can restore 2d6 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] to one creature in it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"2d6\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_awaken_xphb\",\"name\":\"Awaken\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • 8 hours • Touch — You spend the casting time tracing magical pathways within a precious gemstone, and then touch the target. The target must be either a Beast or Plant \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 8 hours\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an agate worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou spend the casting time tracing magical pathways within a precious gemstone, and then touch the target. The target must be either a Beast or Plant creature with an Intelligence of 3 or less or a natural plant that isn't a creature. The target gains an Intelligence of 10 and the ability to speak one language you know. If the target is a natural plant, it becomes a Plant creature and gains the ability to move its limbs, roots, vines, creepers, and so forth, and it gains senses similar to a human's. The DM chooses statistics appropriate for the awakened Plant, such as the statistics for the [[Awakened Shrub|XMM]] or [[Awakened Tree|XMM]] in the *Monster Manual*.\\n\\nThe awakened target has the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for 30 days or until you or your allies deal damage to it. When that condition ends, the awakened creature chooses its attitude toward you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"8 hours\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an agate worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_bane_xphb\",\"name\":\"Bane\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — Up to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range must each make a Charisma saving throw. Whenever a target that fails this save make\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of blood)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nUp to three creatures of your choice that you can see within range must each make a Charisma saving throw. Whenever a target that fails this save makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the target must subtract 1d4 from the attack roll or save.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Thief of Five Fates|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of blood)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_banishing_smite_xphb\",\"name\":\"Banishing Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a> • Self — The target hit by the attack roll takes an extra 5d10 Force damage from the attack. If the attack reduces the target to 50 Hit Points or fewer, the ta\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe target hit by the attack roll takes an extra 5d10 Force damage from the attack. If the attack reduces the target to 50 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or fewer, the target must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be transported to a harmless demiplane for the duration. While there, the target has the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition. When the spell ends, the target reappears in the space it left or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"5d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_banishment_xphb\",\"name\":\"Banishment\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • 30 feet — One creature that you can see within range must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be transported to a harmless demiplane for the duration. While t\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pentacle)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nOne creature that you can see within range must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be transported to a harmless demiplane for the duration. While there, the target has the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition. When the spell ends, the target reappears in the space it left or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied.\\n\\nIf the target is an Aberration, a Celestial, an Elemental, a Fey, or a Fiend, the target doesn't return if the spell lasts for 1 minute. The target is instead transported to a random location on a plane (DM's choice) associated with its creature type.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Abjuration Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pentacle)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_barkskin_xphb\",\"name\":\"Barkskin\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Bonus action • Touch — You touch a willing creature. Until the spell ends, the target's skin assumes a bark-like appearance, and the target has an Armor Class of 17 if its A\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a handful of oak bark)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a willing creature. Until the spell ends, the target's skin assumes a bark-like appearance, and the target has an [[Armor Class|XPHB]] of 17 if its AC is lower than that.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a handful of oak bark)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_beacon_of_hope_xphb\",\"name\":\"Beacon of Hope\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • 30 feet — Choose any number of creatures within range. For the duration, each target has Advantage on Wisdom saving throws and Death Saving Throws and regains t\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose any number of creatures within range. For the duration, each target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on Wisdom saving throws and [[Death Saving Throw|XPHB|Death Saving Throws]] and regains the maximum number of [[Hit Points|XPHB]] possible from any healing.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_beast_sense_xphb\",\"name\":\"Beast Sense\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action or Ritual • Touch — You touch a willing Beast. For the duration, you can perceive through the Beast's senses as well as your own. When perceiving through the Beast's sens\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou touch a willing Beast. For the duration, you can perceive through the Beast's senses as well as your own. When perceiving through the Beast's senses, you benefit from any special senses it has.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Totem Warrior|PHB]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Path of the Wild Heart|XPHB]] ([[Barbarian|XPHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Enclave Magic|FRHoF]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]], [[Watchers|RHW]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_befuddlement_xphb\",\"name\":\"Befuddlement\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Enchantment • Action • 150 feet — You blast the mind of a creature that you can see within range. The target makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 10d1\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a key ring with no keys)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou blast the mind of a creature that you can see within range. The target makes an Intelligence saving throw.\\n\\nOn a failed save, the target takes 10d12 Psychic damage and can't cast spells or take the [[Magic|XPHB]] action. At the end of every 30 days, the target repeats the save, ending the effect on a success. The effect can also be ended by the [[Greater Restoration|XPHB]], [[Heal|XPHB]], or [[Wish|XPHB]] spell.\\n\\nOn a successful save, the target takes half as much damage only.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a key ring with no keys)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d12\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_bestow_curse_xphb\",\"name\":\"Bestow Curse\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • Touch — You touch a creature, which must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become cursed for the duration. Until the curse ends, the target suffers one of t\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou touch a creature, which must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or become cursed for the duration. Until the curse ends, the target suffers one of the following effects of your choice:\\n\\n- Choose one ability. The target has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on ability checks and saving throws made with that ability.\\n- The target has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against you.\\n- In combat, the target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw at the start of each of its turns or be forced to take the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action on that turn.\\n- If you deal damage to the target with an attack roll or a spell, the target takes an extra 1d8 Necrotic damage.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** If you cast this spell using a level 4 spell slot, you can maintain [[Concentration|XPHB]] on it for up to 10 minutes. If you use a level 5+ spell slot, the spell doesn't require [[Concentration|XPHB]], and the duration becomes 8 hours (level 5-6 slot) or 24 hours (level 7-8 slot). If you use a level 9 spell slot, the spell lasts until dispelled.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Sign of Ill Omen|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_bigby_s_hand_xphb\",\"name\":\"Bigby's Hand\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You create a Large hand of shimmering magical energy in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The hand lasts for the duration, and it mov\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an eggshell and a glove)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a Large hand of shimmering magical energy in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The hand lasts for the duration, and it moves at your command, mimicking the movements of your own hand.\\n\\nThe hand is an object that has AC 20 and [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to your [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] maximum. If it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], the spell ends. The hand doesn't occupy its space.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell and as a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on your later turns, you can move the hand up to 60 feet and then cause one of the following effects:\\n\\n- **Clenched Fist.** The hand strikes a target within 5 feet of it. Make a melee spell attack. On a hit, the target takes 5d8 Force damage.\\n- **Forceful Hand.** The hand attempts to push a Huge or smaller creature within 5 feet of it. The target must succeed on a Strength saving throw, or the hand pushes the target up to 5 feet plus a number of feet equal to five times your spellcasting ability modifier. The hand moves with the target, remaining within 5 feet of it.\\n- **Grasping Hand.** The hand attempts to grapple a Huge or smaller creature within 5 feet of it. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw, or the target has the [[Grappled|XPHB]] condition, with an escape DC equal to your spell save DC. While the hand grapples the target, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to cause the hand to crush it, dealing Bludgeoning damage to the target equal to 4d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n- **Interposing Hand.** The hand grants you [[Cover|XPHB|Half Cover]] against attacks and other effects that originate from its space or that pass through it. In addition, its space counts as [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] for your enemies.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage of the Clenched Fist increases by 2d8 and the damage of the Grasping Hand increases by 2d6 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an eggshell and a glove)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blade_barrier_xphb\",\"name\":\"Blade Barrier\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — You create a wall of whirling blades made of magical energy. The wall appears within range and lasts for the duration. You make a straight wall up to \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a wall of whirling blades made of magical energy. The wall appears within range and lasts for the duration. You make a straight wall up to 100 feet long, 20 feet high, and 5 feet thick, or a ringed wall up to 60 feet in diameter, 20 feet high, and 5 feet thick. The wall provides Three-Quarters [[Cover|XPHB]], and its space is [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]].\\n\\nAny creature in the wall's space makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 6d10 Force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature also makes that save if it enters the wall's space or ends its turn there. A creature makes that save only once per turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blade_ward_xphb\",\"name\":\"Blade Ward\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Abjuration Cantrip • Action • Self — Whenever a creature makes an attack roll against you before the spell ends, the attacker subtracts 1d4 from the attack roll.\",\"content\":\"*Abjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nWhenever a creature makes an attack roll against you before the spell ends, the attacker subtracts 1d4 from the attack roll.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Scion of the Three|FRHoF]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Genasi (Earth)|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_bless_xphb\",\"name\":\"Bless\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You bless up to three creatures within range. Whenever a target makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the target adds 1d4 to t\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a Holy Symbol worth 5+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou bless up to three creatures within range. Whenever a target makes an attack roll or a saving throw before the spell ends, the target adds 1d4 to the attack roll or save.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a Holy Symbol worth 5+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blight_xphb\",\"name\":\"Blight\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Necromancy • Action • 30 feet — A creature that you can see within range makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 8d8 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a su\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA creature that you can see within range makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 8d8 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A Plant creature automatically fails the save.\\n\\nAlternatively, target a nonmagical plant that isn't a creature, such as a tree or shrub. It doesn't make a save; it simply withers and dies.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Necromancy Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]], [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blinding_smite_xphb\",\"name\":\"Blinding Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a> • Self — The target hit by the strike takes an extra 3d8 Radiant damage from the attack, and the target has the Blinded condition until the spell ends. At the \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nThe target hit by the strike takes an extra 3d8 Radiant damage from the attack, and the target has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends. At the end of each of its turns, the [[Blinded|XPHB]] target makes a Constitution saving throw, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The extra damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blindness_deafness_xphb\",\"name\":\"Blindness/Deafness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — One creature that you can see within range must succeed on a Constitution saving throw, or it has the Blinded or Deafened condition (your choice) for \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nOne creature that you can see within range must succeed on a Constitution saving throw, or it has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] or [[Deafened|XPHB]] condition (your choice) for the duration. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Deep)|DMG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Svirfneblin Magic|MTF]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blink_xphb\",\"name\":\"Blink\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Self — Roll 1d6 at the end of each of your turns for the duration. On a roll of 4-6, you vanish from your current plane of existence and appear in the Ethere\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nRoll 1d6 at the end of each of your turns for the duration. On a roll of 4-6, you vanish from your current plane of existence and appear in the Ethereal Plane (the spell ends instantly if you are already on that plane). While on the Ethereal Plane, you can perceive the plane you left, which is cast in shades of gray, but you can't see anything there more than 60 feet away. You can affect and be affected only by other creatures on the Ethereal Plane, and creatures on the other plane can't perceive you unless they have a special ability that lets them perceive things on the Ethereal Plane.\\n\\nYou return to the other plane at the start of your next turn and when the spell ends if you are on the Ethereal Plane. You return to an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within 10 feet of the space you left. If no unoccupied space is available within that range, you appear in the nearest unoccupied space.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_blur_xphb\",\"name\":\"Blur\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • Self — Your body becomes blurred. For the duration, any creature has Disadvantage on attack rolls against you. An attacker is immune to this effect if it per\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYour body becomes blurred. For the duration, any creature has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against you. An attacker is immune to this effect if it perceives you with [[Blindsight|XPHB]] or [[Truesight|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Deep)|DMG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Svirfneblin Magic|MTF]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_burning_hands_xphb\",\"name\":\"Burning Hands\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • Self — A thin sheet of flames shoots forth from you. Each creature in a 15-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA thin sheet of flames shoots forth from you. Each creature in a 15-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nFlammable objects in the [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] that aren't being worn or carried start [[burning|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Way of the Sun Soul|XGE]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Flamekin|LFL]], [[Genasi (Fire)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Fire)|MPMM]], [[Tiefling (Mephistopheles)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Hellfire)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Sweeping Cinder Strike|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_call_lightning_xphb\",\"name\":\"Call Lightning\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — A storm cloud appears at a point within range that you can see above yourself. It takes the shape of a [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] tha\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA storm cloud appears at a point within range that you can see above yourself. It takes the shape of a [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] that is 10 feet tall with a 60-foot radius.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, choose a point you can see under the cloud. A lightning bolt shoots from the cloud to that point. Each creature within 5 feet of that point makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d10 Lightning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to call down lightning in that way again, targeting the same point or a different one.\\n\\nIf you're outdoors in a storm when you cast this spell, the spell gives you control over that storm instead of creating a new one. Under such conditions, the spell's damage increases by 1d10.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_calm_emotions_xphb\",\"name\":\"Calm Emotions\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — Each Humanoid in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range must succeed on a Charisma savin\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nEach Humanoid in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be affected by one of the following effects (choose for each creature):\\n\\n- The creature has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to the [[Charmed|XPHB]] and [[Frightened|XPHB]] conditions until the spell ends. If the creature was already [[Charmed|XPHB]] or [[Frightened|XPHB]], those conditions are suppressed for the duration.\\n- The creature becomes [[Indifferent [Attitude]|XPHB|Indifferent]] about creatures of your choice that it's [[Hostile [Attitude]|XPHB|Hostile]] toward. This indifference ends if the target takes damage or witnesses its allies taking damage. When the spell ends, the creature's attitude returns to normal.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]], [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_chain_lightning_xphb\",\"name\":\"Chain Lightning\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — You launch a lightning bolt toward a target you can see within range. Three bolts then leap from that target to as many as three other targets of your\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (three silver pins)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou launch a lightning bolt toward a target you can see within range. Three bolts then leap from that target to as many as three other targets of your choice, each of which must be within 30 feet of the first target. A target can be a creature or an object and can be targeted by only one of the bolts.\\n\\nEach target makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 10d8 Lightning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** One additional bolt leaps from the first target to another target for each spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (three silver pins)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d8\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_charm_monster_xphb\",\"name\":\"Charm Monster\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — One creature you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. It does so with Advantage if you or your allies are fighting it. On a failed save, \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nOne creature you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. It does so with [[Advantage|XPHB]] if you or your allies are fighting it. On a failed save, the target has the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends or until you or your allies damage it. The [[Charmed|XPHB]] creature is [[Friendly [Attitude]|XPHB|Friendly]] to you. When the spell ends, the target knows it was [[Charmed|XPHB]] by you.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_charm_person_xphb\",\"name\":\"Charm Person\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — One Humanoid you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. It does so with Advantage if you or your allies are fighting it. On a failed save, \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nOne Humanoid you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. It does so with [[Advantage|XPHB]] if you or your allies are fighting it. On a failed save, the target has the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends or until you or your allies damage it. The [[Charmed|XPHB]] creature is [[Friendly [Attitude]|XPHB|Friendly]] to you. When the spell ends, the target knows it was [[Charmed|XPHB]] by you.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Glamour|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Fierna)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Devil's Tongue)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Treacherous Allure|ABH]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_chill_touch_xphb\",\"name\":\"Chill Touch\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Necromancy Cantrip • Action • Touch — Channeling the chill of the grave, make a melee spell attack against a target within reach. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Necrotic damage, and it ca\",\"content\":\"*Necromancy Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChanneling the chill of the grave, make a melee spell attack against a target within reach. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Necrotic damage, and it can't regain [[Hit Points|XPHB]] until the end of your next turn.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d10 when you reach levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Scion of the Three|FRHoF]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Tiefling|XPHB]], [[Elf (Zendikar; Mul Daya Nation)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Undertaker|AU]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Touch of Death|RHW]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_chromatic_orb_xphb\",\"name\":\"Chromatic Orb\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — You hurl an orb of energy at a target within range. Choose Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Poison, or Thunder for the type of orb you create, and then ma\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth 50+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hurl an orb of energy at a target within range. Choose Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Poison, or Thunder for the type of orb you create, and then make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 3d8 damage of the chosen type.\\n\\nIf you roll the same number on two or more of the d8s, the orb leaps to a different target of your choice within 30 feet of the target. Make an attack roll against the new target, and make a new damage roll. The orb can't leap again unless you cast the spell with a level 2+ spell slot.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 1. The orb can leap a maximum number of times equal to the level of the slot expended, and a creature can be targeted only once by each casting of this spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Evocation Adept|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth 50+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_circle_of_death_xphb\",\"name\":\"Circle of Death\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • Action • 150 feet — Negative energy ripples out in a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] from a point you choose within range. Each creature in that ar\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (the powder of a crushed black pearl worth 500+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nNegative energy ripples out in a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] from a point you choose within range. Each creature in that area makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 8d8 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 2d8 for each spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (the powder of a crushed black pearl worth 500+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_circle_of_power_xphb\",\"name\":\"Circle of Power\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • Self — An aura radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and your allies have Adv\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nAn aura radiates from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and your allies have [[Advantage|XPHB]] on saving throws against spells and other magical effects. When an affected creature makes a saving throw against a spell or magical effect that allows a save to take only half damage, it takes no damage if it succeeds on the save.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_clairvoyance_xphb\",\"name\":\"Clairvoyance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Divination • 10 minutes • 1 mile — You create an Invisible sensor within range in a location familiar to you (a place you have visited or seen before) or in an obvious location that is \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 1 mile\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a focus worth 100+ GP, either a jeweled horn for hearing or a glass eye for seeing)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create an [[Invisible|XPHB]] sensor within range in a location familiar to you (a place you have visited or seen before) or in an obvious location that is unfamiliar to you (such as behind a door, around a corner, or in a grove of trees). The intangible, invulnerable sensor remains in place for the duration.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, choose seeing or hearing. You can use the chosen sense through the sensor as if you were in its space. As a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you can switch between seeing and hearing.\\n\\nA creature that sees the sensor (such as a creature benefiting from [[See Invisibility|XPHB]] or [[Truesight|XPHB]]) sees a luminous orb about the size of your fist.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Path of the Ancestral Guardian|XGE]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]], [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divination Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"1 mile\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a focus worth 100+ GP, either a jeweled horn for hearing or a glass eye for seeing)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_clone_xphb\",\"name\":\"Clone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Necromancy • 1 hour • Touch — You touch a creature or at least 1 cubic inch of its flesh. An inert duplicate of that creature forms inside the vessel used in the spell's casting an\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes, and a sealable vessel worth 2,000+ GP that is large enough to hold the creature being cloned)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a creature or at least 1 cubic inch of its flesh. An inert duplicate of that creature forms inside the vessel used in the spell's casting and finishes growing after 120 days; you choose whether the finished clone is the same age as the creature or younger. The clone remains inert and endures indefinitely while its vessel remains undisturbed.\\n\\nIf the original creature dies after the clone finishes forming, the creature's soul transfers to the clone if the soul is free and willing to return. The clone is physically identical to the original and has the same personality, memories, and abilities, but none of the original's equipment. The creature's original remains, if any, become inert and can't be revived, since the creature's soul is elsewhere.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes, and a sealable vessel worth 2,000+ GP that is large enough to hold the creature being cloned)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 8\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cloud_of_daggers_xphb\",\"name\":\"Cloud of Daggers\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You conjure spinning daggers in a 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] centered on a point within range. Each creature in that area takes 4d4 Sl\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sliver of glass)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou conjure spinning daggers in a 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] centered on a point within range. Each creature in that area takes 4d4 Slashing damage. A creature also takes this damage if it enters the [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] or ends its turn there or if the [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] moves into its space. A creature takes this damage only once per turn.\\n\\nOn your later turns, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to teleport the [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] up to 30 feet.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 2d4 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sliver of glass)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d4\",\"damageType\":\"Slashing\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Slashing Damage\",\"Slashing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cloudkill_xphb\",\"name\":\"Cloudkill\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — You create a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of yellow-green fog centered on a point within range. The fog lasts for the durati\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of yellow-green fog centered on a point within range. The fog lasts for the duration or until strong wind (such as the one created by [[Gust of Wind|XPHB]]) disperses it, ending the spell. Its area is [[Heavily Obscured|XPHB]].\\n\\nEach creature in the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 5d8 Poison damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature must also make this save when the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] moves into its space and when it enters the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n\\nThe [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] moves 10 feet away from you at the start of each of your turns.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d8\",\"damageType\":\"Poison\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Poison Damage\",\"Poison\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_color_spray_xphb\",\"name\":\"Color Spray\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Illusion • Action • Self — You launch a dazzling array of flashing, colorful light. Each creature in a 15-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] originating from you must succ\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of colorful sand)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou launch a dazzling array of flashing, colorful light. Each creature in a 15-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] originating from you must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition until the end of your next turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of colorful sand)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_command_xphb\",\"name\":\"Command\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You speak a one-word command to a creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or follow the command on its nex\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou speak a one-word command to a creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or follow the command on its next turn. Choose the command from these options:\\n\\n- **Approach.** The target moves toward you by the shortest and most direct route, ending its turn if it moves within 5 feet of you.\\n- **Drop.** The target drops whatever it is holding and then ends its turn.\\n- **Flee.** The target spends its turn moving away from you by the fastest available means.\\n- **Grovel.** The target has the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition and then ends its turn.\\n- **Halt.** On its turn, the target doesn't move and takes no action or [[Bonus Action|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can affect one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Glamour|XGE]] ([[Bard|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[College of Glamour|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_commune_xphb\",\"name\":\"Commune\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — You contact a deity or a divine proxy and ask up to three questions that can be answered with yes or no. You must ask your questions before the spell \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (incense)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou contact a deity or a divine proxy and ask up to three questions that can be answered with yes or no. You must ask your questions before the spell ends. You receive a correct answer for each question.\\n\\nDivine beings aren't necessarily omniscient, so you might receive \\\"unclear\\\" as an answer if a question pertains to information that lies beyond the deity's knowledge. In a case where a one-word answer could be misleading or contrary to the deity's interests, the DM might offer a short phrase as an answer instead.\\n\\nIf you cast the spell more than once before finishing a [[Long Rest|XPHB]], there is a cumulative 25 percent chance for each casting after the first that you get no answer.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (incense)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_commune_with_nature_xphb\",\"name\":\"Commune with Nature\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — You commune with nature spirits and gain knowledge of the surrounding area. In the outdoors, the spell gives you knowledge of the area within 3 miles \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou commune with nature spirits and gain knowledge of the surrounding area. In the outdoors, the spell gives you knowledge of the area within 3 miles of you. In caves and other natural underground settings, the radius is limited to 300 feet. The spell doesn't function where nature has been replaced by construction, such as in castles and settlements.\\n\\nChoose three of the following facts; you learn those facts as they pertain to the spell's area:\\n\\n- Locations of settlements\\n- Locations of portals to other planes of existence\\n- Location of one [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]] 10+ creature (DM's choice) that is a Celestial, an Elemental, a Fey, a Fiend, or an Undead\\n- The most prevalent kind of plant, mineral, or Beast (you choose which to learn)\\n- Locations of bodies of water\\n\\nFor example, you could determine the location of a powerful monster in the area, the locations of bodies of water, and the locations of any towns.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Totem Warrior|PHB]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Path of the Wild Heart|XPHB]] ([[Barbarian|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_compelled_duel_xphb\",\"name\":\"Compelled Duel\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Bonus action • 30 feet — You try to compel a creature into a duel. One creature that you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the target has Dis\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou try to compel a creature into a duel. One creature that you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the target has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against creatures other than you, and it can't willingly move to a space that is more than 30 feet away from you.\\n\\nThe spell ends if you make an attack roll against a creature other than the target, if you cast a spell on an enemy other than the target, if an ally of yours damages the target, or if you end your turn more than 30 feet away from the target.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_comprehend_languages_xphb\",\"name\":\"Comprehend Languages\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — For the duration, you understand the literal meaning of any language that you hear or see signed. You also understand any written language that you se\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of soot and salt)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nFor the duration, you understand the literal meaning of any language that you hear or see signed. You also understand any written language that you see, but you must be touching the surface on which the words are written. It takes about 1 minute to read one page of text. This spell doesn't decode symbols or secret messages.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Banneret|FRHoF]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of soot and salt)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_compulsion_xphb\",\"name\":\"Compulsion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — Each creature of your choice that you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition until the spell ends. F\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nEach creature of your choice that you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends.\\n\\nFor the duration, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to designate a direction that is horizontal to you. Each [[Charmed|XPHB]] target must use as much of its movement as possible to move in that direction on its next turn, taking the safest route. After moving in this way, a target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Bewitching Whispers|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cone_of_cold_xphb\",\"name\":\"Cone of Cold\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • Self — You unleash a blast of cold air. Each creature in a 60-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] originating from you makes a Constitution saving throw\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small crystal or glass cone)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash a blast of cold air. Each creature in a 60-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] originating from you makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 8d8 Cold damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature killed by this spell becomes a frozen statue until it thaws.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Winter Walker|FRHoF]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Breath of Winter|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small crystal or glass cone)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d8\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_confusion_xphb\",\"name\":\"Confusion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • 90 feet — Each creature in a 10-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (three nut shells)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nEach creature in a 10-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw, or that target can't take Bonus Actions or Reactions and must roll 1d10 at the start of each of its turns to determine its behavior for that turn, consulting the table below.\\n\\n| 1d10 | Behavior for the Turn                                                                                                                                                                   |\\n|:----:|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\\n|   1  | The target doesn't take an action, and it uses all its movement to move. Roll 1d4 for the direction: **1**, north; **2**, east; **3**, south; or **4**, west.                           |\\n|  2-6 | The target doesn't move or take actions.                                                                                                                                                |\\n|  7-8 | The target doesn't move, and it takes the [[Attack|XPHB]] action to make one melee attack against a random creature within reach. If none are within reach, the target takes no action. |\\n| 9-10 | The target chooses its behavior.                                                                                                                                                        |\\n\\nAt the end of each of its turns, an affected target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]'s radius increases by 5 feet for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Dreadful Word|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (three nut shells)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_animals_xphb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Animals\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You conjure nature spirits that appear as a Large pack of spectral, intangible animals in an unoccupied space you can see within range. The pack lasts\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou conjure nature spirits that appear as a Large pack of spectral, intangible animals in an unoccupied space you can see within range. The pack lasts for the duration, and you choose the spirits' animal form, such as wolves, serpents, or birds.\\n\\nYou have [[Advantage|XPHB]] on Strength saving throws while you're within 5 feet of the pack, and when you move on your turn, you can also move the pack up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see.\\n\\nWhenever the pack moves within 10 feet of a creature you can see and whenever a creature you can see enters a space within 10 feet of the pack or ends its turn there, you can force that creature to make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 3d10 Slashing damage. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Moon|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Conjuration Adept|AU]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Slashing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Slashing Damage\",\"Slashing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_barrage_xphb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Barrage\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • Self — You brandish the weapon used to cast the spell and conjure similar spectral weapons (or ammunition appropriate to the weapon) that launch forward and \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a Melee or Ranged weapon worth at least 1 CP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou brandish the weapon used to cast the spell and conjure similar spectral weapons (or ammunition appropriate to the weapon) that launch forward and then disappear. Each creature of your choice that you can see in a 60-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 5d8 Force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a Melee or Ranged weapon worth at least 1 CP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ranger\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_celestial_xphb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Celestial\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You conjure a spirit from the Upper Planes, which manifests as a pillar of light in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cy\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou conjure a spirit from the Upper Planes, which manifests as a pillar of light in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range. For each creature you can see in the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]], choose which of these lights shines on it:\\n\\n- **Healing Light.** The target regains [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to 4d12 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n- **Searing Light.** The target makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 6d12 Radiant damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, [[Bright Light|XPHB]] fills the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]], and when you move on your turn, you can also move the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] up to 30 feet.\\n\\nWhenever the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] moves into the space of a creature you can see and whenever a creature you can see enters the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] or ends its turn there, you can bathe it in one of the lights. A creature can be affected by this spell only once per turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The healing and damage increase by 1d12 for each spell slot level above 7.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d12\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"healing\":\"4d12\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_elemental_xphb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Elemental\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You conjure a Large, intangible spirit from the Elemental Planes that appears in an unoccupied space within range. Choose the spirit's element, which \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou conjure a Large, intangible spirit from the Elemental Planes that appears in an unoccupied space within range. Choose the spirit's element, which determines its damage type: air (Lightning), earth (Thunder), fire (Fire), or water (Cold). The spirit lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhenever a creature you can see enters the spirit's space or starts its turn within 5 feet of the spirit, you can force that creature to make a Dexterity saving throw if the spirit has no creature [[Restrained|XPHB]]. On a failed save, the target takes 8d8 damage of the spirit's type, and the target has the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends. At the start of each of its turns, the [[Restrained|XPHB]] target repeats the save. On a failed save, the target takes 4d8 damage of the spirit's type. On a successful save, the target isn't [[Restrained|XPHB]] by the spirit.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Conjuration Adept|AU]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]], [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Minions of Chaos|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d8\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_fey_xphb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Fey\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You conjure a Medium spirit from the Feywild in an unoccupied space you can see within range. The spirit lasts for the duration, and it looks like a F\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou conjure a Medium spirit from the Feywild in an unoccupied space you can see within range. The spirit lasts for the duration, and it looks like a Fey creature of your choice. When the spirit appears, you can make one melee spell attack against a creature within 5 feet of it. On a hit, the target takes Psychic damage equal to 3d12 plus your spellcasting ability modifier, and the target has the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition until the start of your next turn, with both you and the spirit as the source of the fear.\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on your later turns, you can teleport the spirit to an unoccupied space you can see within 30 feet of the space it left and make the attack against a creature within 5 feet of it.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d12 for each spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d12\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_minor_elementals_xphb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Minor Elementals\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • Self — You conjure spirits from the Elemental Planes that flit around you in a 15-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. Until \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou conjure spirits from the Elemental Planes that flit around you in a 15-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. Until the spell ends, any attack you make deals an extra 2d8 damage when you hit a creature in the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. This damage is Acid, Cold, Fire, or Lightning (your choice when you make the attack).\\n\\nIn addition, the ground in the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] is [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] for your enemies.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_volley_xphb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Volley\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 150 feet — You brandish the weapon used to cast the spell and choose a point within range. Hundreds of similar spectral weapons (or ammunition appropriate to the\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a Melee or Ranged weapon worth at least 1 CP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou brandish the weapon used to cast the spell and choose a point within range. Hundreds of similar spectral weapons (or ammunition appropriate to the weapon) fall in a volley and then disappear. Each creature of your choice that you can see in a 40-foot-radius, 20-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on that point makes a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 8d8 Force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a Melee or Ranged weapon worth at least 1 CP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Ranger\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_conjure_woodland_beings_xphb\",\"name\":\"Conjure Woodland Beings\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • Self — You conjure nature spirits that flit around you in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. Whenever the [[Emanation \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou conjure nature spirits that flit around you in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. Whenever the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] enters the space of a creature you can see and whenever a creature you can see enters the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] or ends its turn there, you can force that creature to make a Wisdom saving throw. The creature takes 5d8 Force damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n\\nIn addition, you can take the [[Disengage|XPHB]] action as a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] for the spell's duration.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_contact_other_plane_xphb\",\"name\":\"Contact Other Plane\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — You mentally contact a demigod, the spirit of a long-dead sage, or some other knowledgeable entity from another plane. Contacting this otherworldly in\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou mentally contact a demigod, the spirit of a long-dead sage, or some other knowledgeable entity from another plane. Contacting this otherworldly intelligence can break your mind. When you cast this spell, make a DC 15 Intelligence saving throw. On a successful save, you can ask the entity up to five questions. You must ask your questions before the spell ends. The DM answers each question with one word, such as \\\"yes,\\\" \\\"no,\\\" \\\"maybe,\\\" \\\"never,\\\" \\\"irrelevant,\\\" or \\\"unclear\\\" (if the entity doesn't know the answer to the question). If a one-word answer would be misleading, the DM might instead offer a short phrase as an answer.\\n\\nOn a failed save, you take 6d6 Psychic damage and have the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition until you finish a [[Long Rest|XPHB]]. A [[Greater Restoration|XPHB]] spell cast on you ends this effect.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"6d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_contagion_xphb\",\"name\":\"Contagion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • Action • Touch — Your touch inflicts a magical contagion. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 11d8 Necrotic damage and have the Poisoned con\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 7 days\\nYour touch inflicts a magical contagion. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 11d8 Necrotic damage and have the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition. Also, choose one ability when you cast the spell. While [[Poisoned|XPHB]], the target has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on saving throws made with the chosen ability.\\n\\nThe target must repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns until it gets three successes or failures. If the target succeeds on three of these saves, the spell ends on the target. If the target fails three of the saves, the spell lasts for 7 days on it.\\n\\nWhenever the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] target receives an effect that would end the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition, the target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw, or the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition doesn't end on it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"7 days\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"11d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_contingency_xphb\",\"name\":\"Contingency\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • 10 minutes • Self — Choose a spell of level 5 or lower that you can cast, that has a casting time of an action, and that can target you. You cast that spell—called the co\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gem-encrusted statuette of yourself worth 1,500+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nChoose a spell of level 5 or lower that you can cast, that has a casting time of an action, and that can target you. You cast that spell—called the contingent spell—as part of casting Contingency, expending spell slots for both, but the contingent spell doesn't come into effect. Instead, it takes effect when a certain trigger occurs. You describe that trigger when you cast the two spells. For example, a Contingency cast with [[Water Breathing|XPHB]] might stipulate that Water Breathing comes into effect when you are engulfed in water or a similar liquid.\\n\\nThe contingent spell takes effect immediately after the trigger occurs for the first time, whether or not you want it to, and then Contingency ends.\\n\\nThe contingent spell takes effect only on you, even if it can normally target others. You can use only one Contingency spell at a time. If you cast this spell again, the effect of another Contingency spell on you ends. Also, Contingency ends on you if its material component is ever not on your person.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gem-encrusted statuette of yourself worth 1,500+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_continual_flame_xphb\",\"name\":\"Continual Flame\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • Touch — A flame springs from an object that you touch. The effect casts Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet. It looks lik\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (ruby dust worth 50+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nA flame springs from an object that you touch. The effect casts [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 20-foot radius and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 20 feet. It looks like a regular flame, but it creates no heat and consumes no fuel. The flame can be covered or hidden but not smothered or quenched.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (ruby dust worth 50+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_control_water_xphb\",\"name\":\"Control Water\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Action • 300 feet — Until the spell ends, you control any water inside an area you choose that is a [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] up to 100 feet on a side, using on\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a mixture of water and dust)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nUntil the spell ends, you control any water inside an area you choose that is a [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] up to 100 feet on a side, using one of the following effects. As a [[Magic|XPHB]] action on your later turns, you can repeat the same effect or choose a different one.\\n\\n***Flood.*** You cause the water level of all standing water in the area to rise by as much as 20 feet. If you choose an area in a large body of water, you instead create a 20-foot tall wave that travels from one side of the area to the other and then crashes. Any Huge or smaller vehicles in the wave's path are carried with it to the other side. Any Huge or smaller vehicles struck by the wave have a 25 percent chance of capsizing.\\n\\nThe water level remains elevated until the spell ends or you choose a different effect. If this effect produced a wave, the wave repeats on the start of your next turn while the flood effect lasts.\\n\\n***Part Water.*** You part water in the area and create a trench. The trench extends across the spell's area, and the separated water forms a wall to either side. The trench remains until the spell ends or you choose a different effect. The water then slowly fills in the trench over the course of the next round until the normal water level is restored.\\n\\n***Redirect Flow.*** You cause flowing water in the area to move in a direction you choose, even if the water has to flow over obstacles, up walls, or in other unlikely directions. The water in the area moves as you direct it, but once it moves beyond the spell's area, it resumes its flow based on the terrain. The water continues to move in the direction you chose until the spell ends or you choose a different effect.\\n\\n***Whirlpool.*** You cause a whirlpool to form in the center of the area, which must be at least 50 feet square and 25 feet deep. The whirlpool lasts until you choose a different effect or the spell ends. The whirlpool is 5 feet wide at the base, up to 50 feet wide at the top, and 25 feet tall. Any creature in the water and within 25 feet of the whirlpool is pulled 10 feet toward it. When a creature enters the whirlpool for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there, it makes a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 2d8 Bludgeoning damage. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage. A creature can swim away from the whirlpool only if it first takes an action to pull away and succeeds on a Strength ([[Athletics|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a mixture of water and dust)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_control_weather_xphb\",\"name\":\"Control Weather\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Transmutation • 10 minutes • Self — You take control of the weather within 5 miles of you for the duration. You must be outdoors to cast this spell, and it ends early if you go indoors. \",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (burning incense)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 8 hours\\nYou take control of the weather within 5 miles of you for the duration. You must be outdoors to cast this spell, and it ends early if you go indoors.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, you change the current weather conditions, which are determined by the DM. You can change precipitation, temperature, and wind. It takes 1d4 × 10 minutes for the new conditions to take effect. Once they do so, you can change the conditions again. When the spell ends, the weather gradually returns to normal.\\n\\nWhen you change the weather conditions, find a current condition on the following tables and change its stage by one, up or down. When changing the wind, you can change its direction.\\n\\n##### Precipitation\\n| Stage | Condition                                  |\\n|:-----:|--------------------------------------------|\\n|   1   | Clear                                      |\\n|   2   | Light clouds                               |\\n|   3   | Overcast or ground fog                     |\\n|   4   | Rain, hail, or snow                        |\\n|   5   | Torrential rain, driving hail, or blizzard |\\n\\n##### Temperature\\n| Stage | Condition |\\n|:-----:|-----------|\\n|   1   | Heat wave |\\n|   2   | Hot       |\\n|   3   | Warm      |\\n|   4   | Cool      |\\n|   5   | Cold      |\\n|   6   | Freezing  |\\n\\n##### Wind\\n| Stage | Condition     |\\n|:-----:|---------------|\\n|   1   | Calm          |\\n|   2   | Moderate wind |\\n|   3   | Strong wind   |\\n|   4   | Gale          |\\n|   5   | Storm         |\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (burning incense)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 8\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cordon_of_arrows_xphb\",\"name\":\"Cordon of Arrows\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch up to four nonmagical Arrows or Bolts and plant them in the ground in your space. Until the spell ends, the ammunition can't be physically u\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (four or more arrows or bolts)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch up to four nonmagical Arrows or Bolts and plant them in the ground in your space. Until the spell ends, the ammunition can't be physically uprooted, and whenever a creature other than you enters a space within 30 feet of the ammunition for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there, one piece of ammunition flies up to strike it. The creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 2d4 Piercing damage. The piece of ammunition is then destroyed. The spell ends when none of the ammunition remains planted in the ground.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can designate any creatures you choose, and the spell ignores them.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The amount of ammunition that can be affected increases by two for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (four or more arrows or bolts)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ranger\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_counterspell_xphb\",\"name\":\"Counterspell\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Reaction, which you take when you see a creature within 60 feet of yourself casting a spell with Verbal, Somatic, or Material components • 60 feet — You attempt to interrupt a creature in the process of casting a spell. The creature makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the spell dis\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when you see a creature within 60 feet of yourself casting a spell with Verbal, Somatic, or Material components\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou attempt to interrupt a creature in the process of casting a spell. The creature makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the spell dissipates with no effect, and the action, [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], or [[Reaction|XPHB]] used to cast it is wasted. If that spell was cast with a spell slot, the slot isn't expended.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when you see a creature within 60 feet of yourself casting a spell with Verbal, Somatic, or Material components\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Reaction\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_food_and_water_xphb\",\"name\":\"Create Food and Water\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — You create 45 pounds of food and 30 gallons of fresh water on the ground or in containers within range—both useful in fending off the hazards of malnu\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create 45 pounds of food and 30 gallons of fresh water on the ground or in containers within range—both useful in fending off the hazards of malnutrition and dehydration. The food is bland but nourishing and looks like a food of your choice, and the water is clean. The food spoils after 24 hours if uneaten.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_or_destroy_water_xphb\",\"name\":\"Create or Destroy Water\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — You do one of the following: - Create Water. You create up to 10 gallons of clean water within range in an open container. Alternatively, the water fa\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a mix of water and sand)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou do one of the following:\\n\\n- **Create Water.** You create up to 10 gallons of clean water within range in an open container. Alternatively, the water falls as rain in a 30-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] within range, extinguishing exposed flames there.\\n- **Destroy Water.** You destroy up to 10 gallons of water in an open container within range. Alternatively, you destroy fog in a 30-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] within range.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You create or destroy 10 additional gallons of water, or the size of the [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] increases by 5 feet, for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Water)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Water)|MPMM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a mix of water and sand)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_create_undead_xphb\",\"name\":\"Create Undead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • 1 minute • 10 feet — You can cast this spell only at night. Choose up to three corpses of Medium or Small Humanoids within range. Each one becomes a Ghoul under your contr\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (one 150+ GP black onyx stone for each corpse)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou can cast this spell only at night. Choose up to three corpses of Medium or Small Humanoids within range. Each one becomes a [[Ghoul|XMM]] under your control (see the *Monster Manual* for its stat block).\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on each of your turns, you can mentally command any creature you animated with this spell if the creature is within 120 feet of you (if you control multiple creatures, you can command any of them at the same time, issuing the same command to them). You decide what action the creature will take and where it will move on its next turn, or you can issue a general command, such as to guard a particular place. If you issue no commands, the creature takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and moves only to avoid harm. Once given an order, the creature continues to follow the order until its task is complete.\\n\\nThe creature is under your control for 24 hours, after which it stops obeying any command you've given it. To maintain control of the creature for another 24 hours, you must cast this spell on the creature before the current 24-hour period ends. This use of the spell reasserts your control over up to three creatures you have animated with this spell rather than animating new ones.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** If you use a level 7 spell slot, you can animate or reassert control over four [[Ghoul|XMM|Ghouls]]. If you use a level 8 spell slot, you can animate or reassert control over five [[Ghoul|XMM|Ghouls]] or two [[Ghast|XMM|Ghasts]] or [[Wight|XMM|Wights]]. If you use a level 9 spell slot, you can animate or reassert control over six [[Ghoul|XMM|Ghouls]], three [[Ghast|XMM|Ghasts]] or [[Wight|XMM|Wights]], or two [[Mummy|XMM|Mummies]]. See the *Monster Manual* for these stat blocks.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (one 150+ GP black onyx stone for each corpse)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_creation_xphb\",\"name\":\"Creation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Illusion • 1 minute • 30 feet — You pull wisps of shadow material from the Shadowfell to create an object within range. It is either an object of vegetable matter (soft goods, rope, \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a paintbrush)\\n- **Duration:** Special\\nYou pull wisps of shadow material from the Shadowfell to create an object within range. It is either an object of vegetable matter (soft goods, rope, wood, and the like) or mineral matter (stone, crystal, metal, and the like). The object must be no larger than a 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]], and the object must be of a form and material that you have seen.\\n\\nThe spell's duration depends on the object's material, as shown in the Materials table. If the object is composed of multiple materials, use the shortest duration. Using any object created by this spell as another spell's Material component causes the other spell to fail.\\n\\n##### Materials\\n| Material              | Duration   |\\n|-----------------------|------------|\\n| Vegetable matter      | 24 hours   |\\n| Stone or crystal      | 12 hours   |\\n| Precious metals       | 1 hour     |\\n| Gems                  | 10 minutes |\\n| Adamantine or mithral | 1 minute   |\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] increases by 5 feet for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a paintbrush)\",\"duration\":\"Special\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_crown_of_madness_xphb\",\"name\":\"Crown of Madness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 120 feet — One creature that you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration. The creature succeeds\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nOne creature that you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. The creature succeeds automatically if it isn't Humanoid.\\n\\nA spectral crown appears on the [[Charmed|XPHB]] target's head, and it must use its action before moving on each of its turns to make a melee attack against a creature other than itself that you mentally choose. The target can act normally on its turn if you choose no creature or if no creature is within its reach. The target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\nOn your later turns, you must take the [[Magic|XPHB]] action to maintain control of the target, or the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Baalzebul)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_crusader_s_mantle_xphb\",\"name\":\"Crusader's Mantle\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Self — You radiate a magical aura in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. While in the aura, you and your allies each deal an extra 1d4 R\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou radiate a magical aura in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. While in the aura, you and your allies each deal an extra 1d4 Radiant damage when hitting with a weapon or an [[Unarmed Strike|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_cure_wounds_xphb\",\"name\":\"Cure Wounds\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Action • Touch — A creature you touch regains a number of Hit Points equal to 2d8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA creature you touch regains a number of [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to 2d8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The healing increases by 2d8 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Moon|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Gift of the Metallic Dragon|FTD]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dancing_lights_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dancing Lights\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Illusion Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — You create up to four torch-size lights within range, making them appear as torches, lanterns, or glowing orbs that hover for the duration. Alternativ\",\"content\":\"*Illusion Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create up to four torch-size lights within range, making them appear as torches, lanterns, or glowing orbs that hover for the duration. Alternatively, you combine the four lights into one glowing Medium form that is vaguely humanlike. Whichever form you choose, each light sheds [[Dim Light|XPHB]] in a 10-foot radius.\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you can move the lights up to 60 feet to a space within range. A light must be within 20 feet of another light created by this spell, and a light vanishes if it exceeds the spell's range.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Astral Elf|AAG]], [[Elf (Drow)|PHB]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Drow Descent)|SCAG]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_darkness_xphb\",\"name\":\"Darkness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — For the duration, magical Darkness spreads from a point within range and fills a 15-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]. Darkvision ca\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (bat fur and a piece of coal)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, magical [[Darkness|XPHB]] spreads from a point within range and fills a 15-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]. [[Darkvision|XPHB]] can't see through it, and nonmagical light can't illuminate it.\\n\\nAlternatively, you cast the spell on an object that isn't being worn or carried, causing the [[Darkness|XPHB]] to fill a 15-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from that object. Covering that object with something opaque, such as a bowl or helm, blocks the [[Darkness|XPHB]].\\n\\nIf any of this spell's area overlaps with an area of [[Bright Light|XPHB]] or [[Dim Light|XPHB]] created by a spell of level 2 or lower, that other spell is dispelled.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of Shadow|XPHB]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Shadow Magic|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Drow)|PHB]], [[Tiefling|PHB]], [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Tiefling|XPHB]], [[Elf (Zendikar; Mul Daya Nation)|PSZ]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Drow Descent)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Hellfire)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Infernal Legacy)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling (Asmodeus)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Levistus)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (bat fur and a piece of coal)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_darkvision_xphb\",\"name\":\"Darkvision\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — For the duration, a willing creature you touch has Darkvision with a range of 150 feet.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a dried carrot)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nFor the duration, a willing creature you touch has [[Darkvision|XPHB]] with a range of 150 feet.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a dried carrot)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_daylight_xphb\",\"name\":\"Daylight\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — For the duration, sunlight spreads from a point within range and fills a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]. The sunlight's area i\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nFor the duration, sunlight spreads from a point within range and fills a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]. The sunlight's area is [[Bright Light|XPHB]] and sheds [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 60 feet.\\n\\nAlternatively, you cast the spell on an object that isn't being worn or carried, causing the sunlight to fill a 60-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from that object. Covering that object with something opaque, such as a bowl or helm, blocks the sunlight.\\n\\nIf any of this spell's area overlaps with an area of [[Darkness|XPHB]] created by a spell of level 3 or lower, that other spell is dispelled.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Aasimar|DMG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_death_ward_xphb\",\"name\":\"Death Ward\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a creature and grant it a measure of protection from death. The first time the target would drop to 0 Hit Points before the spell ends, the \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch a creature and grant it a measure of protection from death. The first time the target would drop to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] before the spell ends, the target instead drops to 1 [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]], and the spell ends.\\n\\nIf the spell is still in effect when the target is subjected to an effect that would kill it instantly without dealing damage, that effect is negated against the target, and the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]], [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_delayed_blast_fireball_xphb\",\"name\":\"Delayed Blast Fireball\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — A beam of yellow light flashes from you, then condenses at a chosen point within range as a glowing bead for the duration. When the spell ends, the be\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a ball of bat guano and sulfur)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA beam of yellow light flashes from you, then condenses at a chosen point within range as a glowing bead for the duration. When the spell ends, the bead explodes, and each creature in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on that point makes a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes Fire damage equal to the total accumulated damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe spell's base damage is 12d6, and the damage increases by 1d6 whenever your turn ends and the spell hasn't ended.\\n\\nIf a creature touches the glowing bead before the spell ends, that creature makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the spell ends, causing the bead to explode. On a successful save, the creature can throw the bead up to 40 feet. If the thrown bead enters a creature's space or collides with a solid object, the spell ends, and the bead explodes.\\n\\nWhen the bead explodes, flammable objects in the explosion that aren't being worn or carried start [[burning|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The base damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 7.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a ball of bat guano and sulfur)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_demiplane_xphb\",\"name\":\"Demiplane\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You create a shadowy Medium door on a flat solid surface that you can see within range. This door can be opened and closed, and it leads to a demiplan\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou create a shadowy Medium door on a flat solid surface that you can see within range. This door can be opened and closed, and it leads to a demiplane that is an empty room 30 feet in each dimension, made of wood or stone (your choice).\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the door vanishes, and any objects inside the demiplane remain there. Any creatures inside also remain unless they opt to be shunted through the door as it vanishes, landing with the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition in the unoccupied spaces closest to the door's former space.\\n\\nEach time you cast this spell, you can create a new demiplane or connect the shadowy door to a demiplane you created with a previous casting of this spell. Additionally, if you know the nature and contents of a demiplane created by a casting of this spell by another creature, you can connect the shadowy door to that demiplane instead.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_destructive_wave_xphb\",\"name\":\"Destructive Wave\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • Self — Destructive energy ripples outward from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. Each creature you choose in the [[Emanation [A\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nDestructive energy ripples outward from you in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. Each creature you choose in the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 5d6 Thunder damage and 5d6 Radiant or Necrotic damage (your choice) and has the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage only.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d6\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Paladin\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_detect_evil_and_good_xphb\",\"name\":\"Detect Evil and Good\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action • Self — For the duration, you sense the location of any Aberration, Celestial, Elemental, Fey, Fiend, or Undead within 30 feet of yourself. You also sense whe\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, you sense the location of any Aberration, Celestial, Elemental, Fey, Fiend, or Undead within 30 feet of yourself. You also sense whether the [[Hallow|XPHB]] spell is active there and, if so, where.\\n\\nThe spell is blocked by 1 foot of stone, dirt, or wood; 1 inch of metal; or a thin sheet of lead.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divination Adept|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_detect_magic_xphb\",\"name\":\"Detect Magic\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — For the duration, you sense the presence of magical effects within 30 feet of yourself. If you sense such effects, you can take the Magic action to se\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, you sense the presence of magical effects within 30 feet of yourself. If you sense such effects, you can take the [[Magic|XPHB]] action to see a faint aura around any visible creature or object in the area that bears the magic, and if an effect was created by a spell, you learn the spell's *school of magic*.\\n\\nThe spell is blocked by 1 foot of stone, dirt, or wood; 1 inch of metal; or a thin sheet of lead.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Firbolg|MPMM]], [[Firbolg|VGM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Drow High Magic|XGE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Eldritch Sight|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_detect_poison_and_disease_xphb\",\"name\":\"Detect Poison and Disease\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — For the duration, you sense the location of poisons, poisonous or venomous creatures, and magical contagions within 30 feet of yourself. You sense the\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a yew leaf)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, you sense the location of poisons, poisonous or venomous creatures, and magical contagions within 30 feet of yourself. You sense the kind of poison, creature, or contagion in each case.\\n\\nThe spell is blocked by 1 foot of stone, dirt, or wood; 1 inch of metal; or a thin sheet of lead.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a yew leaf)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_detect_thoughts_xphb\",\"name\":\"Detect Thoughts\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • Self — You activate one of the effects below. Until the spell ends, you can activate either effect as a Magic action on your later turns. Sense Thoughts You \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (1 Copper Piece)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou activate one of the effects below. Until the spell ends, you can activate either effect as a [[Magic|XPHB]] action on your later turns.\\n\\n***Sense Thoughts.*** You sense the presence of thoughts within 30 feet of yourself that belong to creatures that know languages or are telepathic. You don't read the thoughts, but you know that a thinking creature is present.\\n\\nThe spell is blocked by 1 foot of stone, dirt, or wood; 1 inch of metal; or a thin sheet of lead.\\n\\n***Read Thoughts.*** Target one creature you can see within 30 feet of yourself or one creature within 30 feet of yourself that you detected with the Sense Thoughts option. You learn what is most on the target's mind right now. If the target doesn't know any languages and isn't telepathic, you learn nothing.\\n\\nAs a [[Magic|XPHB]] action on your next turn, you can try to probe deeper into the target's mind. If you probe deeper, the target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, you discern the target's reasoning, emotions, and something that looms large in its mind (such as a worry, love, or hate). On a successful save, the spell ends. Either way, the target knows that you are probing into its mind, and until you shift your attention away from the target's mind, the target can take an action on its turn to make an Intelligence ([[Arcana|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC, ending the spell on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gith (Githzerai)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Dispater)|MTF]], [[Githzerai|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]], [[Telepathic|TCE]], [[Telepathic|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (1 Copper Piece)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dimension_door_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dimension Door\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 500 feet — You teleport to a location within range. You arrive at exactly the spot desired. It can be a place you can see, one you can visualize, or one you can \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 500 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou teleport to a location within range. You arrive at exactly the spot desired. It can be a place you can see, one you can visualize, or one you can describe by stating distance and direction, such as \\\"200 feet straight downward\\\" or \\\"300 feet upward to the northwest at a 45-degree angle.\\\"\\n\\nYou can also teleport one willing creature. The creature must be within 5 feet of you when you teleport, and it teleports to a space within 5 feet of your destination space.\\n\\nIf you, the other creature, or both would arrive in a space occupied by a creature or completely filled by one or more objects, you and any creature traveling with you each take 4d6 Force damage, and the teleportation fails.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Conjuration Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"500 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_disguise_self_xphb\",\"name\":\"Disguise Self\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Illusion • Action • Self — You make yourself—including your clothing, armor, weapons, and other belongings on your person—look different until the spell ends. You can seem 1 foo\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou make yourself—including your clothing, armor, weapons, and other belongings on your person—look different until the spell ends. You can seem 1 foot shorter or taller and can appear heavier or lighter. You must adopt a form that has the same basic arrangement of limbs as you have. Otherwise, the extent of the illusion is up to you.\\n\\nThe changes wrought by this spell fail to hold up to physical inspection. For example, if you use this spell to add a hat to your outfit, objects pass through the hat, and anyone who touches it would feel nothing.\\n\\nTo discern that you are disguised, a creature must take the [[Study|XPHB]] action to inspect your appearance and succeed on an Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Deep Gnome|MPMM]], [[Firbolg|MPMM]], [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Firbolg|VGM]], [[Gnome (Deep)|DMG]], [[Hexblood|RHW]], [[Hexblood|VRGR]], [[Tiefling (Dispater)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Glasya)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Svirfneblin Magic|MTF]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Mask of Many Faces|PHB]], [[Mask of Many Faces|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_disintegrate_xphb\",\"name\":\"Disintegrate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — You launch a green ray at a target you can see within range. The target can be a creature, a nonmagical object, or a creation of magical force, such a\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a lodestone and dust)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou launch a green ray at a target you can see within range. The target can be a creature, a nonmagical object, or a creation of magical force, such as the wall created by [[Wall of Force|XPHB]].\\n\\nA creature targeted by this spell makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 10d6 + 40 Force damage. If this damage reduces it to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], it and everything nonmagical it is wearing and carrying are disintegrated into gray dust. The target can be revived only by a [[True Resurrection|XPHB]] or a [[Wish|XPHB]] spell.\\n\\nThis spell automatically disintegrates a Large or smaller nonmagical object or a creation of magical force. If such a target is Huge or larger, this spell disintegrates a 10-foot-[[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] portion of it.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 3d6 for each spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a lodestone and dust)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6 + 40\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dispel_evil_and_good_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dispel Evil and Good\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • Self — For the duration, Celestials, Elementals, Fey, Fiends, and Undead have Disadvantage on attack rolls against you. You can end the spell early by using \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (powdered silver and iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the duration, Celestials, Elementals, Fey, Fiends, and Undead have [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against you. You can end the spell early by using either of the following special functions.\\n\\n***Break Enchantment.*** As a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, you touch a creature that is possessed by or has the [[Charmed|XPHB]] or [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition from one or more creatures of the types above. The target is no longer possessed, [[Charmed|XPHB]], or [[Frightened|XPHB]] by such creatures.\\n\\n***Dismissal.*** As a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, you target one creature you can see within 5 feet of you that has one of the creature types above. The target must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be sent back to its home plane if it isn't there already. If they aren't on their home plane, Undead are sent to the Shadowfell, and Fey are sent to the Feywild.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (powdered silver and iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dispel_magic_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dispel Magic\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • 120 feet — Choose one creature, object, or magical effect within range. Any ongoing spell of level 3 or lower on the target ends. For each ongoing spell of level\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose one creature, object, or magical effect within range. Any ongoing spell of level 3 or lower on the target ends. For each ongoing spell of level 4 or higher on the target, make an ability check using your spellcasting ability (DC 10 plus that spell's level). On a successful check, the spell ends.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You automatically end a spell on the target if the spell's level is equal to or less than the level of the spell slot you use.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Drow High Magic|XGE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dissonant_whispers_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dissonant Whispers\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — One creature of your choice that you can see within range hears a discordant melody in its mind. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed s\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nOne creature of your choice that you can see within range hears a discordant melody in its mind. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 3d6 Psychic damage and must immediately use its [[Reaction|XPHB]], if available, to move as far away from you as it can, using the safest route. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage only.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Enchantment Adept|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_divination_xphb\",\"name\":\"Divination\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — This spell puts you in contact with a god or a god's servants. You ask one question about a specific goal, event, or activity to occur within 7 days. \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (incense worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThis spell puts you in contact with a god or a god's servants. You ask one question about a specific goal, event, or activity to occur within 7 days. The DM offers a truthful reply, which might be a short phrase or cryptic rhyme. The spell doesn't account for circumstances that might change the answer, such as the casting of other spells.\\n\\nIf you cast the spell more than once before finishing a [[Long Rest|XPHB]], there is a cumulative 25 percent chance for each casting after the first that you get no answer.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]], [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divination Adept|AU]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (incense worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_divine_favor_xphb\",\"name\":\"Divine Favor\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — Until the spell ends, your attacks with weapons deal an extra 1d4 Radiant damage on a hit.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nUntil the spell ends, your attacks with weapons deal an extra 1d4 Radiant damage on a hit.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_divine_smite_xphb\",\"name\":\"Divine Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a> • Self — The target takes an extra 2d8 Radiant damage from the attack. The damage increases by 1d8 if the target is a Fiend or an Undead.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThe target takes an extra 2d8 Radiant damage from the attack. The damage increases by 1d8 if the target is a Fiend or an Undead.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_divine_word_xphb\",\"name\":\"Divine Word\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Bonus action • 30 feet — You utter a word imbued with power from the Upper Planes. Each creature of your choice in range makes a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, a tar\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou utter a word imbued with power from the Upper Planes. Each creature of your choice in range makes a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, a target that has 50 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or fewer suffers an effect based on its current [[Hit Points|XPHB]], as shown in the Divine Word Effects table. Regardless of its [[Hit Points|XPHB]], a Celestial, an Elemental, a Fey, or a Fiend target that fails its save is forced back to its plane of origin (if it isn't there already) and can't return to the current plane for 24 hours by any means short of a [[Wish|XPHB]] spell.\\n\\n##### Divine Word Effects\\n| Hit Points | Effect                                                                                              |\\n|:----------:|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\\n|    0-20    | The target dies.                                                                                    |\\n|    21-30   | The target has the [[Blinded|XPHB]], [[Deafened|XPHB]], and [[Stunned|XPHB]] conditions for 1 hour. |\\n|    31-40   | The target has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] and [[Deafened|XPHB]] conditions for 10 minutes.                |\\n|    41-50   | The target has the [[Deafened|XPHB]] condition for 1 minute.                                        |\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dominate_beast_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dominate Beast\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — One Beast you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration. The target has Advantage on t\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nOne Beast you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. The target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on the save if you or your allies are fighting it. Whenever the target takes damage, it repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\nYou have a telepathic link with the [[Charmed|XPHB]] target while the two of you are on the same plane of existence. On your turn, you can use this link to issue commands to the target (no action required), such as \\\"[[Attack|XPHB]] that creature,\\\" \\\"Move over there,\\\" or \\\"Fetch that object.\\\" The target does its best to obey on its turn. If it completes an order and doesn't receive further direction from you, it acts and moves as it likes, focusing on protecting itself.\\n\\nYou can command the target to take a [[Reaction|XPHB]] but must take your own [[Reaction|XPHB]] to do so.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Your [[Concentration|XPHB]] can last longer with a spell slot of level 5 (up to 10 minutes), 6 (up to 1 hour), or 7+ (up to 8 hours).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Hollow Warden|RHW]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Enchantment Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dominate_monster_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dominate Monster\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — One creature you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration. The target has Advantage o\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nOne creature you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. The target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on the save if you or your allies are fighting it. Whenever the target takes damage, it repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\nYou have a telepathic link with the [[Charmed|XPHB]] target while the two of you are on the same plane of existence. On your turn, you can use this link to issue commands to the target (no action required), such as \\\"[[Attack|XPHB]] that creature,\\\" \\\"Move over there,\\\" or \\\"Fetch that object.\\\" The target does its best to obey on its turn. If it completes an order and doesn't receive further direction from you, it acts and moves as it likes, focusing on protecting itself.\\n\\nYou can command the target to take a [[Reaction|XPHB]] but must take your own [[Reaction|XPHB]] to do so.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Your [[Concentration|XPHB]] can last longer with a level 9 spell slot (up to 8 hours).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dominate_person_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dominate Person\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — One Humanoid you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Charmed condition for the duration. The target has Advantage o\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nOne Humanoid you can see within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. The target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on the save if you or your allies are fighting it. Whenever the target takes damage, it repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\nYou have a telepathic link with the [[Charmed|XPHB]] target while the two of you are on the same plane of existence. On your turn, you can use this link to issue commands to the target (no action required), such as \\\"[[Attack|XPHB]] that creature,\\\" \\\"Move over there,\\\" or \\\"Fetch that object.\\\" The target does its best to obey on its turn. If it completes an order and doesn't receive further direction from you, it acts and moves as it likes, focusing on protecting itself.\\n\\nYou can command the target to take a [[Reaction|XPHB]] but must take your own [[Reaction|XPHB]] to do so.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Your [[Concentration|XPHB]] can last longer with a spell slot of level 6 (up to 10 minutes), 7 (up to 1 hour), or 8+ (up to 8 hours).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]], [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dragon_s_breath_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dragon's Breath\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Bonus action • Touch — You touch one willing creature, and choose Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Poison. Until the spell ends, the target can take a Magic action to exhale \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a hot pepper)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou touch one willing creature, and choose Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Poison. Until the spell ends, the target can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to exhale a 15-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]]. Each creature in that area makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 3d6 damage of the chosen type on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a hot pepper)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_drawmij_s_instant_summons_xphb\",\"name\":\"Drawmij's Instant Summons\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • 1 minute or Ritual • Touch — You touch the sapphire used in the casting and an object weighing 10 pounds or less whose longest dimension is 6 feet or less. The spell leaves an Inv\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sapphire worth 1,000+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou touch the sapphire used in the casting and an object weighing 10 pounds or less whose longest dimension is 6 feet or less. The spell leaves an [[Invisible|XPHB]] mark on that object and invisibly inscribes the object's name on the sapphire. Each time you cast this spell, you must use a different sapphire.\\n\\nThereafter, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to speak the object's name and crush the sapphire. The object instantly appears in your hand regardless of physical or planar distances, and the spell ends.\\n\\nIf another creature is holding or carrying the object, crushing the sapphire doesn't transport it, but instead you learn who that creature is and where that creature is currently located.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sapphire worth 1,000+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_dream_xphb\",\"name\":\"Dream\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Illusion • 1 minute • Self — You target a creature you know on the same plane of existence. You or a willing creature you touch enters a trance state to act as a dream messenger. \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a handful of sand)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou target a creature you know on the same plane of existence. You or a willing creature you touch enters a trance state to act as a dream messenger. While in the trance, the messenger is [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] and has a [[Speed|XPHB]] of 0.\\n\\nIf the target is asleep, the messenger appears in the target's dreams and can converse with the target as long as it remains asleep, through the spell's duration. The messenger can also shape the dream's environment, creating landscapes, objects, and other images. The messenger can emerge from the trance at any time, ending the spell. The target recalls the dream perfectly upon waking.\\n\\nIf the target is awake when you cast the spell, the messenger knows it and can either end the trance (and the spell) or wait for the target to sleep, at which point the messenger enters its dreams.\\n\\nYou can make the messenger terrifying to the target. If you do so, the messenger can deliver a message of no more than ten words, and then the target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the target gains no benefit from its rest, and it takes 3d6 Psychic damage when it wakes up.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a handful of sand)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_druidcraft_xphb\",\"name\":\"Druidcraft\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — Whispering to the spirits of nature, you create one of the following effects within range. Weather Sensor You create a Tiny, harmless sensory effect t\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nWhispering to the spirits of nature, you create one of the following effects within range.\\n\\n***Weather Sensor.*** You create a Tiny, harmless sensory effect that predicts what the weather will be at your location for the next 24 hours. The effect might manifest as a golden orb for clear skies, a cloud for rain, falling snowflakes for snow, and so on. This effect persists for 1 round.\\n\\n***Bloom.*** You instantly make a flower blossom, a seed pod open, or a leaf bud bloom.\\n\\n***Sensory Effect.*** You create a harmless sensory effect, such as falling leaves, spectral dancing fairies, a gentle breeze, the sound of an animal, or the faint odor of skunk. The effect must fit in a 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]].\\n\\n***Fire Play.*** You light or snuff out a candle, a torch, or a campfire.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Giant|BGG]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Arcane Archer|XGE]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Archer|AU]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Faerie|LFL]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Fairy|MPMM]], [[Fairy|WBtW]], [[Halfling (Lotusden)|EGW]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]], [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_earthquake_xphb\",\"name\":\"Earthquake\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Transmutation • Action • 500 feet — Choose a point on the ground that you can see within range. For the duration, an intense tremor rips through the ground in a 100-foot-radius circle ce\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 500 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a fractured rock)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose a point on the ground that you can see within range. For the duration, an intense tremor rips through the ground in a 100-foot-radius circle centered on that point. The ground there is [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]].\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell and at the end of each of your turns for the duration, each creature on the ground in the area makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature has the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition, and its [[Concentration|XPHB]] is broken.\\n\\nYou can also cause the effects below.\\n\\n***Fissures.*** A total of 1d6 fissures open in the spell's area at the end of the turn you cast it. You choose the fissures' locations, which can't be under structures. Each fissure is 1d10 × 10 feet deep and 10 feet wide, and it extends from one edge of the spell's area to another edge. A creature in the same space as a fissure must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or fall in. A creature that successfully saves moves with the fissure's edge as it opens.\\n\\n***Structures.*** The tremor deals 50 Bludgeoning damage to any structure in contact with the ground in the area when you cast the spell and at the end of each of your turns until the spell ends. If a structure drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], it collapses.\\n\\nA creature within a distance from a collapsing structure equal to half the structure's height makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 12d6 Bludgeoning damage, has the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition, and is buried in the rubble, requiring a DC 20 Strength ([[Athletics|XPHB]]) check as an action to escape. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage only.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"500 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a fractured rock)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_eldritch_blast_xphb\",\"name\":\"Eldritch Blast\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — You hurl a beam of crackling energy. Make a ranged spell attack against one creature or object in range. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Force damage.\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hurl a beam of crackling energy. Make a ranged spell attack against one creature or object in range. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Force damage.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The spell creates two beams at level 5, three beams at level 11, and four beams at level 17. You can direct the beams at the same target or at different ones. Make a separate attack roll for each beam.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_elemental_weapon_xphb\",\"name\":\"Elemental Weapon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Touch — A nonmagical weapon you touch becomes a magic weapon. Choose one of the following damage types: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder. For the durat\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nA nonmagical weapon you touch becomes a magic weapon. Choose one of the following damage types: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder. For the duration, the weapon has a +1 bonus to attack rolls and deals an extra 1d4 damage of the chosen type when it hits.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** If you use a level 5-6 spell slot, the bonus to attack rolls increases to +2, and the extra damage increases to 2d4. If you use a level 7+ spell slot, the bonus increases to +3, and the extra damage increases to 3d4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_elementalism_xphb\",\"name\":\"Elementalism\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You exert control over the elements, creating one of the following effects within range. Beckon Air You create a breeze strong enough to ripple cloth,\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou exert control over the elements, creating one of the following effects within range.\\n\\n***Beckon Air.*** You create a breeze strong enough to ripple cloth, stir dust, rustle leaves, and close open doors and shutters, all in a 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. Doors and shutters being held open by someone or something aren't affected.\\n\\n***Beckon Earth.*** You create a thin shroud of dust or sand that covers surfaces in a 5-foot-square area, or you cause a single word to appear in your handwriting in a patch of dirt or sand.\\n\\n***Beckon Fire.*** You create a thin cloud of harmless embers and colored, scented smoke in a 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. You choose the color and scent, and the embers can light candles, torches, or lamps in that area. The smoke's scent lingers for 1 minute.\\n\\n***Beckon Water.*** You create a spray of cool mist that lightly dampens creatures and objects in a 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. Alternatively, you create 1 cup of clean water either in an open container or on a surface, and the water evaporates in 1 minute.\\n\\n***Sculpt Element.*** You cause dirt, sand, fire, smoke, mist, or water that can fit in a 1-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] to assume a crude shape (such as that of a creature) for 1 hour.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Elements|XPHB]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_enhance_ability_xphb\",\"name\":\"Enhance Ability\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a creature and choose Strength, Dexterity, Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma. For the duration, the target has Advantage on ability checks u\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (fur or a feather)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou touch a creature and choose Strength, Dexterity, Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma. For the duration, the target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on ability checks using the chosen ability.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 2. You can choose a different ability for each target.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (fur or a feather)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_enlarge_reduce_xphb\",\"name\":\"Enlarge/Reduce\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — For the duration, the spell enlarges or reduces a creature or an object you can see within range (see the chosen effect below). A targeted object must\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of powdered iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the duration, the spell enlarges or reduces a creature or an object you can see within range (see the chosen effect below). A targeted object must be neither worn nor carried. If the target is an unwilling creature, it can make a Constitution saving throw. On a successful save, the spell has no effect.\\n\\nEverything that a targeted creature is wearing and carrying changes size with it. Any item it drops returns to normal size at once. A thrown weapon or piece of ammunition returns to normal size immediately after it hits or misses a target.\\n\\n***Enlarge.*** The target's size increases by one category—from Medium to Large, for example. The target also has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on Strength checks and Strength saving throws. The target's attacks with its enlarged weapons or Unarmed Strikes deal an extra 1d4 damage on a hit.\\n\\n***Reduce.*** The target's size decreases by one category—from Medium to Small, for example. The target also has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on Strength checks and Strength saving throws. The target's attacks with its reduced weapons or Unarmed Strikes deal 1d4 less damage on a hit (this can't reduce the damage below 1).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Duergar|MPMM]], [[Fairy|MPMM]], [[Dwarf (Duergar)|MTF]], [[Faerie|LFL]], [[Fairy|WBtW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]], [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of powdered iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ensnaring_strike_xphb\",\"name\":\"Ensnaring Strike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a weapon • Self — As you hit the target, grasping vines appear on it, and it makes a Strength saving throw. A Large or larger creature has Advantage on this save. On a \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a weapon\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nAs you hit the target, grasping vines appear on it, and it makes a Strength saving throw. A Large or larger creature has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on this save. On a failed save, the target has the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends. On a successful save, the vines shrivel away, and the spell ends.\\n\\nWhile [[Restrained|XPHB]], the target takes 1d6 Piercing damage at the start of each of its turns. The target or a creature within reach of it can take an action to make a Strength ([[Athletics|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. On a success, the spell ends.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a weapon\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Ranger\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_entangle_xphb\",\"name\":\"Entangle\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — Grasping plants sprout from the ground in a 20-foot square within range. For the duration, these plants turn the ground in the area into Difficult Ter\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nGrasping plants sprout from the ground in a 20-foot square within range. For the duration, these plants turn the ground in the area into [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]]. They disappear when the spell ends.\\n\\nEach creature (other than you) in the area when you cast the spell must succeed on a Strength saving throw or have the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends. A [[Restrained|XPHB]] creature can take an action to make a Strength ([[Athletics|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. On a success, it frees itself from the grasping plants and is no longer [[Restrained|XPHB]] by them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Lotusden)|EGW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Conjuration Adept|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]], [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_enthrall_xphb\",\"name\":\"Enthrall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You weave a distracting string of words, causing creatures of your choice that you can see within range to make a Wisdom saving throw. Any creature yo\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou weave a distracting string of words, causing creatures of your choice that you can see within range to make a Wisdom saving throw. Any creature you or your companions are fighting automatically succeeds on this save. On a failed save, a target has a -10 penalty to Wisdom ([[Perception|XPHB]]) checks and Passive [[Perception|XPHB]] until the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Variant; Devil's Tongue)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Enchantment Adept|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_etherealness_xphb\",\"name\":\"Etherealness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • Action • Self — You step into the border regions of the Ethereal Plane, where it overlaps with your current plane. You remain in the Border Ethereal for the duration.\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou step into the border regions of the Ethereal Plane, where it overlaps with your current plane. You remain in the Border Ethereal for the duration. During this time, you can move in any direction. If you move up or down, every foot of movement costs an extra foot. You can perceive the plane you left, which looks gray, and you can't see anything there more than 60 feet away.\\n\\nWhile on the Ethereal Plane, you can affect and be affected only by creatures, objects, and effects on that plane. Creatures that aren't on the Ethereal Plane can't perceive or interact with you unless a feature gives them the ability to do so.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, you return to the plane you left in the spot that corresponds to your space in the Border Ethereal. If you appear in an occupied space, you are shunted to the nearest unoccupied space and take Force damage equal to twice the number of feet you are moved.\\n\\nThis spell ends instantly if you cast it while you are on the Ethereal Plane or a plane that doesn't border it, such as one of the Outer Planes.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target up to three willing creatures (including yourself) for each spell slot level above 7. The creatures must be within 10 feet of you when you cast the spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_evard_s_black_tentacles_xphb\",\"name\":\"Evard's Black Tentacles\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — Squirming, ebony tentacles fill a 20-foot square on ground that you can see within range. For the duration, these tentacles turn the ground in that ar\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tentacle)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nSquirming, ebony tentacles fill a 20-foot square on ground that you can see within range. For the duration, these tentacles turn the ground in that area into [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]].\\n\\nEach creature in that area makes a Strength saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 3d6 Bludgeoning damage, and it has the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends. A creature also makes that save if it enters the area or ends its turn there. A creature makes that save only once per turn.\\n\\nA [[Restrained|XPHB]] creature can take an action to make a Strength ([[Athletics|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC, ending the condition on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tentacle)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"20-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_expeditious_retreat_xphb\",\"name\":\"Expeditious Retreat\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — You take the Dash action, and until the spell ends, you can take that action again as a Bonus Action.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou take the [[Dash|XPHB]] action, and until the spell ends, you can take that action again as a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_eyebite_xphb\",\"name\":\"Eyebite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • Action • Self — For the duration, your eyes become an inky void. One creature of your choice within 60 feet of you that you can see must succeed on a Wisdom saving th\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the duration, your eyes become an inky void. One creature of your choice within 60 feet of you that you can see must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be affected by one of the following effects of your choice for the duration.\\n\\nOn each of your turns until the spell ends, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to target another creature but can't target a creature again if it has succeeded on a save against this casting of the spell.\\n\\n***Asleep.*** The target has the [[Unconscious|XPHB]] condition. It wakes up if it takes any damage or if another creature takes an action to shake it awake.\\n\\n***Panicked.*** The target has the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition. On each of its turns, the [[Frightened|XPHB]] target must take the [[Dash|XPHB]] action and move away from you by the safest and shortest route available. If the target moves to a space at least 60 feet away from you where it can't see you, this effect ends.\\n\\n***Sickened.*** The target has the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fabricate_xphb\",\"name\":\"Fabricate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • 10 minutes • 120 feet — You convert raw materials into products of the same material. For example, you can fabricate a wooden bridge from a clump of trees, a rope from a patc\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou convert raw materials into products of the same material. For example, you can fabricate a wooden bridge from a clump of trees, a rope from a patch of hemp, or clothes from flax or wool.\\n\\nChoose raw materials that you can see within range. You can fabricate a Large or smaller object (contained within a 10-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] or eight connected 5-foot Cubes) given a sufficient quantity of material. If you're working with metal, stone, or another mineral substance, however, the fabricated object can be no larger than Medium (contained within a 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]). The quality of any fabricated objects is based on the quality of the raw materials.\\n\\nCreatures and magic items can't be created by this spell. You also can't use it to create items that require a high degree of skill—such as weapons and armor—unless you have proficiency with the type of [[Artisan's Tools|XPHB]] used to craft such objects.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"5-foot Cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_faerie_fire_xphb\",\"name\":\"Faerie Fire\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — Objects in a 20-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] within range are outlined in blue, green, or violet light (your choice). Each creature in the\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nObjects in a 20-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] within range are outlined in blue, green, or violet light (your choice). Each creature in the [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] is also outlined if it fails a Dexterity saving throw. For the duration, objects and affected creatures shed [[Dim Light|XPHB]] in a 10-foot radius and can't benefit from the [[Invisible|XPHB]] condition.\\n\\n[[Attack|XPHB]] rolls against an affected creature or object have [[Advantage|XPHB]] if the attacker can see it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Drow)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Faerie|LFL]], [[Fairy|MPMM]], [[Fairy|WBtW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Drow Descent)|SCAG]], [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Child of the Sun|LFL]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_false_life_xphb\",\"name\":\"False Life\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Necromancy • Action • Self — You gain 2d4 + 4 Temporary Hit Points.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of alcohol)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou gain 2d4 + 4 [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You gain 5 additional [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling|XPHB]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Fiendish Vigor|PHB]], [[Fiendish Vigor|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of alcohol)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fear_xphb\",\"name\":\"Fear\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Illusion • Action • Self — Each creature in a 30-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or drop whatever it is holding and have the Frigh\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a white feather)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nEach creature in a 30-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or drop whatever it is holding and have the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition for the duration.\\n\\nA [[Frightened|XPHB]] creature takes the [[Dash|XPHB]] action and moves away from you by the safest route on each of its turns unless there is nowhere to move. If the creature ends its turn in a space where it doesn't have line of sight to you, the creature makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the spell ends on that creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a white feather)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_feather_fall_xphb\",\"name\":\"Feather Fall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Reaction, which you take when you or a creature you can see within 60 feet of you falls • 60 feet — Choose up to five falling creatures within range. A falling creature's rate of descent slows to 60 feet per round until the spell ends. If a creature \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when you or a creature you can see within 60 feet of you falls\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a small feather or piece of down)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nChoose up to five falling creatures within range. A falling creature's rate of descent slows to 60 feet per round until the spell ends. If a creature lands before the spell ends, the creature takes no damage from the fall, and the spell ends for that creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Air)|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when you or a creature you can see within 60 feet of you falls\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a small feather or piece of down)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Reaction\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_feign_death_xphb\",\"name\":\"Feign Death\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action or Ritual • Touch — You touch a willing creature and put it into a cataleptic state that is indistinguishable from death. For the duration, the target appears dead to out\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of graveyard dirt)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a willing creature and put it into a cataleptic state that is indistinguishable from death.\\n\\nFor the duration, the target appears dead to outward inspection and to spells used to determine the target's status. The target has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] and [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] conditions, and its [[Speed|XPHB]] is 0.\\n\\nThe target also has [[Resistance|XPHB]] to all damage except Psychic damage, and it has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of graveyard dirt)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_find_familiar_xphb\",\"name\":\"Find Familiar\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • 1 hour or Ritual • 10 feet — You gain the service of a familiar, a spirit that takes an animal form you choose: Bat, Cat, Frog, Hawk, Lizard, Octopus, Owl, Rat, Raven, Spider, Wea\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (burning incense worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou gain the service of a familiar, a spirit that takes an animal form you choose: [[Bat|XMM]], [[Cat|XMM]], [[Frog|XMM]], [[Hawk|XMM]], [[Lizard|XMM]], [[Octopus|XMM]], [[Owl|XMM]], [[Rat|XMM]], [[Raven|XMM]], [[Spider|XMM]], [[Weasel|XMM]], or another Beast that has a Challenge Rating of 0. Appearing in an unoccupied space within range, the familiar has the statistics of the chosen form, though it is a Celestial, Fey, or Fiend (your choice) instead of a Beast. Your familiar acts independently of you, but it obeys your commands.\\n\\n***Telepathic Connection.*** While your familiar is within 100 feet of you, you can communicate with it telepathically. Additionally, as a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you can see through the familiar's eyes and hear what it hears until the start of your next turn, gaining the benefits of any special senses it has.\\n\\nFinally, when you cast a spell with a range of touch, your familiar can deliver the touch. Your familiar must be within 100 feet of you, and it must take a [[Reaction|XPHB]] to deliver the touch when you cast the spell.\\n\\n***Combat.*** The familiar is an ally to you and your allies. It rolls its own [[Initiative|XPHB]] and acts on its own turn. A familiar can't attack, but it can take other actions as normal.\\n\\n***Disappearance of the Familiar.*** When the familiar drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], it disappears. It reappears after you cast this spell again. As a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, you can temporarily dismiss the familiar to a pocket dimension. Alternatively, you can dismiss it forever. As a [[Magic|XPHB]] action while it is temporarily dismissed, you can cause it to reappear in an unoccupied space within 30 feet of you. Whenever the familiar drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or disappears into the pocket dimension, it leaves behind in its space anything it was wearing or carrying.\\n\\n***One Familiar Only.*** You can't have more than one familiar at a time. If you cast this spell while you have a familiar, you instead cause it to adopt a new eligible form.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Familiar Friend|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Servo Crafting|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Strixhaven Mascot|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Chain|PHB]], [[Pact of the Chain|XPHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour or Ritual\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (burning incense worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_find_steed_xphb\",\"name\":\"Find Steed\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — You summon an otherworldly being that appears as a loyal steed in an unoccupied space of your choice within range. This creature uses the Otherworldly\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou summon an otherworldly being that appears as a loyal steed in an unoccupied space of your choice within range. This creature uses the [[Otherworldly Steed|XPHB]] stat block. If you already have a steed from this spell, the steed is replaced by the new one.\\n\\nThe steed resembles a Large, rideable animal of your choice, such as a horse, a camel, a dire wolf, or an elk. Whenever you cast the spell, choose the steed's creature type—Celestial, Fey, or Fiend—which determines certain traits in the stat block.\\n\\n***Combat.*** The steed is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, it shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, and it functions as a controlled mount while you ride it (as defined in the rules on *mounted combat*). If you have the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition, the steed takes its turn immediately after yours and acts independently, focusing on protecting you.\\n\\n***Disappearance of the Steed.*** The steed disappears if it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or if you die. When it disappears, it leaves behind anything it was wearing or carrying. If you cast this spell again, you decide whether you summon the steed that disappeared or a different one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_find_the_path_xphb\",\"name\":\"Find the Path\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Divination • 1 minute • Self — You magically sense the most direct physical route to a location you name. You must be familiar with the location, and the spell fails if you name a d\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a set of divination tools—such as cards or runes—worth 100+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 day\\nYou magically sense the most direct physical route to a location you name. You must be familiar with the location, and the spell fails if you name a destination on another plane of existence, a moving destination (such as a mobile fortress), or an unspecific destination (such as \\\"a green dragon's lair\\\").\\n\\nFor the duration, as long as you are on the same plane of existence as the destination, you know how far it is and in what direction it lies. Whenever you face a choice of paths along the way there, you know which path is the most direct.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a set of divination tools—such as cards or runes—worth 100+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 day\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_find_traps_xphb\",\"name\":\"Find Traps\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • 120 feet — You sense any trap within range that is within line of sight. A trap, for the purpose of this spell, includes any object or mechanism that was created\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou sense any trap within range that is within line of sight. A trap, for the purpose of this spell, includes any object or mechanism that was created to cause damage or other danger. Thus, the spell would sense the [[Alarm|XPHB]] or [[Glyph of Warding|XPHB]] spell or a mechanical pit trap, but it wouldn't reveal a natural weakness in the floor, an unstable ceiling, or a hidden sinkhole.\\n\\nThis spell reveals that a trap is present but not its location. You do learn the general nature of the danger posed by a trap you sense.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_finger_of_death_xphb\",\"name\":\"Finger of Death\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You unleash negative energy toward a creature you can see within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 7d8 + 30 Necrotic damage \",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash negative energy toward a creature you can see within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 7d8 + 30 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nA Humanoid killed by this spell rises at the start of your next turn as a [[Zombie|XMM]] that follows your verbal orders.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"7d8 + 30\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fire_bolt_xphb\",\"name\":\"Fire Bolt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — You hurl a mote of fire at a creature or an object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Fire d\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hurl a mote of fire at a creature or an object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Fire damage. A flammable object hit by this spell starts [[burning|XPHB]] if it isn't being worn or carried.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d10 when you reach levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Tiefling|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Overload|AU]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fire_shield_xphb\",\"name\":\"Fire Shield\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • Self — Wispy flames wreathe your body for the duration, shedding Bright Light in a 10-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 10 feet. The flames provide\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus or a firefly)\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nWispy flames wreathe your body for the duration, shedding [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 10-foot radius and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 10 feet.\\n\\nThe flames provide you with a warm shield or a chill shield, as you choose. The warm shield grants you [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Cold damage, and the chill shield grants you [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Fire damage.\\n\\nIn addition, whenever a creature within 5 feet of you hits you with a melee attack roll, the shield erupts with flame. The attacker takes 2d8 Fire damage from a warm shield or 2d8 Cold damage from a chill shield.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of phosphorus or a firefly)\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fire_storm_xphb\",\"name\":\"Fire Storm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — A storm of fire appears within range. The area of the storm consists of up to ten 10-foot Cubes, which you arrange as you like. Each [[Cube [Area of E\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA storm of fire appears within range. The area of the storm consists of up to ten 10-foot Cubes, which you arrange as you like. Each [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] must be contiguous with at least one other [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. Each creature in the area makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 7d10 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nFlammable objects in the area that aren't being worn or carried start [[burning|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"7d10\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot Cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fireball_xphb\",\"name\":\"Fireball\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — A bright streak flashes from you to a point you choose within range and then blossoms with a low roar into a fiery explosion. Each creature in a 20-fo\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a ball of bat guano and sulfur)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA bright streak flashes from you to a point you choose within range and then blossoms with a low roar into a fiery explosion. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on that point makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 8d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nFlammable objects in the area that aren't being worn or carried start [[burning|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Evocation Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Flames of the Phoenix|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a ball of bat guano and sulfur)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flame_blade_xphb\",\"name\":\"Flame Blade\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Bonus action • Self — You evoke a fiery blade in your free hand. The blade is similar in size and shape to a scimitar, and it lasts for the duration. If you let go of the b\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sumac leaf)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou evoke a fiery blade in your free hand. The blade is similar in size and shape to a scimitar, and it lasts for the duration. If you let go of the blade, it disappears, but you can evoke it again as a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]].\\n\\nAs a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, you can make a melee spell attack with the fiery blade. On a hit, the target takes Fire damage equal to 3d6 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\nThe flaming blade sheds [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 10-foot radius and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 10 feet.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Flamekin|LFL]], [[Rimekin|LFL]], [[Genasi (Fire)|MPMM]], [[Tiefling (Mephistopheles)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sumac leaf)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flame_strike_xphb\",\"name\":\"Flame Strike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — A vertical column of brilliant fire roars down from above. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]]\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of sulfur)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA vertical column of brilliant fire roars down from above. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 5d6 Fire damage and 5d6 Radiant damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The Fire damage and the Radiant damage increase by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of sulfur)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flaming_sphere_xphb\",\"name\":\"Flaming Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — You create a 5-foot-diameter sphere of fire in an unoccupied space on the ground within range. It lasts for the duration. Any creature that ends its t\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a ball of wax)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a 5-foot-diameter sphere of fire in an unoccupied space on the ground within range. It lasts for the duration. Any creature that ends its turn within 5 feet of the sphere makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 2d6 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you can move the sphere up to 30 feet, rolling it along the ground. If you move the sphere into a creature's space, that creature makes the save against the sphere, and the sphere stops moving for the turn.\\n\\nWhen you move the sphere, you can direct it over barriers up to 5 feet tall and jump it across pits up to 10 feet wide. Flammable objects that aren't being worn or carried start [[burning|XPHB]] if touched by the sphere, and it sheds [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 20-foot radius and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 20 feet.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a ball of wax)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_flesh_to_stone_xphb\",\"name\":\"Flesh to Stone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to turn one creature that you can see within range into stone. The target makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it has the \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a cockatrice feather)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to turn one creature that you can see within range into stone. The target makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it has the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition for the duration. On a successful save, its [[Speed|XPHB]] is 0 until the start of your next turn. Constructs automatically succeed on the save.\\n\\nA [[Restrained|XPHB]] target makes another Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves against this spell three times, the spell ends. If it fails its saves three times, it is turned to stone and has the [[Petrified|XPHB]] condition for the duration. The successes and failures needn't be consecutive; keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind.\\n\\nIf you maintain your [[Concentration|XPHB]] on this spell for the entire possible duration, the target is [[Petrified|XPHB]] until the condition is ended by [[Greater Restoration|XPHB]] or similar magic.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a cockatrice feather)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fly_xphb\",\"name\":\"Fly\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature. For the duration, the target gains a Fly Speed of 60 feet and can hover. When the spell ends, the target falls if it is \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a feather)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou touch a willing creature. For the duration, the target gains a [[Fly Speed|XPHB]] of 60 feet and can hover. When the spell ends, the target falls if it is still aloft unless it can stop the fall.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Ride the Wind|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a feather)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fog_cloud_xphb\",\"name\":\"Fog Cloud\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — You create a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of fog centered on a point within range. The [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou create a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of fog centered on a point within range. The [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] is [[Heavily Obscured|XPHB]]. It lasts for the duration or until a strong wind (such as one created by [[Gust of Wind|XPHB]]) disperses it.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The fog's radius increases by 20 feet for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]], [[Triton|MOT]], [[Triton|MPMM]], [[Triton|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Cloying Mists|ABH]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_forbiddance_xphb\",\"name\":\"Forbiddance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • 10 minutes or Ritual • Touch — You create a ward against magical travel that protects up to 40,000 square feet of floor space to a height of 30 feet above the floor. For the duratio\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (ruby dust worth 1,000+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** 1 day\\nYou create a ward against magical travel that protects up to 40,000 square feet of floor space to a height of 30 feet above the floor. For the duration, creatures can't teleport into the area or use portals, such as those created by the [[Gate|XPHB]] spell, to enter the area. The spell proofs the area against planar travel, and therefore prevents creatures from accessing the area by way of the Astral Plane, the Ethereal Plane, the Feywild, the Shadowfell, or the [[Plane Shift|XPHB]] spell.\\n\\nIn addition, the spell damages types of creatures that you choose when you cast it. Choose one or more of the following: Aberrations, Celestials, Elementals, Fey, Fiends, and Undead. When a creature of a chosen type enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there, the creature takes 5d10 Radiant or Necrotic damage (your choice when you cast this spell).\\n\\nYou can designate a password when you cast the spell. A creature that speaks the password as it enters the area takes no damage from the spell.\\n\\nThe spell's area can't overlap with the area of another Forbiddance spell. If you cast [[Forbiddance|XPHB]] every day for 30 days in the same location, the spell lasts until it is dispelled, and the Material components are consumed on the last casting.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (ruby dust worth 1,000+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"1 day\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"5d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_forcecage_xphb\",\"name\":\"Forcecage\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • 100 feet — An immobile, Invisible, [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]-shaped prison composed of magical force springs into existence around an area you choose w\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 100 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (ruby dust worth 1,500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nAn immobile, [[Invisible|XPHB]], [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]-shaped prison composed of magical force springs into existence around an area you choose within range. The prison can be a cage or a solid box, as you choose.\\n\\nA prison in the shape of a cage can be up to 20 feet on a side and is made from 1/2-inch diameter bars spaced 1/2 inch apart. A prison in the shape of a box can be up to 10 feet on a side, creating a solid barrier that prevents any matter from passing through it and blocking any spells cast into or out from the area.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, any creature that is completely inside the cage's area is trapped. Creatures only partially within the area, or those too large to fit inside it, are pushed away from the center of the area until they are completely outside it.\\n\\nA creature inside the cage can't leave it by nonmagical means. If the creature tries to use teleportation or interplanar travel to leave, it must first make a Charisma saving throw. On a successful save, the creature can use that magic to exit the cage. On a failed save, the creature doesn't exit the cage and wastes the spell or effect. The cage also extends into the Ethereal Plane, blocking ethereal travel.\\n\\nThis spell can't be dispelled by [[Dispel Magic|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"100 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (ruby dust worth 1,500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_foresight_xphb\",\"name\":\"Foresight\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Divination • 1 minute • Touch — You touch a willing creature and bestow a limited ability to see into the immediate future. For the duration, the target has Advantage on D20 Tests, a\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a hummingbird feather)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch a willing creature and bestow a limited ability to see into the immediate future. For the duration, the target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on [[D20 Test|XPHB|D20 Tests]], and other creatures have [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against it. The spell ends early if you cast it again.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a hummingbird feather)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 9\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_fount_of_moonlight_xphb\",\"name\":\"Fount of Moonlight\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • Self — A cool light wreathes your body for the duration, emitting Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet. Until the spell e\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA cool light wreathes your body for the duration, emitting [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 20-foot radius and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 20 feet.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you have [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Radiant damage, and your melee attacks deal an extra 2d6 Radiant damage on a hit.\\n\\nIn addition, immediately after you take damage from a creature you can see within 60 feet of yourself, you can take a [[Reaction|XPHB]] to force the creature to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the creature has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition until the end of your next turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Moon|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_freedom_of_movement_xphb\",\"name\":\"Freedom of Movement\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature. For the duration, the target's movement is unaffected by Difficult Terrain, and spells and other magical effects can nei\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a leather strap)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a willing creature. For the duration, the target's movement is unaffected by [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]], and spells and other magical effects can neither reduce the target's [[Speed|XPHB]] nor cause the target to have the [[Paralyzed|XPHB]] or [[Restrained|XPHB]] conditions. The target also has a [[Swim Speed|XPHB]] equal to its [[Speed|XPHB]].\\n\\nIn addition, the target can spend 5 feet of movement to automatically escape from nonmagical restraints, such as manacles or a creature imposing the [[Grappled|XPHB]] condition on it.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]], [[Simic Scientist|GGR]], [[Prismari Student|SCC]], [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Trickster's Escape|XGE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a leather strap)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_friends_xphb\",\"name\":\"Friends\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Enchantment Cantrip • Action • 10 feet — You magically emanate a sense of friendship toward one creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the\",\"content\":\"*Enchantment Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (some makeup)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou magically emanate a sense of friendship toward one creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. The target succeeds automatically if it isn't a Humanoid, if you're fighting it, or if you have cast this spell on it within the past 24 hours.\\n\\nThe spell ends early if the target takes damage or if you make an attack roll, deal damage, or force anyone to make a saving throw. When the spell ends, the target knows it was [[Charmed|XPHB]] by you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Siren|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Tiefling (Fierna)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Infiltrator|AU]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (some makeup)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gaseous_form_xphb\",\"name\":\"Gaseous Form\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Touch — A willing creature you touch shape-shifts, along with everything it's wearing and carrying, into a misty cloud for the duration. The spell ends on the\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of gauze)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nA willing creature you touch shape-shifts, along with everything it's wearing and carrying, into a misty cloud for the duration. The spell ends on the target if it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or if it takes a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to end the spell on itself.\\n\\nWhile in this form, the target's only method of movement is a [[Fly Speed|XPHB]] of 10 feet, and it can hover. The target can enter and occupy the space of another creature. The target has [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage; it has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition; and it has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on Strength, Dexterity, and Constitution saving throws. The target can pass through narrow openings, but it treats liquids as though they were solid surfaces.\\n\\nThe target can't talk or manipulate objects, and any objects it was carrying or holding can't be dropped, used, or otherwise interacted with. Finally, the target can't attack or cast spells.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Misty Escape|ABH]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]], [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Mist Stance|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of gauze)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gate_xphb\",\"name\":\"Gate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You conjure a portal linking an unoccupied space you can see within range to a precise location on a different plane of existence. The portal is a cir\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth 5,000+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou conjure a portal linking an unoccupied space you can see within range to a precise location on a different plane of existence. The portal is a circular opening, which you can make 5 to 20 feet in diameter. You can orient the portal in any direction you choose. The portal lasts for the duration, and the portal's destination is visible through it.\\n\\nThe portal has a front and a back on each plane where it appears. Travel through the portal is possible only by moving through its front. Anything that does so is instantly transported to the other plane, appearing in the unoccupied space nearest to the portal.\\n\\nDeities and other planar rulers can prevent portals created by this spell from opening in their presence or anywhere within their domains.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can speak the name of a specific creature (a pseudonym, title, or nickname doesn't work). If that creature is on a plane other than the one you are on, the portal opens next to the named creature and transports it to the nearest unoccupied space on your side of the portal. You gain no special power over the creature, and it is free to act as the DM deems appropriate. It might leave, attack you, or help you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth 5,000+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_geas_xphb\",\"name\":\"Geas\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • 1 minute • 60 feet — You give a verbal command to a creature that you can see within range, ordering it to carry out some service or refrain from an action or a course of \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 30 days\\nYou give a verbal command to a creature that you can see within range, ordering it to carry out some service or refrain from an action or a course of activity as you decide. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. The target automatically succeeds if it can't understand your command.\\n\\nWhile [[Charmed|XPHB]], the creature takes 5d10 Psychic damage if it acts in a manner directly counter to your command. It takes this damage no more than once each day.\\n\\nYou can issue any command you choose, short of an activity that would result in certain death. Should you issue a suicidal command, the spell ends.\\n\\nA [[Remove Curse|XPHB]], [[Greater Restoration|XPHB]], or [[Wish|XPHB]] spell ends this spell.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** If you use a level 7 or 8 spell slot, the duration is 365 days. If you use a level 9 spell slot, the spell lasts until it is ended by one of the spells mentioned above.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"30 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"5d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gentle_repose_xphb\",\"name\":\"Gentle Repose\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Necromancy • Action or Ritual • Touch — You touch a corpse or other remains. For the duration, the target is protected from decay and can't become Undead. The spell also effectively extends \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (2 Copper Pieces, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nYou touch a corpse or other remains. For the duration, the target is protected from decay and can't become Undead.\\n\\nThe spell also effectively extends the time limit on raising the target from the dead, since days spent under the influence of this spell don't count against the time limit of spells such as [[Raise Dead|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Spores|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (2 Copper Pieces, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_giant_insect_xphb\",\"name\":\"Giant Insect\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You summon a giant centipede, spider, or wasp (chosen when you cast the spell). It manifests in an unoccupied space you can see within range and uses \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou summon a giant centipede, spider, or wasp (chosen when you cast the spell). It manifests in an unoccupied space you can see within range and uses the [[Giant Insect|XPHB]] stat block. The form you choose determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_glibness_xphb\",\"name\":\"Glibness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Enchantment • Action • Self — Until the spell ends, when you make a Charisma check, you can replace the number you roll with a 15. Additionally, no matter what you say, magic that \",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nUntil the spell ends, when you make a Charisma check, you can replace the number you roll with a 15. Additionally, no matter what you say, magic that would determine if you are telling the truth indicates that you are being truthful.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_globe_of_invulnerability_xphb\",\"name\":\"Globe of Invulnerability\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • Action • Self — An immobile, shimmering barrier appears in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] around you and remains for the duration. Any spell \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a glass bead)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nAn immobile, shimmering barrier appears in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] around you and remains for the duration.\\n\\nAny spell of level 5 or lower cast from outside the barrier can't affect anything within it. Such a spell can target creatures and objects within the barrier, but the spell has no effect on them. Similarly, the area within the barrier is excluded from areas of effect created by such spells.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The barrier blocks spells of 1 level higher for each spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a glass bead)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_glyph_of_warding_xphb\",\"name\":\"Glyph of Warding\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • 1 hour • Touch — You inscribe a glyph that later unleashes a magical effect. You inscribe it either on a surface (such as a table or a section of floor) or within an o\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (powdered diamond worth 200+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled or triggered\\nYou inscribe a glyph that later unleashes a magical effect. You inscribe it either on a surface (such as a table or a section of floor) or within an object that can be closed (such as a book or chest) to conceal the glyph. The glyph can cover an area no larger than 10 feet in diameter. If the surface or object is moved more than 10 feet from where you cast this spell, the glyph is broken, and the spell ends without being triggered.\\n\\nThe glyph is nearly imperceptible and requires a successful Wisdom ([[Perception|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC to notice.\\n\\nWhen you inscribe the glyph, you set its trigger and choose whether it's an explosive rune or a spell glyph, as explained below.\\n\\n***Set the Trigger.*** You decide what triggers the glyph when you cast the spell. For glyphs inscribed on a surface, common triggers include touching or stepping on the glyph, removing another object covering it, or approaching within a certain distance of it. For glyphs inscribed within an object, common triggers include opening that object or seeing the glyph. Once a glyph is triggered, this spell ends.\\n\\nYou can refine the trigger so that only creatures of certain types activate it (for example, the glyph could be set to affect Aberrations). You can also set conditions for creatures that don't trigger the glyph, such as those who say a certain password.\\n\\n***Explosive Rune.*** When triggered, the glyph erupts with magical energy in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on the glyph. Each creature in the area makes a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 5d8 Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder damage (your choice when you create the glyph) on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***Spell Glyph.*** You can store a prepared spell of level 3 or lower in the glyph by casting it as part of creating the glyph. The spell must target a single creature or an area. The spell being stored has no immediate effect when cast in this way.\\n\\nWhen the glyph is triggered, the stored spell takes effect. If the spell has a target, it targets the creature that triggered the glyph. If the spell affects an area, the area is centered on that creature. If the spell summons [[Hostile [Attitude]|XPHB|Hostile]] creatures or creates harmful objects or traps, they appear as close as possible to the intruder and attack it. If the spell requires [[Concentration|XPHB]], it lasts until the end of its full duration.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage of an explosive rune increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3. If you create a spell glyph, you can store any spell of up to the same level as the spell slot you use for the Glyph of Warding.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (powdered diamond worth 200+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled or triggered\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"5d8\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_goodberry_xphb\",\"name\":\"Goodberry\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • Touch — Ten berries appear in your hand and are infused with magic for the duration. A creature can take a Bonus Action to eat one berry. Eating a berry resto\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a sprig of mistletoe)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nTen berries appear in your hand and are infused with magic for the duration. A creature can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to eat one berry. Eating a berry restores 1 [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]], and the berry provides enough nourishment to sustain a creature for one day.\\n\\nUneaten berries disappear when the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a sprig of mistletoe)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"1\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_grasping_vine_xphb\",\"name\":\"Grasping Vine\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Bonus action • 60 feet — You conjure a vine that sprouts from a surface in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The vine lasts for the duration. Make a melee spe\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou conjure a vine that sprouts from a surface in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The vine lasts for the duration.\\n\\nMake a melee spell attack against a creature within 30 feet of the vine. On a hit, the target takes 4d8 Bludgeoning damage and is pulled up to 30 feet toward the vine; if the target is Huge or smaller, it has the [[Grappled|XPHB]] condition (escape DC equal to your spell save DC). The vine can grapple only one creature at a time, and you can cause the vine to release a [[Grappled|XPHB]] creature (no action required).\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on your later turns, you can repeat the attack against a creature within 30 feet of the vine.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The number of creatures the vine can grapple increases by one for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_grease_xphb\",\"name\":\"Grease\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — Nonflammable grease covers the ground in a 10-foot square centered on a point within range and turns it into Difficult Terrain for the duration. When \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of pork rind or butter)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nNonflammable grease covers the ground in a 10-foot square centered on a point within range and turns it into [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the grease appears, each creature standing in its area must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or have the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition. A creature that enters the area or ends its turn there must also succeed on that save or fall [[Prone|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of pork rind or butter)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_greater_invisibility_xphb\",\"name\":\"Greater Invisibility\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Illusion • Action • Touch — A creature you touch has the Invisible condition until the spell ends.\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA creature you touch has the [[Invisible|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_greater_restoration_xphb\",\"name\":\"Greater Restoration\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a creature and magically remove one of the following effects from it: - 1 Exhaustion level - The Charmed or Petrified condition - A curse, i\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (diamond dust worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a creature and magically remove one of the following effects from it:\\n\\n- 1 [[Exhaustion|XPHB]] level\\n- The [[Charmed|XPHB]] or [[Petrified|XPHB]] condition\\n- A curse, including the target's [[Attunement|XPHB]] to a cursed magic item\\n- Any reduction to one of the target's ability scores\\n- Any reduction to the target's [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] maximum\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (diamond dust worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_guardian_of_faith_xphb\",\"name\":\"Guardian of Faith\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — A Large spectral guardian appears and hovers for the duration in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The guardian occupies that space a\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nA Large spectral guardian appears and hovers for the duration in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The guardian occupies that space and is invulnerable, and it appears in a form appropriate for your deity or pantheon.\\n\\nAny enemy that moves to a space within 10 feet of the guardian for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 20 Radiant damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. The guardian vanishes when it has dealt a total of 60 damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_guards_and_wards_xphb\",\"name\":\"Guards and Wards\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • 1 hour • Touch — You create a ward that protects up to 2,500 square feet of floor space. The warded area can be up to 20 feet tall, and you shape it as one 50-foot squ\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a silver rod worth 10+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou create a ward that protects up to 2,500 square feet of floor space. The warded area can be up to 20 feet tall, and you shape it as one 50-foot square, one hundred 5-foot squares that are contiguous, or twenty-five 10-foot squares that are contiguous.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can specify individuals that are unaffected by the spell's effects. You can also specify a password that, when spoken aloud within 5 feet of the warded area, makes the speaker immune to its effects.\\n\\nThe spell creates the effects below within the warded area. [[Dispel Magic|XPHB]] has no effect on Guards and Wards itself, but each of the following effects can be dispelled. If all four are dispelled, Guards and Wards ends. If you cast the spell every day for 365 days on the same area, the spell thereafter lasts until all its effects are dispelled.\\n\\n***Corridors.*** Fog fills all the warded corridors, making them [[Heavily Obscured|XPHB]]. In addition, at each intersection or branching passage offering a choice of direction, there is a 50 percent chance that a creature other than you believes it is going in the opposite direction from the one it chooses.\\n\\n***Doors.*** All doors in the warded area are magically locked, as if sealed by the [[Arcane Lock|XPHB]] spell. In addition, you can cover up to ten doors with an illusion to make them appear as plain sections of wall.\\n\\n***Stairs.*** Webs fill all stairs in the warded area from top to bottom, as in the [[Web|XPHB]] spell. These strands regrow in 10 minutes if they are destroyed while Guards and Wards lasts.\\n\\n***Other Spell Effect.*** Place one of the following magical effects within the warded area:\\n\\n- [[Dancing Lights|XPHB]] in four corridors, with a simple program that the lights repeat as long as Guards and Wards lasts\\n- [[Magic Mouth|XPHB]] in two locations\\n- [[Stinking Cloud|XPHB]] in two locations (the vapors return within 10 minutes if dispersed while Guards and Wards lasts)\\n- [[Gust of Wind|XPHB]] in one corridor or room (the wind blows continuously while the spell lasts)\\n- [[Suggestion|XPHB]] in one 5-foot square; any creature that enters that square receives the suggestion mentally\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a silver rod worth 10+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"50-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_guidance_xphb\",\"name\":\"Guidance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Divination Cantrip • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature and choose a skill. Until the spell ends, the creature adds 1d4 to any ability check using the chosen skill.\",\"content\":\"*Divination Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou touch a willing creature and choose a skill. Until the spell ends, the creature adds 1d4 to any ability check using the chosen skill.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Spirits|VRGR]] ([[Bard|PHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Circle of Stars|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Stars|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Arcane Omens|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_guiding_bolt_xphb\",\"name\":\"Guiding Bolt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You hurl a bolt of light toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 4d6 Radiant damage, and the\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou hurl a bolt of light toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 4d6 Radiant damage, and the next attack roll made against it before the end of your next turn has [[Advantage|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Stars|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Stars|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_gust_of_wind_xphb\",\"name\":\"Gust of Wind\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • Self — A [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] of strong wind 60 feet long and 10 feet wide blasts from you in a direction you choose for the duration. Each cr\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a legume seed)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] of strong wind 60 feet long and 10 feet wide blasts from you in a direction you choose for the duration. Each creature in the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pushed 15 feet away from you in a direction following the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]]. A creature that ends its turn in the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] must make the same save.\\n\\nAny creature in the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] must spend 2 feet of movement for every 1 foot it moves when moving closer to you.\\n\\nThe gust disperses gas or vapor, and it extinguishes candles and similar unprotected flames in the area. It causes protected flames, such as those of lanterns, to dance wildly and has a 50 percent chance to extinguish them.\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on your later turns, you can change the direction in which the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] blasts from you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Aarakocra|MPMM]], [[Triton|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]], [[Triton|MOT]], [[Triton|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Rush of the Gale Spirits|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a legume seed)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hail_of_thorns_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hail of Thorns\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Ranged weapon • Self — As you hit the creature, this spell creates a rain of thorns that sprouts from your Ranged weapon or ammunition. The target of the attack and each cre\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Ranged weapon\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nAs you hit the creature, this spell creates a rain of thorns that sprouts from your Ranged weapon or ammunition. The target of the attack and each creature within 5 feet of it make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 1d10 Piercing damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Ranged weapon\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Ranger\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hallow_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hallow\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • 24 hours • Touch — You touch a point and infuse an area around it with holy or unholy power. The area can have a radius up to 60 feet, and the spell fails if the radius \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 24 hours\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (incense worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou touch a point and infuse an area around it with holy or unholy power. The area can have a radius up to 60 feet, and the spell fails if the radius includes an area already under the effect of Hallow. The affected area has the following effects.\\n\\n***Hallowed Ward.*** Choose any of these creature types: Aberration, Celestial, Elemental, Fey, Fiend, or Undead. Creatures of the chosen types can't willingly enter the area, and any creature that is possessed by or that has the [[Charmed|XPHB]] or [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition from such creatures isn't possessed, [[Charmed|XPHB]], or [[Frightened|XPHB]] by them while in the area.\\n\\n***Extra Effect.*** You bind an extra effect to the area from the list below:\\n\\n- **Courage.** Creatures of any types you choose can't gain the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition while in the area.\\n- **Darkness.** [[Darkness|XPHB]] fills the area. Normal light, as well as magical light created by spells of a level lower than this spell, can't illuminate the area.\\n- **Daylight.** Bright light fills the area. Magical [[Darkness|XPHB]] created by spells of a level lower than this spell can't extinguish the light.\\n- **Peaceful Rest.** [[Dead|XPHB]] bodies interred in the area can't be turned into Undead.\\n- **Extradimensional Interference.** Creatures of any types you choose can't enter or exit the area using teleportation or interplanar travel.\\n- **Fear.** Creatures of any types you choose have the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition while in the area.\\n- **Resistance.** Creatures of any types you choose have [[Resistance|XPHB]] to one damage type of your choice while in the area.\\n- **Silence.** No sound can emanate from within the area, and no sound can reach into it.\\n- **Tongues.** Creatures of any types you choose can communicate with any other creature in the area even if they don't share a common language.\\n- **Vulnerability.** Creatures of any types you choose have [[Vulnerability|XPHB]] to one damage type of your choice while in the area.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"24 hours\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (incense worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hallucinatory_terrain_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hallucinatory Terrain\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Illusion • 10 minutes • 300 feet — You make natural terrain in a 150-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] in range look, sound, and smell like another sort of natural terrain. Thus,\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a mushroom)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou make natural terrain in a 150-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] in range look, sound, and smell like another sort of natural terrain. Thus, open fields or a road can be made to resemble a swamp, hill, crevasse, or some other difficult or impassable terrain. A pond can be made to seem like a grassy meadow, a precipice like a gentle slope, or a rock-strewn gully like a wide and smooth road. Manufactured structures, equipment, and creatures within the area aren't changed.\\n\\nThe tactile characteristics of the terrain are unchanged, so creatures entering the area are likely to notice the illusion. If the difference isn't obvious by touch, a creature examining the illusion can take the [[Study|XPHB]] action to make an Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC to disbelieve it. If a creature discerns that the terrain is illusory, the creature sees a vague image superimposed on the real terrain.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Illusion Adept|AU]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a mushroom)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 4\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_harm_xphb\",\"name\":\"Harm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You unleash virulent magic on a creature you can see within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 14d6 Necro\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash virulent magic on a creature you can see within range. The target makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, it takes 14d6 Necrotic damage, and its [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the Necrotic damage it took. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage only. This spell can't reduce a target's [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] maximum below 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"14d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_haste_xphb\",\"name\":\"Haste\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — Choose a willing creature that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, the target's Speed is doubled, it gains a +2 bonus to Armor Class, it h\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a shaving of licorice root)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose a willing creature that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, the target's [[Speed|XPHB]] is doubled, it gains a +2 bonus to [[Armor Class|XPHB]], it has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on Dexterity saving throws, and it gains an additional action on each of its turns. That action can be used to take only the [[Attack|XPHB]] (one attack only), [[Dash|XPHB]], [[Disengage|XPHB]], [[Hide|XPHB]], or [[Utilize|XPHB]] action.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the target is [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] and has a [[Speed|XPHB]] of 0 until the end of its next turn, as a wave of lethargy washes over it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]], [[Quandrix Student|SCC]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a shaving of licorice root)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_heal_xphb\",\"name\":\"Heal\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Abjuration • Action • 60 feet — Choose a creature that you can see within range. Positive energy washes through the target, restoring 70 Hit Points. This spell also ends the Blinded,\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose a creature that you can see within range. Positive energy washes through the target, restoring 70 [[Hit Points|XPHB]]. This spell also ends the [[Blinded|XPHB]], [[Deafened|XPHB]], and [[Poisoned|XPHB]] conditions on the target.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The healing increases by 10 for each spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_healing_word_xphb\",\"name\":\"Healing Word\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Bonus action • 60 feet — A creature of your choice that you can see within range regains Hit Points equal to 2d4 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA creature of your choice that you can see within range regains [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to 2d4 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The healing increases by 2d4 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"healing\":\"2d4\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_heat_metal_xphb\",\"name\":\"Heat Metal\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — Choose a manufactured metal object, such as a metal weapon or a suit of Heavy or Medium metal armor, that you can see within range. You cause the obje\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of iron and a flame)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose a manufactured metal object, such as a metal weapon or a suit of Heavy or Medium metal armor, that you can see within range. You cause the object to glow red-hot. Any creature in physical contact with the object takes 2d8 Fire damage when you cast the spell. Until the spell ends, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on each of your later turns to deal this damage again if the object is within range.\\n\\nIf a creature is holding or wearing the object and takes the damage from it, the creature must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or drop the object if it can. If it doesn't drop the object, it has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls and ability checks until the start of your next turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of iron and a flame)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hellish_rebuke_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hellish Rebuke\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Reaction, which you take in response to taking damage from a creature that you can see within 60 feet of yourself • 60 feet — The creature that damaged you is momentarily surrounded by green flames. It makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 2d10 Fire damage on a failed save o\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take in response to taking damage from a creature that you can see within 60 feet of yourself\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThe creature that damaged you is momentarily surrounded by green flames. It makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 2d10 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling|PHB]], [[Tiefling (Asmodeus)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Infernal Legacy)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling|XPHB]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take in response to taking damage from a creature that you can see within 60 feet of yourself\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Reaction\",\"Warlock\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_heroes_feast_xphb\",\"name\":\"Heroes' Feast\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • 10 minutes • Self — You conjure a feast that appears on a surface in an unoccupied 10-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] next to you. The feast takes 1 hour to cons\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gem-encrusted bowl worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou conjure a feast that appears on a surface in an unoccupied 10-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] next to you. The feast takes 1 hour to consume and disappears at the end of that time, and the beneficial effects don't set in until this hour is over. Up to twelve creatures can partake of the feast.\\n\\nA creature that partakes gains several benefits, which last for 24 hours. The creature has [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Poison damage, and it has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to the [[Frightened|XPHB]] and [[Poisoned|XPHB]] conditions. Its [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] maximum also increases by 2d10, and it gains the same number of [[Hit Points|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gem-encrusted bowl worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_heroism_xphb\",\"name\":\"Heroism\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • Touch — A willing creature you touch is imbued with bravery. Until the spell ends, the creature is immune to the Frightened condition and gains Temporary Hit \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA willing creature you touch is imbued with bravery. Until the spell ends, the creature is immune to the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition and gains [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to your spellcasting ability modifier at the start of each of its turns.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hex_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hex\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Bonus action • 90 feet — You place a curse on a creature that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 Necrotic damage to the target whenever you \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (the petrified eye of a newt)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou place a curse on a creature that you can see within range. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 Necrotic damage to the target whenever you hit it with an attack roll. Also, choose one ability when you cast the spell. The target has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on ability checks made with the chosen ability.\\n\\nIf the target drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] before this spell ends, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on a later turn to curse a new creature.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Your [[Concentration|XPHB]] can last longer with a spell slot of level 2 (up to 4 hours), 3-4 (up to 8 hours), or 5+ (24 hours).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Zendikar; Mul Daya Nation)|PSZ]], [[Hexblood|RHW]], [[Hexblood|VRGR]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Shadowmoor Hexer|LFL]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (the petrified eye of a newt)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hold_monster_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hold Monster\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • Action • 90 feet — Choose a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Paralyzed condition for the duration. At\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a straight piece of iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Paralyzed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Chains of Carceri|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a straight piece of iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hold_person_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hold Person\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — Choose a Humanoid that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Paralyzed condition for the duration. At\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a straight piece of iron)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nChoose a Humanoid that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Paralyzed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional Humanoid for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Winter Walker|FRHoF]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling|XPHB]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Enchantment Adept|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Clench of the North Wind|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a straight piece of iron)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_holy_aura_xphb\",\"name\":\"Holy Aura\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Abjuration • Action • Self — For the duration, you emit an aura in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. While in the aura, creatures of your choice have Advant\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a reliquary worth 1,000+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nFor the duration, you emit an aura in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. While in the aura, creatures of your choice have [[Advantage|XPHB]] on all saving throws, and other creatures have [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against them. In addition, when a Fiend or an Undead hits an affected creature with a melee attack roll, the attacker must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition until the end of its next turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a reliquary worth 1,000+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hunger_of_hadar_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hunger of Hadar\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 150 feet — You open a gateway to the Far Realm, a region infested with unspeakable horrors. A 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of Darkness \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pickled tentacle)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou open a gateway to the Far Realm, a region infested with unspeakable horrors. A 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of [[Darkness|XPHB]] appears, centered on a point within range and lasting for the duration. The [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] is [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]], and it is filled with strange whispers and slurping noises, which can be heard up to 30 feet away. No light, magical or otherwise, can illuminate the area, and creatures fully within it have the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition.\\n\\nAny creature that starts its turn in the area takes 2d6 Cold damage. Any creature that ends its turn there must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 2d6 Acid damage from otherworldly tentacles.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The Cold or Acid damage (your choice) increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pickled tentacle)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hunter_s_mark_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hunter's Mark\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Bonus action • 90 feet — You magically mark one creature you can see within range as your quarry. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 Force damage to the target whenev\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou magically mark one creature you can see within range as your quarry. Until the spell ends, you deal an extra 1d6 Force damage to the target whenever you hit it with an attack roll. You also have [[Advantage|XPHB]] on any Wisdom ([[Perception|XPHB]] or [[Survival|XPHB]]) check you make to find it.\\n\\nIf the target drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] before this spell ends, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to move the mark to a new creature you can see within range.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Your [[Concentration|XPHB]] can last longer with a spell slot of level 3-4 (up to 8 hours) or 5+ (up to 24 hours).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Ranger\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_hypnotic_pattern_xphb\",\"name\":\"Hypnotic Pattern\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You create a twisting pattern of colors in a 30-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] within range. The pattern appears for a moment and vanishes. \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a pinch of confetti)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a twisting pattern of colors in a 30-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] within range. The pattern appears for a moment and vanishes. Each creature in the area who can see the pattern must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. While [[Charmed|XPHB]], the creature has the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition and a [[Speed|XPHB]] of 0.\\n\\nThe spell ends for an affected creature if it takes any damage or if someone else uses an action to shake the creature out of its stupor.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a pinch of confetti)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ice_knife_xphb\",\"name\":\"Ice Knife\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You create a shard of ice and fling it at one creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Pi\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a drop of water or a piece of ice)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create a shard of ice and fling it at one creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d10 Piercing damage. Hit or miss, the shard then explodes. The target and each creature within 5 feet of it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 2d6 Cold damage.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The Cold damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Winter Walker|FRHoF]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Rimekin|LFL]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a drop of water or a piece of ice)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ice_storm_xphb\",\"name\":\"Ice Storm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 300 feet — Hail falls in a 20-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range. Each creature in the [[Cyli\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a mitten)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nHail falls in a 20-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range. Each creature in the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] makes a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 2d10 Bludgeoning damage and 4d6 Cold damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nHailstones turn ground in the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] into [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] until the end of your next turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The Bludgeoning damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Winter Walker|FRHoF]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a mitten)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_identify_xphb\",\"name\":\"Identify\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • 1 minute or Ritual • Touch — You touch an object throughout the spell's casting. If the object is a magic item or some other magical object, you learn its properties and how to us\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pearl worth 100+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch an object throughout the spell's casting. If the object is a magic item or some other magical object, you learn its properties and how to use them, whether it requires [[Attunement|XPHB]], and how many charges it has, if any. You learn whether any ongoing spells are affecting the item and what they are. If the item was created by a spell, you learn that spell's name.\\n\\nIf you instead touch a creature throughout the casting, you learn which ongoing spells, if any, are currently affecting it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pearl worth 100+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_illusory_script_xphb\",\"name\":\"Illusory Script\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Illusion • 1 minute or Ritual • Touch — You write on parchment, paper, or another suitable material and imbue it with an illusion that lasts for the duration. To you and any creatures you de\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** S, M (ink worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nYou write on parchment, paper, or another suitable material and imbue it with an illusion that lasts for the duration. To you and any creatures you designate when you cast the spell, the writing appears normal, seems to be written in your hand, and conveys whatever meaning you intended when you wrote the text. To all others, the writing appears as if it were written in an unknown or magical script that is unintelligible. Alternatively, the illusion can alter the meaning, handwriting, and language of the text, though the language must be one you know.\\n\\nIf the spell is dispelled, the original script and the illusion both disappear.\\n\\nA creature that has [[Truesight|XPHB]] can read the hidden message.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"S, M (ink worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 1\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_imprisonment_xphb\",\"name\":\"Imprisonment\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Abjuration • 1 minute • 30 feet — You create a magical restraint to hold a creature that you can see within range. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a statuette of the target worth 5,000+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou create a magical restraint to hold a creature that you can see within range. The target must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the target is unaffected, and it is immune to this spell for the next 24 hours. On a failed save, the target is imprisoned. While imprisoned, the target doesn't need to breathe, eat, or drink, and it doesn't age. Divination spells can't locate or perceive the imprisoned target, and the target can't teleport.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, the target is also affected by one of the following effects of your choice:\\n\\n- **Burial.** The target is entombed beneath the earth in a hollow globe of magical force that is just large enough to contain the target. Nothing can pass into or out of the globe.\\n- **Chaining.** Chains firmly rooted in the ground hold the target in place. The target has the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition and can't be moved by any means.\\n- **Hedged Prison.** The target is trapped in a demiplane that is warded against teleportation and planar travel. The demiplane is your choice of a labyrinth, a cage, a tower, or the like.\\n- **Minimus Containment.** The target becomes 1 inch tall and is trapped inside an indestructible gemstone or a similar object. Light can pass through the gemstone (allowing the target to see out and other creatures to see in), but nothing else can pass through by any means.\\n- **Slumber.** The target has the [[Unconscious|XPHB]] condition and can't be awoken.\\n\\n***Ending the Spell.*** When you cast the spell, specify a trigger that will end it. The trigger can be as simple or as elaborate as you choose, but the DM must agree that it has a high likelihood of happening within the next decade. The trigger must be an observable action, such as someone making a particular offering at the temple of your god, saving your true love, or defeating a specific monster.\\n\\nA [[Dispel Magic|XPHB]] spell can end the spell only if it is cast with a level 9 spell slot, targeting either the prison or the component used to create it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a statuette of the target worth 5,000+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Special\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_incendiary_cloud_xphb\",\"name\":\"Incendiary Cloud\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • Action • 150 feet — A swirling cloud of embers and smoke fills a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range. The cloud's area\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA swirling cloud of embers and smoke fills a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range. The cloud's area is [[Heavily Obscured|XPHB]]. It lasts for the duration or until a strong wind (like that created by [[Gust of Wind|XPHB]]) disperses it.\\n\\nWhen the cloud appears, each creature in it makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 10d8 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature must also make this save when the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] moves into its space and when it enters the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n\\nThe cloud moves 10 feet away from you in a direction you choose at the start of each of your turns.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_inflict_wounds_xphb\",\"name\":\"Inflict Wounds\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Necromancy • Action • Touch — A creature you touch makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 2d10 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA creature you touch makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 2d10 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Oathbreaker|DMG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Necromancy Adept|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_insect_plague_xphb\",\"name\":\"Insect Plague\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 300 feet — Swarming locusts fill a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range. The [[Sphere [Area of Effe\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a locust)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nSwarming locusts fill a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range. The [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] remains for the duration, and its area is [[Lightly Obscured|XPHB]] and [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]].\\n\\nWhen the swarm appears, each creature in it makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 4d10 Piercing damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature also makes this save when it enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a locust)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d10\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_invisibility_xphb\",\"name\":\"Invisibility\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • Touch — A creature you touch has the Invisible condition until the spell ends. The spell ends early immediately after the target makes an attack roll, deals d\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an eyelash in gum arabic)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nA creature you touch has the [[Invisible|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends. The spell ends early immediately after the target makes an attack roll, deals damage, or casts a spell.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Duergar|MPMM]], [[Dwarf (Duergar)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Glasya)|MTF]], [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Elf (Pallid)|EGW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[One with Shadows|XPHB]], [[Shroud of Shadow|XGE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an eyelash in gum arabic)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_jallarzi_s_storm_of_radiance_xphb\",\"name\":\"Jallarzi's Storm of Radiance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You unleash a storm of flashing light and raging thunder in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a p\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of phosphorus)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou unleash a storm of flashing light and raging thunder in a 10-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point you can see within range. While in this area, creatures have the [[Blinded|XPHB]] and [[Deafened|XPHB]] conditions, and they can't cast spells with a Verbal component.\\n\\nWhen the storm appears, each creature in it makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 2d10 Radiant damage and 2d10 Thunder damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature also makes this save when it enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The Radiant and Thunder damage increase by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of phosphorus)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_jump_xphb\",\"name\":\"Jump\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Bonus action • Touch — You touch a willing creature. Once on each of its turns until the spell ends, that creature can jump up to 30 feet by spending 10 feet of movement.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a grasshopper's hind leg)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou touch a willing creature. Once on each of its turns until the spell ends, that creature can jump up to 30 feet by spending 10 feet of movement.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gith (Githyanki)|MTF]], [[Githyanki|MPMM]], [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Transmutation Adept|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Otherworldly Leap|PHB]], [[Otherworldly Leap|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a grasshopper's hind leg)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_knock_xphb\",\"name\":\"Knock\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — Choose an object that you can see within range. The object can be a door, a box, a chest, a set of manacles, a padlock, or another object that contain\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose an object that you can see within range. The object can be a door, a box, a chest, a set of manacles, a padlock, or another object that contains a mundane or magical means that prevents access.\\n\\nA target that is held shut by a mundane lock or that is stuck or barred becomes unlocked, unstuck, or unbarred. If the object has multiple locks, only one of them is unlocked.\\n\\nIf the target is held shut by [[Arcane Lock|XPHB]], that spell is suppressed for 10 minutes, during which time the target can be opened and closed.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, a loud knock, audible up to 300 feet away, emanates from the target.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_legend_lore_xphb\",\"name\":\"Legend Lore\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 10 minutes • Self — Name or describe a famous person, place, or object. The spell brings to your mind a brief summary of the significant lore about that famous thing, as \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (incense worth 250+ GP, which the spell consumes, and four ivory strips worth 50+ GP each)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nName or describe a famous person, place, or object. The spell brings to your mind a brief summary of the significant lore about that famous thing, as described by the DM.\\n\\nThe lore might consist of important details, amusing revelations, or even secret lore that has never been widely known. The more information you already know about the thing, the more precise and detailed the information you receive is. That information is accurate but might be couched in figurative language or poetry, as determined by the DM.\\n\\nIf the famous thing you chose isn't actually famous, you hear sad musical notes played on a trombone, and the spell fails.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (incense worth 250+ GP, which the spell consumes, and four ivory strips worth 50+ GP each)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_leomund_s_secret_chest_xphb\",\"name\":\"Leomund's Secret Chest\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • Touch — You hide a chest and all its contents on the Ethereal Plane. You must touch the chest and the miniature replica that serve as Material components for \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a chest, 3 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet, constructed from rare materials worth 5,000+ GP, and a Tiny replica of the chest made from the same materials worth 50+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou hide a chest and all its contents on the Ethereal Plane. You must touch the chest and the miniature replica that serve as Material components for the spell. The chest can contain up to 12 cubic feet of nonliving material (3 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet).\\n\\nWhile the chest remains on the Ethereal Plane, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action and touch the replica to recall the chest. It appears in an unoccupied space on the ground within 5 feet of you. You can send the chest back to the Ethereal Plane by taking a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to touch the chest and the replica.\\n\\nAfter 60 days, there is a cumulative 5 percent chance at the end of each day that the spell ends. The spell also ends if you cast this spell again or if the Tiny replica chest is destroyed. If the spell ends and the larger chest is on the Ethereal Plane, the chest remains there for you or someone else to find.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a chest, 3 feet by 2 feet by 2 feet, constructed from rare materials worth 5,000+ GP, and a Tiny replica of the chest made from the same materials worth 50+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_leomund_s_tiny_hut_xphb\",\"name\":\"Leomund's Tiny Hut\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • 1 minute or Ritual • Self — A 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] springs into existence around you and remains stationary for the duration. The spell fails whe\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a crystal bead)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nA 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] springs into existence around you and remains stationary for the duration. The spell fails when you cast it if the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] isn't big enough to fully encapsulate all creatures in its area.\\n\\nCreatures and objects within the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] when you cast the spell can move through it freely. All other creatures and objects are barred from passing through it. Spells of level 3 or lower can't be cast through it, and the effects of such spells can't extend into it.\\n\\nThe atmosphere inside the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] is comfortable and dry, regardless of the weather outside. Until the spell ends, you can command the interior to have [[Dim Light|XPHB]] or [[Darkness|XPHB]] (no action required). The [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] is opaque from the outside and of any color you choose, but it's transparent from the inside.\\n\\nThe spell ends early if you leave the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] or if you cast it again.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a crystal bead)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_lesser_restoration_xphb\",\"name\":\"Lesser Restoration\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Bonus action • Touch — You touch a creature and end one condition on it: Blinded, Deafened, Paralyzed, or Poisoned.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a creature and end one condition on it: [[Blinded|XPHB]], [[Deafened|XPHB]], [[Paralyzed|XPHB]], or [[Poisoned|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Aasimar|DMG]], [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Abjuration Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_levitate_xphb\",\"name\":\"Levitate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — One creature or loose object of your choice that you can see within range rises vertically up to 20 feet and remains suspended there for the duration.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a metal spring)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nOne creature or loose object of your choice that you can see within range rises vertically up to 20 feet and remains suspended there for the duration. The spell can levitate an object that weighs up to 500 pounds. An unwilling creature that succeeds on a Constitution saving throw is unaffected.\\n\\nThe target can move only by pushing or pulling against a fixed object or surface within reach (such as a wall or a ceiling), which allows it to move as if it were climbing. You can change the target's altitude by up to 20 feet in either direction on your turn. If you are the target, you can move up or down as part of your move. Otherwise, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to move the target, which must remain within the spell's range.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the target floats gently to the ground if it is still aloft.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Air)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Air)|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]], [[Drow High Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Ascendant Step|PHB]], [[Ascendant Step|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a metal spring)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_light_xphb\",\"name\":\"Light\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • Touch — You touch one Large or smaller object that isn't being worn or carried by someone else. Until the spell ends, the object sheds Bright Light in a 20-fo\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, M (a firefly or phosphorescent moss)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch one Large or smaller object that isn't being worn or carried by someone else. Until the spell ends, the object sheds [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 20-foot radius and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 20 feet. The light can be colored as you like.\\n\\nCovering the object with something opaque blocks the light. The spell ends if you cast it again.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Aasimar|DMG]], [[Aasimar|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Aasimar (Fallen)|VGM]], [[Aasimar (Protector)|VGM]], [[Aasimar (Scourge)|VGM]], [[Aasimar|XPHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Astral Elf|AAG]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf (Pallid)|EGW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, M (a firefly or phosphorescent moss)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_lightning_arrow_xphb\",\"name\":\"Lightning Arrow\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting or missing a target with a ranged attack using a weapon • Self — As your attack hits or misses the target, the weapon or ammunition you're using transforms into a lightning bolt. Instead of taking any damage or othe\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting or missing a target with a ranged attack using a weapon\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nAs your attack hits or misses the target, the weapon or ammunition you're using transforms into a lightning bolt. Instead of taking any damage or other effects from the attack, the target takes 4d8 Lightning damage on a hit or half as much damage on a miss. Each creature within 10 feet of the target then makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 2d8 Lightning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe weapon or ammunition then returns to its normal form.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage for both effects of the spell increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting or missing a target with a ranged attack using a weapon\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Ranger\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_lightning_bolt_xphb\",\"name\":\"Lightning Bolt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • Self — A stroke of lightning forming a 100-foot-long, 5-foot-wide [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] blasts out from you in a direction you choose. Each cre\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fur and a crystal rod)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA stroke of lightning forming a 100-foot-long, 5-foot-wide [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] blasts out from you in a direction you choose. Each creature in the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 8d6 Lightning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fur and a crystal rod)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d6\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_locate_animals_or_plants_xphb\",\"name\":\"Locate Animals or Plants\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — Describe or name a specific kind of Beast, Plant creature, or nonmagical plant. You learn the direction and distance to the closest creature or plant \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (fur from a bloodhound)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nDescribe or name a specific kind of Beast, Plant creature, or nonmagical plant. You learn the direction and distance to the closest creature or plant of that kind within 5 miles, if any are present.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (fur from a bloodhound)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_locate_creature_xphb\",\"name\":\"Locate Creature\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Divination • Action • Self — Describe or name a creature that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the creature's location if that creature is within 1,000 feet of you. \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (fur from a bloodhound)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nDescribe or name a creature that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the creature's location if that creature is within 1,000 feet of you. If the creature is moving, you know the direction of its movement.\\n\\nThe spell can locate a specific creature known to you or the nearest creature of a specific kind (such as a human or a unicorn) if you have seen such a creature up close—within 30 feet—at least once. If the creature you described or named is in a different form, such as under the effects of a [[Flesh to Stone|XPHB]] or [[Polymorph|XPHB]] spell, this spell doesn't locate the creature.\\n\\nThis spell can't locate a creature if any thickness of lead blocks a direct path between you and the creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (fur from a bloodhound)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_locate_object_xphb\",\"name\":\"Locate Object\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • Self — Describe or name an object that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the object's location if that object is within 1,000 feet of you. If th\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a forked twig)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nDescribe or name an object that is familiar to you. You sense the direction to the object's location if that object is within 1,000 feet of you. If the object is in motion, you know the direction of its movement.\\n\\nThe spell can locate a specific object known to you if you have seen it up close—within 30 feet—at least once. Alternatively, the spell can locate the nearest object of a particular kind, such as a certain kind of apparel, jewelry, furniture, tool, or weapon.\\n\\nThis spell can't locate an object if any thickness of lead blocks a direct path between you and the object.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a forked twig)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_longstrider_xphb\",\"name\":\"Longstrider\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a creature. The target's Speed increases by 10 feet until the spell ends.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of dirt)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a creature. The target's [[Speed|XPHB]] increases by 10 feet until the spell ends.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of dirt)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mage_armor_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mage Armor\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature who isn't wearing armor. Until the spell ends, the target's base AC becomes 13 plus its Dexterity modifier. The spell end\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of cured leather)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou touch a willing creature who isn't wearing armor. Until the spell ends, the target's base AC becomes 13 plus its Dexterity modifier. The spell ends early if the target dons armor.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Armor of Shadows|PHB]], [[Armor of Shadows|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of cured leather)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mage_hand_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mage Hand\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Conjuration Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — A spectral, floating hand appears at a point you choose within range. The hand lasts for the duration. The hand vanishes if it is ever more than 30 fe\",\"content\":\"*Conjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nA spectral, floating hand appears at a point you choose within range. The hand lasts for the duration. The hand vanishes if it is ever more than 30 feet away from you or if you cast this spell again.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, you can use the hand to manipulate an object, open an unlocked door or container, stow or retrieve an item from an open container, or pour the contents out of a vial.\\n\\nAs a [[Magic|XPHB]] action on your later turns, you can control the hand thus again. As part of that action, you can move the hand up to 30 feet.\\n\\nThe hand can't attack, activate magic items, or carry more than 10 pounds.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Gith (Githyanki)|MTF]], [[Gith (Githzerai)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Mammon)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Mephistopheles)|MTF]], [[Githyanki|MPMM]], [[Githzerai|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Telekinetic|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Living Shadow|RHW]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Telekinetic|XPHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_circle_xphb\",\"name\":\"Magic Circle\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • 1 minute • 10 feet — You create a 10-foot-radius, 20-foot-tall [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] of magical energy centered on a point on the ground that you can\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (salt and powdered silver worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou create a 10-foot-radius, 20-foot-tall [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] of magical energy centered on a point on the ground that you can see within range. Glowing runes appear wherever the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] intersects with the floor or other surface.\\n\\nChoose one or more of the following types of creatures: Celestials, Elementals, Fey, Fiends, or Undead. The circle affects a creature of the chosen type in the following ways:\\n\\n- The creature can't willingly enter the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] by nonmagical means. If the creature tries to use teleportation or interplanar travel to do so, it must first succeed on a Charisma saving throw.\\n- The creature has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against targets within the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]].\\n- Targets within the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] can't be possessed by or gain the [[Charmed|XPHB]] or [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition from the creature.\\n\\nEach time you cast this spell, you can cause its magic to operate in the reverse direction, preventing a creature of the specified type from leaving the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] and protecting targets outside it.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The duration increases by 1 hour for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (salt and powdered silver worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_jar_xphb\",\"name\":\"Magic Jar\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Necromancy • 1 minute • Self — Your body falls into a catatonic state as your soul leaves it and enters the container you used for the spell's Material component. While your soul in\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gem, crystal, or reliquary worth 500+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYour body falls into a catatonic state as your soul leaves it and enters the container you used for the spell's Material component. While your soul inhabits the container, you are aware of your surroundings as if you were in the container's space. You can't move or take Reactions. The only action you can take is to project your soul up to 100 feet out of the container, either returning to your living body (and ending the spell) or attempting to possess a Humanoid's body.\\n\\nYou can attempt to possess any Humanoid within 100 feet of you that you can see (creatures warded by a [[Protection from Evil and Good|XPHB]] or [[Magic Circle|XPHB]] spell can't be possessed). The target makes a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, your soul enters the target's body, and the target's soul becomes trapped in the container. On a successful save, the target resists your efforts to possess it, and you can't attempt to possess it again for 24 hours.\\n\\nOnce you possess a creature's body, you control it. Your [[Hit Points|XPHB]], [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]], Strength, Dexterity, Constitution, [[Speed|XPHB]], and senses are replaced by the creature's. You otherwise keep your game statistics.\\n\\nMeanwhile, the possessed creature's soul can perceive from the container using its own senses, but it can't move and it is [[Incapacitated|XPHB]].\\n\\nWhile possessing a body, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to return from the host body to the container if it is within 100 feet of you, returning the host creature's soul to its body. If the host body dies while you're in it, the creature dies, and you make a Charisma saving throw against your own spellcasting DC. On a success, you return to the container if it is within 100 feet of you. Otherwise, you die.\\n\\nIf the container is destroyed or the spell ends, your soul returns to your body. If your body is more than 100 feet away from you or if your body is dead, you die. If another creature's soul is in the container when it is destroyed, the creature's soul returns to its body if the body is alive and within 100 feet. Otherwise, that creature dies.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the container is destroyed.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gem, crystal, or reliquary worth 500+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_missile_xphb\",\"name\":\"Magic Missile\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You create three glowing darts of magical force. Each dart strikes a creature of your choice that you can see within range. A dart deals 1d4 + 1 Force\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create three glowing darts of magical force. Each dart strikes a creature of your choice that you can see within range. A dart deals 1d4 + 1 Force damage to its target. The darts all strike simultaneously, and you can direct them to hit one creature or several.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The spell creates one more dart for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d4 + 1\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_mouth_xphb\",\"name\":\"Magic Mouth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • 1 minute or Ritual • 30 feet — You implant a message within an object in range—a message that is uttered when a trigger condition is met. Choose an object that you can see and that \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (jade dust worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou implant a message within an object in range—a message that is uttered when a trigger condition is met. Choose an object that you can see and that isn't being worn or carried by another creature. Then speak the message, which must be 25 words or fewer, though it can be delivered over as long as 10 minutes. Finally, determine the circumstance that will trigger the spell to deliver your message.\\n\\nWhen that trigger occurs, a magical mouth appears on the object and recites the message in your voice and at the same volume you spoke. If the object you chose has a mouth or something that looks like a mouth (for example, the mouth of a statue), the magical mouth appears there, so the words appear to come from the object's mouth. When you cast this spell, you can have the spell end after it delivers its message, or it can remain and repeat its message whenever the trigger occurs.\\n\\nThe trigger can be as general or as detailed as you like, though it must be based on visual or audible conditions that occur within 30 feet of the object. For example, you could instruct the mouth to speak when any creature moves within 30 feet of the object or when a silver bell rings within 30 feet of it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (jade dust worth 10+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_magic_weapon_xphb\",\"name\":\"Magic Weapon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Bonus action • Touch — You touch a nonmagical weapon. Until the spell ends, that weapon becomes a magic weapon with a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls. The spell en\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a nonmagical weapon. Until the spell ends, that weapon becomes a magic weapon with a +1 bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls. The spell ends early if you cast it again.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The bonus increases to +2 with a level 3-5 spell slot. The bonus increases to +3 with a level 6+ spell slot.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_major_image_xphb\",\"name\":\"Major Image\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 20-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 20-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. The image appears at a spot that you can see within range and lasts for the duration. It seems real, including sounds, smells, and temperature appropriate to the thing depicted, but it can't deal damage or cause conditions.\\n\\nIf you are within range of the illusion, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to cause the image to move to any other spot within range. As the image changes location, you can alter its appearance so that its movements appear natural for the image. For example, if you create an image of a creature and move it, you can alter the image so that it appears to be walking. Similarly, you can cause the illusion to make different sounds at different times, even making it carry on a conversation, for example.\\n\\nPhysical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, for things can pass through it. A creature that takes a [[Study|XPHB]] action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image, and its other sensory qualities become faint to the creature.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The spell lasts until dispelled, without requiring [[Concentration|XPHB]], if cast with a level 4+ spell slot.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Illusion Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mass_cure_wounds_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mass Cure Wounds\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • Action • 60 feet — A wave of healing energy washes out from a point you can see within range. Choose up to six creatures in a 30-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XP\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA wave of healing energy washes out from a point you can see within range. Choose up to six creatures in a 30-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on that point. Each target regains [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to 5d8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The healing increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 5.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Moon|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Abjuration Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"healing\":\"5d8\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mass_heal_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mass Heal\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Abjuration • Action • 60 feet — A flood of healing energy flows from you into creatures around you. You restore up to 700 Hit Points, divided as you choose among any number of creatu\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA flood of healing energy flows from you into creatures around you. You restore up to 700 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], divided as you choose among any number of creatures that you can see within range. Creatures healed by this spell also have the [[Blinded|XPHB]], [[Deafened|XPHB]], and [[Poisoned|XPHB]] conditions removed from them.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mass_healing_word_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mass Healing Word\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Bonus action • 60 feet — Up to six creatures of your choice that you can see within range regain Hit Points equal to 2d4 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nUp to six creatures of your choice that you can see within range regain [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to 2d4 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The healing increases by 1d4 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"healing\":\"2d4\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mass_suggestion_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mass Suggestion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You suggest a course of activity—described in no more than 25 words—to twelve or fewer creatures you can see within range that can hear and understand\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a snake's tongue)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou suggest a course of activity—described in no more than 25 words—to twelve or fewer creatures you can see within range that can hear and understand you. The suggestion must sound achievable and not involve anything that would obviously deal damage to any of the targets or their allies. For example, you could say, \\\"Walk to the village down that road, and help the villagers there harvest crops until sunset.\\\" Or you could say, \\\"Now is not the time for violence. Drop your weapons, and dance! Stop in an hour.\\\"\\n\\nEach target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration or until you or your allies deal damage to the target. Each [[Charmed|XPHB]] target pursues the suggestion to the best of its ability. The suggested activity can continue for the entire duration, but if the suggested activity can be completed in a shorter time, the spell ends for a target upon completing it.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The duration is longer with a spell slot of level 7 (10 days), 8 (30 days), or 9 (366 days).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a snake's tongue)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_maze_xphb\",\"name\":\"Maze\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You banish a creature that you can see within range into a labyrinthine demiplane. The target remains there for the duration or until it escapes the m\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou banish a creature that you can see within range into a labyrinthine demiplane. The target remains there for the duration or until it escapes the maze.\\n\\nThe target can take a [[Study|XPHB]] action to try to escape. When it does so, it makes a DC 20 Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check. If it succeeds, it escapes, and the spell ends.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, the target reappears in the space it left or, if that space is occupied, in the nearest unoccupied space.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_meld_into_stone_xphb\",\"name\":\"Meld into Stone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action or Ritual • Touch — You step into a stone object or surface large enough to fully contain your body, merging yourself and your equipment with the stone for the duration. \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou step into a stone object or surface large enough to fully contain your body, merging yourself and your equipment with the stone for the duration. You must touch the stone to do so. Nothing of your presence remains visible or otherwise detectable by nonmagical senses.\\n\\nWhile merged with the stone, you can't see what occurs outside it, and any Wisdom ([[Perception|XPHB]]) checks you make to hear sounds outside it are made with [[Disadvantage|XPHB]]. You remain aware of the passage of time and can cast spells on yourself while merged in the stone. You can use 5 feet of movement to leave the stone where you entered it, which ends the spell. You otherwise can't move.\\n\\nMinor physical damage to the stone doesn't harm you, but its partial destruction or a change in its shape (to the extent that you no longer fit within it) expels you and deals 6d6 Force damage to you. The stone's complete destruction (or transmutation into a different substance) expels you and deals 50 Force damage to you. If expelled, you move into an unoccupied space closest to where you first entered and have the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_melf_s_acid_arrow_xphb\",\"name\":\"Melf's Acid Arrow\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — A shimmering green arrow streaks toward a target within range and bursts in a spray of acid. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (powdered rhubarb leaf)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA shimmering green arrow streaks toward a target within range and bursts in a spray of acid. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 4d4 Acid damage and 2d4 Acid damage at the end of its next turn. On a miss, the arrow splashes the target with acid for half as much of the initial damage only.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage (both initial and later) increases by 1d4 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (powdered rhubarb leaf)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d4\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mending_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mending\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • 1 minute • Touch — This spell repairs a single break or tear in an object you touch, such as a broken chain link, two halves of a broken key, a torn cloak, or a leaking \",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (two lodestones)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThis spell repairs a single break or tear in an object you touch, such as a broken chain link, two halves of a broken key, a torn cloak, or a leaking wineskin. As long as the break or tear is no larger than 1 foot in any dimension, you mend it, leaving no trace of the former damage.\\n\\nThis spell can physically repair a magic item, but it can't restore magic to such an object.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (two lodestones)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_message_xphb\",\"name\":\"Message\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — You point toward a creature within range and whisper a message. The target (and only the target) hears the message and can reply in a whisper that onl\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a copper wire)\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nYou point toward a creature within range and whisper a message. The target (and only the target) hears the message and can reply in a whisper that only you can hear.\\n\\nYou can cast this spell through solid objects if you are familiar with the target and know it is beyond the barrier. Magical silence; 1 foot of stone, metal, or wood; or a thin sheet of lead blocks the spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Gathered Whispers|RHW]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Azorius Functionary|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a copper wire)\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_meteor_swarm_xphb\",\"name\":\"Meteor Swarm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Evocation • Action • 1 mile — Blazing orbs of fire plummet to the ground at four different points you can see within range. Each creature in a 40-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effe\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 1 mile\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nBlazing orbs of fire plummet to the ground at four different points you can see within range. Each creature in a 40-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on each of those points makes a Dexterity saving throw. A creature takes 20d6 Fire damage and 20d6 Bludgeoning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature in the area of more than one fiery [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] is affected only once.\\n\\nA nonmagical object that isn't being worn or carried also takes the damage if it's in the spell's area, and the object starts [[burning|XPHB]] if it's flammable.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"1 mile\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"20d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mind_blank_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mind Blank\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Abjuration • Action • Touch — Until the spell ends, one willing creature you touch has Immunity to Psychic damage and the Charmed condition. The target is also unaffected by anythi\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nUntil the spell ends, one willing creature you touch has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to Psychic damage and the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition. The target is also unaffected by anything that would sense its emotions or alignment, read its thoughts, or magically detect its location, and no spell—not even [[Wish|XPHB]]—can gather information about the target, observe it remotely, or control its mind.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mind_sliver_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mind Sliver\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Enchantment Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You try to temporarily sliver the mind of one creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on an Intelligence saving throw or take 1d6 P\",\"content\":\"*Enchantment Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou try to temporarily sliver the mind of one creature you can see within range. The target must succeed on an Intelligence saving throw or take 1d6 Psychic damage and subtract 1d4 from the next saving throw it makes before the end of your next turn.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mind_spike_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mind Spike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • 120 feet — You drive a spike of psionic energy into the mind of one creature you can see within range. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw, taking 3d8 Psychic\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou drive a spike of psionic energy into the mind of one creature you can see within range. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw, taking 3d8 Psychic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. On a failed save, you also always know the target's location until the spell ends, but only while the two of you are on the same plane of existence. While you have this knowledge, the target can't become hidden from you, and if it has the [[Invisible|XPHB]] condition, it gains no benefit from that condition against you.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divination Adept|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_minor_illusion_xphb\",\"name\":\"Minor Illusion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Illusion Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You create a sound or an image of an object within range that lasts for the duration. See the descriptions below for the effects of each. The illusion\",\"content\":\"*Illusion Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a bit of fleece)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou create a sound or an image of an object within range that lasts for the duration. See the descriptions below for the effects of each. The illusion ends if you cast this spell again.\\n\\nIf a creature takes a [[Study|XPHB]] action to examine the sound or image, the creature can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the illusion becomes faint to the creature.\\n\\n***Sound.*** If you create a sound, its volume can range from a whisper to a scream. It can be your voice, someone else's voice, a lion's roar, a beating of drums, or any other sound you choose. The sound continues unabated throughout the duration, or you can make discrete sounds at different times before the spell ends.\\n\\n***Image.*** If you create an image of an object—such as a chair, muddy footprints, or a small chest—it must be no larger than a 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. The image can't create sound, light, smell, or any other sensory effect. Physical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, since things can pass through it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of Shadow|XPHB]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Scion of the Three|FRHoF]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[School of Illusion|PHB]] ([[Wizard|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Gnome (Forest)|PHB]], [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Tiefling (Glasya)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Artist|AU]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a bit of fleece)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mirage_arcane_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mirage Arcane\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Illusion • 10 minutes • Sight — You make terrain in an area up to 1 mile square look, sound, smell, and even feel like some other sort of terrain. Open fields or a road could be made\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Sight\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 days\\nYou make terrain in an area up to 1 mile square look, sound, smell, and even feel like some other sort of terrain. Open fields or a road could be made to resemble a swamp, hill, crevasse, or some other rough or impassable terrain. A pond can be made to seem like a grassy meadow, a precipice like a gentle slope, or a rock-strewn gully like a wide and smooth road.\\n\\nSimilarly, you can alter the appearance of structures or add them where none are present. The spell doesn't disguise, conceal, or add creatures.\\n\\nThe illusion includes audible, visual, tactile, and olfactory elements, so it can turn clear ground into [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] (or vice versa) or otherwise impede movement through the area. Any piece of the illusory terrain (such as a rock or stick) that is removed from the spell's area disappears immediately.\\n\\nCreatures with [[Truesight|XPHB]] can see through the illusion to the terrain's true form; however, all other elements of the illusion remain, so while the creature is aware of the illusion's presence, the creature can still physically interact with the illusion.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Sight\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 days\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mirror_image_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mirror Image\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • Self — Three illusory duplicates of yourself appear in your space. Until the spell ends, the duplicates move with you and mimic your actions, shifting positi\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nThree illusory duplicates of yourself appear in your space. Until the spell ends, the duplicates move with you and mimic your actions, shifting position so it's impossible to track which image is real.\\n\\nEach time a creature hits you with an attack roll during the spell's duration, roll a d6 for each of your remaining duplicates. If any of the d6s rolls a 3 or higher, one of the duplicates is hit instead of you, and the duplicate is destroyed. The duplicates otherwise ignore all other damage and effects. The spell ends when all three duplicates are destroyed.\\n\\nA creature is unaffected by this spell if it has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition, [[Blindsight|XPHB]], or [[Truesight|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Glamour|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mislead_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mislead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Illusion • Action • Self — You gain the Invisible condition at the same time that an illusory double of you appears where you are standing. The double lasts for the duration, bu\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou gain the [[Invisible|XPHB]] condition at the same time that an illusory double of you appears where you are standing. The double lasts for the duration, but the invisibility ends immediately after you make an attack roll, deal damage, or cast a spell.\\n\\nAs a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, you can move the illusory double up to twice your [[Speed|XPHB]] and make it gesture, speak, and behave in whatever way you choose. It is intangible and invulnerable.\\n\\nYou can see through its eyes and hear through its ears as if you were located where it is.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_misty_step_xphb\",\"name\":\"Misty Step\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Bonus action • Self — Briefly surrounded by silvery mist, you teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see.\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nBriefly surrounded by silvery mist, you teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|TCE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Eladrin)|DMG]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Gith (Githyanki)|MTF]], [[Githyanki|MPMM]], [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Conjuration Adept|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]], [[Fey Teleportation|XGE]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Outlands Envoy|SatO]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_modify_memory_xphb\",\"name\":\"Modify Memory\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You attempt to reshape another creature's memories. One creature that you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. If you are fighting the cr\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to reshape another creature's memories. One creature that you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. If you are fighting the creature, it has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on the save. On a failed save, the target has the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. While [[Charmed|XPHB]] in this way, the target also has the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition and is unaware of its surroundings, though it can hear you. If it takes any damage or is targeted by another spell, this spell ends, and no memories are modified.\\n\\nWhile this charm lasts, you can affect the target's memory of an event that it experienced within the last 24 hours and that lasted no more than 10 minutes. You can permanently eliminate all memory of the event, allow the target to recall the event with perfect clarity, change its memory of the event's details, or create a memory of some other event.\\n\\nYou must speak to the target to describe how its memories are affected, and it must be able to understand your language for the modified memories to take root. Its mind fills in any gaps in the details of your description. If the spell ends before you finish describing the modified memories, the creature's memory isn't altered. Otherwise, the modified memories take hold when the spell ends.\\n\\nA modified memory doesn't necessarily affect how a creature behaves, particularly if the memory contradicts the creature's natural inclinations, alignment, or beliefs. An illogical modified memory, such as a false memory of how much the creature enjoyed swimming in acid, is dismissed as a bad dream. The DM might deem a modified memory too nonsensical to affect a creature.\\n\\nA [[Remove Curse|XPHB]] or [[Greater Restoration|XPHB]] spell cast on the target restores the creature's true memory.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can alter the target's memories of an event that took place up to 7 days ago (level 6 spell slot), 30 days ago (level 7 spell slot), 365 days ago (level 8 spell slot), or any time in the creature's past (level 9 spell slot).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Enchantment Adept|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_moonbeam_xphb\",\"name\":\"Moonbeam\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A silvery beam of pale light shines down in a 5-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a moonseed leaf)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA silvery beam of pale light shines down in a 5-foot-radius, 40-foot-high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range. Until the spell ends, [[Dim Light|XPHB]] fills the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]], and you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action on later turns to move the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] up to 60 feet.\\n\\nWhen the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] appears, each creature in it makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d10 Radiant damage, and if the creature is shape-shifted (as a result of the [[Polymorph|XPHB]] spell, for example), it reverts to its true form and can't shape-shift until it leaves the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]]. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage only. A creature also makes this save when the spell's area moves into its space and when it enters the spell's area or ends its turn there. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Moon|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a moonseed leaf)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d10\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mordenkainen_s_faithful_hound_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mordenkainen's Faithful Hound\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — You conjure a phantom watchdog in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The hound remains for the duration or until the two of you are mo\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a silver whistle)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou conjure a phantom watchdog in an unoccupied space that you can see within range. The hound remains for the duration or until the two of you are more than 300 feet apart from each other.\\n\\nNo one but you can see the hound, and it is intangible and invulnerable. When a Small or larger creature comes within 30 feet of it without first speaking the password that you specify when you cast this spell, the hound starts barking loudly. The hound has [[Truesight|XPHB]] with a range of 30 feet.\\n\\nAt the start of each of your turns, the hound attempts to bite one enemy within 5 feet of it. That enemy must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 4d8 Force damage.\\n\\nOn your later turns, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to move the hound up to 30 feet.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Dwarf (Mark of Warding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a silver whistle)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mordenkainen_s_magnificent_mansion_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mordenkainen's Magnificent Mansion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • 1 minute • 300 feet — You conjure a shimmering door in range that lasts for the duration. The door leads to an extradimensional dwelling and is 5 feet wide and 10 feet tall\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature door worth 15+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou conjure a shimmering door in range that lasts for the duration. The door leads to an extradimensional dwelling and is 5 feet wide and 10 feet tall. You and any creature you designate when you cast the spell can enter the extradimensional dwelling as long as the door remains open. You can open or close it (no action required) if you are within 30 feet of it. While closed, the door is imperceptible.\\n\\nBeyond the door is a magnificent foyer with numerous chambers beyond. The dwelling's atmosphere is clean, fresh, and warm.\\n\\nYou can create any floor plan you like for the dwelling, but it can't exceed 50 contiguous 10-foot Cubes. The place is furnished and decorated as you choose. It contains sufficient food to serve a nine-course banquet for up to 100 people. Furnishings and other objects created by this spell dissipate into smoke if removed from it.\\n\\nA staff of 100 near-transparent servants attends all who enter. You determine the appearance of these servants and their attire. They are invulnerable and obey your commands. Each servant can perform tasks that a human could perform, but they can't attack or take any action that would directly harm another creature. Thus the servants can fetch things, clean, mend, fold clothes, light fires, serve food, pour wine, and so on. The servants can't leave the dwelling.\\n\\nWhen the spell ends, any creatures or objects left inside the extradimensional space are expelled into the unoccupied spaces nearest to the entrance.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature door worth 15+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"10-foot Cube\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mordenkainen_s_private_sanctum_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mordenkainen's Private Sanctum\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • 10 minutes • 120 feet — You make an area within range magically secure. The area is a [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] that can be as small as 5 feet to as large as 100 fe\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a thin sheet of lead)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou make an area within range magically secure. The area is a [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] that can be as small as 5 feet to as large as 100 feet on each side. The spell lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, you decide what sort of security the spell provides, choosing any of the following properties:\\n\\n- Sound can't pass through the barrier at the edge of the warded area.\\n- The barrier of the warded area appears dark and foggy, preventing vision (including [[Darkvision|XPHB]]) through it.\\n- Sensors created by Divination spells can't appear inside the protected area or pass through the barrier at its perimeter.\\n- Creatures in the area can't be targeted by Divination spells.\\n- Nothing can teleport into or out of the warded area.\\n- Planar travel is blocked within the warded area.\\n\\nCasting this spell on the same spot every day for 365 days makes the spell last until dispelled.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can increase the size of the [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] by 100 feet for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a thin sheet of lead)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_mordenkainen_s_sword_xphb\",\"name\":\"Mordenkainen's Sword\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • 90 feet — You create a spectral sword that hovers within range. It lasts for the duration. When the sword appears, you make a melee spell attack against a targe\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature sword worth 250+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a spectral sword that hovers within range. It lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the sword appears, you make a melee spell attack against a target within 5 feet of the sword. On a hit, the target takes Force damage equal to 4d12 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\nOn your later turns, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to move the sword up to 30 feet to a spot you can see and repeat the attack against the same target or a different one.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature sword worth 250+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d12\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_move_earth_xphb\",\"name\":\"Move Earth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — Choose an area of terrain no larger than 40 feet on a side within range. You can reshape dirt, sand, or clay in the area in any manner you choose for \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature shovel)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 2 hours\\nChoose an area of terrain no larger than 40 feet on a side within range. You can reshape dirt, sand, or clay in the area in any manner you choose for the duration. You can raise or lower the area's elevation, create or fill in a trench, erect or flatten a wall, or form a pillar. The extent of any such changes can't exceed half the area's largest dimension. For example, if you affect a 40-foot square, you can create a pillar up to 20 feet high, raise or lower the square's elevation by up to 20 feet, dig a trench up to 20 feet deep, and so on. It takes 10 minutes for these changes to complete. Because the terrain's transformation occurs slowly, creatures in the area can't usually be trapped or injured by the ground's movement.\\n\\nAt the end of every 10 minutes you spend [[Concentration|XPHB|Concentrating]] on the spell, you can choose a new area of terrain to affect within range.\\n\\nThis spell can't manipulate natural stone or stone construction. Rocks and structures shift to accommodate the new terrain. If the way you shape the terrain would make a structure unstable, it might collapse.\\n\\nSimilarly, this spell doesn't directly affect plant growth. The moved earth carries any plants along with it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature shovel)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 2 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"areaOfEffect\":\"40-foot square\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_nondetection_xphb\",\"name\":\"Nondetection\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • Touch — For the duration, you hide a target that you touch from Divination spells. The target can be a willing creature, or it can be a place or an object no \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of diamond dust worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nFor the duration, you hide a target that you touch from Divination spells. The target can be a willing creature, or it can be a place or an object no larger than 10 feet in any dimension. The target can't be targeted by any Divination spell or perceived through magical scrying sensors.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Deep Gnome|MPMM]], [[Gnome (Deep)|DMG]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]], [[Svirfneblin Magic|MTF]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of diamond dust worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_nystul_s_magic_aura_xphb\",\"name\":\"Nystul's Magic Aura\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • Touch — With a touch, you place an illusion on a willing creature or an object that isn't being worn or carried. A creature gains the Mask effect below, and a\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a small square of silk)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nWith a touch, you place an illusion on a willing creature or an object that isn't being worn or carried. A creature gains the Mask effect below, and an object gains the False Aura effect below. The effect lasts for the duration. If you cast the spell on the same target every day for 30 days, the illusion lasts until dispelled.\\n\\n***Mask (Creature).*** Choose a creature type other than the target's actual type. Spells and other magical effects treat the target as if it were a creature of the chosen type.\\n\\n***False Aura (Object).*** You change the way the target appears to spells and magical effects that detect magical auras, such as [[Detect Magic|XPHB]]. You can make a nonmagical object appear magical, make a magic item appear nonmagical, or change the object's aura so that it appears to belong to a school of magic you choose.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a small square of silk)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_otiluke_s_freezing_sphere_xphb\",\"name\":\"Otiluke's Freezing Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • 300 feet — A frigid globe streaks from you to a point of your choice within range, where it explodes in a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]].\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 300 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature crystal sphere)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA frigid globe streaks from you to a point of your choice within range, where it explodes in a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]. Each creature in that area makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 10d6 Cold damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nIf the globe strikes a body of water, it freezes the water to a depth of 6 inches over an area 30 feet square. This ice lasts for 1 minute. Creatures that were swimming on the surface of frozen water are trapped in the ice and have the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition. A trapped creature can take an action to make a Strength ([[Athletics|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC to break free.\\n\\nYou can refrain from firing the globe after completing the spell's casting. If you do so, a globe about the size of a sling bullet, cool to the touch, appears in your hand. At any time, you or a creature you give the globe to can throw the globe (to a range of 40 feet) or hurl it with a sling (to the sling's normal range). It shatters on impact, with the same effect as a normal casting of the spell. You can also set the globe down without shattering it. After 1 minute, if the globe hasn't already shattered, it explodes.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"300 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature crystal sphere)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_otiluke_s_resilient_sphere_xphb\",\"name\":\"Otiluke's Resilient Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Abjuration • Action • 30 feet — A shimmering sphere encloses a Large or smaller creature or object within range. An unwilling creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a glass sphere)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA shimmering sphere encloses a Large or smaller creature or object within range. An unwilling creature must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or be enclosed for the duration.\\n\\nNothing—not physical objects, energy, or other spell effects—can pass through the barrier, in or out, though a creature in the sphere can breathe there. The sphere is immune to all damage, and a creature or object inside can't be damaged by attacks or effects originating from outside, nor can a creature inside the sphere damage anything outside it.\\n\\nThe sphere is weightless and just large enough to contain the creature or object inside. An enclosed creature can take an action to push against the sphere's walls and thus roll the sphere at up to half the creature's [[Speed|XPHB]]. Similarly, the globe can be picked up and moved by other creatures.\\n\\nA [[Disintegrate|XPHB]] spell targeting the globe destroys it without harming anything inside.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a glass sphere)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_otto_s_irresistible_dance_xphb\",\"name\":\"Otto's Irresistible Dance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — One creature that you can see within range must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the target dances comically until the end of its nex\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nOne creature that you can see within range must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a successful save, the target dances comically until the end of its next turn, during which it must spend all its movement to dance in place.\\n\\nOn a failed save, the target has the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration. While [[Charmed|XPHB]], the target dances comically, must use all its movement to dance in place, and has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on Dexterity saving throws and attack rolls, and other creatures have [[Advantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against it. On each of its turns, the target can take an action to collect itself and repeat the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Revelry|FRHoF]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_pass_without_trace_xphb\",\"name\":\"Pass without Trace\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • Self — You radiate a concealing aura in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and each creature yo\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (ashes from burned mistletoe)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou radiate a concealing aura in a 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. While in the aura, you and each creature you choose have a +10 bonus to Dexterity ([[Stealth|XPHB]]) checks and leave no tracks.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]], [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Genasi (Earth)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Earth)|MPMM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (ashes from burned mistletoe)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_passwall_xphb\",\"name\":\"Passwall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — A passage appears at a point that you can see on a wooden, plaster, or stone surface (such as a wall, ceiling, or floor) within range and lasts for th\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of sesame seeds)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nA passage appears at a point that you can see on a wooden, plaster, or stone surface (such as a wall, ceiling, or floor) within range and lasts for the duration. You choose the opening's dimensions: up to 5 feet wide, 8 feet tall, and 20 feet deep. The passage creates no instability in a structure surrounding it.\\n\\nWhen the opening disappears, any creatures or objects still in the passage created by the spell are safely ejected to an unoccupied space nearest to the surface on which you cast the spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Quandrix Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of sesame seeds)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_phantasmal_force_xphb\",\"name\":\"Phantasmal Force\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to craft an illusion in the mind of a creature you can see within range. The target makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou attempt to craft an illusion in the mind of a creature you can see within range. The target makes an Intelligence saving throw. On a failed save, you create a phantasmal object, creature, or other phenomenon that is no larger than a 10-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] and that is perceivable only to the target for the duration. The phantasm includes sound, temperature, and other stimuli.\\n\\nThe target can take a [[Study|XPHB]] action to examine the phantasm with an Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. If the check succeeds, the target realizes that the phantasm is an illusion, and the spell ends.\\n\\nWhile affected by the spell, the target treats the phantasm as if it were real and rationalizes any illogical outcomes from interacting with it. For example, if the target steps through a phantasmal bridge and survives the fall, it believes the bridge exists and something else caused it to fall.\\n\\nAn affected target can even take damage from the illusion if the phantasm represents a dangerous creature or hazard. On each of your turns, such a phantasm can deal 2d8 Psychic damage to the target if it is in the phantasm's area or within 5 feet of the phantasm. The target perceives the damage as a type appropriate to the illusion.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Illusion Adept|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_phantasmal_killer_xphb\",\"name\":\"Phantasmal Killer\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You tap into the nightmares of a creature you can see within range and create an illusion of its deepest fears, visible only to that creature. The tar\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou tap into the nightmares of a creature you can see within range and create an illusion of its deepest fears, visible only to that creature. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 4d10 Psychic damage and has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on ability checks and attack rolls for the duration. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage, and the spell ends.\\n\\nFor the duration, the target makes a Wisdom saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a failed save, it takes the Psychic damage again. On a successful save, the spell ends.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d10 for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_phantom_steed_xphb\",\"name\":\"Phantom Steed\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Illusion • 1 minute or Ritual • 30 feet — A Large, quasi-real, horselike creature appears on the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice within range. You decide the creature's appearance\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nA Large, quasi-real, horselike creature appears on the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice within range. You decide the creature's appearance, and it is equipped with a saddle, bit, and bridle. Any of the equipment created by the spell vanishes in a puff of smoke if it is carried more than 10 feet away from the steed.\\n\\nFor the duration, you or a creature you choose can ride the steed. The steed uses the [[Riding Horse|XMM]] stat block, except it has a [[Speed|XPHB]] of 100 feet and can travel 13 miles in an hour. When the spell ends, the steed gradually fades, giving the rider 1 minute to dismount. The spell ends early if the steed takes any damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Hollow Warden|RHW]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 3\",\"Special\",\"Ritual\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_planar_ally_xphb\",\"name\":\"Planar Ally\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • 10 minutes • 60 feet — You beseech an otherworldly entity for aid. The being must be known to you: a god, a demon prince, or some other being of cosmic power. That entity se\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou beseech an otherworldly entity for aid. The being must be known to you: a god, a demon prince, or some other being of cosmic power. That entity sends a Celestial, an Elemental, or a Fiend loyal to it to aid you, making the creature appear in an unoccupied space within range. If you know a specific creature's name, you can speak that name when you cast this spell to request that creature, though you might get a different creature anyway (DM's choice).\\n\\nWhen the creature appears, it is under no compulsion to behave a particular way. You can ask it to perform a service in exchange for payment, but it isn't obliged to do so. The requested task could range from simple (fly us across the chasm, or help us fight a battle) to complex (spy on our enemies, or protect us during our foray into the dungeon). You must be able to communicate with the creature to bargain for its services.\\n\\nPayment can take a variety of forms. A Celestial might require a sizable donation of gold or magic items to an allied temple, while a Fiend might demand a living sacrifice or a gift of treasure. Some creatures might exchange their service for a quest undertaken by you.\\n\\nA task that can be measured in minutes requires a payment worth 100 GP per minute. A task measured in hours requires 1,000 GP per hour. And a task measured in days (up to 10 days) requires 10,000 GP per day. The DM can adjust these payments based on the circumstances under which you cast the spell. If the task is aligned with the creature's ethos, the payment might be halved or even waived. Nonhazardous tasks typically require only half the suggested payment, while especially dangerous tasks might require a greater gift. Creatures rarely accept tasks that seem suicidal.\\n\\nAfter the creature completes the task, or when the agreed-upon duration of service expires, the creature returns to its home plane after reporting back to you if possible. If you are unable to agree on a price for the creature's service, the creature immediately returns to its home plane.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_planar_binding_xphb\",\"name\":\"Planar Binding\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Abjuration • 1 hour • 60 feet — You attempt to bind a Celestial, an Elemental, a Fey, or a Fiend to your service. The creature must be within range for the entire casting of the spel\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a jewel worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou attempt to bind a Celestial, an Elemental, a Fey, or a Fiend to your service. The creature must be within range for the entire casting of the spell. (Typically, the creature is first summoned into the center of the inverted version of the [[Magic Circle|XPHB]] spell to trap it while this spell is cast.) At the completion of the casting, the target must succeed on a Charisma saving throw or be bound to serve you for the duration. If the creature was summoned or created by another spell, that spell's duration is extended to match the duration of this spell.\\n\\nA bound creature must follow your commands to the best of its ability. You might command the creature to accompany you on an adventure, to guard a location, or to deliver a message. If the creature is [[Hostile [Attitude]|XPHB|Hostile]], it strives to twist your commands to achieve its own objectives. If the creature carries out your commands completely before the spell ends, it travels to you to report this fact if you are on the same plane of existence. If you are on a different plane, it returns to the place where you bound it and remains there until the spell ends.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The duration increases with a spell slot of level 6 (10 days), 7 (30 days), 8 (180 days), and 9 (366 days).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a jewel worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_plane_shift_xphb\",\"name\":\"Plane Shift\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • Action • Touch — You and up to eight willing creatures who link hands in a circle are transported to a different plane of existence. You can specify a target destinati\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a forked, metal rod worth 250+ GP and attuned to a plane of existence)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou and up to eight willing creatures who link hands in a circle are transported to a different plane of existence. You can specify a target destination in general terms, such as the City of Brass on the Elemental Plane of Fire or the palace of Dispater on the second level of the Nine Hells, and you appear in or near that destination, as determined by the DM.\\n\\nAlternatively, if you know the sigil sequence of a teleportation circle on another plane of existence, this spell can take you to that circle. If the teleportation circle is too small to hold all the creatures you transported, they appear in the closest unoccupied spaces next to the circle.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a forked, metal rod worth 250+ GP and attuned to a plane of existence)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_plant_growth_xphb\",\"name\":\"Plant Growth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action (Overgrowth) or 8 hours (Enrichment) • 150 feet — This spell channels vitality into plants. The casting time you use determines whether the spell has the Overgrowth or the Enrichment effect below. Ove\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action (Overgrowth) or 8 hours (Enrichment)\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThis spell channels vitality into plants. The casting time you use determines whether the spell has the Overgrowth or the Enrichment effect below.\\n\\n***Overgrowth.*** Choose a point within range. All normal plants in a 100-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on that point become thick and overgrown. A creature moving through that area must spend 4 feet of movement for every 1 foot it moves. You can exclude one or more areas of any size within the spell's area from being affected.\\n\\n***Enrichment.*** All plants in a half-mile radius centered on a point within range become enriched for 365 days. The plants yield twice the normal amount of food when harvested. They can benefit from only one Plant Growth per year.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]], [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action (Overgrowth) or 8 hours (Enrichment)\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_poison_spray_xphb\",\"name\":\"Poison Spray\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Necromancy Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You spray toxic mist at a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d12 Poison damage.\",\"content\":\"*Necromancy Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou spray toxic mist at a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d12 Poison damage.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d12 when you reach levels 5 (2d12), 11 (3d12), and 17 (4d12).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Tiefling|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Yuan-Ti|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Yuan-ti Pureblood|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Undertaker|AU]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d12\",\"damageType\":\"Poison\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Poison Damage\",\"Poison\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_polymorph_xphb\",\"name\":\"Polymorph\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — You attempt to transform a creature that you can see within range into a Beast. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or shape-shift into B\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a caterpillar cocoon)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou attempt to transform a creature that you can see within range into a Beast. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or shape-shift into Beast form for the duration. That form can be any Beast you choose that has a [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]] equal to or less than the target's (or the target's level if it doesn't have a [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]]). The target's game statistics are replaced by the stat block of the chosen Beast, but the target retains its alignment, personality, creature type, [[Hit Points|XPHB]], and [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]].\\n\\nThe target gains a number of [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to the [[Hit Points|XPHB]] of the Beast form. These [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] vanish if any remain when the spell ends. The spell ends early on the target if it has no [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] left.\\n\\nThe target is limited in the actions it can perform by the anatomy of its new form, and it can't speak or cast spells.\\n\\nThe target's gear melds into the new form. The creature can't use or otherwise benefit from any of that equipment.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Trickery Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Transmutation Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Sculptor of Flesh|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a caterpillar cocoon)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_power_word_fortify_xphb\",\"name\":\"Power Word Fortify\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You fortify up to six creatures you can see within range. The spell bestows 120 Temporary Hit Points, which you divide among the spell's recipients.\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou fortify up to six creatures you can see within range. The spell bestows 120 [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]], which you divide among the spell's recipients.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_power_word_heal_xphb\",\"name\":\"Power Word Heal\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — A wave of healing energy washes over one creature you can see within range. The target regains all its Hit Points. If the creature has the Charmed, Fr\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA wave of healing energy washes over one creature you can see within range. The target regains all its [[Hit Points|XPHB]]. If the creature has the [[Charmed|XPHB]], [[Frightened|XPHB]], [[Paralyzed|XPHB]], [[Poisoned|XPHB]], or [[Stunned|XPHB]] condition, the condition ends. If the creature has the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition, it can use its [[Reaction|XPHB]] to stand up.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_power_word_kill_xphb\",\"name\":\"Power Word Kill\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You compel one creature you can see within range to die. If the target has 100 Hit Points or fewer, it dies. Otherwise, it takes 12d12 Psychic damage.\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou compel one creature you can see within range to die. If the target has 100 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or fewer, it dies. Otherwise, it takes 12d12 Psychic damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d12\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_power_word_stun_xphb\",\"name\":\"Power Word Stun\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You overwhelm the mind of one creature you can see within range. If the target has 150 Hit Points or fewer, it has the Stunned condition. Otherwise, i\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou overwhelm the mind of one creature you can see within range. If the target has 150 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or fewer, it has the [[Stunned|XPHB]] condition. Otherwise, its [[Speed|XPHB]] is 0 until the start of your next turn.\\n\\nThe [[Stunned|XPHB]] target makes a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the condition on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_prayer_of_healing_xphb\",\"name\":\"Prayer of Healing\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • 10 minutes • 30 feet — Up to five creatures of your choice who remain within range for the spell's entire casting gain the benefits of a Short Rest and also regain 2d8 Hit P\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nUp to five creatures of your choice who remain within range for the spell's entire casting gain the benefits of a [[Short Rest|XPHB]] and also regain 2d8 [[Hit Points|XPHB]]. A creature can't be affected by this spell again until that creature finishes a [[Long Rest|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The healing increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Healing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Healing|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"healing\":\"2d8\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_prestidigitation_xphb\",\"name\":\"Prestidigitation\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 10 feet — You create a magical effect within range. Choose the effect from the options below. If you cast this spell multiple times, you can have up to three of\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou create a magical effect within range. Choose the effect from the options below. If you cast this spell multiple times, you can have up to three of its non-instantaneous effects active at a time.\\n\\n***Sensory Effect.*** You create an instantaneous, harmless sensory effect, such as a shower of sparks, a puff of wind, faint musical notes, or an odd odor.\\n\\n***Fire Play.*** You instantaneously light or snuff out a candle, a torch, or a small campfire.\\n\\n***Clean or Soil.*** You instantaneously clean or soil an object no larger than 1 cubic foot.\\n\\n***Minor Sensation.*** You chill, warm, or flavor up to 1 cubic foot of nonliving material for 1 hour.\\n\\n***Magic Mark.*** You make a color, a small mark, or a symbol appear on an object or a surface for 1 hour.\\n\\n***Minor Creation.*** You create a nonmagical trinket or an illusory image that can fit in your hand. It lasts until the end of your next turn. A trinket can deal no damage and has no monetary worth.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Archer|AU]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Archer|XGE]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cartomancer|BMT]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_prismatic_spray_xphb\",\"name\":\"Prismatic Spray\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Evocation • Action • Self — Eight rays of light flash from you in a 60-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]]. Each creature in the [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] makes a \",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nEight rays of light flash from you in a 60-foot [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]]. Each creature in the [[Cone [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cone]] makes a Dexterity saving throw. For each target, roll 1d8 to determine which color ray affects it, consulting the Prismatic Rays table.\\n\\n##### Prismatic Rays\\n| 1d8 | Ray                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |\\n|:---:|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\\n|  1  | **Red.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Fire damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\\n|  2  | **Orange.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Acid damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |\\n|  3  | **Yellow.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Lightning damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |\\n|  4  | **Green.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Poison damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |\\n|  5  | **Blue.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Cold damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |\\n|  6  | **Indigo.** *Failed Save:* The target has the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition and makes a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves three times, the condition ends. If it fails three times, it has the [[Petrified|XPHB]] condition until it is freed by an effect like the [[Greater Restoration|XPHB]] spell. The successes and failures needn't be consecutive; keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind. |\\n|  7  | **Violet.** *Failed Save:* The target has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition and makes a Wisdom saving throw at the start of your next turn. On a successful save, the condition ends. On a failed save, the condition ends, and the creature teleports to another plane of existence (DM's choice).                                                                                                                                                                           |\\n|  8  | **Special.** The target is struck by two rays. Roll twice, rerolling any 8.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_prismatic_wall_xphb\",\"name\":\"Prismatic Wall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Abjuration • Action • 60 feet — A shimmering, multicolored plane of light forms a vertical opaque wall—up to 90 feet long, 30 feet high, and 1 inch thick—centered on a point within r\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nA shimmering, multicolored plane of light forms a vertical opaque wall—up to 90 feet long, 30 feet high, and 1 inch thick—centered on a point within range. Alternatively, you shape the wall into a globe up to 30 feet in diameter centered on a point within range. The wall lasts for the duration. If you position the wall in a space occupied by a creature, the spell ends instantly without effect.\\n\\nThe wall sheds [[Bright Light|XPHB]] within 100 feet and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 100 feet. You and creatures you designate when you cast the spell can pass through and be near the wall without harm. If another creature that can see the wall moves within 20 feet of it or starts its turn there, the creature must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition for 1 minute.\\n\\nThe wall consists of seven layers, each with a different color. When a creature reaches into or passes through the wall, it does so one layer at a time through all the layers. Each layer forces the creature to make a Dexterity saving throw or be affected by that layer's properties as described in the Prismatic Layers table.\\n\\nThe wall, which has AC 10, can be destroyed one layer at a time, in order from red to violet, by means specific to each layer. If a layer is destroyed, it is gone for the duration. [[Antimagic Field|XPHB]] has no effect on the wall, and [[Dispel Magic|XPHB]] can affect only the violet layer.\\n\\n##### Prismatic Layers\\n| Order | Effects                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |\\n|:-----:|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\\n|   1   | **Red.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Fire damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage. *Additional Effects*: Nonmagical ranged attacks can't pass through this layer, which is destroyed if it takes at least 25 Cold damage.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |\\n|   2   | **Orange.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Acid damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage. *Additional Effects:* Magical ranged attacks can't pass through this layer, which is destroyed by a strong wind (such as the one created by [[Gust of Wind|XPHB]]).                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |\\n|   3   | **Yellow.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Lightning damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage. *Additional Effects:* The layer is destroyed if it takes at least 60 Force damage.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |\\n|   4   | **Green.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Poison damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage. *Additional Effects:* A [[Passwall|XPHB]] spell, or another spell of equal or greater level that can open a portal on a solid surface, destroys this layer.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |\\n|   5   | **Blue.** *Failed Save:* 12d6 Cold damage. *Successful Save:* Half as much damage. *Additional Effects:* The layer is destroyed if it takes at least 25 Fire damage.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |\\n|   6   | **Indigo.** *Failed Save:* The target has the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition and makes a Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns. If it successfully saves three times, the condition ends. If it fails three times, it has the [[Petrified|XPHB]] condition until it is freed by an effect like the [[Greater Restoration|XPHB]] spell. The successes and failures needn't be consecutive; keep track of both until the target collects three of a kind. *Additional Effects:* Spells can't be cast through this layer, which is destroyed by [[Bright Light|XPHB]] shed by the [[Daylight|XPHB]] spell. |\\n|   7   | **Violet.** *Failed Save:* The target has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition and makes a Wisdom saving throw at the start of your next turn. On a successful save, the condition ends. On a failed save, the condition ends, and the creature teleports to another plane of existence (DM's choice). *Additional Effects:* This layer is destroyed by [[Dispel Magic|XPHB]].                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_produce_flame_xphb\",\"name\":\"Produce Flame\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Conjuration Cantrip • Bonus action • Self — A flickering flame appears in your hand and remains there for the duration. While there, the flame emits no heat and ignites nothing, and it sheds Bri\",\"content\":\"*Conjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nA flickering flame appears in your hand and remains there for the duration. While there, the flame emits no heat and ignites nothing, and it sheds [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 20-foot radius and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 20 feet. The spell ends if you cast it again.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to hurl fire at a creature or an object within 60 feet of you. Make a ranged spell attack. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Fire damage.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Flamekin|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Genasi (Fire)|EEPC]], [[Genasi (Fire)|MPMM]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]], [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Druid\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_programmed_illusion_xphb\",\"name\":\"Programmed Illusion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You create an illusion of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon within range that activates when a specific trigger occurs. The illu\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (jade dust worth 25+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou create an illusion of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon within range that activates when a specific trigger occurs. The illusion is imperceptible until then. It must be no larger than a 30-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]], and you decide when you cast the spell how the illusion behaves and what sounds it makes. This scripted performance can last up to 5 minutes.\\n\\nWhen the trigger you specify occurs, the illusion springs into existence and performs in the manner you described. Once the illusion finishes performing, it disappears and remains dormant for 10 minutes, after which the illusion can be activated again.\\n\\nThe trigger can be as general or as detailed as you like, though it must be based on visual or audible phenomena that occur within 30 feet of the area. For example, you could create an illusion of yourself to appear and warn off others who attempt to open a trapped door.\\n\\nPhysical interaction with the image reveals it to be illusory, since things can pass through it. A creature that takes the [[Study|XPHB]] action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image, and any noise it makes sounds hollow to the creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (jade dust worth 25+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_project_image_xphb\",\"name\":\"Project Image\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Illusion • Action • 500 miles — You create an illusory copy of yourself that lasts for the duration. The copy can appear at any location within range that you have seen before, regar\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 500 miles\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a statuette of yourself worth 5+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 day\\nYou create an illusory copy of yourself that lasts for the duration. The copy can appear at any location within range that you have seen before, regardless of intervening obstacles. The illusion looks and sounds like you, but it is intangible. If the illusion takes any damage, it disappears, and the spell ends.\\n\\nYou can see through the illusion's eyes and hear through its ears as if you were in its space. As a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, you can move it up to 60 feet and make it gesture, speak, and behave in whatever way you choose. It mimics your mannerisms perfectly.\\n\\nPhysical interaction with the image reveals it to be illusory, since things can pass through it. A creature that takes the [[Study|XPHB]] action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image, and any noise it makes sounds hollow to the creature.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"500 miles\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a statuette of yourself worth 5+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 day\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_protection_from_energy_xphb\",\"name\":\"Protection from Energy\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • Touch — For the duration, the willing creature you touch has Resistance to one damage type of your choice: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder.\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nFor the duration, the willing creature you touch has [[Resistance|XPHB]] to one damage type of your choice: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, or Thunder.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Glory|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Abjuration Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_protection_from_evil_and_good_xphb\",\"name\":\"Protection from Evil and Good\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Action • Touch — Until the spell ends, one willing creature you touch is protected against creatures that are Aberrations, Celestials, Elementals, Fey, Fiends, or Unde\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a flask of Holy Water worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nUntil the spell ends, one willing creature you touch is protected against creatures that are Aberrations, Celestials, Elementals, Fey, Fiends, or Undead. The protection grants several benefits. Creatures of those types have [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls against the target. The target also can't be possessed by or gain the [[Charmed|XPHB]] or [[Frightened|XPHB]] conditions from them. If the target is already possessed, [[Charmed|XPHB]], or [[Frightened|XPHB]] by such a creature, the target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on any new saving throw against the relevant effect.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a flask of Holy Water worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_protection_from_poison_xphb\",\"name\":\"Protection from Poison\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch a creature and end the Poisoned condition on it. For the duration, the target has Advantage on saving throws to avoid or end the Poisoned co\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a creature and end the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition on it. For the duration, the target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on saving throws to avoid or end the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition, and it has [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Poison damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_purify_food_and_drink_xphb\",\"name\":\"Purify Food and Drink\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Transmutation • Action or Ritual • 10 feet — You remove poison and rot from nonmagical food and drink in a 5-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou remove poison and rot from nonmagical food and drink in a 5-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_raise_dead_xphb\",\"name\":\"Raise Dead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • 1 hour • Touch — With a touch, you revive a dead creature if it has been dead no longer than 10 days and it wasn't Undead when it died. The creature returns to life wi\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth 500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nWith a touch, you revive a dead creature if it has been dead no longer than 10 days and it wasn't Undead when it died.\\n\\nThe creature returns to life with 1 [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]]. This spell also neutralizes any poisons that affected the creature at the time of death.\\n\\nThis spell closes all mortal wounds, but it doesn't restore missing body parts. If the creature is lacking body parts or organs integral for its survival—its head, for instance—the spell automatically fails.\\n\\nComing back from the dead is an ordeal. The target takes a -4 penalty to [[D20 Test|XPHB|D20 Tests]]. Every time the target finishes a [[Long Rest|XPHB]], the penalty is reduced by 1 until it becomes 0.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Necromancy Adept|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth 500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_rary_s_telepathic_bond_xphb\",\"name\":\"Rary's Telepathic Bond\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — You forge a telepathic link among up to eight willing creatures of your choice within range, psychically linking each creature to all the others for t\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (two eggs)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou forge a telepathic link among up to eight willing creatures of your choice within range, psychically linking each creature to all the others for the duration. Creatures that can't communicate in any languages aren't affected by this spell.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, the targets can communicate telepathically through the bond whether or not they share a language. The communication is possible over any distance, though it can't extend to other planes of existence.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Silverquill Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (two eggs)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ray_of_enfeeblement_xphb\",\"name\":\"Ray of Enfeeblement\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — A beam of enervating energy shoots from you toward a creature within range. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a successful save, th\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA beam of enervating energy shoots from you toward a creature within range. The target must make a Constitution saving throw. On a successful save, the target has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on the next attack roll it makes until the start of your next turn.\\n\\nOn a failed save, the target has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on Strength-based [[D20 Test|XPHB|D20 Tests]] for the duration. During that time, it also subtracts 1d8 from all its damage rolls. The target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling|XPHB]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Necromancy Adept|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ray_of_frost_xphb\",\"name\":\"Ray of Frost\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — A frigid beam of blue-white light streaks toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 1d8 Cold d\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA frigid beam of blue-white light streaks toward a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, it takes 1d8 Cold damage, and its [[Speed|XPHB]] is reduced by 10 feet until the start of your next turn.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]], [[Rimekin|LFL]], [[Tiefling (Levistus)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_ray_of_sickness_xphb\",\"name\":\"Ray of Sickness\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Necromancy • Action • 60 feet — You shoot a greenish ray at a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 2d8 Poison damage and h\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou shoot a greenish ray at a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 2d8 Poison damage and has the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition until the end of your next turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Baalzebul)|MTF]], [[Tiefling|XPHB]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Poison\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Poison Damage\",\"Poison\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_regenerate_xphb\",\"name\":\"Regenerate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • 1 minute • Touch — A creature you touch regains 4d8 + 15 Hit Points. For the duration, the target regains 1 Hit Point at the start of each of its turns, and any severed \",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a prayer wheel)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nA creature you touch regains 4d8 + 15 [[Hit Points|XPHB]]. For the duration, the target regains 1 [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] at the start of each of its turns, and any severed body parts regrow after 2 minutes.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a prayer wheel)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"healing\":\"4d8 + 15\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Healing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_reincarnate_xphb\",\"name\":\"Reincarnate\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Necromancy • 1 hour • Touch — You touch a dead Humanoid or a piece of one. If the creature has been dead no longer than 10 days, the spell forms a new body for it and calls the sou\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (rare oils worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a dead Humanoid or a piece of one. If the creature has been dead no longer than 10 days, the spell forms a new body for it and calls the soul to enter that body. Roll 1d10 and consult the table below to determine the body's species, or the DM chooses another playable species.\\n\\n| 1d10 | Species             |\\n|:----:|---------------------|\\n|   1  | [[Aasimar|XPHB]]    |\\n|   2  | [[Dragonborn|XPHB]] |\\n|   3  | [[Dwarf|XPHB]]      |\\n|   4  | [[Elf|XPHB]]        |\\n|   5  | [[Gnome|XPHB]]      |\\n|   6  | [[Goliath|XPHB]]    |\\n|   7  | [[Halfling|XPHB]]   |\\n|   8  | [[Human|XPHB]]      |\\n|   9  | [[Orc|XPHB]]        |\\n|  10  | [[Tiefling|XPHB]]   |\\n\\nThe reincarnated creature makes any choices that a species' description offers, and the creature recalls its former life. It retains the capabilities it had in its original form, except it loses the traits of its previous species and gains the traits of its new one.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (rare oils worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_remove_curse_xphb\",\"name\":\"Remove Curse\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Abjuration • Action • Touch — At your touch, all curses affecting one creature or object end. If the object is a cursed magic item, its curse remains, but the spell breaks its owne\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nAt your touch, all curses affecting one creature or object end. If the object is a cursed magic item, its curse remains, but the spell breaks its owner's [[Attunement|XPHB]] to the object so it can be removed or discarded.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Winter Walker|FRHoF]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_resistance_xphb\",\"name\":\"Resistance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Abjuration Cantrip • Action • Touch — You touch a willing creature and choose a damage type: Acid, Bludgeoning, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Necrotic, Piercing, Poison, Radiant, Slashing, or Thu\",\"content\":\"*Abjuration Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou touch a willing creature and choose a damage type: Acid, Bludgeoning, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Necrotic, Piercing, Poison, Radiant, Slashing, or Thunder. When the creature takes damage of the chosen type before the spell ends, the creature reduces the total damage taken by 1d4. A creature can benefit from this spell only once per turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Arcane Safeguard|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_resurrection_xphb\",\"name\":\"Resurrection\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Necromancy • 1 hour • Touch — With a touch, you revive a dead creature that has been dead for no more than a century, didn't die of old age, and wasn't Undead when it died. The cre\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nWith a touch, you revive a dead creature that has been dead for no more than a century, didn't die of old age, and wasn't Undead when it died.\\n\\nThe creature returns to life with all its [[Hit Points|XPHB]]. This spell also neutralizes any poisons that affected the creature at the time of death. This spell closes all mortal wounds and restores any missing body parts.\\n\\nComing back from the dead is an ordeal. The target takes a -4 penalty to [[D20 Test|XPHB|D20 Tests]]. Every time the target finishes a [[Long Rest|XPHB]], the penalty is reduced by 1 until it becomes 0.\\n\\nCasting this spell to revive a creature that has been dead for 365 days or longer taxes you. Until you finish a [[Long Rest|XPHB]], you can't cast spells again, and you have [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on [[D20 Test|XPHB|D20 Tests]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_reverse_gravity_xphb\",\"name\":\"Reverse Gravity\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • Action • 100 feet — This spell reverses gravity in a 50-foot-radius, 100-foot high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range. All creat\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 100 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a lodestone and iron filings)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThis spell reverses gravity in a 50-foot-radius, 100-foot high [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point within range. All creatures and objects in that area that aren't anchored to the ground fall upward and reach the top of the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]]. A creature can make a Dexterity saving throw to grab a fixed object it can reach, thus avoiding the fall upward.\\n\\nIf a ceiling or an anchored object is encountered in this upward fall, creatures and objects strike it just as they would during a downward fall. If an affected creature or object reaches the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]]'s top without striking anything, it hovers there for the duration. When the spell ends, affected objects and creatures fall downward.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"100 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a lodestone and iron filings)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_revivify_xphb\",\"name\":\"Revivify\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • Touch — You touch a creature that has died within the last minute. That creature revives with 1 Hit Point. This spell can't revive a creature that has died of\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a diamond worth 300+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a creature that has died within the last minute. That creature revives with 1 [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]]. This spell can't revive a creature that has died of old age, nor does it restore any missing body parts.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a diamond worth 300+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Paladin\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_rope_trick_xphb\",\"name\":\"Rope Trick\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a rope. One end of it hovers upward until the rope hangs perpendicular to the ground or the rope reaches a ceiling. At the rope's upper end,\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a segment of rope)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch a rope. One end of it hovers upward until the rope hangs perpendicular to the ground or the rope reaches a ceiling. At the rope's upper end, an [[Invisible|XPHB]] 3-foot-by-5-foot portal opens to an extradimensional space that lasts until the spell ends. That space can be reached by climbing the rope, which can be pulled into or dropped out of it.\\n\\nThe space can hold up to eight Medium or smaller creatures. Attacks, spells, and other effects can't pass into or out of the space, but creatures inside it can see through the portal. Anything inside the space drops out when the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a segment of rope)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sacred_flame_xphb\",\"name\":\"Sacred Flame\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — Flame-like radiance descends on a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d8 Radiant dama\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nFlame-like radiance descends on a creature that you can see within range. The target must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or take 1d8 Radiant damage. The target gains no benefit from [[Cover|XPHB|Half Cover]] or Three-Quarters [[Cover|XPHB]] for this save.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Astral Elf|AAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]]\\n**Feats:** [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Scion of the Outer Planes|SatO]], [[Spellfire Spark|FRHoF]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sanctuary_xphb\",\"name\":\"Sanctuary\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Bonus action • 30 feet — You ward a creature within range. Until the spell ends, any creature who targets the warded creature with an attack roll or a damaging spell must succ\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a shard of glass from a mirror)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou ward a creature within range. Until the spell ends, any creature who targets the warded creature with an attack roll or a damaging spell must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or either choose a new target or lose the attack or spell. This spell doesn't protect the warded creature from areas of effect.\\n\\nThe spell ends if the warded creature makes an attack roll, casts a spell, or deals damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Way of the Open Hand|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Mark of Warding|EFA]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a shard of glass from a mirror)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_scorching_ray_xphb\",\"name\":\"Scorching Ray\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You hurl three fiery rays. You can hurl them at one target within range or at several. Make a ranged spell attack for each ray. On a hit, the target t\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou hurl three fiery rays. You can hurl them at one target within range or at several. Make a ranged spell attack for each ray. On a hit, the target takes 2d6 Fire damage.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You create one additional ray for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of Wildfire|TCE]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_scrying_xphb\",\"name\":\"Scrying\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Divination • 10 minutes • Self — You can see and hear a creature you choose that is on the same plane of existence as you. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw, which is modified (s\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** 10 minutes\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a focus worth 1,000+ GP, such as a crystal ball, mirror, or water-filled font)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou can see and hear a creature you choose that is on the same plane of existence as you. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw, which is modified (see the tables below) by how well you know the target and the sort of physical connection you have to it. The target doesn't know what it is making the save against, only that it feels uneasy.\\n\\n| Your Knowledge of the Target Is... | Save Modifier |\\n|------------------------------------|:-------------:|\\n| Secondhand (heard of the target)   |       +5      |\\n| Firsthand (met the target)         |       +0      |\\n| Extensive (know the target well)   |       -5      |\\n\\n| You Have the Target's...                | Save Modifier |\\n|-----------------------------------------|:-------------:|\\n| Picture or other likeness               |       -2      |\\n| Garment or other possession             |       -4      |\\n| Body part, lock of hair, or bit of nail |      -10      |\\n\\nOn a successful save, the target isn't affected, and you can't use this spell on it again for 24 hours.\\n\\nOn a failed save, the spell creates an [[Invisible|XPHB]], intangible sensor within 10 feet of the target. You can see and hear through the sensor as if you were there. The sensor moves with the target, remaining within 10 feet of it for the duration. If something can see the sensor, it appears as a luminous orb about the size of your fist.\\n\\nInstead of targeting a creature, you can target a location you have seen. When you do so, the sensor appears at that location and doesn't move.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Vengeance|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Divination Adept|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"10 minutes\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a focus worth 1,000+ GP, such as a crystal ball, mirror, or water-filled font)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_searing_smite_xphb\",\"name\":\"Searing Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a> • Self — As you hit the target, it takes an extra 1d6 Fire damage from the attack. At the start of each of its turns until the spell ends, the target takes 1d6\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nAs you hit the target, it takes an extra 1d6 Fire damage from the attack. At the start of each of its turns until the spell ends, the target takes 1d6 Fire damage and then makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the spell continues. On a successful save, the spell ends.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** All the damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Zariel)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Paladin\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_see_invisibility_xphb\",\"name\":\"See Invisibility\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Divination • Action • Self — For the duration, you see creatures and objects that have the Invisible condition as if they were visible, and you can see into the Ethereal Plane. Cr\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of talc)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nFor the duration, you see creatures and objects that have the [[Invisible|XPHB]] condition as if they were visible, and you can see into the Ethereal Plane. Creatures and objects there appear ghostly.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Watchers|TCE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Detection)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Detection|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of talc)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_seeming_xphb\",\"name\":\"Seeming\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Illusion • Action • 30 feet — You give an illusory appearance to each creature of your choice that you can see within range. An unwilling target can make a Charisma saving throw, a\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou give an illusory appearance to each creature of your choice that you can see within range. An unwilling target can make a Charisma saving throw, and if it succeeds, it is unaffected by this spell.\\n\\nYou can give the same appearance or different ones to the targets. The spell can change the appearance of the targets' bodies and equipment. You can make each creature seem 1 foot shorter or taller and appear heavier or lighter. A target's new appearance must have the same basic arrangement of limbs as the target, but the extent of the illusion is otherwise up to you. The spell lasts for the duration.\\n\\nThe changes wrought by this spell fail to hold up to physical inspection. For example, if you use this spell to add a hat to a creature's outfit, objects pass through the hat.\\n\\nA creature that takes the [[Study|XPHB]] action to examine a target can make an Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. If it succeeds, it becomes aware that the target is disguised.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Gloom Stalker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Gloom Stalker|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Illusion Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sending_xphb\",\"name\":\"Sending\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Divination • Action • Unlimited — You send a short message of 25 words or fewer to a creature you have met or a creature described to you by someone who has met it. The target hears th\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Unlimited\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a copper wire)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou send a short message of 25 words or fewer to a creature you have met or a creature described to you by someone who has met it. The target hears the message in its mind, recognizes you as the sender if it knows you, and can answer in a like manner immediately. The spell enables targets to understand the meaning of your message.\\n\\nYou can send the message across any distance and even to other planes of existence, but if the target is on a different plane than you, there is a 5 percent chance that the message doesn't arrive. You know if the delivery fails.\\n\\nUpon receiving your message, a creature can block your ability to reach it again with this spell for 8 hours. If you try to send another message during that time, you learn that you are blocked, and the spell fails.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Far Scribe|TCE]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Unlimited\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a copper wire)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sequester_xphb\",\"name\":\"Sequester\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Transmutation • Action • Touch — With a touch, you magically sequester an object or a willing creature. For the duration, the target has the Invisible condition and can't be targeted \",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (gem dust worth 5,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nWith a touch, you magically sequester an object or a willing creature. For the duration, the target has the [[Invisible|XPHB]] condition and can't be targeted by Divination spells, detected by magic, or viewed remotely with magic.\\n\\nIf the target is a creature, it enters a state of suspended animation; it has the [[Unconscious|XPHB]] condition, doesn't age, and doesn't need food, water, or air.\\n\\nYou can set a condition for the spell to end early. The condition can be anything you choose, but it must occur or be visible within 1 mile of the target. Examples include \\\"after 1,000 years\\\" or \\\"when the tarrasque awakens.\\\" This spell also ends if the target takes any damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (gem dust worth 5,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shapechange_xphb\",\"name\":\"Shapechange\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Transmutation • Action • Self — You shape-shift into another creature for the duration or until you take a Magic action to shape-shift into a different eligible form. The new form mu\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a jade circlet worth 1,500+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou shape-shift into another creature for the duration or until you take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to shape-shift into a different eligible form. The new form must be of a creature that has a [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]] no higher than your level or [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]]. You must have seen the sort of creature before, and it can't be a Construct or an Undead.\\n\\nWhen you cast the spell, you gain a number of [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to the [[Hit Points|XPHB]] of the first form into which you shape-shift. These [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] vanish if any remain when the spell ends.\\n\\nYour game statistics are replaced by the stat block of the chosen form, but you retain your creature type; alignment; personality; Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma scores; [[Hit Points|XPHB]]; [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]]; proficiencies; and ability to communicate. If you have the Spellcasting feature, you retain it too.\\n\\nUpon shape-shifting, you determine whether your equipment drops to the ground or changes in size and shape to fit the new form while you're in it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a jade circlet worth 1,500+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shatter_xphb\",\"name\":\"Shatter\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — A loud noise erupts from a point of your choice within range. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered there\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a chip of mica)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nA loud noise erupts from a point of your choice within range. Each creature in a 10-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered there makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 3d8 Thunder damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A Construct has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on the save.\\n\\nA nonmagical object that isn't being worn or carried also takes the damage if it's in the spell's area.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Evocation Adept|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Gong of the Summit|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a chip of mica)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shield_xphb\",\"name\":\"Shield\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Reaction, which you take when you are hit by an attack roll or targeted by the Magic Missile spell • Self — An imperceptible barrier of magical force protects you. Until the start of your next turn, you have a +5 bonus to AC, including against the triggering\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Reaction, which you take when you are hit by an attack roll or targeted by the Magic Missile spell\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nAn imperceptible barrier of magical force protects you. Until the start of your next turn, you have a +5 bonus to AC, including against the triggering attack, and you take no damage from [[Magic Missile|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gith (Githzerai)|MTF]], [[Githzerai|MPMM]], [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Abjuration Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Reaction, which you take when you are hit by an attack roll or targeted by the Magic Missile spell\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Reaction\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Reaction\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shield_of_faith_xphb\",\"name\":\"Shield of Faith\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Abjuration • Bonus action • 60 feet — A shimmering field surrounds a creature of your choice within range, granting it a +2 bonus to AC for the duration.\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a prayer scroll)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA shimmering field surrounds a creature of your choice within range, granting it a +2 bonus to AC for the duration.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a prayer scroll)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shillelagh_xphb\",\"name\":\"Shillelagh\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Bonus action • Self — A Club or Quarterstaff you are holding is imbued with nature's power. For the duration, you can use your spellcasting ability instead of Strength for \",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (mistletoe)\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nA Club or Quarterstaff you are holding is imbued with nature's power. For the duration, you can use your spellcasting ability instead of Strength for the attack and damage rolls of melee attacks using that weapon, and the weapon's damage die becomes a d8. If the attack deals damage, it can be Force damage or the weapon's normal damage type (your choice).\\n\\nThe spell ends early if you cast it again or if you let go of the weapon.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage die changes when you reach levels 5 (d10), 11 (d12), and 17 (2d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (mistletoe)\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Druid\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shining_smite_xphb\",\"name\":\"Shining Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a> • Self — The target hit by the strike takes an extra 2d6 Radiant damage from the attack. Until the spell ends, the target sheds Bright Light in a 5-foot radius\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe target hit by the strike takes an extra 2d6 Radiant damage from the attack. Until the spell ends, the target sheds [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 5-foot radius, attack rolls against it have [[Advantage|XPHB]], and it can't benefit from the [[Invisible|XPHB]] condition.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Zariel)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Paladin\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_shocking_grasp_xphb\",\"name\":\"Shocking Grasp\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • Touch — Lightning springs from you to a creature that you try to touch. Make a melee spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Lightning\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nLightning springs from you to a creature that you try to touch. Make a melee spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Lightning damage, and it can't make [[Opportunity Attack|XPHB|Opportunity Attacks]] until the start of its next turn.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Genasi (Air)|MPMM]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_silence_xphb\",\"name\":\"Silence\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Illusion • Action or Ritual • 120 feet — For the duration, no sound can be created within or pass through a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choo\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, no sound can be created within or pass through a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range. Any creature or object entirely inside the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to Thunder damage, and creatures have the [[Deafened|XPHB]] condition while entirely inside it. Casting a spell that includes a Verbal component is impossible there.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Way of Shadow|PHB]] ([[Monk|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_silent_image_xphb\",\"name\":\"Silent Image\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Illusion • Action • 60 feet — You create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 15-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. \",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create the image of an object, a creature, or some other visible phenomenon that is no larger than a 15-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]]. The image appears at a spot within range and lasts for the duration. The image is purely visual; it isn't accompanied by sound, smell, or other sensory effects.\\n\\nAs a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, you can cause the image to move to any spot within range. As the image changes location, you can alter its appearance so that its movements appear natural for the image. For example, if you create an image of a creature and move it, you can alter the image so that it appears to be walking.\\n\\nPhysical interaction with the image reveals it to be an illusion, since things can pass through it. A creature that takes a [[Study|XPHB]] action to examine the image can determine that it is an illusion with a successful Intelligence ([[Investigation|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. If a creature discerns the illusion for what it is, the creature can see through the image.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Mark of Shadow)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Shadow|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Illusion Adept|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Misty Visions|PHB]], [[Misty Visions|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of fleece)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_simulacrum_xphb\",\"name\":\"Simulacrum\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Illusion • 12 hours • Touch — You create a simulacrum of one Beast or Humanoid that is within 10 feet of you for the entire casting of the spell. You finish the casting by touching\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** 12 hours\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (powdered ruby worth 1,500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled\\nYou create a simulacrum of one Beast or Humanoid that is within 10 feet of you for the entire casting of the spell. You finish the casting by touching both the creature and a pile of ice or snow that is the same size as that creature, and the pile turns into the simulacrum, which is a creature. It uses the game statistics of the original creature at the time of casting, except it is a Construct, its [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] maximum is half as much, and it can't cast this spell.\\n\\nThe simulacrum is [[Friendly [Attitude]|XPHB|Friendly]] to you and creatures you designate. It obeys your commands and acts on your turn in combat. The simulacrum can't gain levels, and it can't take Short or Long Rests.\\n\\nIf the simulacrum takes damage, the only way to restore its [[Hit Points|XPHB]] is to repair it as you take a [[Long Rest|XPHB]], during which you expend components worth 100 GP per [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]] restored. The simulacrum must stay within 5 feet of you for the repair.\\n\\nThe simulacrum lasts until it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], at which point it reverts to snow and melts away. If you cast this spell again, any simulacrum you created with this spell is instantly destroyed.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"12 hours\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (powdered ruby worth 1,500+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sleep_xphb\",\"name\":\"Sleep\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — Each creature of your choice in a 5-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range must succeed on a Wisdom savi\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pinch of sand or rose petals)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nEach creature of your choice in a 5-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition until the end of its next turn, at which point it must repeat the save. If the target fails the second save, the target has the [[Unconscious|XPHB]] condition for the duration. The spell ends on a target if it takes damage or someone within 5 feet of it takes an action to shake it out of the spell's effect.\\n\\nCreatures that don't sleep, such as elves, or that have [[Immunity|XPHB]] to the [[Exhaustion|XPHB]] condition automatically succeed on saves against this spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Twilight Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Archfey Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Archfey|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (Pallid)|EGW]], [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Dimir Operative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pinch of sand or rose petals)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sleet_storm_xphb\",\"name\":\"Sleet Storm\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 150 feet — Until the spell ends, sleet falls in a 40-foot-tall, 20-foot-radius [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point you choose within \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature umbrella)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nUntil the spell ends, sleet falls in a 40-foot-tall, 20-foot-radius [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] centered on a point you choose within range. The area is [[Heavily Obscured|XPHB]], and exposed flames in the area are doused.\\n\\nGround in the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] is [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]]. When a creature enters the [[Cylinder [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cylinder]] for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there, it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or have the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition and lose [[Concentration|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature umbrella)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_slow_xphb\",\"name\":\"Slow\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • 120 feet — You alter time around up to six creatures of your choice in a 40-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] within range. Each target must succeed on a \",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of molasses)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou alter time around up to six creatures of your choice in a 40-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] within range. Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be affected by this spell for the duration.\\n\\nAn affected target's [[Speed|XPHB]] is halved, it takes a -2 penalty to AC and Dexterity saving throws, and it can't take Reactions. On its turns, it can take either an action or a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], not both, and it can make only one attack if it takes the [[Attack|XPHB]] action. If it casts a spell with a Somatic component, there is a 25 percent chance the spell fails as a result of the target making the spell's gestures too slowly.\\n\\nAn affected target repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Transmutation Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Mire the Mind|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of molasses)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sorcerous_burst_xphb\",\"name\":\"Sorcerous Burst\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 120 feet — You cast sorcerous energy at one creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 damage\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou cast sorcerous energy at one creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 damage of a type you choose: Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Poison, Psychic, or Thunder.\\n\\nIf you roll an 8 on a d8 for this spell, you can roll another d8, and add it to the damage. When you cast this spell, the maximum number of these d8s you can add to the spell's damage equals your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Kobold|MPMM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spare_the_dying_xphb\",\"name\":\"Spare the Dying\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Necromancy Cantrip • Action • 15 feet — Choose a creature within range that has 0 Hit Points and isn't dead. The creature becomes Stable.\",\"content\":\"*Necromancy Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 15 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nChoose a creature within range that has 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] and isn't dead. The creature becomes [[Stable|XPHB]].\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The range doubles when you reach levels 5 (30 feet), 11 (60 feet), and 17 (120 feet).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Arcane Undertaker|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"15 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_speak_with_animals_xphb\",\"name\":\"Speak with Animals\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Divination • Action or Ritual • Self — For the duration, you can comprehend and verbally communicate with Beasts, and you can use any of the Influence action's skill options with them. Most\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nFor the duration, you can comprehend and verbally communicate with Beasts, and you can use any of the [[Influence|XPHB]] action's skill options with them.\\n\\nMost Beasts have little to say about topics that don't pertain to survival or companionship, but at minimum, a Beast can give you information about nearby locations and monsters, including whatever it has perceived within the past day.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Totem Warrior|PHB]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Path of the Wild Heart|XPHB]] ([[Barbarian|XPHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Handling)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Emerald Enclave Fledgling|FRHoF]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Mark of Handling|EFA]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Watchers|RHW]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Beast Speech|PHB]], [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Warlock\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_speak_with_dead_xphb\",\"name\":\"Speak with Dead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • 10 feet — You grant the semblance of life to a corpse of your choice within range, allowing it to answer questions you pose. The corpse must have a mouth, and t\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (burning incense)\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou grant the semblance of life to a corpse of your choice within range, allowing it to answer questions you pose. The corpse must have a mouth, and this spell fails if the deceased creature was Undead when it died. The spell also fails if the corpse was the target of this spell within the past 10 days.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can ask the corpse up to five questions. The corpse knows only what it knew in life, including the languages it knew. Answers are usually brief, cryptic, or repetitive, and the corpse is under no compulsion to offer a truthful answer if you are antagonistic toward it or it recognizes you as an enemy. This spell doesn't return the creature's soul to its body, only its animating spirit. Thus, the corpse can't learn new information, doesn't comprehend anything that has happened since it died, and can't speculate about future events.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Phantom|RHW]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[The Undying|SCAG]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Undead|VRGR]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Whispers of the Grave|PHB]], [[Whispers of the Grave|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (burning incense)\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_speak_with_plants_xphb\",\"name\":\"Speak with Plants\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action • Self — You imbue plants in an immobile 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] with limited sentience and animation, giving them the ability to\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou imbue plants in an immobile 30-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] with limited sentience and animation, giving them the ability to communicate with you and follow your simple commands. You can question plants about events in the spell's area within the past day, gaining information about creatures that have passed, weather, and other circumstances.\\n\\nYou can also turn [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] caused by plant growth (such as thickets and undergrowth) into ordinary terrain that lasts for the duration. Or you can turn ordinary terrain where plants are present into [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] that lasts for the duration.\\n\\nThe spell doesn't enable plants to uproot themselves and move about, but they can move their branches, tendrils, and stalks for you.\\n\\nIf a Plant creature is in the area, you can communicate with it as if you shared a common language.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Orc (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]], [[Human (Variant; Mark of Finding)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Finding|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spider_climb_xphb\",\"name\":\"Spider Climb\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • Touch — Until the spell ends, one willing creature you touch gains the ability to move up, down, and across vertical surfaces and along ceilings, while leavin\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of bitumen and a spider)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nUntil the spell ends, one willing creature you touch gains the ability to move up, down, and across vertical surfaces and along ceilings, while leaving its hands free. The target also gains a [[Climb Speed|XPHB]] equal to its [[Speed|XPHB]].\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Transmutation Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Golgari Agent|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of bitumen and a spider)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spike_growth_xphb\",\"name\":\"Spike Growth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Transmutation • Action • 150 feet — The ground in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range sprouts hard spikes and thorns. The area becom\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (seven thorns)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nThe ground in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range sprouts hard spikes and thorns. The area becomes [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] for the duration. When a creature moves into or within the area, it takes 2d4 Piercing damage for every 5 feet it travels.\\n\\nThe transformation of the ground is camouflaged to look natural. Any creature that can't see the area when the spell is cast must take a [[Search|XPHB]] action and succeed on a Wisdom ([[Perception|XPHB]] or [[Survival|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC to recognize the terrain as hazardous before entering it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Lotusden)|EGW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Red Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (seven thorns)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spirit_guardians_xphb\",\"name\":\"Spirit Guardians\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • Self — Protective spirits flit around you in a 15-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. If you are good or neutral, their spec\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a prayer scroll)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nProtective spirits flit around you in a 15-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] for the duration. If you are good or neutral, their spectral form appears angelic or fey (your choice). If you are evil, they appear fiendish.\\n\\nWhen you cast this spell, you can designate creatures to be unaffected by it. Any other creature's [[Speed|XPHB]] is halved in the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]], and whenever the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] enters a creature's space and whenever a creature enters the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] or ends its turn there, the creature must make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the creature takes 3d8 Radiant damage (if you are good or neutral) or 3d8 Necrotic damage (if you are evil). On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of Spirits|RHW]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]], [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a prayer scroll)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_spiritual_weapon_xphb\",\"name\":\"Spiritual Weapon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Evocation • Bonus action • 60 feet — You create a floating, spectral force that resembles a weapon of your choice and lasts for the duration. The force appears within range in a space of \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a floating, spectral force that resembles a weapon of your choice and lasts for the duration. The force appears within range in a space of your choice, and you can immediately make one melee spell attack against one creature within 5 feet of the force. On a hit, the target takes Force damage equal to 1d8 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.\\n\\nAs a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] on your later turns, you can move the force up to 20 feet and repeat the attack against a creature within 5 feet of it.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for every slot level above 2.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Life Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 2\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_staggering_smite_xphb\",\"name\":\"Staggering Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Enchantment • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a> • Self — The target takes an extra 4d6 Psychic damage from the attack, and the target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Stunned condition until\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThe target takes an extra 4d6 Psychic damage from the attack, and the target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Stunned|XPHB]] condition until the end of your next turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The extra damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 4\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Paladin\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_starry_wisp_xphb\",\"name\":\"Starry Wisp\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You launch a mote of light at one creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Radia\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou launch a mote of light at one creature or object within range. Make a ranged spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d8 Radiant damage, and until the end of your next turn, it emits [[Dim Light|XPHB]] in a 10-foot radius and can't benefit from the [[Invisible|XPHB]] condition.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d8 when you reach levels 5 (2d8), 11 (3d8), and 17 (4d8).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Moon|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_steel_wind_strike_xphb\",\"name\":\"Steel Wind Strike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 30 feet — You flourish the weapon used in the casting and then vanish to strike like the wind. Choose up to five creatures you can see within range. Make a mele\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** S, M (a Melee weapon worth 1+ SP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou flourish the weapon used in the casting and then vanish to strike like the wind. Choose up to five creatures you can see within range. Make a melee spell attack against each target. On a hit, a target takes 6d10 Force damage.\\n\\nYou then teleport to an unoccupied space you can see within 5 feet of one of the targets.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Hollow Warden|RHW]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"S, M (a Melee weapon worth 1+ SP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_stinking_cloud_xphb\",\"name\":\"Stinking Cloud\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You create a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of yellow, nauseating gas centered on a point within range. The cloud is Heavily O\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a rotten egg)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] of yellow, nauseating gas centered on a point within range. The cloud is [[Heavily Obscured|XPHB]]. The cloud lingers in the air for the duration or until a strong wind (such as the one created by [[Gust of Wind|XPHB]]) disperses it.\\n\\nEach creature that starts its turn in the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have the [[Poisoned|XPHB]] condition until the end of the current turn. While [[Poisoned|XPHB]] in this way, the creature can't take an action or a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]].\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a rotten egg)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_stone_shape_xphb\",\"name\":\"Stone Shape\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Action • Touch — You touch a stone object of Medium size or smaller or a section of stone no more than 5 feet in any dimension and form it into any shape you like. For\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (soft clay)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a stone object of Medium size or smaller or a section of stone no more than 5 feet in any dimension and form it into any shape you like. For example, you could shape a large rock into a weapon, statue, or coffer, or you could make a small passage through a wall that is 5 feet thick. You could also shape a stone door or its frame to seal the door shut. The object you create can have up to two hinges and a latch, but finer mechanical detail isn't possible.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Lorehold Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (soft clay)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_stoneskin_xphb\",\"name\":\"Stoneskin\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Transmutation • Action • Touch — Until the spell ends, one willing creature you touch has Resistance to Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage.\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (diamond dust worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nUntil the spell ends, one willing creature you touch has [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[War Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Conquest|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Eternal Mountain Defense|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (diamond dust worth 100+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_storm_of_vengeance_xphb\",\"name\":\"Storm of Vengeance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Conjuration • Action • 1 mile — A churning storm cloud forms for the duration, centered on a point within range and spreading to a radius of 300 feet. Each creature under the cloud w\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 1 mile\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA churning storm cloud forms for the duration, centered on a point within range and spreading to a radius of 300 feet. Each creature under the cloud when it appears must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 2d6 Thunder damage and have the [[Deafened|XPHB]] condition for the duration.\\n\\nAt the start of each of your later turns, the storm produces different effects, as detailed below.\\n\\n***Turn 2.*** Acidic rain falls. Each creature and object under the cloud takes 4d6 Acid damage.\\n\\n***Turn 3.*** You call six bolts of lightning from the cloud to strike six different creatures or objects beneath it. Each target makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 10d6 Lightning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\n***Turn 4.*** Hailstones rain down. Each creature under the cloud takes 2d6 Bludgeoning damage.\\n\\n***Turns 5-10.*** Gusts and freezing rain assail the area under the cloud. Each creature there takes 1d6 Cold damage. Until the spell ends, the area is [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]] and [[Heavily Obscured|XPHB]], ranged attacks with weapons are impossible there, and strong wind blows through the area.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"1 mile\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_suggestion_xphb\",\"name\":\"Suggestion\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — You suggest a course of activity—described in no more than 25 words—to one creature you can see within range that can hear and understand you. The sug\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (a drop of honey)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 8 hours\\nYou suggest a course of activity—described in no more than 25 words—to one creature you can see within range that can hear and understand you. The suggestion must sound achievable and not involve anything that would obviously deal damage to the target or its allies. For example, you could say, \\\"Fetch the key to the cult's treasure vault, and give the key to me.\\\" Or you could say, \\\"Stop fighting, leave this library peacefully, and don't return.\\\"\\n\\nThe target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Charmed|XPHB]] condition for the duration or until you or your allies deal damage to the target. The [[Charmed|XPHB]] target pursues the suggestion to the best of its ability. The suggested activity can continue for the entire duration, but if the suggested activity can be completed in a shorter time, the spell ends for the target upon completing it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Tiefling (Fierna)|MTF]], [[Yuan-Ti|MPMM]], [[Yuan-ti Pureblood|VGM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (a drop of honey)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_aberration_xphb\",\"name\":\"Summon Aberration\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth an aberrant spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Aberrant Spirit stat block. When you\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pickled tentacle and an eyeball in a platinum-inlaid vial worth 400+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth an aberrant spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Aberrant Spirit|XPHB]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose Beholderkin, Mind Flayer, or Slaad. The creature resembles an Aberration of that kind, which determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, it shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pickled tentacle and an eyeball in a platinum-inlaid vial worth 400+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_beast_xphb\",\"name\":\"Summon Beast\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth a bestial spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Bestial Spirit stat block. When you ca\",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a feather, tuft of fur, and fish tail inside a gilded acorn worth 200+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a bestial spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Bestial Spirit|XPHB]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose an environment: Air, Land, or Water. The creature resembles an animal of your choice that is native to the chosen environment, which determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Shadow Sorcery|RHW]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a feather, tuft of fur, and fish tail inside a gilded acorn worth 200+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_celestial_xphb\",\"name\":\"Summon Celestial\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth a Celestial spirit. It manifests in an angelic form in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Celestial Spirit \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a reliquary worth 500+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a Celestial spirit. It manifests in an angelic form in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Celestial Spirit|XPHB]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose Avenger or Defender. Your choice determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a reliquary worth 500+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_construct_xphb\",\"name\":\"Summon Construct\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth the spirit of a Construct. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Construct Spirit stat block. \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a lockbox worth 400+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth the spirit of a Construct. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Construct Spirit|XPHB]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose a material: Clay, Metal, or Stone. The creature resembles an animate statue (you determine the appearance) made of the chosen material, which determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a lockbox worth 400+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_dragon_xphb\",\"name\":\"Summon Dragon\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You call forth a Dragon spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Draconic Spirit stat block. The creatur\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (an object with the image of a dragon engraved on it worth 500+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a Dragon spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Draconic Spirit|XPHB]] stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Draconic Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (an object with the image of a dragon engraved on it worth 500+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_elemental_xphb\",\"name\":\"Summon Elemental\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth an Elemental spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Elemental Spirit stat block. When y\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (air, a pebble, ash, and water inside a gold-inlaid vial worth 400+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth an Elemental spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Elemental Spirit|XPHB]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose an element: Air, Earth, Fire, or Water. The creature resembles a bipedal form wreathed in the chosen element, which determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (air, a pebble, ash, and water inside a gold-inlaid vial worth 400+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_fey_xphb\",\"name\":\"Summon Fey\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth a Fey spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Fey Spirit stat block. When you cast the s\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gilded flower worth 300+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a Fey spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Fey Spirit|XPHB]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose a mood: Fuming, Mirthful, or Tricksy. The creature resembles a Fey creature of your choice marked by the chosen mood, which determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Fey Wanderer|XPHB]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gilded flower worth 300+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_fiend_xphb\",\"name\":\"Summon Fiend\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 90 feet — You call forth a fiendish spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Fiendish Spirit stat block. When you \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bloody vial worth 600+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth a fiendish spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Fiendish Spirit|XPHB]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose Demon, Devil, or Yugoloth. The creature resembles a Fiend of the chosen type, which determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bloody vial worth 600+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_summon_undead_xphb\",\"name\":\"Summon Undead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • 90 feet — You call forth an Undead spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the Undead Spirit stat block. When you cas\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 90 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gilded skull worth 300+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou call forth an Undead spirit. It manifests in an unoccupied space that you can see within range and uses the [[Undead Spirit|XPHB]] stat block. When you cast the spell, choose the creature's form: Ghostly, Putrid, or Skeletal. The spirit resembles an Undead creature with the chosen form, which determines certain details in its stat block. The creature disappears when it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe creature is an ally to you and your allies. In combat, the creature shares your [[Initiative|XPHB]] count, but it takes its turn immediately after yours. It obeys your verbal commands (no action required by you). If you don't issue any, it takes the [[Dodge|XPHB]] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Use the spell slot's level for the spell's level in the stat block.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Undead Patron|RHW]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"90 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gilded skull worth 300+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sunbeam_xphb\",\"name\":\"Sunbeam\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • Self — You launch a sunbeam in a 5-foot-wide, 60-foot-long [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]]. Each creature in the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] make\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a magnifying glass)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou launch a sunbeam in a 5-foot-wide, 60-foot-long [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]]. Each creature in the [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 6d8 Radiant damage and has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition until the start of your next turn. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage only.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can take a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to create a new [[Line [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Line]] of radiance.\\n\\nFor the duration, a mote of brilliant radiance shines above you. It sheds [[Bright Light|XPHB]] in a 30-foot radius and [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for an additional 30 feet. This light is sunlight.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a magnifying glass)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"6d8\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_sunburst_xphb\",\"name\":\"Sunburst\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — Brilliant sunlight flashes in a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in t\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of sunstone)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nBrilliant sunlight flashes in a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point you choose within range. Each creature in the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 12d6 Radiant damage and has the [[Blinded|XPHB]] condition for 1 minute. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage only.\\n\\nA creature [[Blinded|XPHB]] by this spell makes another Constitution saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n\\nThis spell dispels [[Darkness|XPHB]] in its area that was created by any spell.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of sunstone)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"12d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_swift_quiver_xphb\",\"name\":\"Swift Quiver\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Bonus action • Self — When you cast the spell and as a Bonus Action until it ends, you can make two attacks with a weapon that fires Arrows or Bolts, such as a Longbow or a\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a Quiver worth 1+ GP)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nWhen you cast the spell and as a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] until it ends, you can make two attacks with a weapon that fires Arrows or Bolts, such as a Longbow or a Light Crossbow. The spell magically creates the ammunition needed for each attack. Each Arrow or Bolt created by the spell deals damage like a nonmagical piece of ammunition of its kind and disintegrates immediately after it hits or misses.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a Quiver worth 1+ GP)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_symbol_xphb\",\"name\":\"Symbol\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Abjuration • 1 minute • Touch — You inscribe a harmful glyph either on a surface (such as a section of floor or wall) or within an object that can be closed (such as a book or chest)\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (powdered diamond worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Until dispelled or triggered\\nYou inscribe a harmful glyph either on a surface (such as a section of floor or wall) or within an object that can be closed (such as a book or chest). The glyph can cover an area no larger than 10 feet in diameter. If you choose an object, it must remain in place; if it is moved more than 10 feet from where you cast this spell, the glyph is broken, and the spell ends without being triggered.\\n\\nThe glyph is nearly imperceptible and requires a successful Wisdom ([[Perception|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC to notice.\\n\\nWhen you inscribe the glyph, you set its trigger and choose which effect the symbol bears: Death, Discord, Fear, Pain, Sleep, or Stunning. Each one is explained below.\\n\\n***Set the Trigger.*** You decide what triggers the glyph when you cast the spell. For glyphs inscribed on a surface, common triggers include touching or stepping on the glyph, removing another object covering it, or approaching within a certain distance of it. For glyphs inscribed within an object, common triggers include opening that object or seeing the glyph.\\n\\nYou can refine the trigger so that only creatures of certain types activate it (for example, the glyph could be set to affect Aberrations). You can also set conditions for creatures that don't trigger the glyph, such as those who say a certain password.\\n\\nOnce triggered, the glyph glows, filling a 60-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] with [[Dim Light|XPHB]] for 10 minutes, after which time the spell ends. Each creature in the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] when the glyph activates is targeted by its effect, as is a creature that enters the [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there. A creature is targeted only once per turn.\\n\\n***Death.*** Each target makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 10d10 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful save.\\n\\n***Discord.*** Each target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, a target argues with other creatures for 1 minute. During this time, it is incapable of meaningful communication and has [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on attack rolls and ability checks.\\n\\n***Fear.*** Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition for 1 minute. While [[Frightened|XPHB]], the target must move at least 30 feet away from the glyph on each of its turns, if able.\\n\\n***Pain.*** Each target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or have the [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] condition for 1 minute.\\n\\n***Sleep.*** Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Unconscious|XPHB]] condition for 10 minutes. A creature awakens if it takes damage or if someone takes an action to shake it awake.\\n\\n***Stunning.*** Each target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Stunned|XPHB]] condition for 1 minute.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Abjurer|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (powdered diamond worth 1,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Until dispelled or triggered\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"10d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_synaptic_static_xphb\",\"name\":\"Synaptic Static\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • Action • 120 feet — You cause psychic energy to erupt at a point within range. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on that \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou cause psychic energy to erupt at a point within range. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on that point makes an Intelligence saving throw, taking 8d6 Psychic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nOn a failed save, a target also has muddled thoughts for 1 minute. During that time, it subtracts 1d6 from all its attack rolls and ability checks, as well as any Constitution saving throws to maintain [[Concentration|XPHB]]. The target makes an Intelligence saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"8d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"INT Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tasha_s_bubbling_cauldron_xphb\",\"name\":\"Tasha's Bubbling Cauldron\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 5 feet — You conjure a claw-footed cauldron filled with bubbling liquid. The cauldron appears in an unoccupied space on the ground within 5 feet of you and las\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 5 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a gilded ladle worth 500 + GP)\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou conjure a claw-footed cauldron filled with bubbling liquid. The cauldron appears in an unoccupied space on the ground within 5 feet of you and lasts for the duration. The cauldron can't be moved and disappears when the spell ends, along with the bubbling liquid inside it.\\n\\nThe liquid in the cauldron duplicates the properties of a Common or an Uncommon potion of your choice (such as a [[Potion of Healing|XDMG]]). As a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you or an ally can reach into the cauldron and withdraw one potion of that kind. The potion is contained in a vial that disappears when the potion is consumed. The cauldron can produce a number of these potions equal to your spellcasting ability modifier (minimum 1). When the last of these potions is withdrawn from the cauldron, the cauldron disappears, and the spell ends.\\n\\nPotions obtained from the cauldron that aren't consumed disappear when you cast this spell again.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"5 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a gilded ladle worth 500 + GP)\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tasha_s_hideous_laughter_xphb\",\"name\":\"Tasha's Hideous Laughter\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Enchantment • Action • 30 feet — One creature of your choice that you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, it has the Prone and Incapacitated conditions\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a tart and a feather)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nOne creature of your choice that you can see within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, it has the [[Prone|XPHB]] and [[Incapacitated|XPHB]] conditions for the duration. During that time, it laughs uncontrollably if it's capable of laughter, and it can't end the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition on itself.\\n\\nAt the end of each of its turns and each time it takes damage, it makes another Wisdom saving throw. The target has [[Advantage|XPHB]] on the save if the save is triggered by damage. On a successful save, the spell ends.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** You can target one additional creature for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Fey Touched|TCE]], [[Fey-Touched|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]], [[Vampire Touched|ABH]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a tart and a feather)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_telekinesis_xphb\",\"name\":\"Telekinesis\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Transmutation • Action • 60 feet — You gain the ability to move or manipulate creatures or objects by thought. When you cast the spell and as a Magic action on your later turns before t\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou gain the ability to move or manipulate creatures or objects by thought. When you cast the spell and as a [[Magic|XPHB]] action on your later turns before the spell ends, you can exert your will on one creature or object that you can see within range, causing the appropriate effect below. You can affect the same target round after round or choose a new one at any time. If you switch targets, the prior target is no longer affected by the spell.\\n\\n***Creature.*** You can try to move a Huge or smaller creature. The target must succeed on a Strength saving throw, or you move it up to 30 feet in any direction within the spell's range. Until the end of your next turn, the creature has the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition, and if you lift it into the air, it is suspended there. It falls at the end of your next turn unless you use this option on it again and it fails the save.\\n\\n***Object.*** You can try to move a Huge or smaller object. If the object isn't being worn or carried, you automatically move it up to 30 feet in any direction within the spell's range.\\n\\nIf the object is worn or carried by a creature, that creature must succeed on a Strength saving throw, or you pull the object away and move it up to 30 feet in any direction within the spell's range.\\n\\nYou can exert fine control on objects with your telekinetic grip, such as manipulating a simple tool, opening a door or a container, stowing or retrieving an item from an open container, or pouring the contents from a vial.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Psi Warrior|TCE]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Aberrant Mind|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[The Great Old One|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Psi Warrior|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Aberrant Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Great Old One Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_telepathy_xphb\",\"name\":\"Telepathy\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Divination • Action • Unlimited — You create a telepathic link between yourself and a willing creature with which you are familiar. The creature can be anywhere on the same plane of ex\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Unlimited\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pair of linked silver rings)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nYou create a telepathic link between yourself and a willing creature with which you are familiar. The creature can be anywhere on the same plane of existence as you. The spell ends if you or the target are no longer on the same plane.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you and the target can instantly share words, images, sounds, and other sensory messages with each other through the link, and the target recognizes you as the creature it is communicating with. The spell enables a creature to understand the meaning of your words and any sensory messages you send to it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Unlimited\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pair of linked silver rings)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 8\",\"Action\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_teleport_xphb\",\"name\":\"Teleport\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 7 Conjuration • Action • 10 feet — This spell instantly transports you and up to eight willing creatures that you can see within range, or a single object that you can see within range,\",\"content\":\"*Level 7 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nThis spell instantly transports you and up to eight willing creatures that you can see within range, or a single object that you can see within range, to a destination you select. If you target an object, it must be Large or smaller, and it can't be held or carried by an unwilling creature.\\n\\nThe destination you choose must be known to you, and it must be on the same plane of existence as you. Your familiarity with the destination determines whether you arrive there successfully. The DM rolls 1d100 and consults the Teleportation Outcome table and the explanations after it.\\n\\n##### Teleportation Outcome\\n| Familiarity              | Mishap | Similar Area | Off Target | On Target |\\n|--------------------------|:------:|:------------:|:----------:|:---------:|\\n| Permanent circle         |    —   |       —      |      —     |   01-00   |\\n| Linked object            |    —   |       —      |      —     |   01-00   |\\n| Very familiar            |  01-05 |     06-13    |    14-24   |   25-00   |\\n| Seen casually            |  01-33 |     34-43    |    44-53   |   54-00   |\\n| Viewed once or described |  01-43 |     44-53    |    54-73   |   74-00   |\\n| False destination        |  01-50 |     51-00    |      —     |     —     |\\n\\n***Familiarity.*** Here are the meanings of the terms in the table's Familiarity column:\\n\\n- \\\"Permanent circle\\\" means a permanent teleportation circle whose sigil sequence you know.\\n- \\\"Linked object\\\" means you possess an object taken from the desired destination within the last six months, such as a book from a wizard's library.\\n- \\\"Very familiar\\\" is a place you have visited often, a place you have carefully studied, or a place you can see when you cast the spell.\\n- \\\"Seen casually\\\" is a place you have seen more than once but with which you aren't very familiar.\\n- \\\"Viewed once or described\\\" is a place you have seen once, possibly using magic, or a place you know through someone else's description, perhaps from a map.\\n- \\\"False destination\\\" is a place that doesn't exist. Perhaps you tried to scry an enemy's sanctum but instead viewed an illusion, or you are attempting to teleport to a location that no longer exists.\\n\\n***Mishap.*** The spell's unpredictable magic results in a difficult journey. Each teleporting creature (or the target object) takes 3d10 Force damage, and the DM rerolls on the table to see where you wind up (multiple mishaps can occur, dealing damage each time).\\n\\n***Similar Area.*** You and your group (or the target object) appear in a different area that's visually or thematically similar to the target area. You appear in the closest similar place. If you are heading for your home laboratory, for example, you might appear in another person's laboratory in the same city.\\n\\n***Off Target.*** You and your group (or the target object) appear 2d12 miles away from the destination in a random direction. Roll 1d8 for the direction: 1, east; 2, southeast; 3, south; 4, southwest; 5, west; 6, northwest; 7, north; or 8, northeast.\\n\\n***On Target.*** You and your group (or the target object) appear where you intended.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":7,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d10\",\"damageType\":\"Force\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 7\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Force Damage\",\"Force\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_teleportation_circle_xphb\",\"name\":\"Teleportation Circle\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • 1 minute • 10 feet — As you cast the spell, you draw a 5-foot-radius circle on the ground inscribed with sigils that link your location to a permanent teleportation circle\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, M (rare inks worth 50+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 1 round\\nAs you cast the spell, you draw a 5-foot-radius circle on the ground inscribed with sigils that link your location to a permanent teleportation circle of your choice whose sigil sequence you know and that is on the same plane of existence as you. A shimmering portal opens within the circle you drew and remains open until the end of your next turn. Any creature that enters the portal instantly appears within 5 feet of the destination circle or in the nearest unoccupied space if that space is occupied.\\n\\nMany major temples, guildhalls, and other important places have permanent teleportation circles. Each circle includes a unique sigil sequence—a string of runes arranged in a particular pattern.\\n\\nWhen you first gain the ability to cast this spell, you learn the sigil sequences for two destinations on the Material Plane, determined by the DM. You might learn additional sigil sequences during your adventures. You can commit a new sigil sequence to memory after studying it for 1 minute.\\n\\nYou can create a permanent teleportation circle by casting this spell in the same location every day for 365 days.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Cartographer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Horizon Walker|XGE]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Passage)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Passage|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, M (rare inks worth 50+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"1 round\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Special\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tenser_s_floating_disk_xphb\",\"name\":\"Tenser's Floating Disk\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — This spell creates a circular, horizontal plane of force, 3 feet in diameter and 1 inch thick, that floats 3 feet above the ground in an unoccupied sp\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of mercury)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell creates a circular, horizontal plane of force, 3 feet in diameter and 1 inch thick, that floats 3 feet above the ground in an unoccupied space of your choice that you can see within range. The disk remains for the duration and can hold up to 500 pounds. If more weight is placed on it, the spell ends, and everything on the disk falls to the ground.\\n\\nThe disk is immobile while you are within 20 feet of it. If you move more than 20 feet away from it, the disk follows you so that it remains within 20 feet of you. It can move across uneven terrain, up or down stairs, slopes and the like, but it can't cross an elevation change of 10 feet or more. For example, the disk can't move across a 10-foot-deep pit, nor could it leave such a pit if it was created at the bottom.\\n\\nIf you move more than 100 feet from the disk (typically because it can't move around an obstacle to follow you), the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Making)|ERLW]], [[Tiefling (Mammon)|MTF]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Mark of Making|EFA]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of mercury)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thaumaturgy_xphb\",\"name\":\"Thaumaturgy\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You manifest a minor wonder within range. You create one of the effects below within range. If you cast this spell multiple times, you can have up to \",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nYou manifest a minor wonder within range. You create one of the effects below within range. If you cast this spell multiple times, you can have up to three of its 1-minute effects active at a time.\\n\\n***Altered Eyes.*** You alter the appearance of your eyes for 1 minute.\\n\\n***Booming Voice.*** Your voice booms up to three times as loud as normal for 1 minute. For the duration, you have [[Advantage|XPHB]] on Charisma ([[Intimidation|XPHB]]) checks.\\n\\n***Fire Play.*** You cause flames to flicker, brighten, dim, or change color for 1 minute.\\n\\n***Invisible Hand.*** You instantaneously cause an unlocked door or window to fly open or slam shut.\\n\\n***Phantom Sound.*** You create an instantaneous sound that originates from a point of your choice within range, such as a rumble of thunder, the cry of a raven, or ominous whispers.\\n\\n***Tremors.*** You cause harmless tremors in the ground for 1 minute.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Path of the Giant|BGG]] ([[Barbarian|PHB]]), [[Drakewarden|FTD]] ([[Ranger|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Tiefling|PHB]], [[Tiefling (Asmodeus)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Baalzebul)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Dispater)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Zariel)|MTF]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Hellfire)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Infernal Legacy)|SCAG]], [[Tiefling|XPHB]]\\n**Feats:** [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thorn_whip_xphb\",\"name\":\"Thorn Whip\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Transmutation Cantrip • Action • 30 feet — You create a vine-like whip covered in thorns that lashes out at your command toward a creature in range. Make a melee spell attack against the target\",\"content\":\"*Transmutation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (the stem of a plant with thorns)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou create a vine-like whip covered in thorns that lashes out at your command toward a creature in range. Make a melee spell attack against the target. On a hit, the target takes 1d6 Piercing damage, and if it is Large or smaller, you can pull it up to 10 feet closer to you.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Spell Sniper|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (the stem of a plant with thorns)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Druid\",\"Artificer\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thunderclap_xphb\",\"name\":\"Thunderclap\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • Self — Each creature in a 5-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 1d6 T\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nEach creature in a 5-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] originating from you must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 1d6 Thunder damage. The spell's thunderous sound can be heard up to 100 feet away.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[College of the Moon|FRHoF]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Strength Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf|LFL]], [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Elf (Kaladesh; Vahadar)|PSK]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Green)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Emeria Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Druidic Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Wood Elf Magic|XGE]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Druidic Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thunderous_smite_xphb\",\"name\":\"Thunderous Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a> • Self — Your strike rings with thunder that is audible within 300 feet of you, and the target takes an extra 2d6 Thunder damage from the attack. Additionally,\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYour strike rings with thunder that is audible within 300 feet of you, and the target takes an extra 2d6 Thunder damage from the attack. Additionally, if the target is a creature, it must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pushed 10 feet away from you and have the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Zeal Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Noble Genies|FRHoF]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a target with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"2d6\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Paladin\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_thunderwave_xphb\",\"name\":\"Thunderwave\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • Self — You unleash a wave of thunderous energy. Each creature in a 15-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] originating from you makes a Constitution savi\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash a wave of thunderous energy. Each creature in a 15-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] originating from you makes a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 2d8 Thunder damage and is pushed 10 feet away from you. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage only.\\n\\nIn addition, unsecured objects that are entirely within the [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] are pushed 10 feet away from you, and a thunderous boom is audible within 300 feet.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Tempest Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[The Fathomless|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Rune Shaper|BGG]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Gruul Anarch|GGR]], [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Fist of Four Thunders|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d8\",\"damageType\":\"Thunder\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Thunder Damage\",\"Thunder\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_time_stop_xphb\",\"name\":\"Time Stop\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Transmutation • Action • Self — You briefly stop the flow of time for everyone but yourself. No time passes for other creatures, while you take 1d4 + 1 turns in a row, during which y\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou briefly stop the flow of time for everyone but yourself. No time passes for other creatures, while you take 1d4 + 1 turns in a row, during which you can use actions and move as normal.\\n\\nThis spell ends if one of the actions you use during this period, or any effects that you create during it, affects a creature other than you or an object being worn or carried by someone other than you. In addition, the spell ends if you move to a place more than 1,000 feet from the location where you cast it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_toll_the_dead_xphb\",\"name\":\"Toll the Dead\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Necromancy Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You point at one creature you can see within range, and the single chime of a dolorous bell is audible within 10 feet of the target. The target must s\",\"content\":\"*Necromancy Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou point at one creature you can see within range, and the single chime of a dolorous bell is audible within 10 feet of the target. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or take 1d8 Necrotic damage. If the target is missing any of its [[Hit Points|XPHB]], it instead takes 1d12 Necrotic damage.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by one die when you reach levels 5 (2d8 or 2d12), 11 (3d8 or 3d12), and 17 (4d8 or 4d12).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Arcane Undertaker|AU]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d8\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tongues_xphb\",\"name\":\"Tongues\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Divination • Action • Touch — This spell grants the creature you touch the ability to understand any spoken or signed language that it hears or sees. Moreover, when the target comm\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, M (a miniature ziggurat)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell grants the creature you touch the ability to understand any spoken or signed language that it hears or sees. Moreover, when the target communicates by speaking or signing, any creature that knows at least one language can understand it if that creature can hear the speech or see the signing.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Knowledge Domain|FRHoF]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Gnome (Mark of Scribing)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Mark of Scribing|EFA]], [[Outlands Envoy|SatO]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, M (a miniature ziggurat)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_transport_via_plants_xphb\",\"name\":\"Transport via Plants\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 10 feet — This spell creates a magical link between a Large or larger inanimate plant within range and another plant, at any distance, on the same plane of exis\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 10 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nThis spell creates a magical link between a Large or larger inanimate plant within range and another plant, at any distance, on the same plane of existence. You must have seen or touched the destination plant at least once before. For the duration, any creature can step into the target plant and exit from the destination plant by using 5 feet of movement.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"10 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tree_stride_xphb\",\"name\":\"Tree Stride\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Conjuration • Action • Self — You gain the ability to enter a tree and move from inside it to inside another tree of the same kind within 500 feet. Both trees must be living and at\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou gain the ability to enter a tree and move from inside it to inside another tree of the same kind within 500 feet. Both trees must be living and at least the same size as you. You must use 5 feet of movement to enter a tree. You instantly know the location of all other trees of the same kind within 500 feet and, as part of the move used to enter the tree, can either pass into one of those trees or step out of the tree you're in. You appear in a spot of your choice within 5 feet of the destination tree, using another 5 feet of movement. If you have no movement left, you appear within 5 feet of the tree you entered.\\n\\nYou can use this transportation ability only once on each of your turns. You must end each turn outside a tree.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Ancients|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_true_polymorph_xphb\",\"name\":\"True Polymorph\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Transmutation • Action • 30 feet — Choose one creature or nonmagical object that you can see within range. The creature shape-shifts into a different creature or a nonmagical object, or\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of mercury, a dollop of gum arabic, and a wisp of smoke)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nChoose one creature or nonmagical object that you can see within range. The creature shape-shifts into a different creature or a nonmagical object, or the object shape-shifts into a creature (the object must be neither worn nor carried). The transformation lasts for the duration or until the target dies or is destroyed, but if you maintain [[Concentration|XPHB]] on this spell for the full duration, the spell lasts until dispelled.\\n\\nAn unwilling creature can make a Wisdom saving throw, and if it succeeds, it isn't affected by this spell.\\n\\n***Creature into Creature.*** If you turn a creature into another kind of creature, the new form can be any kind you choose that has a [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]] equal to or less than the target's [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]] or level. The target's game statistics are replaced by the stat block of the new form, but it retains its [[Hit Points|XPHB]], [[Hit Point Dice|XPHB]], alignment, and personality.\\n\\nThe target gains a number of [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to the [[Hit Points|XPHB]] of the new form. These [[Temporary Hit Points|XPHB]] vanish if any remain when the spell ends.\\n\\nThe target is limited in the actions it can perform by the anatomy of its new form, and it can't speak or cast spells.\\n\\nThe target's gear melds into the new form. The creature can't use or otherwise benefit from any of that equipment.\\n\\n***Object into Creature.*** You can turn an object into any kind of creature, as long as the creature's size is no larger than the object's size and the creature has a [[Challenge Rating|XPHB]] of 9 or lower. The creature is [[Friendly [Attitude]|XPHB|Friendly]] to you and your allies. In combat, it takes its turns immediately after yours, and it obeys your commands.\\n\\nIf the spell lasts more than an hour, you no longer control the creature. It might remain [[Friendly [Attitude]|XPHB|Friendly]] to you, depending on how you have treated it.\\n\\n***Creature into Object.*** If you turn a creature into an object, it transforms along with whatever it is wearing and carrying into that form, as long as the object's size is no larger than the creature's size. The creature's statistics become those of the object, and the creature has no memory of time spent in this form after the spell ends and it returns to normal.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of mercury, a dollop of gum arabic, and a wisp of smoke)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_true_resurrection_xphb\",\"name\":\"True Resurrection\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Necromancy • 1 hour • Touch — You touch a creature that has been dead for no longer than 200 years and that died for any reason except old age. The creature is revived with all its\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 hour\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (diamonds worth 25,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou touch a creature that has been dead for no longer than 200 years and that died for any reason except old age. The creature is revived with all its [[Hit Points|XPHB]].\\n\\nThis spell closes all wounds, neutralizes any poison, cures all magical contagions, and lifts any curses affecting the creature when it died. The spell replaces damaged or missing organs and limbs. If the creature was Undead, it is restored to its non-Undead form.\\n\\nThe spell can provide a new body if the original no longer exists, in which case you must speak the creature's name. The creature then appears in an unoccupied space you choose within 10 feet of you.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"1 hour\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (diamonds worth 25,000+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 9\",\"Special\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_true_seeing_xphb\",\"name\":\"True Seeing\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Divination • Action • Touch — For the duration, the willing creature you touch has Truesight with a range of 120 feet.\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Divination*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (mushroom powder worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nFor the duration, the willing creature you touch has [[Truesight|XPHB]] with a range of 120 feet.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (mushroom powder worth 25+ GP, which the spell consumes)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_true_strike_xphb\",\"name\":\"True Strike\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Divination Cantrip • Action • Self — Guided by a flash of magical insight, you make one attack with the weapon used in the spell's casting. The attack uses your spellcasting ability for t\",\"content\":\"*Divination Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** S, M (a weapon with which you have proficiency and that is worth 1+ CP)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nGuided by a flash of magical insight, you make one attack with the weapon used in the spell's casting. The attack uses your spellcasting ability for the attack and damage rolls instead of using Strength or Dexterity. If the attack deals damage, it can be Radiant damage or the weapon's normal damage type (your choice).\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** Whether you deal Radiant damage or the weapon's normal damage type, the attack deals extra Radiant damage when you reach levels 5 (1d6), 11 (2d6), and 17 (3d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Diviner|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Elf (High)|PHB]], [[Elf|XPHB]], [[Half-Elf (Variant; Moon Elf or Sun Elf Descent)|SCAG]], [[Khoravar|EFA]], [[Kobold|MPMM]], [[Merfolk (Ixalan; Blue)|PSX]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Ula Creed)|PSZ]]\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Arcane Warrior|AU]], [[Artificer Initiate|TCE]], [[Cold Caster|FRHoF]], [[Initiate of High Sorcery|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Divination\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"S, M (a weapon with which you have proficiency and that is worth 1+ CP)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Divination\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_tsunami_xphb\",\"name\":\"Tsunami\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 8 Conjuration • 1 minute • 1 mile — A wall of water springs into existence at a point you choose within range. You can make the wall up to 300 feet long, 300 feet high, and 50 feet thick\",\"content\":\"*Level 8 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 1 mile\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 6 rounds\\nA wall of water springs into existence at a point you choose within range. You can make the wall up to 300 feet long, 300 feet high, and 50 feet thick. The wall lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the wall appears, each creature in its area makes a Strength saving throw, taking 6d10 Bludgeoning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nAt the start of each of your turns after the wall appears, the wall, along with any creatures in it, moves 50 feet away from you. Any Huge or smaller creature inside the wall or whose space the wall enters when it moves must succeed on a Strength saving throw or take 5d10 Bludgeoning damage. A creature can take this damage only once per round. At the end of the turn, the wall's height is reduced by 50 feet, and the damage the wall deals on later rounds is reduced by 1d10. When the wall reaches 0 feet in height, the spell ends.\\n\\nA creature caught in the wall can move by swimming. Because of the wave's force, though, the creature must succeed on a Strength ([[Athletics|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC to move at all. If it fails the check, it can't move. A creature that moves out of the wall falls to the ground.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\",\"stats\":{\"level\":8,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"1 mile\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 6 rounds\",\"actionType\":\"Special\",\"damage\":\"6d10\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 8\",\"Special\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_unseen_servant_xphb\",\"name\":\"Unseen Servant\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Conjuration • Action or Ritual • 60 feet — This spell creates an Invisible, mindless, shapeless, Medium force that performs simple tasks at your command until the spell ends. The servant spring\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of string and of wood)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell creates an [[Invisible|XPHB]], mindless, shapeless, Medium force that performs simple tasks at your command until the spell ends. The servant springs into existence in an unoccupied space on the ground within range. It has AC 10, 1 [[Hit Points|XPHB|Hit Point]], and a Strength of 2, and it can't attack. If it drops to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]], the spell ends.\\n\\nOnce on each of your turns as a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]], you can mentally command the servant to move up to 15 feet and interact with an object. The servant can perform simple tasks that a human could do, such as fetching things, cleaning, mending, folding clothes, lighting fires, serving food, and pouring drinks. Once you give the command, the servant performs the task to the best of its ability until it completes the task, then waits for your next command.\\n\\nIf you command the servant to perform a task that would move it more than 60 feet away from you, the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Halfling (Mark of Hospitality)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Ritual Caster|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Ritual Caster|XPHB]], [[Mark of Hospitality|EFA]], [[Quicksmithing|PSK]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Izzet Engineer|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Book of Ancient Secrets|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of string and of wood)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Bard\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_vampiric_touch_xphb\",\"name\":\"Vampiric Touch\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Necromancy • Action • Self — The touch of your shadow-wreathed hand can siphon life force from others to heal your wounds. Make a melee spell attack against one creature within re\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nThe touch of your shadow-wreathed hand can siphon life force from others to heal your wounds. Make a melee spell attack against one creature within reach. On a hit, the target takes 3d6 Necrotic damage, and you regain [[Hit Points|XPHB]] equal to half the amount of Necrotic damage dealt.\\n\\nUntil the spell ends, you can make the attack again on each of your turns as a [[Magic|XPHB]] action, targeting the same creature or a different one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 3.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Death Domain|DMG]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Ambition Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|RHW]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Lunar Sorcery|DSotDQ]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Necromancer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Grave Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Necromancy Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Witherbloom Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"3d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"attackType\":\"Melee Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_vicious_mockery_xphb\",\"name\":\"Vicious Mockery\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Enchantment Cantrip • Action • 60 feet — You unleash a string of insults laced with subtle enchantments at one creature you can see or hear within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom s\",\"content\":\"*Enchantment Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou unleash a string of insults laced with subtle enchantments at one creature you can see or hear within range. The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or take 1d6 Psychic damage and have [[Disadvantage|XPHB]] on the next attack roll it makes before the end of its next turn.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Species / Races:** [[Merfolk (Zendikar; Cosi Creed)|PSZ]], [[Tiefling (Variant; Devil's Tongue)|SCAG]]\\n**Feats:** [[Arcane Eloquence|AU]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_vitriolic_sphere_xphb\",\"name\":\"Vitriolic Sphere\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 150 feet — You point at a location within range, and a glowing, 1-foot-diameter ball of acid streaks there and explodes in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Eff\",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 150 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a drop of bile)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou point at a location within range, and a glowing, 1-foot-diameter ball of acid streaks there and explodes in a 20-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]]. Each creature in that area makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 10d4 Acid damage and another 5d4 Acid damage at the end of its next turn. On a successful save, a creature takes half the initial damage only.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The initial damage increases by 2d4 for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Alchemist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Evocation Adept|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"150 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a drop of bile)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d4\",\"damageType\":\"Acid\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Acid Damage\",\"Acid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_fire_xphb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Fire\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 4 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You create a wall of fire on a solid surface within range. You can make the wall up to 60 feet long, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick, or a ringed wall \",\"content\":\"*Level 4 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of charcoal)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou create a wall of fire on a solid surface within range. You can make the wall up to 60 feet long, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick, or a ringed wall up to 20 feet in diameter, 20 feet high, and 1 foot thick. The wall is opaque and lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the wall appears, each creature in its area makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 5d8 Fire damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nOne side of the wall, selected by you when you cast this spell, deals 5d8 Fire damage to each creature that ends its turn within 10 feet of that side or inside the wall. A creature takes the same damage when it enters the wall for the first time on a turn or ends its turn there. The other side of the wall deals no damage.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 4.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Light Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Forge Domain|XGE]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]]), [[The Fiend|PHB]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[The Celestial|XGE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Light Domain|XPHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Spellfire Sorcery|FRHoF]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Celestial Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Fiend Patron|XPHB]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Vestige Patron|AU]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Boros Legionnaire|GGR]], [[Rakdos Cultist|GGR]], [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[River of Hungry Flame|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":4,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of charcoal)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"5d8\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 4\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_force_xphb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Force\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — An Invisible wall of force springs into existence at a point you choose within range. The wall appears in any orientation you choose, as a horizontal \",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a shard of glass)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nAn [[Invisible|XPHB]] wall of force springs into existence at a point you choose within range. The wall appears in any orientation you choose, as a horizontal or vertical barrier or at an angle. It can be free floating or resting on a solid surface. You can form it into a hemispherical dome or a globe with a radius of up to 10 feet, or you can shape a flat surface made up of ten 10-foot-by-10-foot panels. Each panel must be contiguous with another panel. In any form, the wall is 1/4 inch thick and lasts for the duration. If the wall cuts through a creature's space when it appears, the creature is pushed to one side of the wall (you choose which side).\\n\\nNothing can physically pass through the wall. It is immune to all damage and can't be dispelled by [[Dispel Magic|XPHB]]. A [[Disintegrate|XPHB]] spell destroys the wall instantly, however. The wall also extends into the Ethereal Plane and blocks ethereal travel through the wall.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Armorer|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Armorer|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[Oath of Redemption|XGE]] ([[Paladin|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Soul|TCE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]]), [[Clockwork Sorcery|XPHB]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Evocation Adept|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a shard of glass)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_ice_xphb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Ice\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — You create a wall of ice on a solid surface within range. You can form it into a hemispherical dome or a globe with a radius of up to 10 feet, or you \",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of quartz)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a wall of ice on a solid surface within range. You can form it into a hemispherical dome or a globe with a radius of up to 10 feet, or you can shape a flat surface made up of ten 10-foot-square panels. Each panel must be contiguous with another panel. In any form, the wall is 1 foot thick and lasts for the duration.\\n\\nIf the wall cuts through a creature's space when it appears, the creature is pushed to one side of the wall (you choose which side) and makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 10d6 Cold damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe wall is an object that can be damaged and thus breached. It has AC 12 and 30 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] per 10-foot section, and it has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to Cold, Poison, and Psychic damage and [[Vulnerability|XPHB]] to Fire damage. Reducing a 10-foot section of wall to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] destroys it and leaves behind a sheet of frigid air in the space the wall occupied.\\n\\nA creature moving through the sheet of frigid air for the first time on a turn makes a Constitution saving throw, taking 5d6 Cold damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage the wall deals when it appears increases by 2d6 and the damage from passing through the sheet of frigid air increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of quartz)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d6\",\"damageType\":\"Cold\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Wizard\",\"Cold Damage\",\"Cold\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_stone_xphb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Stone\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A nonmagical wall of solid stone springs into existence at a point you choose within range. The wall is 6 inches thick and is composed of ten 10-foot-\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a cube of granite)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nA nonmagical wall of solid stone springs into existence at a point you choose within range. The wall is 6 inches thick and is composed of ten 10-foot-by-10-foot panels. Each panel must be contiguous with another panel. Alternatively, you can create 10-foot-by-20-foot panels that are only 3 inches thick.\\n\\nIf the wall cuts through a creature's space when it appears, the creature is pushed to one side of the wall (you choose which side). If a creature would be surrounded on all sides by the wall (or the wall and another solid surface), that creature can make a Dexterity saving throw. On a success, it can use its [[Reaction|XPHB]] to move up to its [[Speed|XPHB]] so that it is no longer enclosed by the wall.\\n\\nThe wall can have any shape you desire, though it can't occupy the same space as a creature or object. The wall doesn't need to be vertical or rest on a firm foundation. It must, however, merge with and be solidly supported by existing stone. Thus, you can use this spell to bridge a chasm or create a ramp.\\n\\nIf you create a span greater than 20 feet in length, you must halve the size of each panel to create supports. You can crudely shape the wall to create battlements and the like.\\n\\nThe wall is an object made of stone that can be damaged and thus breached. Each panel has AC 15 and 30 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] per inch of thickness, and it has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to Poison and Psychic damage. Reducing a panel to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] destroys it and might cause connected panels to collapse at the DM's discretion.\\n\\nIf you maintain your [[Concentration|XPHB]] on this spell for its full duration, the wall becomes permanent and can't be dispelled. Otherwise, the wall disappears when the spell ends.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Wave of Rolling Earth|PHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a cube of granite)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wall_of_thorns_xphb\",\"name\":\"Wall of Thorns\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 120 feet — You create a wall of tangled brush bristling with needle-sharp thorns. The wall appears within range on a solid surface and lasts for the duration. Yo\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a handful of thorns)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 10 minutes\\nYou create a wall of tangled brush bristling with needle-sharp thorns. The wall appears within range on a solid surface and lasts for the duration. You choose to make the wall up to 60 feet long, 10 feet high, and 5 feet thick or a circle that has a 20-foot diameter and is up to 20 feet high and 5 feet thick. The wall blocks line of sight.\\n\\nWhen the wall appears, each creature in its area makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 7d8 Piercing damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nA creature can move through the wall, albeit slowly and painfully. For every 1 foot a creature moves through the wall, it must spend 4 feet of movement. Furthermore, the first time a creature enters a space in the wall on a turn or ends its turn there, the creature makes a Dexterity saving throw, taking 7d8 Slashing damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** Both types of damage increase by 1d8 for each spell slot level above 6.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a handful of thorns)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"7d8\",\"damageType\":\"Piercing\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Piercing Damage\",\"Piercing\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_warding_bond_xphb\",\"name\":\"Warding Bond\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Abjuration • Action • Touch — You touch another creature that is willing and create a mystic connection between you and the target until the spell ends. While the target is within \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Abjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Touch\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a pair of platinum rings worth 50+ GP each, which you and the target must wear for the duration)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nYou touch another creature that is willing and create a mystic connection between you and the target until the spell ends. While the target is within 60 feet of you, it gains a +1 bonus to AC and saving throws, and it has [[Resistance|XPHB]] to all damage. Also, each time it takes damage, you take the same amount of damage.\\n\\nThe spell ends if you drop to 0 [[Hit Points|XPHB]] or if you and the target become separated by more than 60 feet. It also ends if the spell is cast again on either of the connected creatures.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Battle Smith|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Battle Smith|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Solidarity Domain (PSA)|PSA]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Peace Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the White Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Selesnya Initiate|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Abjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Touch\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a pair of platinum rings worth 50+ GP each, which you and the target must wear for the duration)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Abjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_water_breathing_xphb\",\"name\":\"Water Breathing\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — This spell grants up to ten willing creatures of your choice within range the ability to breathe underwater until the spell ends. Affected creatures a\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a short reed)\\n- **Duration:** 24 hours\\nThis spell grants up to ten willing creatures of your choice within range the ability to breathe underwater until the spell ends. Affected creatures also retain their normal mode of respiration.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Sea|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Transmuter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Gift of the Depths|XGE]], [[Gift of the Depths|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a short reed)\",\"duration\":\"24 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_water_walk_xphb\",\"name\":\"Water Walk\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Transmutation • Action or Ritual • 30 feet — This spell grants the ability to move across any liquid surface—such as water, acid, mud, snow, quicksand, or lava—as if it were harmless solid ground\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action or Ritual\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a piece of cork)\\n- **Duration:** 1 hour\\nThis spell grants the ability to move across any liquid surface—such as water, acid, mud, snow, quicksand, or lava—as if it were harmless solid ground (creatures crossing molten lava can still take damage from the heat). Up to ten willing creatures of your choice within range gain this ability for the duration.\\n\\nAn affected target must take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to pass from the liquid's surface into the liquid itself and vice versa, but if the target falls into the liquid, the target passes through the surface into the liquid below.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Genasi (Water)|MPMM]], [[Triton|MPMM]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Prismari Student|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action or Ritual\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a piece of cork)\",\"duration\":\"1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Ritual\",\"Cleric\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Artificer\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_web_xphb\",\"name\":\"Web\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Conjuration • Action • 60 feet — You conjure a mass of sticky webbing at a point within range. The webs fill a 20-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] there for the duration. The \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a bit of spiderweb)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 hour\\nYou conjure a mass of sticky webbing at a point within range. The webs fill a 20-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] there for the duration. The webs are [[Difficult Terrain|XPHB]], and the area within them is [[Lightly Obscured|XPHB]].\\n\\nIf the webs aren't anchored between two solid masses (such as walls or trees) or layered across a floor, wall, or ceiling, the web collapses on itself, and the spell ends at the start of your next turn. Webs layered over a flat surface have a depth of 5 feet.\\n\\nThe first time a creature enters the webs on a turn or starts its turn there, it must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw or have the [[Restrained|XPHB]] condition while in the webs or until it breaks free.\\n\\nA creature [[Restrained|XPHB]] by the webs can take an action to make a Strength ([[Athletics|XPHB]]) check against your spell save DC. If it succeeds, it is no longer [[Restrained|XPHB]].\\n\\nThe webs are flammable. Any 5-foot [[Cube [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Cube]] of webs exposed to fire burns away in 1 round, dealing 2d4 Fire damage to any creature that starts its turn in the fire.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Artificer|EFA]] (EFA)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|XPHB]] ([[Druid|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Swarmkeeper|TCE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Circle of the Land|PHB]] ([[Druid|PHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a bit of spiderweb)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 hour\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d4\",\"damageType\":\"Fire\",\"saveType\":\"DEX Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Artificer\",\"Fire Damage\",\"Fire\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_weird_xphb\",\"name\":\"Weird\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Illusion • Action • 120 feet — You try to create illusory terrors in others' minds. Each creature of your choice in a 30-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Illusion*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou try to create illusory terrors in others' minds. Each creature of your choice in a 30-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 10d10 Psychic damage and has the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition for the duration. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage only.\\n\\nA [[Frightened|XPHB]] target makes a Wisdom saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a failed save, it takes 5d10 Psychic damage. On a successful save, the spell ends on that target.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Illusionist|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Illusion\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"10d10\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Illusion\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wind_walk_xphb\",\"name\":\"Wind Walk\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Transmutation • 1 minute • 30 feet — You and up to ten willing creatures of your choice within range assume gaseous forms for the duration, appearing as wisps of cloud. While in this clou\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Transmutation*\\n- **Casting Time:** 1 minute\\n- **Range:** 30 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a candle)\\n- **Duration:** 8 hours\\nYou and up to ten willing creatures of your choice within range assume gaseous forms for the duration, appearing as wisps of cloud. While in this cloud form, a target has a [[Fly Speed|XPHB]] of 300 feet and can hover; it has [[Immunity|XPHB]] to the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition; and it has [[Resistance|XPHB]] to Bludgeoning, Piercing, and Slashing damage. The only actions a target can take in this form are the [[Dash|XPHB]] action or a [[Magic|XPHB]] action to begin reverting to its normal form. Reverting takes 1 minute, during which the target has the [[Stunned|XPHB]] condition. Until the spell ends, the target can revert to cloud form, which also requires a [[Magic|XPHB]] action followed by a 1-minute transformation.\\n\\nIf a target is in cloud form and flying when the effect ends, the target descends 60 feet per round for 1 minute until it lands, which it does safely. If it can't land after 1 minute, it falls the remaining distance.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Transmutation\",\"castingTime\":\"1 minute\",\"range\":\"30 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a candle)\",\"duration\":\"8 hours\",\"actionType\":\"Special\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Transmutation\",\"Level 6\",\"Special\",\"Druid\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wind_wall_xphb\",\"name\":\"Wind Wall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 3 Evocation • Action • 120 feet — A wall of strong wind rises from the ground at a point you choose within range. You can make the wall up to 50 feet long, 15 feet high, and 1 foot thi\",\"content\":\"*Level 3 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 120 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a fan and a feather)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA wall of strong wind rises from the ground at a point you choose within range. You can make the wall up to 50 feet long, 15 feet high, and 1 foot thick. You can shape the wall in any way you choose so long as it makes one continuous path along the ground. The wall lasts for the duration.\\n\\nWhen the wall appears, each creature in its area makes a Strength saving throw, taking 4d8 Bludgeoning damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.\\n\\nThe strong wind keeps fog, smoke, and other gases at bay. Small or smaller flying creatures or objects can't pass through the wall. Loose, lightweight materials brought into the wall fly upward. Arrows, bolts, and other ordinary projectiles launched at targets behind the wall are deflected upward and miss automatically. Boulders hurled by Giants or siege engines, and similar projectiles, are unaffected. Creatures in [[gaseous form|XPHB]] can't pass through it.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Druid|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Ranger|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Artillerist|TCE]] ([[Artificer|TCE]]), [[Artillerist|EFA]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Nature Domain|PHB]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Half-Elf (Variant; Mark of Storm)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Mark of Storm|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Simic Scientist|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":3,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"120 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a fan and a feather)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d8\",\"damageType\":\"Bludgeoning\",\"saveType\":\"STR Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 3\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Druid\",\"Ranger\",\"Bludgeoning Damage\",\"Bludgeoning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wish_xphb\",\"name\":\"Wish\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 9 Conjuration • Action • Self — Wish is the mightiest spell a mortal can cast. By simply speaking aloud, you can alter reality itself. The basic use of this spell is to duplicate any\",\"content\":\"*Level 9 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nWish is the mightiest spell a mortal can cast. By simply speaking aloud, you can alter reality itself.\\n\\nThe basic use of this spell is to duplicate any other spell of level 8 or lower. If you use it this way, you don't need to meet any requirements to cast that spell, including costly components. The spell simply takes effect.\\n\\nAlternatively, you can create one of the following effects of your choice:\\n\\n- **Object Creation.** You create one object of up to 25,000 GP in value that isn't a magic item. The object can be no more than 300 feet in any dimension, and it appears in an unoccupied space that you can see on the ground.\\n- **Instant Health.** You allow yourself and up to twenty creatures that you can see to regain all [[Hit Points|XPHB]], and you end all effects on them listed in the [[Greater Restoration|XPHB]] spell.\\n- **Resistance.** You grant up to ten creatures that you can see [[Resistance|XPHB]] to one damage type that you choose. This [[Resistance|XPHB]] is permanent.\\n- **Spell Immunity.** You grant up to ten creatures you can see immunity to a single spell or other magical effect for 8 hours.\\n- **Sudden Learning.** You replace one of your feats with another feat for which you are eligible. You lose all the benefits of the old feat and gain the benefits of the new one. You can't replace a feat that is a prerequisite for any of your other feats or features.\\n- **Roll Redo.** You undo a single recent event by forcing a reroll of any die roll made within the last round (including your last turn). Reality reshapes itself to accommodate the new result. For example, a Wish spell could undo an ally's failed saving throw or a foe's [[Critical Hit|XPHB]]. You can force the reroll to be made with [[Advantage|XPHB]] or [[Disadvantage|XPHB]], and you choose whether to use the reroll or the original roll.\\n- **Reshape Reality.** You may wish for something not included in any of the other effects. To do so, state your wish to the DM as precisely as possible. The DM has great latitude in ruling what occurs in such an instance; the greater the wish, the greater the likelihood that something goes wrong. This spell might simply fail, the effect you desire might be achieved only in part, or you might suffer an unforeseen consequence as a result of how you worded the wish. For example, wishing that a villain were dead might propel you forward in time to a period when that villain is no longer alive, effectively removing you from the game. Similarly, wishing for a Legendary magic item or an Artifact might instantly transport you to the presence of the item's current owner. If your wish is granted and its effects have consequences for a whole community, region, or world, you are likely to attract powerful foes. If your wish would affect a god, the god's divine servants might instantly intervene to prevent it or to encourage you to craft the wish in a particular way. If your wish would undo the multiverse itself, threaten the City of Sigil, or affect the Lady of Pain in any way, you see an image of her in your mind for a moment; she shakes her head, and your wish fails.\\n\\nThe stress of casting Wish to produce any effect other than duplicating another spell weakens you. After enduring that stress, each time you cast a spell until you finish a [[Long Rest|XPHB]], you take 1d10 Necrotic damage per level of that spell. This damage can't be reduced or prevented in any way. In addition, your Strength score becomes 3 for 2d4 days. For each of those days that you spend resting and doing nothing more than light activity, your remaining recovery time decreases by 2 days. Finally, there is a 33 percent chance that you are unable to cast [[Wish|XPHB]] ever again if you suffer this stress.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Arcana Domain|SCAG]] ([[Cleric|PHB]]), [[The Genie|TCE]] ([[Warlock|PHB]]), [[Arcana Domain|AU]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Conjurer|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\",\"stats\":{\"level\":9,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d10\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 9\",\"Action\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Wizard\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_witch_bolt_xphb\",\"name\":\"Witch Bolt\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Evocation • Action • 60 feet — A beam of crackling energy lances toward a creature within range, forming a sustained arc of lightning between you and the target. Make a ranged spell\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Evocation*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a twig struck by lightning)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nA beam of crackling energy lances toward a creature within range, forming a sustained arc of lightning between you and the target. Make a ranged spell attack against it. On a hit, the target takes 2d12 Lightning damage.\\n\\nOn each of your subsequent turns, you can take a [[Bonus Action|XPHB]] to deal 1d12 Lightning damage to the target automatically, even if the first attack missed.\\n\\nThe spell ends if the target is ever outside the spell's range or if it has Total [[Cover|XPHB]] from you.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The initial damage increases by 1d12 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Sorcerer|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Warlock|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Reanimator|RHW]] ([[Artificer|EFA]]), [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|XPHB]] ([[Fighter|XPHB]]), [[Warrior of the Mystic Arts|AU]] ([[Monk|XPHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|XPHB]] ([[Rogue|XPHB]]), [[Evoker|XPHB]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]]), [[Eldritch Knight|PHB]] ([[Fighter|PHB]]), [[Arcane Trickster|PHB]] ([[Rogue|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Aberrant Dragonmark|EFA]], [[Boon of Siberys|EFA]], [[Aberrant Dragonmark|ERLW]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Strixhaven Initiate|SCC]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a twig struck by lightning)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"2d12\",\"damageType\":\"Lightning\",\"attackType\":\"Ranged Spell Attack\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Level 1\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Sorcerer\",\"Warlock\",\"Wizard\",\"Lightning Damage\",\"Lightning\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_word_of_radiance_xphb\",\"name\":\"Word of Radiance\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Evocation Cantrip • Action • Self — Burning radiance erupts from you in a 5-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. Each creature of your choice that you can see in it must s\",\"content\":\"*Evocation Cantrip*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, M (a sunburst token)\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nBurning radiance erupts from you in a 5-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. Each creature of your choice that you can see in it must succeed on a Constitution saving throw or take 1d6 Radiant damage.\\n***Cantrip Upgrade.*** The damage increases by 1d6 when you reach levels 5 (2d6), 11 (3d6), and 17 (4d6).\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Khoravar|EFA]]\\n**Feats:** [[Blessed Warrior|XPHB]], [[Magic Initiate|XPHB]], [[Divinely Favored|DSotDQ]], [[Light Bringer|ABH]], [[Magic Initiate|PHB]]\\n**Optional Features:** [[Blessed Warrior|TCE]], [[Pact of the Tome|PHB]], [[Pact of the Tome|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":0,\"school\":\"Evocation\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, M (a sunburst token)\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Radiant\",\"saveType\":\"CON Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Evocation\",\"Cantrip\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\",\"Radiant Damage\",\"Radiant\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_word_of_recall_xphb\",\"name\":\"Word of Recall\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 6 Conjuration • Action • 5 feet — You and up to five willing creatures within 5 feet of you instantly teleport to a previously designated sanctuary. You and any creatures that teleport\",\"content\":\"*Level 6 Conjuration*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 5 feet\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** Instantaneous\\nYou and up to five willing creatures within 5 feet of you instantly teleport to a previously designated sanctuary. You and any creatures that teleport with you appear in the nearest unoccupied space to the spot you designated when you prepared your sanctuary (see below). If you cast this spell without first preparing a sanctuary, the spell has no effect.\\n\\nYou must designate a location, such as a temple, as a sanctuary by casting this spell there.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|PHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":6,\"school\":\"Conjuration\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"5 feet\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"Instantaneous\",\"actionType\":\"Action\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Conjuration\",\"Level 6\",\"Action\",\"Cleric\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_wrathful_smite_xphb\",\"name\":\"Wrathful Smite\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 1 Necromancy • Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a> • Self — The target takes an extra 1d6 Necrotic damage from the attack, and it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Frightened condition until the\",\"content\":\"*Level 1 Necromancy*\\n- **Casting Time:** Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V\\n- **Duration:** 1 minute\\nThe target takes an extra 1d6 Necrotic damage from the attack, and it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the [[Frightened|XPHB]] condition until the spell ends. At the end of each of its turns, the [[Frightened|XPHB]] target repeats the save, ending the spell on itself on a success.\\n***Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.*** The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 1.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Hollow Warden|RHW]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[The Hexblade|XGE]] ([[Warlock|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Shadow Touched|TCE]], [[Shadow-Touched|XPHB]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":1,\"school\":\"Necromancy\",\"castingTime\":\"Bonus action, which you take immediately after hitting a creature with a Melee weapon or an <a href=\\\"variantrules.html#unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\"  onmouseover=\\\"Renderer.hover.pHandleLinkMouseOver(event, this)\\\" onmouseleave=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseLeave(event, this)\\\" onmousemove=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkMouseMove(event, this)\\\" onclick=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkClick(event, this)\\\" onwheel=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkWheel(event, this)\\\" ondragstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleLinkDragStart(event, this)\\\" data-vet-page=\\\"variantrules.html\\\" data-vet-source=\\\"XPHB\\\" data-vet-hash=\\\"unarmed%20strike_xphb\\\" ontouchstart=\\\"Renderer.hover.handleTouchStart(event, this)\\\" >Unarmed Strike</a>\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V\",\"duration\":\"1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Bonus Action\",\"damage\":\"1d6\",\"damageType\":\"Necrotic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Necromancy\",\"Level 1\",\"Bonus Action\",\"Paladin\",\"Necrotic Damage\",\"Necrotic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_yolande_s_regal_presence_xphb\",\"name\":\"Yolande's Regal Presence\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 5 Enchantment • Action • Self — You surround yourself with unearthly majesty in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. Whenever the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPH\",\"content\":\"*Level 5 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** Self\\n- **Components:** V, S, M (a miniature tiara)\\n- **Duration:** Concentration, up to 1 minute\\nYou surround yourself with unearthly majesty in a 10-foot [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]]. Whenever the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] enters the space of a creature you can see and whenever a creature you can see enters the [[Emanation [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Emanation]] or ends its turn there, you can force that creature to make a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, the target takes 4d6 Psychic damage and has the [[Prone|XPHB]] condition, and you can push it up to 10 feet away. On a successful save, the target takes half as much damage only. A creature makes this save only once per turn.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Wizard|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[Oath of Glory|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Enchanter|AU]] ([[Wizard|XPHB]])\\n**Feats:** [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":5,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"Self\",\"components\":\"V, S, M (a miniature tiara)\",\"duration\":\"Concentration, up to 1 minute\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"damage\":\"4d6\",\"damageType\":\"Psychic\",\"saveType\":\"WIS Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 5\",\"Action\",\"Concentration\",\"Bard\",\"Wizard\",\"Psychic Damage\",\"Psychic\"]},{\"id\":\"5et_spell_zone_of_truth_xphb\",\"name\":\"Zone of Truth\",\"category\":\"spells\",\"source\":\"XPHB\",\"summary\":\"Level 2 Enchantment • Action • 60 feet — You create a magical zone that guards against deception in a 15-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range. \",\"content\":\"*Level 2 Enchantment*\\n- **Casting Time:** Action\\n- **Range:** 60 feet\\n- **Components:** V, S\\n- **Duration:** 10 minutes\\nYou create a magical zone that guards against deception in a 15-foot-radius [[Sphere [Area of Effect]|XPHB|Sphere]] centered on a point within range. Until the spell ends, a creature that enters the spell's area for the first time on a turn or starts its turn there makes a Charisma saving throw. On a failed save, a creature can't speak a deliberate lie while in the radius. You know whether a creature succeeds or fails on this save.\\n\\nAn affected creature is aware of the spell and can avoid answering questions to which it would normally respond with a lie. Such a creature can be evasive yet must be truthful.\\n\\n**Classes:** [[Bard|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Cleric|XPHB]] (XPHB), [[Paladin|XPHB]] (XPHB)\\n**Subclasses:** [[College of Lore|XPHB]] ([[Bard|XPHB]]), [[Order Domain|TCE]] ([[Cleric|XPHB]]), [[Oath of the Crown|SCAG]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|XPHB]] ([[Paladin|XPHB]]), [[Monster Slayer|XGE]] ([[Ranger|XPHB]]), [[Divine Soul|XGE]] ([[Sorcerer|XPHB]]), [[Oath of Devotion|PHB]] ([[Paladin|PHB]])\\n**Species / Races:** [[Human (Mark of Sentinel)|ERLW]]\\n**Feats:** [[Adept of the Black Robes|DSotDQ]], [[Boon of Magic School Mastery|AU]], [[Magic Connoisseur|AU]], [[Mark of Sentinel|EFA]]\\n**Backgrounds:** [[Orzhov Representative|GGR]]\",\"stats\":{\"level\":2,\"school\":\"Enchantment\",\"castingTime\":\"Action\",\"range\":\"60 feet\",\"components\":\"V, S\",\"duration\":\"10 minutes\",\"actionType\":\"Action\",\"saveType\":\"CHA Save\"},\"tags\":[\"Spell\",\"XPHB\",\"Enchantment\",\"Level 2\",\"Action\",\"Bard\",\"Cleric\",\"Paladin\"]}]");
